"le feiceáil sa slabhra scagaire) a dhíchur. Athróidh an scagaire chun cur i "
"bhfeidhm láithreach:func: `~django.utils.html.conditional_escape` i Django "
"2.0."

msgid "``Manager.use_for_related_fields`` and inheritance changes"
msgstr "``Manager.Use_for_Related_Fields`` agus athruithe oidhreachta"

msgid ""
"``Manager.use_for_related_fields`` is deprecated in favor of "
"setting :attr:`Meta.base_manager_name "
"<django.db.models.Options.base_manager_name>` on the model."
msgstr ""
"<django.db.models.Options.base_manager_name>Tá "
"``Manager.Use_for_Related_Fields`` a dhíchur i bhfabhar socruithe: attr: "
"`Meta.Base_Manager_name `ar an mhúnla."

msgid ""
"Model ``Manager`` inheritance will follow MRO inheritance rules in Django "
"2.0, changing the current behavior where managers defined on non-abstract "
"base classes aren't inherited by child classes. A deprecating warning with "
"instructions on how to adapt your code is raised if you have any affected "
"managers. You'll either redeclare a manager from an abstract model on the "
"child class to override the manager from the concrete model, or you'll set "
"the model's ``Meta.manager_inheritance_from_future=True`` option to opt-in "
"to the new inheritance behavior."
msgstr ""
"Leanfaidh oidhreacht Mhúnla `Bainisteoir ``rialacha oidhreachta MRO i Django "
"2.0, ag athrú an t-iompar reatha nuair nach n-oidhreacht ag ranganna leanaí "
"bainisteoirí atá sainmhínithe ar ranganna bonn neamh-teibí. Ardaítear "
"rabhadh laghdaitheach le treoracha maidir le conas do chód a oiriúnú má tá "
"aon bhainisteoirí difear agat. Déanfaidh tú bainisteoir a athdhearbhú ó "
"mhúnla teibí ar rang an linbh chun an bainisteoir a shárú ón tsamhail "
"choincréite, nó socraíonn tú rogha "
"``meta.manager_heritance_from_future=true`` an tsamhail chun roghnú isteach "
"san iompar oidhreachta nua."

msgid ""
"During the deprecation period, ``use_for_related_fields`` will be honored "
"and raise a warning, even if a ``base_manager_name`` is set. This allows "
"third-party code to preserve legacy behavior while transitioning to the new "
"API. The warning can be silenced by setting "
"``silence_use_for_related_fields_deprecation=True`` on the manager."
msgstr ""
"Le linn na tréimhse díghabhála, déanfar onóir ar ``use_for_related_fields`` "
"agus ardófar rabhadh, fiú má shocraítear ``base_manager_name``. Ligeann sé "
"seo cód tríú páirtí iompar oidhreachta a chaomhnú agus é ag aistriú chuig an "
"API nua. Is féidir an rabhadh a thostú trí "
"``Silence_USE_for_related_fields_deprecation=true`` a shocrú ar an "
"mbainisteoir."

msgid ""
"The ``makemigrations --exit`` option is deprecated in favor of "
"the :option:`makemigrations --check` option."
msgstr ""
"Tá an rogha ``makemigrations --exit`` a dhíchur i bhfabhar an rogha: "
"`makemigrations --check`."

