msgstr "``faigh_fields_with_model () ``"

msgid "``get_concrete_fields_with_model()``"
msgstr "```faigh_réimsí coincréite_with_model () ``"

msgid "``get_m2m_with_model()``"
msgstr "```get_m2m_with_model () ``"

msgid "``get_all_related_objects()``"
msgstr "```faigh_all_earra_bhainteach_() ``"

msgid "``get_all_related_objects_with_model()``"
msgstr "```Faigh_rudaí gaolmhaithe_le_samhail () ``"

msgid "``get_all_related_many_to_many_objects()``"
msgstr "```faigh_all_bhainteach_go leor le go leor rudaí () ``"

msgid "``get_all_related_m2m_objects_with_model()``"
msgstr "```faigh_all_gaol_m2m_rudaí_le_samhail () ``"

msgid ""
"The ``error_message`` argument of ``django.forms.RegexField`` is removed."
msgstr "Baintear an argóint ``error_message`` de `django.forms.regexfield``."

msgid "The ``unordered_list`` filter no longer supports old style lists."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaíonn an scagaire ``unordered_list`` le seanliostaí stíl a thuilleadh."

msgid "Support for string ``view`` arguments to ``url()`` is removed."
msgstr "Baintear tacaíocht d'argóintí teaghrán ``view`` chuig `url () ``."

msgid ""
"The backward compatible shim  to rename ``django.forms.Form._has_changed()`` "
"to ``has_changed()`` is removed."
msgstr ""
"An shim comhoiriúnach ar chúl chun ``Django.Forms.form a athainmniú. "
"Baintear _has_modified () ``go ``has_changes ()``."

msgid "The ``removetags`` template filter is removed."
msgstr "Baintear an scagaire teimpléad ``removetags ``."

msgid ""
"The ``remove_tags()`` and ``strip_entities()`` functions in "
"``django.utils.html`` is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear na feidhmeanna ``remove_tags () ``agus `strip_entity ()`` i "
"`django.utils.html``."

msgid ""
"The ``is_admin_site`` argument to "
"``django.contrib.auth.views.password_reset()`` is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an argóint ``is_admin_site`` le "
"``django.contrib.auth.views.password_reset () ``."

msgid "``django.db.models.field.subclassing.SubfieldBase`` is removed."
msgstr "Baintear ``django.db.models.field.subclassing.subfieldbase``."

msgid "``django.utils.checksums`` is removed."
msgstr "Baintear ``django.utils.checksums``."

msgid ""
"The ``original_content_type_id`` attribute on "
"``django.contrib.admin.helpers.InlineAdminForm`` is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an tréith ``original_content_type_id`` ar "
"`Django.contrib.admin.helpers.inlineAdminForm``."

msgid ""
"The backwards compatibility shim to allow ``FormMixin.get_form()`` to be "
"defined with no default value for its ``form_class`` argument is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an shim comhoiriúnachta ar ais chun ligean do ``formMixin.get_form "
"() ``a shainiú gan aon luach réamhshocraithe dá argóint ``form_class``."

msgid ""
"The following settings are removed, and you must upgrade to "
"the :setting:`TEMPLATES` setting:"
msgstr ""
"Baintear na socruithe seo a leanas, agus ní mór duit uasghrádú a dhéanamh "
"chuig an socrú:setting: `TEMPLATES`:"

msgid "``ALLOWED_INCLUDE_ROOTS``"
msgstr "``CEADÁIL_INCLUDE_FRÉAMH``"

msgid "``TEMPLATE_CONTEXT_PROCESSORS``"
msgstr "``PRÓISEÁLAITHE COMHTHÉACS TEIMPLÉAD``"

msgid "``TEMPLATE_DEBUG``"
msgstr "``TEMPLATE_DEBUG``"

msgid "``TEMPLATE_DIRS``"
msgstr "``TEIMPLÉAD_DIRS``"

msgid "``TEMPLATE_LOADERS``"
msgstr "``TEIMPLÉ_LOADERS``"

msgid "``TEMPLATE_STRING_IF_INVALID``"
msgstr "``TEIMPLÉAD_STRING_IFE_NEAMHBHAILÍ``"

msgid ""
"The backwards compatibility alias ``django.template.loader.BaseLoader`` is "
"removed."
msgstr "Baintear an alias comhoiriúnachta ar chúl ``Django.Template.Loader``."

msgid ""
"Django template objects returned "
"by :func:`~django.template.loader.get_template` "
"and :func:`~django.template.loader.select_template` no longer accept "
"a :class:`~django.template.Context` in "
"their :meth:`~django.template.backends.base.Template.render()` method."
msgstr ""
"Ní ghlacann rudaí teimpléad Django ar ais ar:func: "
"`~django.template.loader.get_template` agus:func: "
"`~django.template.loader.select_template` le a:class: "
"`~django.template.context` ina: meth: "
"`~django.template.backends.base.template.render () `modh."

msgid ""
":doc:`Template response APIs </ref/template-response>` enforce the use "
"of :class:`dict` and backend-dependent template objects instead "
"of :class:`~django.template.Context` and :class:`~django.template.Template` "
"respectively."
msgstr ""
":doc: Forfheidhmíonn `APIs freagra teimpléad` úsáid o:class: `dict` </ref/"
"template-response> agus rudaí teimpléad atá ag brath ar chúltaca in "
"ionad:class: `~django.template.context` agus:class: "
"`~django.template.template` faoi seach."

msgid ""
"The ``current_app`` parameter for the following function and classes is "
"removed:"
msgstr ""
"Baintear an paraiméadar ``current_app`` don fheidhm agus na ranganna seo a "
"leanas:"

msgid "``django.shortcuts.render()``"
msgstr "``django.shortcuts.render () ``"

msgid "``django.template.Context()``"
msgstr "``Django.Template.context () ``"

msgid "``django.template.RequestContext()``"
msgstr "``Django.Template.requestContext () ``"

msgid "``django.template.response.TemplateResponse()``"
msgstr "``Django.Template.Response.TemplateResponse () ``"

msgid ""
"The ``dictionary`` and ``context_instance`` parameters for the following "
"functions are removed:"
msgstr ""
"Baintear na paraiméadair ``foclóire`` agus ``context_instance`` do na "
"feidhmeanna seo a leanas:"

msgid "``django.shortcuts.render_to_response()``"
msgstr "``django.shortcuts.render_to_response () ``"

msgid "``django.template.loader.render_to_string()``"
msgstr "``django.template.loader.render_to_string () ``"

msgid "The ``dirs`` parameter for the following functions is removed:"
msgstr "Baintear an paraiméadar `dirs`` do na feidhmeanna seo a leanas:"

msgid "``django.template.loader.get_template()``"
msgstr "``django.template.loader.get_template () ``"

msgid "``django.template.loader.select_template()``"
msgstr "``django.template.loader.select_template () ``"

msgid ""
"Session verification is enabled regardless of whether or not "
"``'django.contrib.auth.middleware.SessionAuthenticationMiddleware'`` is in "
"``MIDDLEWARE_CLASSES``. ``SessionAuthenticationMiddleware`` no longer has "
"any purpose and can be removed from ``MIDDLEWARE_CLASSES``. It's kept as a "
"stub until Django 2.0 as a courtesy for users who don't read this note."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaítear fíorú seisiúin beag beann cibé an bhfuil "
"``DJANGO.contrib.auth.middleware.SessionAuthenticationMiddleware'` i "
"`MIDDLEWARE_CLASSES`` nó nach bhfuil. Níl aon chuspóir ag "
"`SessionAuthenticationMiddleware`` a thuilleadh agus is féidir é a bhaint as "
"`MIDDLEWARE_CLASSES`. Coinnítear é mar stub go dtí Django 2.0 mar chúirtéis "
"d'úsáideoirí nach léann an nóta seo."

msgid "Private attribute ``django.db.models.Field.related`` is removed."
msgstr "Baintear tréith príobháideach ``Django.db.Models.Field.Related``."

msgid "The ``--list`` option of the ``migrate`` management command is removed."
msgstr "Baintear an rogha ``--list`` den ordú bainistíochta ``imirce``."

msgid "The ``ssi`` template tag is removed."
msgstr "Baintear an chlib teimpléad ``ssi``."

msgid ""
"Support for the ``=`` comparison operator in the ``if`` template tag is "
"removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear tacaíocht don oibreoir comparáide ``=`` sa chlib teimpléad ``if ``."

msgid ""
"The backwards compatibility shims to allow ``Storage.get_available_name()`` "
"and ``Storage.save()`` to be defined without a ``max_length`` argument are "
"removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear na cinn comhoiriúnachta ar chúl chun ligean "
"``Storage.get_available_name () ``agus ``Storage.save ()`` a shainiú gan "
"argóint ``max_long``."

msgid ""
"Support for the legacy ``%(<foo>)s`` syntax in "
"``ModelFormMixin.success_url`` is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear tacaíocht don chomhréir oidhreachta ``% (<foo>) s`` i "
"`ModelFormMixin.Success_URL``."

msgid ""
"``GeoQuerySet`` aggregate methods ``collect()``, ``extent()``, "
"``extent3d()``, ``make_line()``, and ``unionagg()`` are removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear modhanna comhiomlána ``GeoquerySet ``bailiú () ``, `méid ()``, "
"`extent3d () ``, ``make_line ()``, agus ``unionagg () ```."

msgid ""
"The ability to specify ``ContentType.name`` when creating a content type "
"instance is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an cumas ``ContentType.Name`` a shonrú agus sampla cineál ábhair á "
"chruthú."

msgid "Support for the old signature of ``allow_migrate`` is removed."
msgstr "Baintear tacaíocht do sheanshíniú ``allow_migrate``."

msgid ""
"Support for the syntax of ``{% cycle %}`` that uses comma-separated "
"arguments is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear tacaíocht do chomhréir ``{% cycle%}`` a úsáideann argóintí scartha "
"le camóg."

msgid ""
"The warning that :class:`~django.core.signing.Signer` issued when given an "
"invalid separator is now a ``ValueError``."
msgstr ""
"Is é an rabhadh go n-eisíodh: class: `~django.core.signing.signer` nuair a "
"thugtar deighilteoir neamhbhailí ina ``ValueError`` anois."

msgid "Django 1.10.1 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.10.1"

msgid "*September 1, 2016*"
msgstr "*1 Meán Fómhair, 2016*"

msgid "Django 1.10.1 fixes several bugs in 1.10."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.10.1 roinnt fabhtanna i 1.10."

msgid "Bugfixes"
msgstr "Buigdheisiúcháin"

msgid ""
"Fixed a crash in MySQL connections where ``SELECT @@SQL_AUTO_IS_NULL`` "
"doesn't return a result (:ticket:`26991`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh timpiste i naisc MySQL nuair nach dtugann ``SELECT @ "
"@SQL_AUTO_IS_NULL ``toradh ar ais (:ticket: `26991`)."

msgid ""
"Allowed ``User.is_authenticated`` and ``User.is_anonymous`` properties to be "
"compared using ``==``, ``!=``, and ``|`` (:ticket:`26988`, :ticket:`27154`)."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaítear airíonna ``User.is_Authenticated`` agus ``User.is_anonymous`` a "
"chur i gcomparáid ag baint úsáide as ``==``, ``! =``, agus ``|`` (:ticket: "
"`26988`, :ticket: `27154`)."

msgid ""
"Removed the broken ``BaseCommand.usage()`` method which was for ``optparse`` "
"support (:ticket:`27000`)."
msgstr ""
"Baineadh an modh briste ``BaseCommand.Usage () ``a bhí le haghaidh "
"tacaíochta ``optparse`` (:ticket: `27000`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a checks framework crash with an empty ``Meta.default_permissions`` "
"(:ticket:`26997`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh timpiste creat seiceálacha le `Meta.default_Permissions`` folamh "
"(:ticket: `26997`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in the number of queries when using ``RadioSelect`` with "
"a ``ModelChoiceField`` form field (:ticket:`27001`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraíodh aischéimniú i líon na gceisteanna nuair a úsáidtear "
"``RadioSelect`` le réimse foirme ``ModelChoiceField` (:ticket: `27001`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a crash if ``request.META['CONTENT_LENGTH']`` is an empty string "
"(:ticket:`27005`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh timpiste más sreang folamh é ``request.meta ['CONTENT_LENGTH'] "
"``(:ticket: `27005`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed the ``isnull`` lookup on a ``ForeignKey`` with its ``to_field`` "
"pointing to a ``CharField`` or pointing to a ``CharField`` defined with "
"``primary_key=True`` (:ticket:`26983`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh an cuardach ``isnull`` ar `ForeignKey`` agus a `to_field`` ag díriú "
"ar ``charfield`` nó ag treoir ar ``charfield`` sainmhínithe le "
"``primary_key=true`` (:ticket: `26983`)."

msgid ""
"Prevented the ``migrate`` command from raising "
"``InconsistentMigrationHistory`` in the presence of unapplied squashed "
"migrations (:ticket:`27004`)."
msgstr ""
"Chuir sé cosc ar an ordú ```imirce`` `InconsistentImmigrationHistory`` a "
"ardú i láthair imirce scáite neamhfheidhmeacha (:ticket: `27004`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in ``Client.force_login()`` which required specifying a "
"``backend`` rather than automatically using the first one if multiple "
"backends are configured (:ticket:`27027`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú in ``Client.force_login () ``a bhí ag teastáil "
"``backend`` a shonrú seachas an chéad cheann a úsáid go huathoibríoch má tá "
"cúltaca iolracha cumraithe (:ticket: `27027`)."

msgid ""
"Made ``QuerySet.bulk_create()`` properly initialize model instances on "
"backends, such as PostgreSQL, that support returning the IDs of the created "
"records so that many-to-many relationships can be used on the new objects "
"(:ticket:`27026`)."
msgstr ""
"Rinneadh ``QuerySet.bulk_create () ``cásanna samhail a thionscnamh i gceart "
"ar chúltaca, mar shampla PostgreSQL, a thacaíonn le ID na dtaifid cruthaithe "
"a thabhairt ar ais ionas gur féidir caidrimh go leor a úsáid ar na rudaí nua "
"(:ticket: `27026`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed crash of ``django.views.static.serve()`` with ``show_indexes`` enabled "
"(:ticket:`26973`)."
msgstr ""
"Timpiste seasta de ``django.views.static.serve () ``le `show_indexes`` "
"cumasaithe (:ticket: `26973`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed ``ClearableFileInput`` to avoid the ``required`` HTML attribute when "
"initial data exists (:ticket:`27037`)."
msgstr ""
"Seasta ``ClearableFileInput`` chun an tréith HTML ``riachtan`` a sheachaint "
"nuair a bhíonn sonraí tosaigh ann (:ticket: `27037`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed annotations with database functions when combined with lookups on "
"PostGIS (:ticket:`27014`)."
msgstr ""
"Anótaí seasta le feidhmeanna bunachar sonraí nuair a dhéantar iad a "
"chomhcheangal le cuardaigh ar PostGIS (: ticket: `27014`)."

msgid ""
"Reallowed the ``{% for %}`` tag to unpack any iterable (:ticket:`27058`)."
msgstr ""
"Athíoslagadh an chlib ``{% for%}`` chun aon ath-athphacáil (:ticket: "
"`27058`)."

msgid ""
"Made ``makemigrations`` skip inconsistent history checks on non-default "
"databases if database routers aren't in use or if no apps can be migrated to "
"the database (:ticket:`27054`, :ticket:`27110`, :ticket:`27142`)."
msgstr ""
"Scaipeáil “makemigrations`” seiceálacha staire neamhréamhshocraithe ar "
"bhunachar sonraí neamhréamhshocraithe mura bhfuil ródairí bunachar sonraí in "
"úsáid nó mura féidir aon aipeanna a aistriú chuig an mbunachar sonraí "
"(:ticket: `27054`, :ticket: `27110`, :ticket: `27142`)."

msgid ""
"Removed duplicated managers in ``Model._meta.managers`` (:ticket:`27073`)."
msgstr ""
"Bainisteoirí dúbailte a bhaint i ``Samhail. _meta.managers`` (:ticket: "
"`27073`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed ``contrib.admindocs`` crash when a view is in a class, such as some of "
"the admin views (:ticket:`27018`)."
msgstr ""
"Timpiste seasta ``contrib.admindocs`` nuair a bhíonn amharc i rang, mar "
"shampla cuid de na tuairimí riaracháin (:ticket: `27018`)."

msgid ""
"Reverted a few admin checks that checked ``field.many_to_many`` back to "
"``isinstance(field, models.ManyToManyField)`` since it turned out the checks "
"weren't suitable to be generalized like that (:ticket:`26998`)."
msgstr ""
"Chuir cúpla seiceáil riaracháin ar ais a sheiceáil ``field.many_to_many`` ar "
"ais go ``isinstance (field, Models.manyTomanyField) ``ós rud é nach raibh na "
"seiceálacha oiriúnach le ginearálú mar sin (:ticket: `26998`)."

msgid ""
"Added the database alias to the ``InconsistentMigrationHistory`` message "
"raised by ``makemigrations`` and ``migrate`` (:ticket:`27089`)."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh ailias an bunachar sonraí leis an teachtaireacht "
"``InconsistentMigrationHistory`` arna ardú ag ``makemigrations`` agus "
"``migrate`` (:ticket: `27089`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed the creation of ``ContentType`` and ``Permission`` objects for models "
"of applications without migrations when calling the ``migrate`` command with "
"no migrations to apply (:ticket:`27044`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraíodh cruthú rudaí ``ContentType`` agus `Ceadúna`` do mhúnlaí iarratais "
"gan imirce agus tú ag glaoch ar an ordú ```imirce`` gan aon imirce le cur i "
"bhfeidhm (:ticket: `27044`)."

msgid ""
"Included the already applied migration state changes in the ``Apps`` "
"instance provided to the ``pre_migrate`` signal receivers to allow "
"``ContentType`` renaming to be performed on model rename (:ticket:`27100`)."
msgstr ""
"San áireamh na hathruithe stáit imirce a chuirtear i bhfeidhm cheana féin sa "
"chás ``Apps` a chuirtear ar fáil do na glacadóirí comhartha ``pre_migrate`` "
"chun ligean athainmniú ``contentType`` a dhéanamh ar athainmniú samhail "
"(:ticket: `27100`)."

msgid ""
"Reallowed subclassing ``UserCreationForm`` without ``USERNAME_FIELD`` in "
"``Meta.fields`` (:ticket:`27111`)."
msgstr ""
"Fo-aicmiú “UserCreationForm” a athshlánú gan ``USERNAME_FIELD`` i "
"`Meta.Fields`` (:ticket: `27111`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in model forms where model fields with a ``default`` that "
"didn't appear in POST data no longer used the ``default`` (:ticket:`27039`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i bhfoirmeacha samhail nuair nach n-úsáideann réimsí "
"samhail le ``réamhshocraithe`` nár raibh le feiceáil i sonraí POST an "
"``default`` a thuilleadh (:ticket: `27039`)."

msgid "Django 1.10.2 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.10.2"

msgid "*October 1, 2016*"
msgstr "*1 Deireadh Fómhair, 2016*"

msgid "Django 1.10.2 fixes several bugs in 1.10.1."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.10.2 roinnt fabhtanna i 1.10.1."

msgid ""
"Fixed a crash in MySQL database validation where ``SELECT @@sql_mode`` "
"doesn't return a result (:ticket:`27180`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh timpiste i mbailíochtú bunachar sonraí MySQL nuair nach dtugann "
"``SELECT @ @sql_mode ``toradh ar ais (:ticket: `27180`)."

msgid ""
"Allowed combining ``contrib.postgres.search.SearchQuery`` with more than one "
"``&`` or ``|`` operators (:ticket:`27143`)."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaítear ``Contrib.Postgres.search.searchQuery`` a chomhcheangal le níos "
"mó ná oibreoir ``&`` nó ``|`` amháin (:ticket: `27143`)."

msgid ""
"Disabled system check for URL patterns beginning with a '/' when "
"``APPEND_SLASH=False`` (:ticket:`27238`)."
msgstr ""
"Seiceáil an chórais faoi mhíchumas le haghaidh patrúin URL ag tosú le '/' "
"nuair a bhíonn ``append_slash=false ``(:ticket: `27238`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed model form ``default`` fallback for ``CheckboxSelectMultiple``, "
"``MultiWidget``, ``FileInput``, ``SplitDateTimeWidget``, "
"``SelectDateWidget``, and ``SplitArrayWidget`` (:ticket:`27186`). Custom "
"widgets affected by this issue should "
"implement :meth:`~django.forms.Widget.value_omitted_from_data`."
msgstr ""
"Foirm mhúnla seasta ``default`` fillback do ``CheckboxSelectMultiple``, "
"`MultiWidget``, `FileInput``, `SplitDateTimeWidget``, ``SelectDateWidget``, "
"agus ``SplitarRayWidget`` (:ticket: `27186`). Ba cheart giuirléidí "
"saincheaptha a mbaineann an tsaincheist seo i bhfeidhm: meth: "
"`~django.forms.widget.value_omitted_from_data`."

msgid ""
"Fixed a crash in ``runserver`` logging during a \"Broken pipe\" error "
"(:ticket:`27271`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh timpiste i logáil ``runserver ``le linn earráide “píopa briste” "
"(:ticket: `27271 `)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression where unchanged localized date/time fields were listed as "
"changed in the admin's model history messages (:ticket:`27302`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraíodh aischéimniú inar liostaíodh réimsí dáta/ama áitiúla gan athrú mar "
"a athraíodh i dteachtaireachtaí stair samhail an riaracháin (:ticket: "
"`27302`)."

msgid "Django 1.10.3 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.10.3"

msgid "*November 1, 2016*"
msgstr "*1 Samhain, 2016*"

msgid "Django 1.10.3 fixes two security issues and several bugs in 1.10.2."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 1.10.3 dhá shaincheist slándála agus roinnt fabhtanna i "
"1.10.2."

msgid "User with hardcoded password created when running tests on Oracle"
msgstr ""
"Úsáideoir le pasfhocal crua-chódaithe crua-chruthaithe agus tástálacha á rith"

msgid ""
"When running tests with an Oracle database, Django creates a temporary "
"database user. In older versions, if a password isn't manually specified in "
"the database settings ``TEST`` dictionary, a hardcoded password is used. "
"This could allow an attacker with network access to the database server to "
"connect."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a bhíonn tástálacha á reáchtáil le bunachar sonraí Oracle, cruthaíonn "
"Django úsáideoir bunachar sonraí sealadach. I leaganacha níos sine, mura "
"sonraítear pasfhocal de láimh i bhfoclóir socruithe an bhunachair shonraí "
"``TEST``, úsáidtear pasfhocal crua-chóid. D'fhéadfadh sé seo ligean "
"d'ionsaitheoir le rochtain líonra ar an bhfreastalaí bunachar sonraí chun "
"nascadh."

msgid ""
"This user is usually dropped after the test suite completes, but not when "
"using the ``manage.py test --keepdb`` option or if the user has an active "
"session (such as an attacker's connection)."
msgstr ""
"Is gnách go dtioctar an t-úsáideoir seo tar éis don tsraith tástála a "
"chríochnú, ach ní nuair a úsáidtear an rogha ``manage.py test --keepdb`` nó "
"má tá seisiún gníomhach ag an úsáideoir (mar shampla nasc ionsaitheora)."

msgid "A randomly generated password is now used for each test run."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear pasfhocal a ghintear go randamach anois le haghaidh gach rith "
"tástála."

msgid "DNS rebinding vulnerability when ``DEBUG=True``"
msgstr "Leochaileacht DNS a athcheangal nuair a bhíonn ``debug = true``"

msgid ""
"Older versions of Django don't validate the ``Host`` header against "
"``settings.ALLOWED_HOSTS`` when ``settings.DEBUG=True``. This makes them "
"vulnerable to a `DNS rebinding attack <https://benmmurphy.github.io/blog/"
"2016/07/11/rails-webconsole-dns-rebinding/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Ní bhailíochtaíonn leaganacha níos sine de Django an ceanntásc ``Óstach`` i "
"gcoinne ``settings.ALLOWED_HOSTS`` nuair a bhíonn ``settings.DEBUG=True``. "
"Fágann sin go bhfuil siad i mbaol ionsaí athcheangail DNS <https://"
"benmmurphy.github.io/blog/2016/07/11/rails-webconsole-dns-rebinding/>`_."

msgid ""
"While Django doesn't ship a module that allows remote code execution, this "
"is at least a cross-site scripting vector, which could be quite serious if "
"developers load a copy of the production database in development or connect "
"to some production services for which there's no development instance, for "
"example. If a project uses a package like the ``django-debug-toolbar``, then "
"the attacker could execute arbitrary SQL, which could be especially bad if "
"the developers connect to the database with a superuser account."
msgstr ""
"Cé nach seolann Django modúl a cheadaíonn forghníomhú cód iargúlta, is "
"veicteoir scripteála tras-láithreáin é seo ar a laghad, a d'fhéadfadh a "
"bheith tromchúiseach go leor má luchtálann forbróirí cóip den bhunachar "
"sonraí táirgeachta i bhforbairt nó má nascann le roinnt seirbhísí "
"táirgeachta nach bhfuil aon sampla forbartha ann, mar shampla. Má úsáideann "
"tionscadal pacáiste cosúil leis an ``django-debug-toolbarra`, ansin "
"d'fhéadfadh an t-ionsaitheoir SQL treallach a fhorghníomhú, rud a "
"d'fhéadfadh a bheith go háirithe dona má nascann na forbróirí leis an "
"mbunachar sonraí le cuntas superuser."

msgid ""
"``settings.ALLOWED_HOSTS`` is now validated regardless of ``DEBUG``. For "
"convenience, if ``ALLOWED_HOSTS`` is empty and ``DEBUG=True``, the following "
"variations of localhost are allowed ``['localhost', '127.0.0.1', '::1']``. "
"If your local settings file has your production ``ALLOWED_HOSTS`` value, you "
"must now omit it to get those fallback values."
msgstr ""
"Tá `settings.allowed_hosts`` bailíochtaithe anois beag beann ar ``DEBUG`. Ar "
"mhaithe le háisiúlacht, má tá `ALLOWED_HOSTS`` folamh agus ``debug=true``, "
"ceadaítear na hathruithe seo a leanas de localhost ``['localhost', "
"'127.0.0.1', ': 1']``. Má tá do luach táirgeachta `ALLOWED_HOSTS` ag do "
"chomhad socruithe áitiúil, ní mór duit é a fhágáil anois chun na luachanna "
"cúlghairm sin a fháil."

msgid ""
"Allowed ``User.is_authenticated`` and ``User.is_anonymous`` properties to be "
"tested for ``set`` membership (:ticket:`27309`)."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaítear airíonna ``User.is_Authenticated`` agus ``User.is_anonymous`` a "
"thástáil le haghaidh ballraíochta ``set`` (:ticket: `27309`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a performance regression when running ``migrate`` in projects with "
"``RenameModel`` operations (:ticket:`27279`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraíodh aischéimniú feidhmíochta agus ``imirce`` á reáchtáil i "
"dtionscadail le hoibríochtaí ``Renamemodel`` (:ticket: `27279`)."

msgid ""
"Added ``model_name`` to the ``allow_migrate()`` calls in ``makemigrations`` "
"(:ticket:`27200`)."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh ``model_name`` leis na glaonna ``allow_migration () ``i "
"`makemigrations`` (:ticket: `27200`)."

msgid ""
"Made the ``JavaScriptCatalog`` view respect the ``packages`` argument; "
"previously it was ignored (:ticket:`27374`)."
msgstr ""
"Rinneadh an dearcadh ``JavaScriptCatalog`` meas ar an argóint ``pacáistí ``; "
"roimhe seo tugadh neamhaird air (:ticket: `27374`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed ``QuerySet.bulk_create()`` on PostgreSQL when the number of objects is "
"a multiple plus one of ``batch_size`` (:ticket:`27385`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh ``QuerySet.bulk_create () ``ar PostgreSQL nuair is é líon na rudaí "
"iolrach móide ceann de ``batch_size`` (:ticket: `27385`)."

msgid ""
"Prevented ``i18n_patterns()`` from using too much of the URL as the language "
"to fix a use case for ``prefix_default_language=False`` (:ticket:`27063`)."
msgstr ""
"Chuir sé cosc ar ``i18n_patterns () ``an iomarca den URL a úsáid mar theanga "
"chun cás úsáide a shocrú le haghaidh ``Prefix_default_LANGUAGE=false`` "
"(:ticket: `27063`)."

msgid ""
"Replaced a possibly incorrect redirect from ``SessionMiddleware`` when a "
"session is destroyed in a concurrent request with a ``SuspiciousOperation`` "
"to indicate that the request can't be completed (:ticket:`27363`)."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh athreorú mícheart d'fhéadfadh a bheith ina ionad ó "
"`SessionMiddleware` nuair a scriostar seisiún in iarratas comhthráthúil le "
"``AbhraisciousOperation`` chun a léiriú nach féidir an t-iarratas a "
"chomhlánú (:ticket: `27363`)."

msgid "Django 1.10.4 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.10.4"

msgid "*December 1, 2016*"
msgstr "*1 Nollaig, 2016*"

msgid "Django 1.10.4 fixes several bugs in 1.10.3."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.10.4 roinnt fabhtanna i 1.10.3."

msgid ""
"Quoted the Oracle test user's password in queries to fix the \"ORA-00922: "
"missing or invalid option\" error when the password starts with a number or "
"special character (:ticket:`27420`)."
msgstr ""
"Luaigh pasfhocal úsáideora tástála Oracle i gceisteanna chun an earráid "
"“ORA-00922: rogha ar iarraidh nó neamhbhailí” a shocrú nuair a thosaíonn an "
"pasfhocal le huimhir nó carachtar speisialta (:ticket: `27420`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed incorrect ``app_label`` / ``model_name`` arguments for "
"``allow_migrate()`` in ``makemigrations`` migration consistency checks "
"(:ticket:`27461`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh argóintí míchearta ``app_label``/``model_name`` do `allow_migration "
"() ``i seiceálacha comhsheasmhachta imirce ``makemigrations`` (:ticket: "
"`27461`)."

msgid ""
"Made ``Model.delete(keep_parents=True)`` preserve parent reverse "
"relationships in multi-table inheritance (:ticket:`27407`)."
msgstr ""
"Rinneadh ``Model.delete (Keep_Parents=True) ``caidrimh droim thuismitheoirí "
"a chaomhnú in oidhreacht il-tábla (:ticket: `27407`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a ``QuerySet.update()`` crash on SQLite when updating a "
"``DateTimeField`` with an ``F()`` expression and a ``timedelta`` "
"(:ticket:`27544`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh timpiste ``QuerySet.Update () ``ar SQLite nuair a nuashonraítear "
"``DateTimeField`` le abairt ``F ()`` agus ``timedel` (:ticket: `27544`)."

msgid ""
"Prevented ``LocaleMiddleware`` from redirecting on URLs that should return "
"404 when using ``prefix_default_language=False`` (:ticket:`27402`)."
msgstr ""
"Cosc ar ``LocalEmiddleware`` ó atreorú ar URLanna ar chóir go bhfaighfeadh "
"404 ar ais nuair a úsáidtear ``Prefix_Default_Languag-Fale`` (:ticket: "
"`27402`)."

msgid ""
"Prevented an unnecessary index from being created on an InnoDB "
"``ForeignKey`` when the field was added after the model was created "
"(:ticket:`27558`)."
msgstr ""
"Chuir sé cosc ar innéacs neamhriachtanach a chruthú ar InnoDB ``ForeignKey`` "
"nuair a cuireadh an réimse leis tar éis an tsamhail a chruthú (:ticket: "
"`27558`)."

msgid "Django 1.10.5 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.10.5"

msgid "*January 4, 2017*"
msgstr "*4 Eanáir, 2017*"

msgid "Django 1.10.5 fixes several bugs in 1.10.4."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.10.5 roinnt fabhtanna i 1.10.4."

msgid ""
"Fixed a crash in the debug view if ``request.user`` can't be retrieved, such "
"as if the database is unavailable (:ticket:`27567`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh timpiste sa radharc dífhabhtaithe mura féidir ``request.user`` a "
"aisghabháil, amhail mura bhfuil an bunachar sonraí ar fáil (:ticket: "
"`27567`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed occasional missing plural forms in ``JavaScriptCatalog`` "
"(:ticket:`27418`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh foirmeacha iolra in easnamh ó am go chéile i `JavaScriptCatalog`` "
"(:ticket: `27418`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in the ``timesince`` and ``timeuntil`` filters that "
"caused incorrect results for dates in a leap year (:ticket:`27637`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú sna scagairí ``timesince`` agus `timeuntil`` a bhí ina "
"chúis le torthaí míchearta do dhátaí i mbliain léim (:ticket: `27637`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression where ``collectstatic`` overwrote newer files in remote "
"storages (:ticket:`27658`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú nuair a scríobh `collectstatic`` comhaid níos nuaí i "
"gcianstórálaí (:ticket: `27658`)."

msgid "Django 1.10.6 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.10.6"

msgid "*March 1, 2017*"
msgstr "*1 Márta, 2017*"

msgid "Django 1.10.6 fixes several bugs in 1.10.5."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.10.6 roinnt fabhtanna i 1.10.5."

msgid ""
"Fixed ``ClearableFileInput``’s \"Clear\" checkbox on model form fields where "
"the model field has a ``default`` (:ticket:`27805`)."
msgstr ""
"Seasta bosca seiceála “Glan” `ClearableFileInput`` ar réimsí foirm mhúnla "
"ina bhfuil ``default`` sa réimse samhail (:ticket: `27805`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed ``RequestDataTooBig`` and ``TooManyFieldsSent`` exceptions crashing "
"rather than generating a bad request response (:ticket:`27820`)."
msgstr ""
"Seasta eisceachtaí ``RequestDatatoObig`` agus `ToomanyFieldssent`` ag titim "
"seachas droch-fhreagra iarratais a ghiniúint (:ticket: `27820`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a crash on Oracle and PostgreSQL when subtracting ``DurationField`` or "
"``IntegerField`` from ``DateField`` (:ticket:`27828`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh timpiste ar Oracle agus PostgreSQL nuair a bhíonn `DurationField`` "
"nó `IntegerField`` á bhaint as ``DateField`` (:ticket: `27828`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed query expression date subtraction accuracy on PostgreSQL for "
"differences larger than a month (:ticket:`27856`)."
msgstr ""
"Cruinneas faoin dáta léirithe fiosrúcháin seasta ar PostgreSQL le haghaidh "
"difríochtaí níos mó ná mí (:ticket: `27856`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a ``GDALException`` raised by ``GDALClose`` on GDAL ≥ 2.0 "
"(:ticket:`27479`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh ``GdalException`` arna ardú ag ``GdalClose`` ar GDAL ≥ 2.0 "
"(:ticket: `27479`)."

msgid "Django 1.10.7 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.10.7"

msgid "*April 4, 2017*"
msgstr "*4 Aibreán, 2017*"

msgid "Django 1.10.7 fixes two security issues and a bug in 1.10.6."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.10.7 dhá shaincheist slándála agus fabht i 1.10.6."

msgid ""
"CVE-2017-7233: Open redirect and possible XSS attack via user-supplied "
"numeric redirect URLs"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2017-7233: Athsheoladh oscailte agus ionsaí XSS féideartha trí URLanna "
"atreoraithe uimhriúla a sholáthraíonn an úsáideoir"

msgid ""
"Django relies on user input in some cases  (e.g. "
"``django.contrib.auth.views.login()`` and :doc:`i18n </topics/i18n/index>`) "
"to redirect the user to an \"on success\" URL. The security check for these "
"redirects (namely ``django.utils.http.is_safe_url()``) considered some "
"numeric URLs (e.g. ``http:999999999``) \"safe\" when they shouldn't be."
msgstr ""
"Braitheann Django ar ionchur úsáideora i roinnt cásanna (m.sh. "
"``django.contrib.auth.views.login () ``agus:doc: `i18n`) chun an t-úsáideoir "
"a atreorú chuig URL “ar rath”. </topics/i18n/index> Mheas an seiceáil "
"slándála do na haatreoruithe seo (eadhon ``django.utils.http.is_safe_url () "
"``) roinnt URLanna uimhriúla (m.sh. `http:999999999``) “sábháilte” nuair nár "
"chóir iad a bheith."

msgid ""
"Also, if a developer relies on ``is_safe_url()`` to provide safe redirect "
"targets and puts such a URL into a link, they could suffer from an XSS "
"attack."
msgstr ""
"Chomh maith leis sin, má bhraitheann forbróir ar ``is_safe_url () ``chun "
"spriocanna athsheolta sábháilte a sholáthar agus má chuireann sé URL den "
"sórt sin i nasc, d'fhéadfadh siad a bheith ag fulaingt ó ionsaí XSS."

msgid ""
"CVE-2017-7234: Open redirect vulnerability in ``django.views.static.serve()``"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2017-7234: Leochaileacht atreoraithe oscailte i "
"``django.views.static.serve () ``"

msgid ""
"A maliciously crafted URL to a Django site using "
"the :func:`~django.views.static.serve` view could redirect to any other "
"domain. The view no longer does any redirects as they don't provide any "
"known, useful functionality."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh URL ceardaithe go mailíseach chuig suíomh Django ag baint úsáide "
"as an amharc:func: `~django.views.static.serve` a atreorú chuig aon fhearann "
"eile. Ní dhéanann an dearcadh aon atreoruithe a thuilleadh toisc nach "
"soláthraíonn siad aon fheidhmiúlacht úsáideach ar eolas."

msgid ""
"Note, however, that this view has always carried a warning that it is not "
"hardened for production use and should be used only as a development aid."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara, áfach, go raibh rabhadh i gcónaí ag an dearcadh seo nach "
"bhfuil sé cruaite le haghaidh úsáide táirgeachta agus gur chóir é a úsáid "
"ach mar chúnamh forbartha."

msgid ""
"Made admin's ``RelatedFieldWidgetWrapper`` use the wrapped widget's "
"``value_omitted_from_data()`` method (:ticket:`27905`)."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann “RelatedFieldWidgetWrapper” riaracháin Made modh "
"``value_omitted_from_data () ``an giuirléid fillte (:ticket: `27905`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed model form ``default`` fallback for ``SelectMultiple`` "
"(:ticket:`27993`)."
msgstr ""
"Foirm mhúnla seasta ``default`` filleadh ar ``SelectMultiple`` (:ticket: "
"`27993`)."

msgid "Django 1.10.8 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.10.8"

msgid "*September 5, 2017*"
msgstr "*Meán Fómhair 5, 2017*"

msgid "Django 1.10.8 fixes a security issue in 1.10.7."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.10.8 saincheist slándála i 1.10.7."

msgid ""
"CVE-2017-12794: Possible XSS in traceback section of technical 500 debug page"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2017-12794: XSS féideartha i gcuid rianaithe de leathanach dífhabhtaithe "
"teicniúil 500"

msgid ""
"In older versions, HTML autoescaping was disabled in a portion of the "
"template for the technical 500 debug page. Given the right circumstances, "
"this allowed a cross-site scripting attack. This vulnerability shouldn't "
"affect most production sites since you shouldn't run with ``DEBUG = True`` "
"(which makes this page accessible) in your production settings."
msgstr ""
"I leaganacha níos sine, díchumasaíodh uath-éalú HTML i gcuid den teimpléad "
"don leathanach dífhabhtaithe teicniúil 500. I bhfianaise na gcúinsí cearta, "
"cheadaigh sé seo ionsaí scriptithe tras-láithreáin. Níor cheart go "
"gcuirfeadh an leochaileacht seo isteach ar fhormhór na suíomhanna táirgthe "
"mar níor cheart duit rith le ``DEBUG = True`` (a chuireann an leathanach seo "
"inrochtana) i do shocruithe táirgeachta."

msgid "Django 1.11 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11"

msgid "Welcome to Django 1.11!"
msgstr "Fáilte go dtí Django 1.11!"

msgid ""
"These release notes cover the :ref:`new features <whats-new-1.11>`, as well "
"as some :ref:`backwards incompatible changes <backwards-incompatible-1.11>` "
"you'll want to be aware of when upgrading from Django 1.10 or older "
"versions. We've :ref:`begun the deprecation process for some features "
"<deprecated-features-1.11>`."
msgstr ""
"Clúdaíonn na nótaí scaoilte seo na:ref: `gnéithe nua <whats-new-1.11>`, "
"chomh maith le roinnt: ref: `athruithe neamh-chomhoiriúnacha ar "
"chúl<backwards-incompatible-1.11>` a mbeidh tú ag iarraidh a bheith ar an "
"eolas fúthu agus tú ag uasghrádú ó Django 1.10 nó leaganacha níos sine. "
"<deprecated-features-1.11>We've:ref: `thosaigh an próiseas díghabhála do "
"roinnt gnéithe `."

msgid ""
"Django 1.11 is designated as a :term:`long-term support release <Long-term "
"support release>`. It will receive security updates for at least three years "
"after its release. Support for the previous LTS, Django 1.8, will end in "
"April 2018."
msgstr ""
"<Long-term support release>Ainmnítear Django 1.11 mar a: téarma: `scaoileadh "
"tacaíochta fadtéarmach `. Gheobhaidh sé nuashonruithe slándála ar feadh trí "
"bliana ar a laghad tar éis a scaoilte Beidh deireadh le tacaíocht don LTS "
"roimhe seo, Django 1.8, i mí Aibreáin 2018."

msgid ""
"Django 1.11 requires Python 2.7, 3.4, 3.5, 3.6, or 3.7 (as of 1.11.17). We "
"**highly recommend** and only officially support the latest release of each "
"series."
msgstr ""
"Éilíonn Django 1.11 Python 2.7, 3.4, 3.5, 3.6, nó 3.7 (amhail 1.11.17). "
"Molaimid** go hard** agus ní thacaímid go hoifigiúil ach leis an scaoileadh "
"is déanaí de gach sraith."

msgid ""
"The Django 1.11.x series is the last to support Python 2. The next major "
"release, Django 2.0, will only support Python 3.4+."
msgstr ""
"Is é an tsraith Django 1.11.x an ceann deireanach a thacaíonn le Python 2. "
"Ní thacóidh an chéad eisiúint mhór eile, Django 2.0, ach le Python 3.4+."

msgid "Deprecating warnings are no longer loud by default"
msgstr "Ní bhíonn rabhaidh dhíspreagtha ard a thuilleadh de réir réamhshoc"

msgid ""
"Unlike older versions of Django, Django's own deprecation warnings are no "
"longer displayed by default. This is consistent with Python's default "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"Murab ionann agus leaganacha níos sine de Django, ní thaispeántar rabhaidh "
"diúltaithe Django féin de réir réamhshocraithe a thuilleadh. Tá sé seo ag "
"teacht le hiompar réamhshocraithe Python."

msgid ""
"This change allows third-party apps to support both Django 1.11 LTS and "
"Django 1.8 LTS without having to add code to avoid deprecation warnings."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an t-athrú seo d'aipeanna tríú páirtí tacú le Django 1.11 LTS agus "
"Django 1.8 LTS araon gan cód a chur leis chun rabhaidh díghrádaithe a "
"sheachaint."

msgid ""
"Following the release of Django 2.0, we suggest that third-party app authors "
"drop support for all versions of Django prior to 1.11. At that time, you "
"should be able run your package's tests using ``python -Wd`` so that "
"deprecation warnings do appear. After making the deprecation warning fixes, "
"your app should be compatible with Django 2.0."
msgstr ""
"Tar éis Django 2.0 a scaoileadh, molaimid go scaoilfidh údair aip tríú "
"páirtí tacaíocht do gach leagan de Django roimh 1.11. Ag an am sin, ba "
"cheart go mbeadh tú in ann tástálacha do phacáiste a reáchtáil ag baint "
"úsáide as `python -Wd`` ionas go mbeidh rabhaidh dífhabhtaithe le feiceáil. "
"Tar éis duit na socruithe rabhaidh díghrádaithe a dhéanamh, ba chóir go "
"mbeadh d'aip comhoiriúnach le Django 2.0."

msgid "What's new in Django 1.11"
msgstr "Cad atá nua i Django 1.11"

msgid "Class-based model indexes"
msgstr "Innéacsanna samhail rang-bhunaithe"

msgid ""
"The new :mod:`django.db.models.indexes` module contains classes which ease "
"creating database indexes. Indexes are added to models using "
"the :attr:`Meta.indexes <django.db.models.Options.indexes>` option."
msgstr ""
"Tá ranganna sa mhodúl nua:mod: `django.db.models.indexes` a éascaíonn "
"innéacsanna bunachar sonraí a chruthú. "
"<django.db.models.Options.indexes>Cuirtear innéacsanna le samhlacha ag baint "
"úsáide as an rogha: attr: `Meta.Indexes `."

msgid ""
"The :class:`~django.db.models.Index` class creates a b-tree index, as if you "
"used :attr:`~django.db.models.Field.db_index` on the model field or "
"``index_together`` on the model ``Meta`` class. It can be subclassed to "
"support different index types, such "
"as :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.indexes.GinIndex`. It also allows "
"defining the order (ASC/DESC) for the columns of the index."
msgstr ""
"Cruthaíonn an rang:Class: `~django.db.models.index` innéacs b-crann, amhail "
"is dá n-úsáide:attr: `~django.db.models.field.db_index` ar an réimse samhail "
"nó ``index_together ``ar an rang `Meta`` samhail. Is féidir é a fho-aicmiú "
"chun tacú le cineálacha innéacs éagsúla, mar shampla:class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.indexes.ginIndex`. Ligeann sé freisin an t-ord "
"(ASC/DESC) a shainiú do cholúin an innéacs."

msgid "Template-based widget rendering"
msgstr "Rindreáil giuirléid bunaithe ar theimpléad"

msgid ""
"To ease customizing widgets, form widget rendering is now done using the "
"template system rather than in Python. See :doc:`/ref/forms/renderers`."
msgstr ""
"Chun giuirléidí a shaincheapadh a éascú, déantar rindreáil giuirléid foirme "
"anois ag baint úsáide as an gcóras teimplé Féach: doc: `/ref/foirme/"
"renderers`."

msgid ""
"You may need to adjust any custom widgets that you've written for a "
"few :ref:`backwards incompatible changes <template-widget-"
"incompatibilities-1-11>`."
msgstr ""
"<template-widget-incompatibilities-1-11>B'fhéidir go mbeidh ort aon "
"ghuirléidí saincheaptha atá scríofa agat a choigeartú le haghaidh cúpla "
"athrú: ref: `athruithe neamh-chomhoiriúnacha ar ais `."

msgid "``Subquery`` expressions"
msgstr "Nathanna ``Subcheiste``"

msgid ""
"The new :class:`~django.db.models.Subquery` "
"and :class:`~django.db.models.Exists` database expressions allow creating "
"explicit subqueries. Subqueries may refer to fields from the outer queryset "
"using the :class:`~django.db.models.OuterRef` class."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn na nathanna bunachar sonraí nua:class: "
"`~django.db.models.subquery` agus:class: `~django.db.models.exists` fo-"
"cheisteanna follasacha a chruthú. Féadfaidh fo-cheisteanna tagairt a "
"dhéanamh do réimsí ón tacar ceisteanna seachtrach ag baint úsáide as an "
"aic:class: `~Django.db.Models.OuterRef`."

msgid ""
":attr:`.ModelAdmin.date_hierarchy` can now reference fields across relations."
msgstr ""
":attr: Is féidir le `.ModelAdmin.Date_Hierarchy` réimsí tagartha a dhéanamh "
"anois ar fud caidrimh."

msgid ""
"The new :meth:`ModelAdmin.get_exclude() "
"<django.contrib.admin.ModelAdmin.get_exclude>` hook allows specifying the "
"exclude fields based on the request or model instance."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an crúca nua:meth: `ModelAdmin.get_Exclude () "
"<django.contrib.admin.ModelAdmin.get_exclude>`na réimsí eisiata a shonrú "
"bunaithe ar an iarratas nó an tsamhail."

msgid ""
"The ``popup_response.html`` template can now be overridden per app, per "
"model, or by setting the :attr:`.ModelAdmin.popup_response_template` "
"attribute."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir an teimpléad ``popup_response.html`` a shárú anois in aghaidh an "
"aip, in aghaidh an tsamhail, nó tríd an tréith: :attr: "
"`.modeladmin.popup_response_template` a shocrú."

msgid ""
"The default iteration count for the PBKDF2 password hasher is increased by "
"20%."
msgstr ""
"Méadaítear 20% an líon athraithe réamhshocraithe don hasher pasfhocal PBKDF2."

msgid ""
"The :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.LoginView` "
"and :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.LogoutView` class-based views "
"supersede the deprecated ``login()`` and ``logout()`` function-based views."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann tuairimí rang-bhunaithe an:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.views.loginView` agus:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.views.logoutView` in ionad na tuairimí bunaithe ar "
"fheidhm ``login () ``agus ``logout () `."

msgid ""
"The :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.PasswordChangeView`, :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.PasswordChangeDoneView`, :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.PasswordResetView`, :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.PasswordResetDoneView`, :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.PasswordResetConfirmView`, "
"and :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.PasswordResetCompleteView` class-"
"based views supersede the deprecated ``password_change()``, "
"``password_change_done()``, ``password_reset()``, ``password_reset_done()``, "
"``password_reset_confirm()``, and ``password_reset_complete()`` function-"
"based views."
msgstr ""
"The:Class: `~django.contrib.auth.views.passwordChangeView`, :class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.views.paswordChangeDoneView`, :class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.views.passwordResetView`, :class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.views.wordDresetView` `, :class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.views.PasswordResetConfirmView`, agus:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.views.PasswordResetCompleteView` athsholáthraíonn "
"tuairimí aicmbunaithe ar an `password_change () ``, `password_change ()`, "
"`wordpass_reset ()``, ``password_reset_done () ``, `password_reset_confirm "
"()``, agus ``password_reset_complete () `` tuairimí bunaithe ar fheidhm."

msgid ""
"The new ``post_reset_login`` attribute "
"for :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.PasswordResetConfirmView` allows "
"automatically logging in a user after a successful password reset. If you "
"have multiple ``AUTHENTICATION_BACKENDS`` configured, use the "
"``post_reset_login_backend`` attribute to choose which one to use."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn an tréith nua ``post_reset_login`` d':class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.views.passwordResetConfirmView` logáil isteach go "
"huathoibríoch ar úsáideoir tar éis athshocrú pasfhocal rathúil. Má tá go "
"leor ``AUTHENTICATION_BACKENDS` cumraithe agat, bain úsáid as an tréith "
"``post_reset_login_backend`` chun cén ceann atá le húsáid a roghnú."

msgid ""
"To avoid the possibility of leaking a password reset token via the HTTP "
"Referer header (for example, if the reset page includes a reference to CSS "
"or JavaScript hosted on another domain), "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.PasswordResetConfirmView` (but not "
"the deprecated ``password_reset_confirm()`` function-based view) stores the "
"token in a session and redirects to itself to present the password change "
"form to the user without the token in the URL."
msgstr ""
"Chun an fhéidearthacht comhartha athshocraithe pasfhocal a sceitheadh trí "
"cheanntásc HTTP Referer a sheachaint (mar shampla, má chuimsíonn an "
"leathanach athshocraithe tagairt do CSS nó JavaScript arna óstáil ar "
"fhearann eile), stóráilíonn an:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.views.PasswordResetConfirmView` (ach ní an "
"`password_reset_confirm () `amharc feidhm-bhunaithe) treoraíonn sé féin chun "
"an fhoirm athraithe pasfhocal a chur i láthair don úsáideoir gan an "
"comhartha san URL."

msgid ""
":func:`~django.contrib.auth.update_session_auth_hash` now rotates the "
"session key to allow a password change to invalidate stolen session cookies."
msgstr ""
":func: `~django.contrib.auth.update_session_auth_hash` rothlaíonn an eochair "
"seisiúin anois chun athrú pasfhocal a cheadú chun fianáin seisiúin goidte a "
"chur ar bhailí."

msgid ""
"The new ``success_url_allowed_hosts`` attribute "
"for :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.LoginView` "
"and :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.LogoutView` allows specifying a set "
"of hosts that are safe for redirecting after login and logout."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn an tréith nua ``success_url_allowed_hosts`` d':class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.views.loginView` agus:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.views.logoutView` sraith óstach atá sábháilte le "
"hathreorú tar éis logáil isteach agus logáil amach a shonrú."

msgid ""
"Added password validators ``help_text`` "
"to :class:`~django.contrib.auth.forms.UserCreationForm`."
msgstr ""
"Breiseadh bailíochtóirí pasfhocal ``help_text`` chuig:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.forms.userCreationForm`."

msgid ""
"The ``HttpRequest`` is now passed "
"to :func:`~django.contrib.auth.authenticate` which in turn passes it to the "
"authentication backend if it accepts a ``request`` argument."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear an `HttpRequest`` anois chuig:func: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.autenticate` a chuireann chuig an gcúltaca "
"fíordheimhnithe é ina dhiaidh sin má ghlacann sé le argóint ``request``."

msgid ""
"The :func:`~django.contrib.auth.signals.user_login_failed` signal now "
"receives a ``request`` argument."
msgstr ""
"Faigheann an comhartha:func: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.signals.user_login_failed` argóint ``iarrat`` anois."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.contrib.auth.forms.PasswordResetForm` supports custom user "
"models that use an email field named something other than ``'email'``. "
"Set :attr:`CustomUser.EMAIL_FIELD "
"<django.contrib.auth.models.CustomUser.EMAIL_FIELD>` to the name of the "
"field."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.contrib.auth.forms.PasswordResetForm` tacaíonn le samhlacha "
"úsáideora saincheaptha a úsáideann réimse ríomhphoist darb ainm rud éigin "
"seachas ```email'`. "
"<django.contrib.auth.models.CustomUser.EMAIL_FIELD>Socraigh: attr: "
"`CustomUser.email_field `chuig ainm an réimse."

msgid ""
":func:`~django.contrib.auth.get_user_model` can now be called at import "
"time, even in modules that define models."
msgstr ""
":func: Is féidir `~django.contrib.auth.get_user_model` a ghlaoch anois ag am "
"allmhairithe, fiú i modúil a shainmhíníonn samhlacha."

msgid ":mod:`django.contrib.contenttypes`"
msgstr ":mod: `django.contrib.contenttypes`"

msgid ""
"When stale content types are detected in "
"the :djadmin:`remove_stale_contenttypes` command, there's now a list of "
"related objects such as ``auth.Permission``\\s that will also be deleted. "
"Previously, only the content types were listed (and this prompt was after "
"``migrate`` rather than in a separate command)."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a bhraitear cineálacha ábhar seasta san ordú:djadmin: "
"`remove_stale_contenttypes`, tá liosta de rudaí gaolmhara ann anois mar "
"`Auth.Permission``\\ s a scriosfar freisin. Roimhe seo, níor liostaíodh ach "
"na cineálacha ábhair (agus bhí an pras seo tar éis ``imirce`` seachas in "
"ordú ar leithligh)."

msgid ""
"The new :meth:`.GEOSGeometry.from_gml` and :meth:`.OGRGeometry.from_gml` "
"methods allow creating geometries from GML."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn na modhanna nua:meth: `.geosgeometry.from_GML` agus:meth: "
"`.ogrgeometry.from_GML` geoiméadraí a chruthú ó GML."

msgid "Added support for the :lookup:`dwithin` lookup on SpatiaLite."
msgstr "Tacaíocht bhreise don chuardach: lookup: `dwithin` ar SpatiaLite."

msgid ""
"The :class:`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.Area` "
"function, :class:`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.Distance` "
"function, and distance lookups now work with geodetic coordinates on "
"SpatiaLite."
msgstr ""
"Oibríonn an fheidhm: Class: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.Area`, :class: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.distance` feidhm, agus cuardaigh "
"achair anois le comhordanáidí geodéiseacha ar Spatialite."

msgid ""
"The OpenLayers-based form widgets now use ``OpenLayers.js`` from ``https://"
"cdnjs.cloudflare.com`` which is more suitable for production use than the "
"old ``https://openlayers.org/`` source. They are also updated to use "
"OpenLayers 3."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann na giuirléidí foirmeacha bunaithe ar OpenLayers anois "
"``OpenLayers.js ``ó`` https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com ``atá níos oiriúnaí le "
"húsáid táirgeachta ná an sean-fhoinse`` https://openlayers.org/ ``. Déantar "
"iad a nuashonrú freisin chun OpenLayers 3 a úsáid."

msgid "PostGIS migrations can now change field dimensions."
msgstr "Is féidir le himirce PostGIS toisí réimse a athrú anois."

msgid ""
"Added the ability to pass the ``size``, ``shape``, and ``offset`` parameters "
"when creating :class:`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.GDALRaster` objects."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh an cumas leis na paraiméadair ``size ``, `shape``, agus ``offset`` "
"a rith agus rudaí:class: `~django.contrib.gis.gdal.gdalRaster` á chruthú."

msgid ""
"Added SpatiaLite support for "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.IsValid` "
"function, :class:`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.MakeValid` "
"function, and :lookup:`isvalid` lookup."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear tacaíocht Spatialite leis an bhfeidhm: class: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.isValid`, :class: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.makeValid` feidhm, agus:lookup: "
"`isvalid` cuardach."

msgid ""
"Added Oracle support for "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.AsGML` "
"function, :class:`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.BoundingCircle` "
"function, :class:`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.IsValid` function, "
"and :lookup:`isvalid` lookup."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh tacaíocht Oracle leis an bhfeidhm: class: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.asgml`, :class: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.boundingCircle` feidhm, :class: "
"`~django.contrib.db.models.functions.isvalid` feidhm, agus:lookup: `validis`."

msgid ""
"The new ``distinct`` argument "
"for :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.aggregates.StringAgg` determines if "
"concatenated values will be distinct."
msgstr ""
"Cinneann an argóint nua ``distint`` do:class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.aggregates.stringagg` an mbeidh luachanna "
"comhtháite ar leith."

msgid ""
"The new :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.indexes.GinIndex` "
"and :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.indexes.BrinIndex` classes allow "
"creating ``GIN`` and ``BRIN`` indexes in the database."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn na ranganna nua:class: `~django.contrib.postgres.indexes.ginIndex` "
"agus:class: `~django.contrib.postgres.indexes.brinIndex` innéacsanna ``GIN`` "
"agus `BRIN`` a chruthú sa bhunachar sonraí."

msgid ""
"``django.contrib.postgres.fields.JSONField`` accepts a new ``encoder`` "
"parameter to specify a custom class to encode data types not supported by "
"the standard encoder."
msgstr ""
"Glacann ``django.contrib.postgres.fields.jsonfield`` le paraiméadar nua "
"``encoder`` chun rang saincheaptha a shonrú chun cineálacha sonraí nach "
"dtacaíonn an t-ionchódóir caighdeánach a ionchódú."

msgid ""
"The new ``CIText`` mixin "
"and :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.operations.CITextExtension` migration "
"operation allow using PostgreSQL's ``citext`` extension for case-insensitive "
"lookups. Three fields are provided: ``CICharField``, ``CIEmailField``, and "
"``CITextField``."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an t-oibríocht imirce nua ``citext`` agus:class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.operations.CiteXtExtension` síneadh ``citext`` "
"PostgreSQL a úsáid le haghaidh cuardaigh cás-neamh-íogair. Cuirtear trí "
"réimse ar fáil: `Cicharfield``, `Ciemailfield``, agus ``CitextField``."

msgid ""
"The new :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.aggregates.JSONBAgg` allows "
"aggregating values as a JSON array."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn an nua:class: `~django.contrib.postgres.aggregates.jsonBagg` "
"luachanna a chomhiomlánú mar eagar JSON."

msgid ""
"The :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.HStoreField` (model field) "
"and :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.forms.HStoreField` (form field) allow "
"storing null values."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn an: Class: `~django.contrib.postgres.fields.hStorefield` (réimse "
"samhail) agus:class: `~django.contrib.postgres.forms.hStorefield` (réimse "
"foirme) luachanna null a stóráil."

msgid ""
"Memcached backends now pass the contents of :setting:`OPTIONS <CACHES-"
"OPTIONS>` as keyword arguments to the client constructors, allowing for more "
"advanced control of client behavior. See the :ref:`cache arguments "
"<cache_arguments>` documentation for examples."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann cúltaca Memcached anois ábhar: socrú: `OPTIONS <CACHES-OPTIONS>`mar "
"argóintí eochairfhocal chuig tógálaí na gcliant, rud a cheadaíonn rialú níos "
"airde ar iompar cliant. Féach an doiciméad:ref: `cache argóintí "
"<cache_arguments>`le haghaidh samplaí."

msgid ""
"Memcached backends now allow defining multiple servers as a comma-delimited "
"string in :setting:`LOCATION <CACHES-LOCATION>`, for convenience with third-"
"party services that use such strings in environment variables."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann cúltaca Memcached anois freastalaithe iolracha a shainiú mar shreang "
"teoranta le camóg in:socrú: `LOCATION <CACHES-LOCATION>`, ar mhaithe le "
"seirbhísí tríú páirtí a úsáideann teaghráin den sórt sin in athróga "
"comhshaoil."

msgid ""
"Added the :setting:`CSRF_USE_SESSIONS` setting to allow storing the CSRF "
"token in the user's session rather than in a cookie."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh an socrú: socrú: `CSRF_USE_SESSIONS` leis chun an comhartha CSRF a "
"stóráil i seisiún an úsáideora seachas i bhfianán."

msgid ""
"Added the ``skip_locked`` argument to :meth:`.QuerySet.select_for_update()` "
"on PostgreSQL 9.5+ and Oracle to execute queries with ``FOR UPDATE SKIP "
"LOCKED``."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh an argóint `skip_locked`` leis la:meth: "
"`.queryset.select_for_update () `ar PostgreSQL 9.5+ agus Oracle chun "
"ceisteanna a fhorghníomhú le ``FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED``."

msgid ""
"Added the :setting:`TEST['TEMPLATE'] <TEST_TEMPLATE>` setting to let "
"PostgreSQL users specify a template for creating the test database."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh an socrú: socrú: `TEST ['TEMPLATE'] <TEST_TEMPLATE>`leis chun "
"ligean d'úsáideoirí PostgreSQL teimpléad a shonrú chun an bunachar sonraí "
"tástála a chruthú."

msgid ""
":meth:`.QuerySet.iterator()` now uses `server-side cursors`_ on PostgreSQL. "
"This feature transfers some of the worker memory load (used to hold query "
"results) to the database and might increase database memory usage."
msgstr ""
":meth:`.QuerySet.iterator()` úsáideann `cúrsóirí taobh an fhreastalaí`_ "
"anois ar PostgreSQL. Aistríonn an ghné seo cuid d’ualach cuimhne an oibrí (a "
"úsáidtear chun torthaí fiosrúcháin a choinneáil) chuig an mbunachar sonraí "
"agus d’fhéadfadh sé úsáid chuimhne an bhunachair shonraí a mhéadú."

msgid ""
"Added MySQL support for the ``'isolation_level'`` option "
"in :setting:`OPTIONS` to allow specifying the :ref:`transaction isolation "
"level <mysql-isolation-level>`. To avoid possible data loss, it's "
"recommended to switch from MySQL's default level, repeatable read, to read "
"committed."
msgstr ""
"<mysql-isolation-level>Cuireadh tacaíocht MySQL leis an rogha "
"```isolation_level'`` in:setting: `OPTIONS` chun ligean an: ref: `leibhéal "
"aonrú idirbheart `a shonrú. Chun caillteanas sonraí féideartha a sheachaint, "
"moltar aistriú ó leibhéal réamhshocraithe MySQL, inathsheolta, go léamh "
"tiomanta."

msgid "Added support for ``cx_Oracle`` 5.3."
msgstr "Tacaíocht bhreise do ``CX_Oracle ``5.3."

msgid "Email"
msgstr "Ríomhphost"

msgid ""
"Added the :setting:`EMAIL_USE_LOCALTIME` setting to allow sending SMTP date "
"headers in the local time zone rather than in UTC."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh an socrú: leagan: `EMAIL_USE_LOCALTIME` leis chun ceannteidil dáta "
"SMTP a sheoladh sa chrios ama áitiúil seachas i UTC."

msgid ""
"``EmailMessage.attach()`` and ``attach_file()`` now fall back to MIME "
"type :mimetype:`application/octet-stream` when binary content that can't be "
"decoded as UTF-8 is specified for a :mimetype:`text/*` attachment."
msgstr ""
"Tagann ``emailmessage.attachment () ``agus ``attach_file ()`` ar ais anois "
"go cineál MIME: mimetype: `application/octet-stream` nuair a shonraítear "
"ábhar dénártha nach féidir a dhíchódú mar UTF-8 le haghaidh a:mimetype: "
"`text/*` ceangaltán."

msgid ""
"To make it wrappable "
"by :class:`io.TextIOWrapper`, :class:`~django.core.files.File` now has the "
"``readable()``, ``writable()``, and ``seekable()`` methods."
msgstr ""
"Chun é a dhéanamh infhilleadh ag: class: `IO.TextioWrapper`, :class: "
"`~django.core.files.file` anois tá na modhanna ``inléiteach () ``, `scríofa "
"()``, agus ``searchable () ``."

msgid ""
"The new ``empty_value`` attribute "
"on :class:`~django.forms.CharField`, :class:`~django.forms.EmailField`, :class:`~django.forms.RegexField`, :class:`~django.forms.SlugField`, "
"and :class:`~django.forms.URLField` allows specifying the Python value to "
"use to represent \"empty\"."
msgstr ""
"An tréith nua ``empty_value`` ar:class: `~django.forms.charfield`, :class: "
"`~django.forms.emailfield`, :class: `~django.forms.regexfield`, :class: "
"`~django.forms.slugfield`, agus:class: `~django.forms.URLField` Ligeann ELD` "
"an luach Python le húsáid a shonrú chun “folamh” a léiriú."

msgid ""
"The new :meth:`Form.get_initial_for_field() "
"<django.forms.Form.get_initial_for_field>` method returns initial data for a "
"form field."
msgstr ""
"<django.forms.Form.get_initial_for_field>Tugann an modh nua:meth: "
"`form.get_initial_for_field () `sonraí tosaigh ar ais do réimse foirme."

msgid ""
"Number formatting and the :setting:`NUMBER_GROUPING` setting support non-"
"uniform digit grouping."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn formáidiú uimhreacha agus an socrú: `NUMBER_GROUPING` le grúpáil "
"dhigit neamh-aonfhoirmeach."

msgid ""
"The new :option:`loaddata --exclude` option allows excluding models and apps "
"while loading data from fixtures."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn an rogha nua:option: `loaddata --exclude` samhlacha agus aipeanna "
"a eisiamh agus sonraí á luchtú ó daingneáin."

msgid ""
"The new :option:`diffsettings --default` option allows specifying a settings "
"module other than Django's default settings to compare against."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an rogha nua:option: `diffsettings --default` modúl socruithe "
"seachas socruithe réamhshocraithe Django a shonrú chun comparáid a dhéanamh "
"ina gcoinne."

msgid ""
"``app_label``\\s arguments now limit the :option:`showmigrations --plan` "
"output."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann argóintí `app_label`` teorainn anois leis an aschur: "
"`showmigrations --plan."

msgid "Added support for serialization of ``uuid.UUID`` objects."
msgstr "Tacaíocht bhreise le haghaidh sraitheadh rudaí ``UUID.UUID ``."

msgid ""
"Added support for callable values in the ``defaults`` argument "
"of :meth:`QuerySet.update_or_create() "
"<django.db.models.query.QuerySet.update_or_create>` "
"and :meth:`~django.db.models.query.QuerySet.get_or_create`."
msgstr ""
"<django.db.models.query.QuerySet.update_or_create>Cuireadh tacaíocht le "
"haghaidh luachanna inghlaonta san argóint ``defaults`` de:meth: "
"`queryset.update_or_create () `agus:meth: "
"`~django.db.models.query.queryset.get_or_create`."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.db.models.ImageField` now has a "
"default :data:`~django.core.validators.validate_image_file_extension` "
"validator. (This validator moved to the form field in :doc:`Django 1.11.2 "
"<1.11.2>`.)"
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.db.models.imagefield` tá bailíochtóir réamhshocraithe: "
"data: `~django.core.validators.validate_image_file_extension` anois. "
"<1.11.2>(Bhog an bailíochtóir seo chuig an réimse foirme in:doc: `Django "
"1.11.2 `.)"

msgid ""
"Added support for time truncation "
"to :class:`~django.db.models.functions.Trunc` functions."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíocht bhreise le haghaidh gearradh ama chuig feidhmeanna: class: "
"`~Django.db.Models.Functions.trunc`."

msgid ""
"Added the :class:`~django.db.models.functions.ExtractWeek` function to "
"extract the week from :class:`~django.db.models.DateField` "
"and :class:`~django.db.models.DateTimeField` and exposed it through "
"the :lookup:`week` lookup."
msgstr ""
"Chuir an fheidhm: class: `~django.db.models.functions.extractWeek` leis chun "
"an tseachtain a bhaint ó:class: `~django.db.models.dateField` agus:class: "
"`~django.db.models.DateTimeField` agus nochtaigh sé tríd an cuardach: "
"`seachtain`."

msgid ""
"Added the :class:`~django.db.models.functions.TruncTime` function to "
"truncate :class:`~django.db.models.DateTimeField` to its time component and "
"exposed it through the :lookup:`time` lookup."
msgstr ""
"Chuir an fheidhme:class: `~django.db.models.functions.truncTime` leis an "
"bhfeidhm chuig truncate:class: `~Django.db.Models.DateTimeField` lena "
"chomhpháirt ama agus nochtaigh sé tríd an cuardach: lookup: `time`."

msgid ""
"Added support for expressions in :meth:`.QuerySet.values` "
"and :meth:`~.QuerySet.values_list`."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíocht bhreise le haghaidh abairtí in:meth: `.queryset.values` agus:meth: "
"`~.queryset.values_list`."

msgid ""
"Added support for query expressions on lookups that take multiple arguments, "
"such as ``range``."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíocht bhreise le haghaidh abairtí fiosrúcháin ar chuardaigh a thógann go "
"leor argóintí, mar shampla `raon ``."

msgid ""
"You can now use the ``unique=True`` option "
"with :class:`~django.db.models.FileField`."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat an rogha ``Unique=True`` a úsáid anois le:class: "
"`~django.db.models.filefield`."

msgid ""
"Added the ``nulls_first`` and ``nulls_last`` parameters "
"to :class:`Expression.asc() <django.db.models.Expression.asc>` "
"and :meth:`~django.db.models.Expression.desc` to control the ordering of "
"null values."
msgstr ""
"<django.db.models.Expression.asc>Cuireadh na paraiméadair ``nulls_first`` "
"agus ``nulls_last`` chuig: class: `Expression.asc () `agus:meth: "
"`~django.db.Models.Expression.desc` chun ordú luachanna null a rialú."

msgid ""
"The new ``F`` expression ``bitleftshift()`` and ``bitrightshift()`` methods "
"allow :ref:`bitwise shift operations <using-f-expressions-in-filters>`."
msgstr ""
"<using-f-expressions-in-filters>Ceadaíonn an abairt nua ``F`` ``bitleftshift "
"() ``agus ``bitrightshift ()`` modhanna: ref: `oibríochtaí aistrithe bitwise "
"`."

msgid ""
"Added :meth:`.QuerySet.union`, :meth:`~.QuerySet.intersection`, "
"and :meth:`~.QuerySet.difference`."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh leis: Meth: `.QuerySet.Union`, :meth: `~.QuerySet.Intersection`, "
"agus:meth: `~.querySet.Difference`."

msgid "Added :meth:`QueryDict.fromkeys() <django.http.QueryDict.fromkeys>`."
msgstr ""
"<django.http.QueryDict.fromkeys>Cuireadh leis: Meth: `Querydict.fromKeys () "
"`."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.middleware.common.CommonMiddleware` now sets the ``Content-"
"Length`` response header for non-streaming responses."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.middleware.common.commonMiddleWare` socraíonn anois an "
"ceannteideal freagartha ``Content-Length`` le haghaidh freagraí neamh-sruthú."

msgid ""
"Added the :setting:`SECURE_HSTS_PRELOAD` setting to allow appending the "
"``preload`` directive to the ``Strict-Transport-Security`` header."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh an socrú:setting: `SECURE_HSTS_PRELOAD` leis chun ligean an treoir "
"``réamh-load` a chur leis an gceannteideal ``Strict-Transport-Security ``."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.middleware.http.ConditionalGetMiddleware` now adds the "
"``ETag`` header to responses."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.middleware.http.ConditionalGetMiddleware` anois cuireann an "
"ceannteideal ``Etag ``le freagraí."

msgid ""
"The new ``django.core.serializers.base.Serializer.stream_class`` attribute "
"allows subclasses to customize the default stream."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an tréith nua ``Django.Core.Serializers.Base.Serializer.Stream_Class "
"``d'fho-aicmí an sruth réamhshocraithe a shaincheapadh."

msgid ""
"The encoder used by the :ref:`JSON serializer <serialization-formats-json>` "
"can now be customized by passing a ``cls`` keyword argument to the "
"``serializers.serialize()`` function."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir an t-ionchódóir a úsáideann an: ref: `JSON serializer "
"<serialization-formats-json>`a shaincheapadh anois trí argóint eochairfhocal "
"``cls`` a chur chuig an bhfeidhm ``serializers.serialize () ``."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.core.serializers.json.DjangoJSONEncoder` now "
"serializes :class:`~datetime.timedelta` objects (used "
"by :class:`~django.db.models.DurationField`)."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.core.serializers.json.djangojsonEncoder` sraith "
"anois:class: `~datetime.timedelta` rudaí (úsáidtear ar:class: "
"`~Django.db.Models.DurationField`)."

msgid ""
":meth:`~django.utils.safestring.mark_safe` can now be used as a decorator."
msgstr ""
":meth: Is féidir `~django.utils.safestring.mark_safe` a úsáid anois mar "
"mhaisitheoir."

msgid ""
"The :class:`~django.template.backends.jinja2.Jinja2` template backend now "
"supports context processors by setting the ``'context_processors'`` option "
"in :setting:`OPTIONS <TEMPLATES-OPTIONS>`."
msgstr ""
"<TEMPLATES-OPTIONS>Tacaíonn cúltaca teimpléad:class: "
"`~django.template.backends.jinja2.jinja2` le próiseálaithe comhthéacs anois "
"tríd an rogha ``'context_processors'` a shocrú in:setting: `OPTION`."

msgid ""
"The :ttag:`regroup` tag now returns ``namedtuple``\\s instead of "
"dictionaries so you can unpack the group object directly in a loop, e.g. "
"``{% for grouper, list in regrouped %}``."
msgstr ""
"Tugann an clibe:ttag: `athghrúpa` ``namedtuple``\\ s anois in ionad foclóirí "
"ionas gur féidir leat an réad grúpa a dhíphacáil go díreach i lúb, m.sh. "
"``{% for grouper, liosta i athghrúpáilte%}``."

msgid ""
"Added a :ttag:`resetcycle` template tag to allow resetting the sequence of "
"the :ttag:`cycle` template tag."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh clib teimpléad a:ttag: `resetcicle` leis chun seicheamh an chlib "
"teimpléad: ttag: `timthriall` a athshocrú."

msgid ""
"You can now specify specific directories for a "
"particular :class:`filesystem.Loader "
"<django.template.loaders.filesystem.Loader>`."
msgstr ""
"<django.template.loaders.filesystem.Loader>Is féidir leat eolairí ar leith a "
"shonrú anois le haghaidh áirithe: class: `Filesystem.loader `."

msgid ""
"Added :meth:`.DiscoverRunner.get_test_runner_kwargs` to allow customizing "
"the keyword arguments passed to the test runner."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh leis: Meth: `.DiscoverRunner.get_Test_Runner_Kwargs` chun ligean na "
"hargóintí eochairfhocal a chuirtear chuig an rádálaí tástála a shaincheapadh."

msgid ""
"Added the :option:`test --debug-mode` option to help troubleshoot test "
"failures by setting the :setting:`DEBUG` setting to ``True``."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh an rogha: rogha: `test --debug-mode` leis chun cabhrú le teipeanna "
"tástála a réiteach tríd an socrú: socrú: `DEBUG` go `True``."

msgid ""
"The new :func:`django.test.utils.setup_databases` (moved from "
"``django.test.runner``) and :func:`~django.test.utils.teardown_databases` "
"functions make it easier to build custom test runners."
msgstr ""
"Déanann na feidhmeanna nua:func: `django.test.utils.setup_databases` (bogadh "
"ó ``django.test.runner``) agus:func: `~django.test.utils.teardown_databases` "
"níos éasca reathaithe tástála saincheaptha a thógáil."

msgid ""
"Added support for :meth:`python:unittest.TestCase.subTest`’s when using "
"the :option:`test --parallel` option."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíocht bhreise le haghaidh: meth: `python: unittest.testcase.subtest` "
"agus an rogha: 'test --parallel` á úsáid agat."

msgid ""
"``DiscoverRunner`` now runs the system checks at the start of a test run. "
"Override the :meth:`.DiscoverRunner.run_checks` method if you want to "
"disable that."
msgstr ""
"Ritheann ``DiscoverRunner`` seiceálacha an chórais anois ag tús rith "
"tástála. Athraigh an modh:meth: `.DiscoverRunner.run_checks` más mian leat é "
"sin a dhíchumasú."

msgid ""
"Added :class:`~django.core.validators.FileExtensionValidator` to validate "
"file extensions "
"and :data:`~django.core.validators.validate_image_file_extension` to "
"validate image files."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh leis: Class: `~django.core.validators.fileExtensionValidator` chun "
"síntí comhaid a bhailíochtú agus:data: "
"`~django.core.validators.validate_image_file_extension` chun comhaid íomhá a "
"bhailíochtú."

msgid "Backwards incompatible changes in 1.11"
msgstr "Athruithe neamh-chomhoiriúnacha ar ais i 1.11"

msgid ""
"To simplify the codebase and because it's easier to install than when "
"``contrib.gis`` was first released, :ref:`gdalbuild` is now a required "
"dependency for GeoDjango. In older versions, it's only required for SQLite."
msgstr ""
"Chun an bunachar cóid a shimpliú agus toisc go bhfuil sé níos éasca a "
"shuiteáil ná nuair a scaoileadh ``contrib.gis`` den chéad uair, is spleáchas "
"riachtanach é: ref: `gdalbuild` anois do GeoDjango. I leaganacha níos sine, "
"ní theastaíonn sé ach le haghaidh SQLite."

msgid ""
"``contrib.gis.maps`` is removed as it interfaces with a retired version of "
"the Google Maps API and seems to be unmaintained. If you're using "
"it, :ticket:`let us know <14284>`."
msgstr ""
"Baintear ``contrib.gis.maps`` toisc go ndéanann sé comhéadan le leagan ar "
"scor de API Google Maps agus is cosúil nach bhfuil sé cothabháilte. "
"<14284>Má tá tú ag úsáid é, :ticket: `Cuir in iúl dúinn `."

msgid "The ``GEOSGeometry`` equality operator now also compares SRID."
msgstr ""
"Déanann an t-oibreoir comhionannais `Geosgeometry` comparáid anois idir SRID."

msgid ""
"The OpenLayers-based form widgets now use OpenLayers 3, and the ``gis/"
"openlayers.html`` and ``gis/openlayers-osm.html`` templates have been "
"updated. Check your project if you subclass these widgets or extend the "
"templates. Also, the new widgets work a bit differently than the old ones. "
"Instead of using a toolbar in the widget, you click to draw, click and drag "
"to move the map, and click and drag a point/vertex/corner to move it."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann na giuirléidí foirmeacha bunaithe ar OpenLayers OpenLayers 3 "
"anois, agus tá na teimpléid `gis/openlayers.html`` agus ``gis/openlayers-"
"osm.html`` nuashonraithe. Seiceáil do thionscadal má dhéanann tú na "
"giuirléidí seo a fho-rangú nó má leathnaíonn Chomh maith leis sin, oibríonn "
"na giuirléidí nua beagán difriúil ná na seancinn. In ionad uirlisí uirlisí a "
"úsáid sa ghuirléid, cliceáil tú chun tarraingt, cliceáil agus tarraingt chun "
"an léarscáil a bhogadh, agus cliceáil agus tarraingt point/beart/cúinne chun "
"é a bhogadh."

msgid "Support for SpatiaLite < 4.0 is dropped."
msgstr "Titeann tacaíocht do SpatiaLite <4.0."

msgid "Support for GDAL 1.7 and 1.8 is dropped."
msgstr "Titear tacaíocht do GDAL 1.7 agus 1.8."

msgid ""
"The widgets in ``contrib.gis.forms.widgets`` and the admin's "
"``OpenLayersWidget`` use the :doc:`form rendering API </ref/forms/"
"renderers>` rather than ``loader.render_to_string()``. If you're using a "
"custom widget template, you'll need to be sure your form renderer can locate "
"it. For example, you could use "
"the :class:`~django.forms.renderers.TemplatesSetting` renderer."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann na giuirléidí in ``contrib.gis.forms.widgets`` agus "
"``OpenLayersWidget`` an riaracháin an:doc: `foirm rindreála API` seachas "
"``loader.render_to_string () `</ref/forms/renderers> `. Má tá teimpléad "
"giuirléid saincheaptha á úsáid agat, beidh ort a bheith cinnte gur féidir le "
"do rindreoir foirme é a aimsiú. Mar shampla, d'fhéadfá an renderer: class: "
"`~django.forms.renderers.templateSetting` a úsáid."

msgid ""
"``collectstatic`` may now fail during post-processing when using a hashed "
"static files storage if a reference loop exists (e.g. ``'foo.css'`` "
"references ``'bar.css'`` which itself references ``'foo.css'``) or if the "
"chain of files referencing other files is too deep to resolve in several "
"passes. In the latter case, increase the number of passes "
"using :attr:`.ManifestStaticFilesStorage.max_post_process_passes`."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh go dteipeann ar `collectstatic`` anois le linn iar-phróiseála "
"agus stóráil comhaid statacha hashed á n-úsáid má tá lúb tagartha ann (m.sh. "
"```foo.css'` tagairtí ``bar.css'`` a thagraíonn do ``foo.css'`) nó má tá an "
"slabhra comhaid eile ró-dhomhain le réiteach i roinnt pasanna. Sa chás "
"deireanach sin, méadaigh líon na bpasanna ag baint úsáidea:attr: "
"`.manifestStaticFilesStorage.MAX_POST_PROCESS_PASES`."

msgid ""
"When using ``ManifestStaticFilesStorage``, static files not found in the "
"manifest at runtime now raise a ``ValueError`` instead of returning an "
"unchanged path. You can revert to the old behavior by "
"setting :attr:`.ManifestStaticFilesStorage.manifest_strict` to ``False``."
msgstr ""
"Agus ``ManifestStaticFilesStorage`` á n-úsáid agat, ardaíonn comhaid "
"statacha nach bhfaightear sa léiriú ag an tréimhse ``ValueError`` anois in "
"ionad cosán gan athrú a thabhairt ar ais. Is féidir leat filleadh ar an sean-"
"iompar trí shocrú: attr: `.manifestStaticFilesStorage.manifest_strict` go "
"``False``."

msgid ""
"This section describes changes that may be needed in third-party database "
"backends."
msgstr ""
"Déanann an rannán seo cur síos ar athruithe a d’fhéadfadh a bheith ag "
"teastáil ar dhroim bhunachar sonraí tríú páirtí."

msgid ""
"The ``DatabaseOperations.time_trunc_sql()`` method is added to support "
"``TimeField`` truncation. It accepts a ``lookup_type`` and ``field_name`` "
"arguments and returns the appropriate SQL to truncate the given time field "
"``field_name`` to a time object with only the given specificity. The "
"``lookup_type`` argument can be either ``'hour'``, ``'minute'``, or "
"``'second'``."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear an modh ``DatabaseOperations.time_trunc_sql ()`` leis chun tacú le "
"trongáil ``Timefield`. Glacann sé le hargóintí ``lookup_type`` agus "
"`field_name`` agus filleann sé an SQL cuí ar ais chun an réimse ama tugtha "
"``field_name`` a ghearradh chuig réad ama nach bhfuil ach an sainiúlacht ar "
"leith air. Is féidir leis an argóint ``lookup_type`` a bheith ina ```uair "
"'``, ``nóiméad'`, nó ```soicind``."

msgid ""
"The ``DatabaseOperations.datetime_cast_time_sql()`` method is added to "
"support the :lookup:`time` lookup. It accepts a ``field_name`` and "
"``tzname`` arguments and returns the SQL necessary to cast a datetime value "
"to time value."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear an modh ``DatabaseOperations.DateTime_Cast_Time_SQL () `leis chun "
"tacú leis an cuardach: lookup: `time`. Glacann sé le hargóintí "
"``field_name`` agus ``tzname`` agus filleann sé an SQL riachtanach chun "
"luach dáta-ama a chaitheamh go luach ama."

msgid ""
"To enable ``FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED`` support, set "
"``DatabaseFeatures.has_select_for_update_skip_locked = True``."
msgstr ""
"Chun tacaíocht ``FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED`` a chumasú, socraigh "
"``databaseFeatures.HAS_SELECT_FOR_UPDATE_SKIP_LOCKED = True``."

msgid ""
"The new ``DatabaseFeatures.supports_index_column_ordering`` attribute "
"specifies if a database allows defining ordering for columns in indexes. The "
"default value is ``True`` and the "
"``DatabaseIntrospection.get_constraints()`` method should include an "
"``'orders'`` key in each of the returned dictionaries with a list of "
"``'ASC'`` and/or ``'DESC'`` values corresponding to the ordering of each "
"column in the index."
msgstr ""
"Sonraíonn an tréith nua ``DatabaseFeatures.supports_index_column_ordering`` "
"an gceadaíonn bunachar sonraí ordú a shainiú do cholúin in innéacsanna. Is é "
"an luach réamhshocraithe ``True`` agus ba chóir go mbeadh eochair "
"``'ordaithe '``i ngach ceann de na foclóirí ar ais le liosta luachanna "
"``ASC'` agus/nó ``DESC`` agus/nó luachanna ``DESC`` a fhreagraíonn d'ordú "
"gach colún san innéacs."

msgid ""
":djadmin:`inspectdb` no longer calls ``DatabaseIntrospection.get_indexes()`` "
"which is deprecated. Custom database backends should ensure all types of "
"indexes are returned by ``DatabaseIntrospection.get_constraints()``."
msgstr ""
":djadmin: ní ghlaonn `inspectdb` a thuilleadh "
"``DatabaseIntrospection.get_indexes ()`` atá díscoite. Ba cheart go "
"gcinnteoidh cúltaca bunachar sonraí saincheaptha a chinntiú go gcuirtear "
"gach cineál innéacs ar ais ag ``DatabaseIntrospection.get_Constraints ()``."

msgid ""
"Renamed the ``ignores_quoted_identifier_case`` feature to "
"``ignores_table_name_case`` to more accurately reflect how it is used."
msgstr ""
"Athainmnigh an ghné `ignores_quoted_identificfier_case`` go "
"`ignores_table_name_case`` chun léiriú níos cruinne an chaoi a n-úsáidtear é."

msgid ""
"The ``name`` keyword argument is added to the "
"``DatabaseWrapper.create_cursor(self, name=None)`` method to allow usage of "
"server-side cursors on backends that support it."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear an argóint eochairfhocal ``ainm ``leis an modh "
"`DatabaseWrapper.create_cursor (self, name=None)`` chun cúrsaí taobh an "
"fhreastalaí a úsáid ar chúltaca a thacaíonn leis a cheadú."

msgid "Dropped support for PostgreSQL 9.2 and PostGIS 2.0"
msgstr "Tacaíocht titim do PostgreSQL 9.2 agus PostGIS 2.0"

msgid ""
"Upstream support for PostgreSQL 9.2 ends in September 2017. As a "
"consequence, Django 1.11 sets PostgreSQL 9.3 as the minimum version it "
"officially supports."
msgstr ""
"Críochnaíonn tacaíocht suas srutha do PostgreSQL 9.2 i Meán Fómhair 2017. "
"Mar thoradh air sin, socraíonn Django 1.11 PostgreSQL 9.3 mar an leagan "
"íosta a thacaíonn sé go hoifigiúil."

msgid ""
"Support for PostGIS 2.0 is also removed as PostgreSQL 9.2 is the last "
"version to support it."
msgstr ""
"Baintear tacaíocht do PostGIS 2.0 freisin mar is é PostgreSQL 9.2 an leagan "
"deireanach chun tacú leis."

msgid ""
"Also, the minimum supported version of psycopg2 is increased from 2.4.5 to "
"2.5.4."
msgstr ""
"Chomh maith leis sin, méadaítear an leagan íosta tacaithe de psycopg2 ó "
"2.4.5 go 2.5.4."

msgid "``LiveServerTestCase`` binds to port zero"
msgstr "Ceanglaíonn ``Liveservertestcase`` le calafort nialas"

msgid ""
"Rather than taking a port range and iterating to find a free port, "
"``LiveServerTestCase`` binds to port zero and relies on the operating system "
"to assign a free port. The ``DJANGO_LIVE_TEST_SERVER_ADDRESS`` environment "
"variable is no longer used, and as it's also no longer used, the ``manage.py "
"test --liveserver`` option is removed."
msgstr ""
"Seachas raon calafoirt a ghlacadh agus athrá chun calafort saor in aisce a "
"aimsiú, ceanglaíonn ``Liveservertestcase`` le calafort nialas agus "
"braitheann sé ar an gcóras oibriúcháin chun calafort saor in aisce a "
"shannadh. Ní úsáidtear an t-athróg timpeallachta "
"``DJANGO_LIVE_TEST_SERVER_ADDRESS`` a thuilleadh, agus toisc nach n-"
"úsáidtear é a thuilleadh freisin, baintear an rogha `manage.py test --"
"liveserver`."

msgid ""
"If you need to bind ``LiveServerTestCase`` to a specific port, use the "
"``port`` attribute added in Django 1.11.2."
msgstr ""
"Más gá duit ``LiveserVertestCase`` a cheangal le calafort ar leith, bain "
"úsáid as an tréith ```port ``cuireadh i Django 1.11.2."

msgid ""
"Protection against insecure redirects in :mod:`django.contrib.auth` and "
"``i18n`` views"
msgstr ""
"Cosaint i gcoinne atreoruithe neamhchinnte i:mod: tuairimí "
"`django.contrib.auth` agus ``i18n``"

msgid ""
"``LoginView``, ``LogoutView`` (and the deprecated function-based "
"equivalents), and :func:`~django.views.i18n.set_language` protect users from "
"being redirected to non-HTTPS ``next`` URLs when the app is running over "
"HTTPS."
msgstr ""
"Cosnaíonn ``LoginView``, `LogoutView`` (agus na coibhéisí bunaithe ar "
"fheidhm atá díluaite), agus:func: `~django.views.i18n.set_language` "
"úsáideoirí ó bheith atreoraithe chuig URLanna ``next`` neamh-HTTPS nuair a "
"bhíonn an aip ag rith thar HTTPS."

msgid ""
"``QuerySet.get_or_create()`` and ``update_or_create()`` validate arguments"
msgstr ""
"``QuerySet.get_or_create () ``agus ``update_or_create ()`` argóintí a "
"bhailíochtú"

msgid ""
"To prevent typos from passing "
"silently, :meth:`~django.db.models.query.QuerySet.get_or_create` "
"and :meth:`~django.db.models.query.QuerySet.update_or_create` check that "
"their arguments are model fields. This should be backwards-incompatible only "
"in the fact that it might expose a bug in your project."
msgstr ""
"Chun clóscríobh a chosc ó rith go ciúin, :meth: "
"`~django.db.models.query.queryset.get_or_create` agus:meth: "
"`~django.db.models.queryset.update_or_create` seiceáil gur réimsí samhail "
"iad a gcuid argóintí. Níor chóir go mbeadh sé seo comhoiriúnach ar chúl ach "
"amháin sa bhfíric go bhféadfadh sé fabht i do thionscadal a nochtadh."

msgid ""
"``pytz`` is a required dependency and support for ``settings.TIME_ZONE = "
"None`` is removed"
msgstr ""
"Is spleáchas riachtanach é ``pytz`` agus tacaíocht do `settings.TIME_ZONE = "
"None ``baintear"

msgid ""
"To simplify Django's timezone handling, ``pytz`` is now a required "
"dependency. It's automatically installed along with Django."
msgstr ""
"Chun láimhseáil crios ama Django a shimpliú, is spleáchas riachtanach anois "
"é `pytz`. Tá sé suiteáilte go huathoibríoch mar aon le Django."

msgid ""
"Support for ``settings.TIME_ZONE = None`` is removed as the behavior isn't "
"commonly used and is questionably useful. If you want to automatically "
"detect the timezone based on the system timezone, you can "
"use :pypi:`tzlocal`::"
msgstr ""
"Baintear tacaíocht do `settings.time_zone = None ``toisc nach n-úsáidtear an "
"t-iompar go coitianta agus tá sé úsáideach go cinnte. Más mian leat an crios "
"ama a bhrath go huathoibríoch bunaithe ar chrios ama an chórais, is féidir "
"leat úsáid a úsáid:pypi: `tzlocal`::"

msgid ""
"This works similar to ``settings.TIME_ZONE = None`` except that it also sets "
"``os.environ['TZ']``. `Let us know <https://groups.google.com/g/django-"
"developers/c/OAV3FChfuPM/discussion>`__ if there's a use case where you find "
"you can't adapt your code to set a ``TIME_ZONE``."
msgstr ""
"Oibríonn sé seo cosúil le ``settings.time_zone = None ``ach amháin go "
"socraíonn sé ``os.environ ['TZ']`` freisin. `Cuir in iúl dúinn `__ má < "
"https://groups.google.com/g/django-developers/c/OAV3FChfuPM/discussion> tá "
"cás úsáide ann ina bhfaighidh tú nach féidir leat do chód a oiriúnú chun "
"``TIME_ZONE`` a shocrú."

msgid "HTML changes in admin templates"
msgstr "Athruithe HTML i dteimpléid riaracháin"

msgid ""
"``<p class=\"help\">`` is replaced with a ``<div>`` tag to allow including "
"lists inside help text."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear clib <p class=\"help\">```` in ionad ``<div>`` chun liostaí a "
"áireamh laistigh de théacs cabhrach."

msgid ""
"Read-only fields are wrapped in ``<div class=\"readonly\">...</div>`` "
"instead of ``<p>...</p>`` to allow any kind of HTML as the field's content."
msgstr ""
"<div class=\"readonly\">Tá réimsí léite amháin fillte i ``...</div> <p>``in "
"ionad``...</p> ``chun aon chineál HTML a cheadú mar ábhar an réimse."

msgid "Changes due to the introduction of template-based widget rendering"
msgstr ""
"Athruithe mar gheall ar rindreáil giuirléid bunaithe ar theimpléad a "
"thabhairt isteach"

msgid "Some undocumented classes in ``django.forms.widgets`` are removed:"
msgstr ""
"Baintear roinnt ranganna neamhdhoiciméadaithe i ``django.forms.widgets``:"

msgid "``SubWidget``"
msgstr "``Subwidget``"

msgid ""
"``RendererMixin``, ``ChoiceFieldRenderer``, ``RadioFieldRenderer``, "
"``CheckboxFieldRenderer``"
msgstr ""
"``RendererMixin``, `RoghiceFieldRenderer``, `RadioFieldRender``, "
"`CheckboxFieldRender``"

msgid "``ChoiceInput``, ``RadioChoiceInput``, ``CheckboxChoiceInput``"
msgstr "``RoiceInput``, `RadioChoiceInput``, `CheckboxChoiceInput``"

msgid "The undocumented ``Select.render_option()`` method is removed."
msgstr "Baintear an modh ``Select.render_option () ``neamhdhoiciméadaithe."

msgid ""
"The ``Widget.format_output()`` method is removed. Use a custom widget "
"template instead."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an modh ``Widget.format_output()``. Úsáid teimpléad giuirléid "
"saincheaptha ina ionad sin."

msgid ""
"Some widget values, such as ``<select>`` options, are now localized if "
"``settings.USE_L10N=True``. You could revert to the old behavior with custom "
"widget templates that uses the :ttag:`localize` template tag to turn off "
"localization."
msgstr ""
"Tá roinnt luachanna giuirléid, mar shampla roghanna ```, log <select>ánaithe "
"anois má tá ``settings.use_l10n=true``. D'fhéadfá filleadh ar an sean-iompar "
"le teimpléid giuirléid saincheaptha a úsáideann an chlib teimpléad:ttag: "
"`localize` chun logánú a mhúchadh."

msgid ""
"``django.template.backends.django.Template.render()`` prohibits non-dict "
"context"
msgstr ""
"``Django.Template.Backends.Django.Template.render () ``cosc ar chomhthéacs "
"neamh-dict"

msgid ""
"For compatibility with multiple template engines, "
"``django.template.backends.django.Template.render()`` (returned from high-"
"level template loader APIs such as ``loader.get_template()``) must receive a "
"dictionary of context rather than ``Context`` or ``RequestContext``. If you "
"were passing either of the two classes, pass a dictionary instead -- doing "
"so is backwards-compatible with older versions of Django."
msgstr ""
"Le haghaidh comhoiriúnacht le hinnill teimpléad iolracha, caithfidh "
"``django.template.backends.django.template.render () ``(ar ais ó APIs "
"luchtaire teimpléad ardleibhéil mar ``loader.get_template ()``) foclóir "
"comhthéacs a fháil seachas ``Context`` nó `requestContext``. Má bhí tú ag "
"rith ceachtar den dá rang, pas foclóir ina ionad sin - tá sé sin ag luí ar "
"ais le leaganacha níos sine de Django."

msgid "Model state changes in migration operations"
msgstr "Athruithe stáit samhail in oibríochtaí imirce"

msgid ""
"To improve the speed of applying migrations, rendering of related models is "
"delayed until an operation that needs them (e.g. ``RunPython``). If you have "
"a custom operation that works with model classes or model instances from the "
"``from_state`` argument in ``database_forwards()`` or "
"``database_backwards()``, you must render model states using the "
"``clear_delayed_apps_cache()`` method as described in :ref:`writing your own "
"migration operation <writing-your-own-migration-operation>`."
msgstr ""
"Chun luas imirce a chur i bhfeidhm a fheabhsú, cuirtear moill ar rindreáil "
"samhlacha gaolmhara go dtí go ndéanfar oibríocht a theastaíonn iad (m.sh. "
"`Runpython``). <writing-your-own-migration-operation>Má tá oibríocht "
"saincheaptha agat a oibríonn le ranganna samhail nó cásanna samhail ón "
"argóint ``from_state`` i `database_forwards () ``nó `database_backwards "
"()``, ní mór duit stáit samhail a rinneadh ag baint úsáide as an modh "
"``clear_delayed_apps_cache () ``mar a thuairiscítear in:ref: `scríobh "
"d'oibríocht imirce féin `."

msgid "Server-side cursors on PostgreSQL"
msgstr "Cúrsóirí taobh an fhreastalaí ar PostgreSQL"

msgid ""
"The change to make :meth:`.QuerySet.iterator()` use server-side cursors on "
"PostgreSQL prevents running Django with PgBouncer in transaction pooling "
"mode. To reallow that, use the :setting:`DISABLE_SERVER_SIDE_CURSORS "
"<DATABASE-DISABLE_SERVER_SIDE_CURSORS>` setting (added in Django 1.11.1) "
"in :setting:`DATABASES`."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann an t-athrú chun déanaime:meth: `.queryset.iterator () `úsáid cúrsaí "
"taobh an fhreastalaí ar PostgreSQL cosc ar Django a rith le PGBouncer i mód "
"comhionannaithe idirbheart. <DATABASE-DISABLE_SERVER_SIDE_CURSORS>Chun é sin "
"a íoslódáil, bain úsáid as an socrú:setting: `DISABLE_SERVER_SIDE_CURSORS "
"`(curtha leis i Django 1.11.1) in:setting: `DATABASES`."

msgid "See :ref:`transaction-pooling-server-side-cursors` for more discussion."
msgstr ""
"Féach:ref: `transaction-pooling-server-side-cursors` le haghaidh tuilleadh "
"plé."

msgid ""
"If no items in the feed have a ``pubdate`` or ``updateddate`` "
"attribute, :meth:`SyndicationFeed.latest_post_date() "
"<django.utils.feedgenerator.SyndicationFeed.latest_post_date>` now returns "
"the current UTC date/time, instead of a datetime without any timezone "
"information."
msgstr ""
"<django.utils.feedgenerator.SyndicationFeed.latest_post_date>Mura bhfuil "
"tréith ``pubdate`` nó `updateddate`` ag aon earraí sa bhfotha, filleann: "
"meth: `SyndicationFeed.latest_post_date () `an dáta/am reatha UTC anois, in "
"ionad dáta-am gan aon fhaisnéis crios ama."

msgid ""
"CSRF failures are logged to the ``django.security.csrf`` logger instead of "
"``django.request``."
msgstr ""
"Tá teipeanna CSRF logáilte chuig an logger ``django.security.csrf`` in ionad "
"``django.request``."

msgid ""
":setting:`ALLOWED_HOSTS` validation is no longer disabled when running "
"tests. If your application includes tests with custom host names, you must "
"include those host names in :setting:`ALLOWED_HOSTS`. See :ref:`topics-"
"testing-advanced-multiple-hosts`."
msgstr ""
":setting: Ní dhéantar bailíochtú `ALLOWED_HOSTS` a dhíchumasú a thuilleadh "
"agus tástálacha á reáchtáil. Má chuimsíonn d'iarratas tástálacha le "
"hainmneacha óstach saincheaptha, ní mór duit na hainmneacha óstach sin a "
"áireamh in:setting: `ALLOWED_HOSTS`. Féach: tagairt: `topics-tástáile-ard-"
"iolrthóstacha`."

msgid ""
"Using a foreign key's id (e.g. ``'field_id'``) in "
"``ModelAdmin.list_display`` displays the related object's ID. Remove the "
"``_id`` suffix if you want the old behavior of the string representation of "
"the object."
msgstr ""
"Ag baint úsáide as id eochair eachtrach (m.sh. ``field_id'``) in "
"`ModelAdmin.list_display``, taispeánann ID an réad gaolmhar. Bain an iarmhír "
"``_id`` más mian leat sean-iompar léiriú teaghrán an réada."

msgid ""
"In model forms, :class:`~django.db.models.CharField` with ``null=True`` now "
"saves ``NULL`` for blank values instead of empty strings."
msgstr ""
"I bhfoirmeacha samhail, sábhálann: class: `~django.db.models.charfield` le "
"``Null=True`` anois ``NULL`` le haghaidh luachanna bána in ionad teaghráin "
"folamh."

msgid ""
"On Oracle, :meth:`Model.validate_unique() "
"<django.db.models.Model.validate_unique>` no longer checks empty strings for "
"uniqueness as the database interprets the value as ``NULL``."
msgstr ""
"Ar Oracle, :meth: `Model.validate_unique () "
"<django.db.models.Model.validate_unique>`ní sheiceálann teaghráin folamh le "
"haghaidh uathúlacht a thuilleadh mar a léirmhíníonn an bunachar sonraí an "
"luach mar `NULL``."

msgid ""
"If you subclass :class:`.AbstractUser` and override ``clean()``, be sure it "
"calls ``super()``. :meth:`.BaseUserManager.normalize_email` is called in a "
"new :meth:`.AbstractUser.clean` method so that normalization is applied in "
"cases like model form validation."
msgstr ""
"Má dhéanann tú fo-aicmi:class: `.abstractUser` agus má sháraíonn tú ``clean "
"() ``, bí cinnte go dtugann sé ``super ()``. :meth: Glaítear "
"`.BaseUserManager.Normalize_Email` i modh nua:meth: `.abstractuser.clean` "
"ionas go gcuirfear normalú i bhfeidhm i gcásanna cosúil le bailíochtú foirm "
"mhúnla."

msgid ""
"``EmailField`` and ``URLField`` no longer accept the ``strip`` keyword "
"argument. Remove it because it doesn't have an effect in older versions of "
"Django as these fields always strip whitespace."
msgstr ""
"Ní ghlacann ``emailfield`` agus `URLField`` leis an argóint eochairfhocal "
"``strip`` a thuilleadh. Bain é toisc nach bhfuil éifeacht aige i leaganacha "
"níos sine de Django mar scriosann na réimsí seo spás bán i gcónaí."

msgid ""
"The ``checked`` and ``selected`` attribute rendered by form widgets now uses "
"HTML5 boolean syntax rather than XHTML's ``checked='checked'`` and "
"``selected='selected'``."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann an tréith ``seiceáil`` agus ``roghnaithe`` a rinneadh ag "
"giuirléidí foirme chomhréir boolean HTML5 anois seachas ``checked='checked'` "
"agus ``selected='roghnaithe'` XHTML."

msgid ""
":meth:`RelatedManager.add() "
"<django.db.models.fields.related.RelatedManager.add>`, :meth:`~django.db.models.fields.related.RelatedManager.remove`, :meth:`~django.db.models.fields.related.RelatedManager.clear`, "
"and :meth:`~django.db.models.fields.related.RelatedManager.set` now clear "
"the ``prefetch_related()`` cache."
msgstr ""
":meth: `RelatedManager.add () "
"<django.db.models.fields.related.RelatedManager.add>`, :meth: "
"`~Django.db.Models.Fields.Related.RelatedManager.remove`, :meth: "
"`~Django.db.Models.Fields.Related.RelatedManager.Clear`, agus:meth: "
"`~Django.db.Models.Fields.Related.RelatedManager.` déan an taisce "
"``prefetch_related () ``a ghlanadh anois."

msgid ""
"To prevent possible loss of saved "
"settings, :func:`~django.test.utils.setup_test_environment` now raises an "
"exception if called a second time before "
"calling :func:`~django.test.utils.teardown_test_environment`."
msgstr ""
"Chun caillteanas féideartha socruithe sábháilte a chosc, ardaíonn: func: "
"`~django.test.utils.setup_test_environment` eisceacht anois má thugtar air "
"an dara huair sula nglaonn sé: func: "
"`~django.test.utils.teardown_test_environment`."

msgid ""
"The undocumented ``DateTimeAwareJSONEncoder`` alias "
"for :class:`~django.core.serializers.json.DjangoJSONEncoder` (renamed in "
"Django 1.0) is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an alias ``DateTimeAwarejsonEncoder`` neamhdhoiciméadaithe "
"do:class: `~django.core.serializers.json.djangojsonEncoder` (athainmnithe i "
"Django 1.0)."

msgid ""
"The :class:`cached template loader <django.template.loaders.cached.Loader>` "
"is now enabled if :setting:`OPTIONS['loaders'] <TEMPLATES-OPTIONS>` isn't "
"specified and :setting:`OPTIONS['debug'] <TEMPLATES-OPTIONS>` is ``False`` "
"(the latter option defaults to the value of :setting:`DEBUG`). This could be "
"backwards-incompatible if you have some :ref:`template tags that aren't "
"thread safe <template_tag_thread_safety>`."
msgstr ""
"Tá an: class: `luchtóir teimpléad cached "
"<django.template.loaders.cached.Loader>`cumasaithe anois mura ndéantar "
"socrú: `OPTIONS ['luchtaitheoirí']<TEMPLATES-OPTIONS>` sonraithe "
"agus:setting: `OPTIONS ['debug'] `<TEMPLATES-OPTIONS>is `False`` "
"(réamhshocraíonn an rogha deireanach go luach:socrú: `DEBUG`). "
"<template_tag_thread_safety>D'fhéadfadh sé seo a bheith comhoiriúnach ar "
"chúl má tá clibeanna teimpléad éigin agat: ref: `nach bhfuil sábháilte "
"snáithe `."

msgid ""
"The prompt for stale content type deletion no longer occurs after running "
"the ``migrate`` command. Use the new :djadmin:`remove_stale_contenttypes` "
"command instead."
msgstr ""
"Ní tharlaíonn an pras le haghaidh scriosadh cineál ábhair seasta a "
"thuilleadh tar éis an t-ordú ``imirce`` a reáchtáil. Úsáid an t-ordú "
"nua:djadmin: `remove_stale_contenttypes` ina ionad."

msgid ""
"The admin's widget for ``IntegerField`` uses ``type=\"number\"`` rather than "
"``type=\"text\"``."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann giuirléid an riaracháin do ``IntegerField`` ``type=\"number\"`` "
"seachas ``type=\"text\"``."

msgid ""
"Conditional HTTP headers are now parsed and compared according to "
"the :rfc:`7232` Conditional Requests specification rather than the "
"older :rfc:`2616`."
msgstr ""
"Déantar ceanntásca coinníollach HTTP a pháirseáil agus comparáid anois de "
"réir na sonraíochta Iarrataí Coinníollacha: rfc: `7232` seachas an níos "
"sine: rfc: `2616`."

msgid ""
":func:`~django.utils.cache.patch_response_headers` no longer adds a ``Last-"
"Modified`` header. According to the :rfc:`7234#section-4.2.2`, this header "
"is useless alongside other caching headers that provide an explicit "
"expiration time, e.g. ``Expires`` or ``Cache-"
"Control``. :class:`~django.middleware.cache.UpdateCacheMiddleware` "
"and :func:`~django.utils.cache.add_never_cache_headers` call "
"``patch_response_headers()`` and therefore are also affected by this change."
msgstr ""
":func: Ní chuireann `~django.utils.cache.patch_response_headers` "
"ceannteideal ```Last-Modified`` a thuilleadh. De réir la:rfc: `7234 #section "
"-4.2.2`, tá an ceannteideal seo gan úsáid in éineacht le ceanntásc eile a "
"sholáthraíonn am éaga follasach, m.sh. ``Expires`` nó ``Cache-"
"Control``. :class: `~django.middleware.cache.UpdateCacheMiddleware` "
"agus:func: `~django.utils.cache.add_never_cache_headers` glaoigh "
"`patch_response_heads () ``agus dá bhrí sin bíonn tionchar ag an athrú seo "
"orthu freisin."

msgid ""
"In the admin templates, ``<p class=\"help\">`` is replaced with a ``<div>`` "
"tag to allow including lists inside help text."
msgstr ""
"Sna teimpléid riaracháin, cuirtear clib <p class=\"help\">```` in ionad "
"``<div>`` chun liostaí a áireamh laistigh de théacs cabhrach."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.middleware.http.ConditionalGetMiddleware` no longer sets the "
"``Date`` header as web servers set that header. It also no longer sets the "
"``Content-Length`` header as this is now done "
"by :class:`~django.middleware.common.CommonMiddleware`."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.middleware.http.ConditionalGetMiddleware` ní shocraíonn an "
"ceannteideal ``Dáta ``a thuilleadh mar a shocraíonn freastalaithe gréasáin "
"an ceannteideal sin. Ní shocraíonn sé an ceannteideal ``Content-Length`` a "
"thuilleadh mar a dhéanann sé seo anois:class: "
"`~django.middleware.common.commonMiddleware`."

msgid ""
"If you have a middleware that modifies a response's content and appears "
"before ``CommonMiddleware`` in the ``MIDDLEWARE`` or ``MIDDLEWARE_CLASSES`` "
"settings, you must reorder your middleware so that responses aren't modified "
"after ``Content-Length`` is set, or have the response modifying middleware "
"reset the ``Content-Length`` header."
msgstr ""
"Má tá middleware agat a athraíonn ábhar freagra agus atá le feiceáil roimh "
"``CommonMiddleware`` i socruithe ``MIDDLEWARE`` nó `MIDDLEWARE_CLASSES``, ní "
"mór duit do mheán a athordú ionas nach ndéanfar freagraí tar éis `Content-"
"Length`` a shocrú nó an freagra a athshocrú."

msgid ""
":meth:`~django.apps.AppConfig.get_model` "
"and :meth:`~django.apps.AppConfig.get_models` now "
"raise :exc:`~django.core.exceptions.AppRegistryNotReady` if they're called "
"before models of all applications have been loaded. Previously they only "
"required the target application's models to be loaded and thus could return "
"models without all their relations set up. If you need the old behavior of "
"``get_model()``, set the ``require_ready`` argument to ``False``."
msgstr ""
":meth: `~django.apps.appconfig.get_model` agus:meth: "
"`~django.apps.appconfig.get_models` anois:exc: "
"`~django.core.exceptions.appregistryNotReady` má ghlaoitear orthu sular "
"luchtadh samhlacha de na feidhmchláir go léir. Roimhe seo ní theastaigh "
"uathu ach samhlacha an spriocfheidhmchláir a luchtú agus dá bhrí sin "
"d'fhéadfaí samhlacha a thabhairt ar ais gan a gcaidreamh go lé Má "
"theastaíonn sean-iompar ``get_model () ``uait, socraigh an argóint "
"``requi_ready`` go ``False``."

msgid "The unused ``BaseCommand.can_import_settings`` attribute is removed."
msgstr "Baintear an tréith ``BaseCommand.can_import_settings`` neamhúsáidte."

msgid "The undocumented ``django.utils.functional.lazy_property`` is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an ``django.utils.functional.lazy_property`` neamhdhoiciméadaithe."

msgid ""
"For consistency with non-multipart requests, ``MultiPartParser.parse()`` now "
"leaves ``request.POST`` immutable. If you're modifying that ``QueryDict``, "
"you must now first copy it, e.g. ``request.POST.copy()``."
msgstr ""
"Le haghaidh comhsheasmhachta le hiarratais neamh-ilpháirteach, fágann "
"```MultipartParser.parse () ````Request.Post`` inathraithe anois. Má tá tú "
"ag modhnú an ``QueryDict`` sin, ní mór duit anois é a chóipeáil ar dtús, "
"m.sh. ``Request.post.copy () ``."

msgid "Support for ``cx_Oracle`` < 5.2 is removed."
msgstr "Baintear tacaíocht do ``CX_Oracle ``< 5.2."

msgid "Support for IPython < 1.0 is removed from the ``shell`` command."
msgstr "Baintear tacaíocht do IPython <1.0 ón ordú ``sliog``."

msgid ""
"The signature of private API ``Widget.build_attrs()`` changed from "
"``extra_attrs=None, **kwargs`` to ``base_attrs, extra_attrs=None``."
msgstr ""
"D'athraigh síniú API príobháideach ``Widget.build_attrs () ``ó "
"`Extra_Attrs=None, **kwargs`` go ``base_attrs, extra_attrs=None ``."

msgid ""
"File-like objects (e.g., :class:`~io.StringIO` and :class:`~io.BytesIO`) "
"uploaded to an :class:`~django.db.models.ImageField` using the test client "
"now require a ``name`` attribute with a value that passes "
"the :data:`~django.core.validators.validate_image_file_extension` validator. "
"See the note in :meth:`.Client.post`."
msgstr ""
"Tá réada cosúil le comhad (m.sh., :class: `~io.stringio` agus:class: "
"`~io.bytesio`) a uaslódáil chuig an:class: `~django.db.models.imagefield` ag "
"baint úsáide as an cliant tástála ag teastáil tréith ``name`` anois le luach "
"a rachaidh an:data: `~django.core.validators.extenate_image_file_sione_` "
"bailíochtaitheoir. Féach an nóta in:meth: `.client.post`."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.db.models.FileField` now moves rather than copies the file "
"it receives. With the default file upload settings, files larger "
"than :setting:`FILE_UPLOAD_MAX_MEMORY_SIZE` now have the same permissions as "
"temporary files (often ``0o600``) rather than the system's standard umask "
"(often ``0o6644``). Set the :setting:`FILE_UPLOAD_PERMISSIONS` if you need "
"the same permission regardless of file size."
msgstr ""
":class: `~Django.db.Models.FileField` bogann anois seachas an comhad a "
"fhaigheann sé a chóipeáil. Leis na socruithe uaslódála comhaid "
"réamhshocraithe, tá na ceadanna céanna ag comhaid níos mó ná: setting: "
"`FILE_UPLOAD_MAX_MEMORY_SIZE` anois le comhaid shealadacha (`0o600`` go "
"minic) seachas umask caighdeánach an chórais (``0o6644`` go minic). Socraigh "
"an:setting: `FILE_UPLOAD_PERMISSIONS` má theastaíonn an cead céanna uait "
"beag beann ar mhéid an chomhaid."

msgid "Features deprecated in 1.11"
msgstr "Gnéithe atá díscríofa i 1.11"

msgid "``models.permalink()`` decorator"
msgstr "``models.permalink () ``maisitheoir"

msgid "Use :func:`django.urls.reverse` instead. For example::"
msgstr "Úsáid: func: `django.urls.reverse` ina ionad. Mar shampla::"

msgid "becomes::"
msgstr "éiríonn sé::"

msgid ""
"``contrib.auth``’s ``login()`` and ``logout()`` function-based views are "
"deprecated in favor of new class-based "
"views :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.LoginView` "
"and :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.LogoutView`."
msgstr ""
"Tá tuairimí bunaithe ar fheidhm ```contrib.auth`` `login () ``agus ``logout "
"() ``` luasghabhunaithe i bhfabhar radhairc nua aicme-bhunaithe: class: "
"`~django.contrib.contrib.auth.views.loginView` agus:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.views.logoutView`."

msgid ""
"The unused ``extra_context`` parameter of "
"``contrib.auth.views.logout_then_login()``  is deprecated."
msgstr ""
"Tá an paraiméadar ``extra_context`` neamhúsáidte de "
"`contrib.auth.views.logout_then_login () ``a dhíchur."

msgid ""
"``contrib.auth``’s ``password_change()``, ``password_change_done()``, "
"``password_reset()``, ``password_reset_done()``, "
"``password_reset_confirm()``, and ``password_reset_complete()`` function-"
"based views are deprecated in favor of new class-based "
"views :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.PasswordChangeView`, :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.PasswordChangeDoneView`, :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.PasswordResetView`, :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.PasswordResetDoneView`, :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.PasswordResetConfirmView`, "
"and :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.PasswordResetCompleteView`."
msgstr ""
"Tá ``contrib.auth`` `password_change () ``, `password_change_done ()``, "
"`password_reset () ``, `password_reset_done ()``, `password_reset_done () "
"``, `password_reset_verify ()``, agus ``password_reset_complete () `tuairimí "
"nua ar fheidhm tuairimí range-bhunaithe: class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.views.passwordChangeView`, :class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.views.passwordChangedOneView`, :class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.views.passwordResetView`, :class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.views.passwordResetView` DoneView`, :class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.views.PasswordResetConfirmView`, agus:class: `~django. "
"Contrib.auth.views.PasswordResetCompleteView`."

msgid ""
"``django.test.runner.setup_databases()`` is moved "
"to :func:`django.test.utils.setup_databases`. The old location is deprecated."
msgstr ""
"Bogtar ``django.test.runner.setup_databases () ``chuig: func: "
"`django.test.utils.setup_databases`. Tá an sean-shuíomh mionscailte."

msgid ""
"``django.utils.translation.string_concat()`` is deprecated in favor "
"of :func:`django.utils.text.format_lazy`. ``string_concat(*strings)`` can be "
"replaced by ``format_lazy('{}' * len(strings), *strings)``."
msgstr ""
"Tá ``django.utils.translation.string_concat () ``luasghabháilte i "
"bhfabhr:func: `django.utils.text.format_lazy`. Is féidir ``format_lazy ('{}' "
"* len (teaghráin), *teaghráin) ``a chur in ionad ``string_concat "
"(*teaghráin)``."

msgid ""
"For the ``PyLibMCCache`` cache backend, passing ``pylibmc`` behavior "
"settings as top-level attributes of ``OPTIONS`` is deprecated. Set them "
"under a ``behaviors`` key within ``OPTIONS`` instead."
msgstr ""
"Maidir leis an gcúltaca taisce ``Pylibmccache``, tá socruithe iompraíochta "
"`pylibmc`` a rith mar thréithe barrleibhéil de ``OPTIONS`` a dhíchur. "
"Socraigh iad faoi eochair ``iompraíochtaí ``laistigh de `OPTIONS`` ina ionad."

msgid ""
"The ``host`` parameter of ``django.utils.http.is_safe_url()`` is deprecated "
"in favor of the new ``allowed_hosts`` parameter."
msgstr ""
"Tá an paraiméadar ``host`` de `django.utils.http.is_safe_url () ``a dhíchur "
"i bhfabhar an pharaiméadar nua ``allowed_hosts``."

msgid ""
"Silencing exceptions raised while rendering the :ttag:`{% include %} "
"<include>` template tag is deprecated as the behavior is often more "
"confusing than helpful. In Django 2.1, the exception will be raised."
msgstr ""
"Tá eis <include>ceachtaí a thostú a ardaíodh agus clib teimpléad: ttag: `{% "
"include%}` á léiriú díreach mar is minic a bhíonn an t-iompar níos mearbhall "
"ná cabhrach. I Django 2.1, ardófar an eisceacht."

msgid ""
"``DatabaseIntrospection.get_indexes()`` is deprecated in favor of "
"``DatabaseIntrospection.get_constraints()``."
msgstr ""
"Tá ``DatabaseIntrospection.get_Indexes ()`` díscoilte i bhfabhar "
"``DatabaseIntrospection.get_Constraints () ``."

msgid ""
":func:`~django.contrib.auth.authenticate` now passes a ``request`` argument "
"to the ``authenticate()`` method of authentication backends. Support for "
"methods that don't accept ``request`` as the first positional argument will "
"be removed in Django 2.1."
msgstr ""
":func: `~django.contrib.auth.auth.autenticate` téann argóint ``request`` "
"anois chuig an modh ``autenticate () ``cúltaca fíordheimhnithe. Bainfear "
"tacaíocht do mhodhanna nach nglacann le ``iarraidh` mar an chéad argóint "
"seasaimh i Django 2.1."

msgid ""
"The ``USE_ETAGS`` setting is deprecated in favor "
"of :class:`~django.middleware.http.ConditionalGetMiddleware` which now adds "
"the ``ETag`` header to responses regardless of the setting. "
"``CommonMiddleware`` and ``django.utils.cache.patch_response_headers()`` "
"will no longer set ETags when the deprecation ends."
msgstr ""
"Tá an socrú ``USE_ETAG`` díluaite i bhfabhr:class: "
"`~django.middleware.http.ConditionalGetMiddleware` a chuireann an "
"ceannteideal ``Etag`` anois le freagraí beann ar an socrú. Ní shocróidh "
"``CommonMiddleware`` agus ``django.utils.cache.patch_response_heads () "
"``eTaganna a thuilleadh nuair a chríochnaíonn an díphacáil."

msgid ""
"``Model._meta.has_auto_field`` is deprecated in favor of checking if "
"``Model._meta.auto_field is not None``."
msgstr ""
"``Samhail. Tá _meta.has_auto_field`` a dhíchur i bhfabhar seiceáil an bhfuil "
"`Samhail. Níl _meta.auto_field Non ``."

msgid ""
"Using regular expression groups with ``iLmsu#`` in ``url()`` is deprecated. "
"The only group that's useful is ``(?i)`` for case-insensitive URLs, however, "
"case-insensitive URLs aren't a good practice because they create multiple "
"entries for search engines, for example. An alternative solution could be to "
"create a :data:`~django.conf.urls.handler404` that looks for uppercase "
"characters in the URL and redirects to a lowercase equivalent."
msgstr ""
"Tá grúpaí léirithe rialta le `Ilmsu#`` in `url () ``díluchtaithe. Is é an t-"
"aon ghrúpa atá úsáideach ná ``(? i) ``le haghaidh URLanna cás-neamh-íogair, "
"áfach, ní dea-chleachtas iad URLanna cás-neamh-íogair toisc go gcruthaíonn "
"siad iontrálacha iolracha d'innill chuardaigh, mar shampla. D'fhéadfadh "
"réiteach malartach a bheith a chruthú a:data: `~django.conf.urls.handler404` "
"a lorgaíonn carachtair uachtaracha sa URL agus a atreoraíonn chuig coibhéis "
"beaga."

msgid ""
"The ``renderer`` argument is added to the :meth:`Widget.render() "
"<django.forms.Widget.render>` method. Methods that don't accept that "
"argument will work through a deprecation period."
msgstr ""
"<django.forms.Widget.render>Cuirtear an argóint ``renderer`` leis an "
"modh:meth: `Widget.render () `. Oibreoidh modhanna nach nglacann leis an "
"argóint sin trí thréimhse díscrúdaithe."

msgid "Django 1.11.1 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.1"

msgid "*May 6, 2017*"
msgstr "*6 Bealtaine, 2017*"

msgid "Django 1.11.1 adds a minor feature and fixes several bugs in 1.11."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann Django 1.11.1 gné mionghné leis agus socraíonn sé roinnt fabhtanna "
"i 1.11."

msgid "Allowed disabling server-side cursors on PostgreSQL"
msgstr "Ceadaítear cursóirí taobh an fhreastalaí a dhíchumasú ar PostgreSQL"

msgid ""
"The change in Django 1.11 to make :meth:`.QuerySet.iterator()` use server-"
"side cursors on PostgreSQL prevents running Django with PgBouncer in "
"transaction pooling mode. To reallow that, use "
"the :setting:`DISABLE_SERVER_SIDE_CURSORS <DATABASE-"
"DISABLE_SERVER_SIDE_CURSORS>` setting in :setting:`DATABASES`."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann an t-athrú i Django 1.11 chun déanaim:meth: `.queryset.iterator () "
"`úsáid cúrsaí taobh an fhreastalaí ar PostgreSQL cosc ar Django a reáchtáil "
"le PGBouncer i mód comhiomlánaithe idirbheart. <DATABASE-"
"DISABLE_SERVER_SIDE_CURSORS>Chun é sin a íoslódáil, bain úsáid as an socrú:: "
"`DISABLE_SERVER_SIDE_CURSORS `in:setting: `DATABASES`."

msgid ""
"Made migrations respect ``Index``’s ``name`` argument. If you created a "
"named index with Django 1.11, ``makemigrations`` will create a migration to "
"recreate the index with the correct name (:ticket:`28051`)."
msgstr ""
"Meas ar imirce a rinneadh argóint ```ainm ``Innéacs``. Má chruthaigh tú "
"innéacs ainmnithe le Django 1.11, cruthóidh ``makemigrations`` imirce chun "
"an t-innéacs a athchruthú leis an ainm ceart (:ticket: `28051`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a crash when using a ``__icontains`` lookup on a ``ArrayField`` "
"(:ticket:`28038`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh timpiste nuair a úsáidtear cuardach ``__icontains`` ar "
"`Arrayfield`` (:ticket: `28038`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a crash when using a 2-tuple in ``EmailMessage``’s ``attachments`` "
"argument (:ticket:`28042`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh timpiste nuair a úsáidtear 2-tuple in argóint ```ceangaltáin "
"``emailMessage`` (:ticket: `28042`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed ``QuerySet.filter()`` crash when it references the name of a "
"``OneToOneField`` primary key (:ticket:`28047`)."
msgstr ""
"Timpiste seasta ``QuerySet.Filter () ``nuair a thagann sé tagairt d'ainm "
"eochair phríomhúil ``OneTooneField` (:ticket: `28047`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed empty POST data table appearing instead of \"No POST data\" in HTML "
"debug page (:ticket:`28079`)."
msgstr ""
"Tábla sonraí POST folamh seasta atá le feiceáil in ionad “No POST data” i "
"leathanach dífhabhtaithe HTML (:ticket: `28079`)."

msgid ""
"Restored ``BoundField``\\s without any ``choices`` evaluating to ``True`` "
"(:ticket:`28058`)."
msgstr ""
"Athchóirithe ``Boundfield``\\ s gan aon ``roghna`` a mheas go ``True`` "
"(:ticket: `28058`)."

msgid ""
"Prevented ``SessionBase.cycle_key()`` from losing session data if "
"``_session_cache`` isn't populated (:ticket:`28066`)."
msgstr ""
"Cosc ar ``sessionBase.cycle_key () ``sonraí seisiúin a chailleadh mura "
"bhfuil ``_session_cache`` daonra (:ticket: `28066`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed layout of ``ReadOnlyPasswordHashWidget`` (used in the admin's user "
"change page) (:ticket:`28097`)."
msgstr ""
"Leagan amach seasta de ``ReadOnlyPasswordHashWidget`` (a úsáidtear i "
"leathanach athraithe úsáideora an riaracháin) (:ticket: `28097`)."

msgid ""
"Allowed prefetch calls on managers with custom ``ModelIterable`` subclasses "
"(:ticket:`28096`)."
msgstr ""
"Glaonna réamh-cheadaithe ar bhainisteoirí le fo-aicmí saincheaptha "
"``ModelIterable` (:ticket: `28096`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed change password link in the ``contrib.auth`` admin for ``el``, "
"``es_MX``, and ``pt`` translations (:ticket:`28100`)."
msgstr ""
"Nasc pasfhocal athraithe seasta sa riarachán ``contrib.auth`` d'aistriúcháin "
"``el``, `es_mx``, agus `pt`` (:ticket: `28100`)."

msgid ""
"Restored the output of the ``class`` attribute in the ``<ul>`` of widgets "
"that use the ``multiple_input.html`` template. This fixes "
"``ModelAdmin.radio_fields`` with ``admin.HORIZONTAL`` (:ticket:`28059`)."
msgstr ""
"Athchóirigh aschur an tréith ``class ``sa`` de ghuirléidí a úsáideann an "
"teimpléad `<ul>`multiple_input.html``. Socraíonn sé seo "
"``ModelAdmin.Radio_Fields`` le `Admin.Horizontal`` (:ticket: `28059`)."

msgid "Fixed crash in ``BaseGeometryWidget.subwidgets()`` (:ticket:`28039`)."
msgstr ""
"Timpiste seasta i ``BaseGeometryWidget.subWidgets () ``(:ticket: `28039`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed exception reraising in ORM query execution when ``cursor.execute()`` "
"fails and the subsequent ``cursor.close()`` also fails (:ticket:`28091`)."
msgstr ""
"Athardú eisceachta seasta i bhforghníomhú ceisteanna ORM nuair a theipeann "
"ar ``cursor.execute () ``agus teipeann ar an `cursor.close () `ina dhiaidh "
"sin freisin (:ticket: `28091`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression where ``CheckboxSelectMultiple``, ``NullBooleanSelect``, "
"``RadioSelect``, ``SelectMultiple``, and ``Select`` localized option values "
"(:ticket:`28075`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú ina bhfuil luachanna rogha logánaithe "
"``CheckboxSelectMultiple``, `NullBooleanSelect``, `RadioSelect``, "
"`SelectMultiple``, agus ``Select`` (:ticket: `28075`)."

msgid ""
"Corrected the stack level of unordered queryset pagination warnings "
"(:ticket:`28109`)."
msgstr ""
"Ceartaigh leibhéal cruach rabhaidh leathanaigh tacar fiosrúcháin neamh-"
"ordaithe (:ticket: `28109`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression causing incorrect queries for ``__in`` subquery lookups "
"when models use ``ForeignKey.to_field`` (:ticket:`28101`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú ina chúis le ceisteanna míchearta le haghaidh cuardaigh "
"fo-cheisteanna ``__in`` nuair a úsáideann samhlacha ``ForeignKey.to_Field`` "
"(:ticket: `28101`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed crash when overriding the template of "
"``django.views.static.directory_index()`` (:ticket:`28122`)."
msgstr ""
"Timpiste seasta agus an teimpléad de `django.views.static.directory_index () "
"``(:ticket: `28122`) a shárú."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in formset ``min_num`` validation with unchanged forms "
"that have initial data (:ticket:`28130`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i bhailíochtú foirmeacha ``min_num`` le foirmeacha gan "
"athrú a bhfuil sonraí tosaigh acu (:ticket: `28130`)."

msgid "Prepared for ``cx_Oracle`` 6.0 support (:ticket:`28138`)."
msgstr "Ullmhaithe le haghaidh tacaíocht ``CX_Oracle`` 6.0 (:ticket: `28138`)."

msgid ""
"Updated the ``contrib.postgres`` ``SplitArrayWidget`` to use template-based "
"widget rendering (:ticket:`28040`)."
msgstr ""
"Nuashonraigh an ``contrib.postgres`` ```splitarrayWidget`` chun rindreáil "
"giuirléid bunaithe ar theimpléad a úsáid (:ticket: `28040`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed crash in ``BaseGeometryWidget.get_context()`` when overriding existing "
"``attrs`` (:ticket:`28105`)."
msgstr ""
"Timpiste seasta i ``BasegeometryWidget.get_context () ``agus an `attrs`` atá "
"ann cheana a shárú (:ticket: `28105`)."

msgid ""
"Prevented ``AddIndex`` and ``RemoveIndex`` from mutating model state "
"(:ticket:`28043`)."
msgstr ""
"Cosc ar ``AddIndex`` agus ``RemoveIndex`` ó stát samhail a athrú (:ticket: "
"`28043`)."

msgid ""
"Prevented migrations from dropping database indexes from ``Meta.indexes`` "
"when changing ``Field.db_index`` to ``False`` (:ticket:`28052`)."
msgstr ""
"Cosc ar imirce ó innéacsanna bunachar sonraí a scaoileadh ó `Meta.indexes`` "
"nuair a athraíodh ``Field.db_Index`` go `False`` (:ticket: `28052`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in choice ordering in form fields with grouped and non-"
"grouped options (:ticket:`28157`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraíodh aischéimniú in ordú roghanna i réimsí foirme le roghanna grúpáilte "
"agus neamhghrúpáilte (:ticket: `28157`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed crash in  ``BaseInlineFormSet._construct_form()`` when using "
"``save_as_new`` (:ticket:`28159`)."
msgstr ""
"Timpiste seasta i ``BaseinlineFormSet. _construct_form () ``nuair a "
"úsáidtear ``save_as_new`` (:ticket: `28159`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression where ``Model._state.db`` wasn't set correctly on multi-"
"table inheritance parent models after saving a child model (:ticket:`28166`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú ina bhfuil ``Samhail. Níor socraíodh _state.db`` i "
"gceart ar mhúnlaí tuismitheoirí oidhreachta il-tábla tar éis múnla linbh a "
"shábháil (:ticket: `28166`)."

msgid ""
"Corrected the return type of ``ArrayField(CITextField())`` values retrieved "
"from the database (:ticket:`28161`)."
msgstr ""
"Ceartaigh an cineál tuairisceáin luachanna ``ArrayField (CITextField ()) `a "
"aisghabhadh ón mbunachar sonraí (:ticket: `28161`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed ``QuerySet.prefetch_related()`` crash when fetching relations in "
"nested ``Prefetch`` objects (:ticket:`27554`)."
msgstr ""
"Timpiste seasta ``QuerySet.prefetch_related () ``agus caidreamh á fháil i "
"rudaí `Prefetch`` neadaithe (:ticket: `27554`)."

msgid ""
"Prevented hiding GDAL errors if it's not installed when using "
"``contrib.gis`` (:ticket:`28160`). (It's a required dependency as of Django "
"1.11.)"
msgstr ""
"Cosc ar earráidí GDAL a cheilt mura bhfuil sé suiteáilte agus tú ag úsáid "
"``contrib.gis`` (:ticket: `28160`). (Is spleáchas riachtanach é mar Django "
"1.11.)"

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression causing ``__in`` lookups on a foreign key to fail when "
"using the foreign key's parent model as the lookup value (:ticket:`28175`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú ina chúis go dteipeann ar chuardaigh ``__in`` ar "
"eochair eachtrach nuair a úsáidtear tuismithearmsamhail an eochair eachtrach "
"mar an luach cuardaigh (:ticket: `28175`)."

msgid "Django 1.11.10 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.10"

msgid "*February 1, 2018*"
msgstr "*1 Feabhra, 2018*"

msgid "Django 1.11.10 fixes a security issue and several bugs in 1.11.9."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 1.11.10 saincheist slándála agus roinnt fabhtanna i 1.11.9."

msgid "CVE-2018-6188: Information leakage in ``AuthenticationForm``"
msgstr "CVE-2018-6188: Sceitheadh faisnéise i “Form Fíordheimhniúcháin”"

msgid ""
"A regression in Django 1.11.8 "
"made :class:`~django.contrib.auth.forms.AuthenticationForm` run its "
"``confirm_login_allowed()`` method even if an incorrect password is entered. "
"This can leak information about a user, depending on what messages "
"``confirm_login_allowed()`` raises. If ``confirm_login_allowed()`` isn't "
"overridden, an attacker enter an arbitrary username and see if that user has "
"been set to ``is_active=False``. If ``confirm_login_allowed()`` is "
"overridden, more sensitive details could be leaked."
msgstr ""
"Rinneadh aischéimniú i Django 1.11.8: class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.forms.AuthenticationForm` a modh `confirm_login_allow "
"() ``fiú má iontráiltear pasfhocal mícheart. Féadann sé seo faisnéis faoi "
"úsáideoir a sceitheadh, ag brath ar na teachtaireachtaí a ardaíonn "
"`confirm_login_allow () ``. Mura ndéantar `confirm_login_allow () ``a "
"fhilleadh, cuireann ionsaitheoir ainm úsáideora treallach isteach agus féach "
"an bhfuil an t-úsáideoir sin socraithe go ``is_active=false``. Má dhéantar "
"`confirm_login_allow () ``a athshealbhú, d'fhéadfaí sonraí níos íogaire a "
"sceitheadh."

msgid ""
"This issue is fixed with the caveat that ``AuthenticationForm`` can no "
"longer raise the \"This account is inactive.\" error if the authentication "
"backend rejects inactive users (the default authentication backend, "
"``ModelBackend``, has done that since Django 1.10). This issue will be "
"revisited for Django 2.1 as a fix to address the caveat will likely be too "
"invasive for inclusion in older versions."
msgstr ""
"Socraítear an cheist seo leis an rabhadh nach féidir le ``AuthenticationForm "
"``an earráid “Tá an cuntas seo neamhghníomhach.” a ardú a thuilleadh má "
"dhiúltaíonn an cúltaca fíordheimhnithe úsáideoirí neamhghníomhacha (déan an "
"cúltaca fíordheimhnithe réamhshocraithe, `ModelBackend``, é sin ó Django "
"1.10). Déanfar athbhreithniú ar an tsaincheist seo do Django 2.1 mar shocrú "
"chun aghaidh a thabhairt ar an gcaitheamh is dócha go mbeidh sé ró-ionrach "
"lena chur san áireamh i leaganacha níos sine."

msgid ""
"Fixed incorrect foreign key nullification if a model has two foreign keys to "
"the same model and a target model is deleted (:ticket:`29016`)."
msgstr ""
"Neamhnú eochair eachtrach mícheart seasta má tá dhá eochair eachtracha ag "
"samhail don tsamhail chéanna agus scriostar spriocmhúnla (:ticket: `29016`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression where ``contrib.auth.authenticate()`` crashes if an "
"authentication backend doesn't accept ``request`` and a later one does "
"(:ticket:`29071`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú ina dtiocfaidh ``contrib.auth.autenticate () ``mura "
"nglacann cúltaca fíordheimhnithe le ``request`` agus má dhéanann ceann níos "
"déanaí (:ticket: `29071`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed crash when entering an invalid uuid in ``ModelAdmin.raw_id_fields`` "
"(:ticket:`29094`)."
msgstr ""
"Timpiste seasta agus uuid neamhbhailí á iontráil i "
"``ModelAdmin.raw_id_fields`` (:ticket: `29094`)."

msgid "Django 1.11.11 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.11"

msgid "*March 6, 2018*"
msgstr "*6 Márta, 2018*"

msgid "Django 1.11.11 fixes two security issues in 1.11.10."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.11.11 dhá shaincheist slándála i 1.11.10."

msgid ""
"CVE-2018-7536: Denial-of-service possibility in ``urlize`` and "
"``urlizetrunc`` template filters"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2018-7536: Féidearthacht seirbhíse a dhiúltú i scagairí teimpléad "
"``urlize`` agus ``urlizetrunc``"

msgid ""
"The ``django.utils.html.urlize()`` function was extremely slow to evaluate "
"certain inputs due to catastrophic backtracking vulnerabilities in two "
"regular expressions. The ``urlize()`` function is used to implement the "
"``urlize`` and ``urlizetrunc`` template filters, which were thus vulnerable."
msgstr ""
"Bhí an fheidhm ``django.utils.html.urlize () `thar a bheith mall chun "
"ionchuir áirithe a mheas mar gheall ar leochaileachtaí siar-rianaithe "
"tubaisteacha i dhá abairt rialta. Úsáidtear an fheidhm ``urlize () ``chun na "
"scagairí teimpléad ``urlize`` agus ``urlizetrunc`` a chur i bhfeidhm, a bhí "
"leochaileach dá bhrí sin."

msgid ""
"The problematic regular expressions are replaced with parsing logic that "
"behaves similarly."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear loighic parsála a iompraíonn mar an gcéanna in ionad na nathanna "
"rialta fadhbacha."

msgid ""
"CVE-2018-7537: Denial-of-service possibility in ``truncatechars_html`` and "
"``truncatewords_html`` template filters"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2018-7537: Féidearthacht seirbhíse a dhiúltú i scagairí teimpléad "
"``truncatechars_html`` agus ``truncatewords_html``"

msgid ""
"If ``django.utils.text.Truncator``'s ``chars()`` and ``words()`` methods "
"were passed the ``html=True`` argument, they were extremely slow to evaluate "
"certain inputs due to a catastrophic backtracking vulnerability in a regular "
"expression. The ``chars()`` and ``words()`` methods are used to implement "
"the ``truncatechars_html`` and ``truncatewords_html`` template filters, "
"which were thus vulnerable."
msgstr ""
"Má rinneadh modhanna ``Django.utils.text.truncator`` ``chars () ``agus`` "
"words () ```` ``argóint `HTML=True``, bhí siad thar a bheith mall chun "
"ionchuir áirithe a mheas mar gheall ar leochaileacht tubaisteach siar-"
"rianaithe i léiriú rialta. Úsáidtear na modhanna ``chars () ``agus`` words "
"() ``chun na scagairí teimpléad ``truncatechars_html`` agus "
"``truncatewords_html`` a bhí leochaileach dá bhrí sin a chur i bhfeidhm."

msgid "The backtracking problem in the regular expression is fixed."
msgstr "Socraítear an fhadhb siar-rianaithe sa léiriú rialta."

msgid "Django 1.11.12 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.12"

msgid "*April 2, 2018*"
msgstr "*Aibreán 2, 2018*"

msgid "Django 1.11.12 fixes two bugs in 1.11.11."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.11.12 dhá fhabhtanna i 1.11.11."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 1.11.8 where combining two annotated "
"``values_list()`` querysets with ``union()``, ``difference()``, or "
"``intersection()`` crashed due to mismatching columns (:ticket:`29229`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 1.11.8 nuair a tháinig dhá cheisteanna "
"anótaithe ``values_list () `le `aontas ()`, ``difríocht ()``, nó ``crosta () "
"````, ```` anótaithe mar gheall ar cholúin mímheaitseála (:ticket: `29229`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 1.11 where an empty choice could be initially "
"selected for the ``SelectMultiple`` and ``CheckboxSelectMultiple`` widgets "
"(:ticket:`29273`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 1.11 áit ar féidir rogha folamh a roghnú ar "
"dtús do na giuirléidí ``SelectMultiple`` agus ``CheckboxSelectMultiple`` "
"(:ticket: `29273`)."

msgid "Django 1.11.13 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.13"

msgid "*May 1, 2018*"
msgstr "*1 Bealtaine, 2018*"

msgid "Django 1.11.13 fixes several bugs in 1.11.12."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.11.13 roinnt fabhtanna i 1.11.12."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 1.11.8 where altering a field with a unique "
"constraint may drop and rebuild more foreign keys than necessary "
"(:ticket:`29193`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 1.11.8 áit ar féidir réimse a athrú le srian "
"uathúil níos mó eochracha eachtracha ná mar is gá a scaoileadh agus a "
"atógáil (:ticket: `29193`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed crashes in ``django.contrib.admindocs`` when a view is a callable "
"object, such as ``django.contrib.syndication.views.Feed`` (:ticket:`29296`)."
msgstr ""
"Timpeanna seasta i ``django.contrib.admindocs`` nuair is réad inghlaonta é "
"amharc, mar shampla ``django.contrib.syndication.views.feed`` (:ticket: "
"`29296`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 1.11.12 where ``QuerySet.values()`` or "
"``values_list()`` after combining an annotated and unannotated queryset with "
"``union()``, ``difference()``, or ``intersection()`` crashed due to "
"mismatching columns (:ticket:`29286`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 1.11.12 nuair a tháinig ``QuerySet.values () "
"``nó `values_list ()`` tar éis tacar ceisteanna anótaithe agus gan anótáilte "
"a chomhcheangal le ``union () ``, `difríocht ()``, nó ``crosbhall () ``mar "
"gheall ar cholúin mímheaitseála (:ticket: `29286`)."

msgid "Django 1.11.14 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.14"

msgid "*July 2, 2018*"
msgstr "*2 Iúil, 2018*"

msgid "Django 1.11.14 fixes several bugs in 1.11.13."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.11.14 roinnt fabhtanna i 1.11.13."

msgid ""
"Fixed ``WKBWriter.write()`` and ``write_hex()`` for empty polygons on GEOS "
"3.6.1+ (:ticket:`29460`)."
msgstr ""
"Seasta ``WKBWriter.write () ``agus ``write_hex ()`` le haghaidh polagóin "
"folamh ar GEOS 3.6.1+ (:ticket: `29460`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 1.10 that could result in large memory usage "
"when making edits using ``ModelAdmin.list_editable`` (:ticket:`28462`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 1.10 a d'fhéadfadh úsáid mór cuimhne a bheith "
"mar thoradh air agus eagarthóirí á ndéanamh ag baint úsáide as "
"`ModelAdmin.list_Editable`` (:ticket: `28462`)."

msgid "Django 1.11.15 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.15"

msgid "*August 1, 2018*"
msgstr "*1 Lúnasa, 2018*"

msgid "Django 1.11.15 fixes a security issue in 1.11.14."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.11.15 saincheist slándála i 1.11.14."

msgid "CVE-2018-14574: Open redirect possibility in ``CommonMiddleware``"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2018-14574: Féidearthacht atreoraithe oscailte i ``CommonMiddleware``"

msgid ""
"If the :class:`~django.middleware.common.CommonMiddleware` and "
"the :setting:`APPEND_SLASH` setting are both enabled, and if the project has "
"a URL pattern that accepts any path ending in a slash (many content "
"management systems have such a pattern), then a request to a maliciously "
"crafted URL of that site could lead to a redirect to another site, enabling "
"phishing and other attacks."
msgstr ""
"Má tá an socrú:class: `~django.middleware.common.commonMiddleware` agus "
"an:setting: `APPEND_SLASH` cumasaithe, agus má tá patrún URL ag an "
"tionscadal a ghlacann le haon chosán a chríochnaíonn le slash (tá patrún den "
"sórt sin ag go leor córais bainistíochta ábhair), ansin d'fhéadfadh athreorú "
"chuig láithreán eile mar thoradh ar iarratas ar URL atá déanta go "
"mailíseach. ionsaithe."

msgid ""
"``CommonMiddleware`` now escapes leading slashes to prevent redirects to "
"other domains."
msgstr ""
"Éalaíonn ``CommonMiddleware`` anois le sliotáin tosaigh chun atreoruithe "
"chuig fearainn eile a chosc."

msgid "Django 1.11.16 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.16"

msgid "*October 1, 2018*"
msgstr "*1 Deireadh Fómhair, 2018*"

msgid "Django 1.11.16 fixes a data loss bug in 1.11.15."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.11.16 fabht caillteanas sonraí i 1.11.15."

msgid ""
"Fixed a race condition in ``QuerySet.update_or_create()`` that could result "
"in data loss (:ticket:`29499`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh coinníoll rása i ``QuerySet.update_or_create () ``a d'fhéadfadh "
"caillteanas sonraí a bheith mar thoradh air (:ticket: `29499`)."

msgid "Django 1.11.17 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.17"

msgid "*December 3, 2018*"
msgstr "*3 Nollaig, 2018*"

msgid ""
"Django 1.11.17 fixes several bugs in 1.11.16 and adds compatibility with "
"Python 3.7."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 1.11.17 roinnt fabhtanna i 1.11.16 agus cuireann sé "
"comhoiriúnacht le Python 3.7."

msgid ""
"Prevented repetitive calls to ``geos_version_tuple()`` in the ``WKBWriter`` "
"class in an attempt to fix a random crash involving ``LooseVersion`` since "
"Django 1.11.14 (:ticket:`29959`)."
msgstr ""
"Cosc ar ghlaonna athchleachtacha chuig ``geos_version_tuple () ``sa rang "
"``WKBwriter`` mar iarracht timpiste randamach a shocrú a bhaineann le "
"`LooSeversion`` ó Django 1.11.14 (:ticket: `29959`)."

msgid "Django 1.11.18 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.18"

msgid "*January 4, 2019*"
msgstr "*4 Eanáir, 2019*"

msgid "Django 1.11.18 fixes a security issue in 1.11.17."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.11.18 saincheist slándála i 1.11.17."

msgid "CVE-2019-3498: Content spoofing possibility in the default 404 page"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2019-3498: Féidearthacht spoofing ábhair sa leathanach réamhshocraithe "
"404"

msgid ""
"An attacker could craft a malicious URL that could make spoofed content "
"appear on the default page generated by the "
"``django.views.defaults.page_not_found()`` view."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh ionsaitheoir URL mailíseach a cheardú a d'fhéadfadh ábhar "
"spoofed a chur le feiceáil ar an leathanach réamhshocraithe a ghineann an "
"radharc ``django.views.defaults.page_not_found () `."

msgid ""
"The URL path is no longer displayed in the default 404 template and the "
"``request_path`` context variable is now quoted to fix the issue for custom "
"templates that use the path."
msgstr ""
"Ní thaispeántar an cosán URL sa teimpléad réamhshocraithe 404 a thuilleadh "
"agus luaitear an t-athróg comhthéacs `request_path`` anois chun an cheist a "
"shocrú do theimpléid saincheaptha a úsáideann an cosán."

msgid "Django 1.11.19 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.19"

msgid "*February 11, 2019*"
msgstr "*11 Feabhra, 2019*"

msgid "Django 1.11.19 fixes a security issue in 1.11.18."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.11.19 saincheist slándála i 1.11.18."

msgid ""
"CVE-2019-6975: Memory exhaustion in ``django.utils.numberformat.format()``"
msgstr "CVE-2019-6975: Ídiú cuimhne i ``django.utils.numberformat.format () ``"

msgid ""
"If ``django.utils.numberformat.format()`` -- used by ``contrib.admin`` as "
"well as the ``floatformat``, ``filesizeformat``, and ``intcomma`` templates "
"filters -- received a ``Decimal`` with a large number of digits or a large "
"exponent, it could lead to significant memory usage due to a call to "
"``'{:f}'.format()``."
msgstr ""
"Má fhaigheann ``django.utils.numberformat.format () ``-- a úsáideann "
"``contrib.admin`` chomh maith leis na scagairí ``floatform``, "
"`filesizeformat``, agus ``intcom`` -- `Decimal`` le líon mór digití nó "
"exponent mór, d'fhéadfadh úsáid shuntasach cuimhne mar thoradh air mar "
"gheall ar ghlao chuig ``'{:f} '.format ()``."

msgid ""
"To avoid this, decimals with more than 200 digits are now formatted using "
"scientific notation."
msgstr ""
"Chun é seo a sheachaint, déantar deacháin le níos mó ná 200 dhigit a "
"fhormáidiú anois ag baint úsáide as nótaí eolaíoch."

msgid "Django 1.11.2 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.2"

msgid "*June 1, 2017*"
msgstr "*1 Meitheamh, 2017*"

msgid ""
"Django 1.11.2 adds a minor feature and fixes several bugs in 1.11.1. Also, "
"the latest string translations from Transifex are incorporated."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann Django 1.11.2 gné mionghné leis agus socraíonn sé roinnt fabhtanna "
"i 1.11.1. Chomh maith leis sin, corpraítear na haistriúcháin teaghráin is "
"déanaí ó Transifex."

msgid "Minor feature"
msgstr "Gné mhionghné"

msgid ""
"The new ``LiveServerTestCase.port`` attribute reallows the use case of "
"binding to a specific port following the :ref:`bind to port zero "
"<liveservertestcase-port-zero-change>` change in Django 1.11."
msgstr ""
"<liveservertestcase-port-zero-change>Aithníonn an tréith nua "
"``LiveServerTestCase.port`` an cás úsáide a bhaineann le ceangailt le "
"calafort ar leith tar éis an athraithe:ref: `bind le calafort nialas` i "
"Django 1.11."

msgid ""
"Added detection for GDAL 2.1 and 2.0, and removed detection for unsupported "
"versions 1.7 and 1.8 (:ticket:`28181`)."
msgstr ""
"Breise braite le haghaidh GDAL 2.1 agus 2.0, agus braite bainte le haghaidh "
"leaganacha gan tacaíocht 1.7 agus 1.8 (:ticket: `28181 `)."

msgid ""
"Changed ``contrib.gis`` to raise ``ImproperlyConfigured`` rather than "
"``GDALException`` if ``gdal`` isn't installed, to allow third-party apps to "
"catch that exception (:ticket:`28178`)."
msgstr ""
"Athraíodh ``contrib.gis`` chun `ImproperlyConfigured`` a ardú seachas "
"``GdalException`` mura bhfuil `gdal`` suiteáilte, chun ligean do aipeanna "
"tríú páirtí an eisceacht sin a ghabháil (:ticket: `28178`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed ``django.utils.http.is_safe_url()`` crash on invalid IPv6 URLs "
"(:ticket:`28142`)."
msgstr ""
"Timpiste seasta ``django.utils.http.is_safe_url () ``ar URLanna IPv6 "
"neamhbhailí (:ticket: `28142`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed regression causing pickling of model fields to crash (:ticket:`28188`)."
msgstr ""
"Aischéimniú seasta a chruthaíonn piceáil réimsí samhail (:ticket: `28188`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed ``django.contrib.auth.authenticate()`` when multiple authentication "
"backends don't accept a positional ``request`` argument (:ticket:`28207`)."
msgstr ""
"Seasta ``django.contrib.auth.autenticate () ``nuair nach nglacann cúltaca "
"fíordheimhnithe iolracha le argóint ``request`` seasmhach (:ticket: `28207`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed introspection of index field ordering on PostgreSQL (:ticket:`28197`)."
msgstr ""
"Introspéireacht sheasta ar ordú réimse innéacs ar PostgreSQL (:ticket: "
"`28197`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression where ``Model._state.adding`` wasn't set correctly on "
"multi-table inheritance parent models after saving a child model "
"(:ticket:`28210`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú ina bhfuil ``Samhail. Níor socraíodh _state.adding`` i "
"gceart ar mhúnlaí tuismitheoirí oidhreachta il-tábla tar éis samhail linbh a "
"shábháil (:ticket: `28210`)."

msgid ""
"Allowed ``DjangoJSONEncoder`` to serialize "
"``django.utils.deprecation.CallableBool`` (:ticket:`28230`)."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaítear do `DjangojsonEncoder`` ``Django.utils.deprecation.callableBool`` "
"a shraitheadh (:ticket: `28230`)."

msgid ""
"Relaxed the validation added in Django 1.11 of the fields in the "
"``defaults`` argument of ``QuerySet.get_or_create()`` and "
"``update_or_create()`` to reallow settable model properties "
"(:ticket:`28222`)."
msgstr ""
"Scaoileadh an bailíochtú a cuireadh i Django 1.11 de na réimsí san argóint "
"``defaults`` de `QuerySet.get_or_create () ``agus ``update_or_create ()`` "
"chuig airíonna samhail socraithe fíor-íseal (:ticket: `28222`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed ``MultipleObjectMixin.paginate_queryset()`` crash on Python 2 if the "
"``InvalidPage`` message contains non-ASCII (:ticket:`28204`)."
msgstr ""
"Timpiste seasta ``MultipleObjectMixin.Paginate_QuerySet () ``ar Python 2 má "
"tá neamh-ASCII sa teachtaireacht ```InvalidPage`` (:ticket: `28204`)."

msgid ""
"Prevented ``Subquery`` from adding an unnecessary ``CAST`` which resulted in "
"invalid SQL (:ticket:`28199`)."
msgstr ""
"Chuir sé cosc ar ``Subcheiste`` ó `CAST`` gan ghá a chur leis agus mar "
"thoradh air sin bhí SQL neamhbhailí (:ticket: `28199`)."

msgid "Corrected detection of GDAL 2.1 on Windows (:ticket:`28181`)."
msgstr "Braite ceartaithe GDAL 2.1 ar Windows (:ticket: `28181`)."

msgid ""
"Made date-based generic views return a 404 rather than crash when given an "
"out of range date (:ticket:`28209`)."
msgstr ""
"Tugann tuairimí cineálacha dáta-bhunaithe ar ais 404 seachas timpiste nuair "
"a thugtar dáta lasmuigh den raon (:ticket: `28209`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression where ``file_move_safe()`` crashed when moving files to a "
"CIFS mount (:ticket:`28170`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú nuair a tháinig ``file_move_safe () ``tar éis comhaid a "
"bhogadh chuig gléas CIFS (:ticket: `28170`)."

msgid ""
"Moved the ``ImageField`` file extension validation added in Django 1.11 from "
"the model field to the form field to reallow the use case of storing images "
"without an extension (:ticket:`28242`)."
msgstr ""
"Bhog sé an bailíochtú síneadh comhad ``ImageField` a cuireadh i Django 1.11 "
"ón réimse samhail go réimse an fhoirme chun an cás úsáide a bhaineann le "
"híomhánna a stóráil gan síneadh (:ticket: `28242`) a athshlánú."

msgid "Django 1.11.20 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.20"

msgid "Django 1.11.20 fixes a packaging error in 1.11.19."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.11.20 earráid pacáistithe i 1.11.19."

msgid "Corrected packaging error from 1.11.19 (:ticket:`30175`)."
msgstr "Earráid pacáistithe ceartaithe ó 1.11.19 (:ticket: `30175`)."

msgid "Django 1.11.21 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.21"

msgid "*June 3, 2019*"
msgstr "*3 Meitheamh, 2019*"

msgid "Django 1.11.21 fixes a security issue in 1.11.20."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.11.21 saincheist slándála i 1.11.20."

msgid "CVE-2019-12308: AdminURLFieldWidget XSS"
msgstr "CVE-2019-12308: AdminUrlFieldWidget XSS"

msgid ""
"The clickable \"Current URL\" link generated by ``AdminURLFieldWidget`` "
"displayed the provided value without validating it as a safe URL. Thus, an "
"unvalidated value stored in the database, or a value provided as a URL query "
"parameter payload, could result in an clickable JavaScript link."
msgstr ""
"Léirigh an nasc “URL reatha” inchliceáilte a ghinigh ``adminURLFieldWidget`` "
"an luach a chuirtear ar fáil gan é a bhailíochtú mar URL sábháilte. Dá bhrí "
"sin, d'fhéadfadh nasc JavaScript inchliceáilte a bheith mar thoradh ar luach "
"neamhbhailíochtaithe a stóráiltear sa bhunachar sonraí, nó luach a chuirtear "
"ar fáil mar ualach pá paraiméadar ceisteachta URL."

msgid ""
"``AdminURLFieldWidget`` now validates the provided value "
"using :class:`~django.core.validators.URLValidator` before displaying the "
"clickable link. You may customize the validator by passing a "
"``validator_class`` kwarg to ``AdminURLFieldWidget.__init__()``, e.g. when "
"using :attr:`~django.contrib.admin.ModelAdmin.formfield_overrides`."
msgstr ""
"Bailíonn ``AdminUrlFieldWidget`` anois an luach a chuirtear ar fáil ag baint "
"úsáide:class: `~django.core.validators.urlValidator` sula dtaispeántar an "
"nasc inchliceáilte. Féadfaidh tú an bailíochtóir a shaincheapadh trí kwarg "
"``validator_class`` a chur chuig `AdminUrlFieldWidget. __init__ () ``, m.sh. "
"nuair a úsáideann tú: attr: "
"`~django.contrib.admin.modeladmin.formfield_overrides`."

msgid "Django 1.11.22 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.22"

msgid "*July 1, 2019*"
msgstr "*1 Iúil, 2019*"

msgid "Django 1.11.22 fixes a security issue in 1.11.21."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.11.22 saincheist slándála i 1.11.21."

msgid ""
"CVE-2019-12781: Incorrect HTTP detection with reverse-proxy connecting via "
"HTTPS"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2019-12781: Braite HTTP mícheart le seachfhreastalaí droim ag nascadh "
"trí HTTPS"

msgid ""
"When deployed behind a reverse-proxy connecting to Django via "
"HTTPS, :attr:`django.http.HttpRequest.scheme` would incorrectly detect "
"client requests made via HTTP as using HTTPS. This entails incorrect results "
"for :meth:`~django.http.HttpRequest.is_secure`, "
"and :meth:`~django.http.HttpRequest.build_absolute_uri`, and that HTTP "
"requests would not be redirected to HTTPS in accordance "
"with :setting:`SECURE_SSL_REDIRECT`."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a imscaradh taobh thiar de seachfhreastalaí ar ais a nascann le Django "
"trí HTTPS,: attr: `Django.http.HttpRequest.Scheme` braithfeadh go mícheart "
"iarratais ar chliaint a rinneadh trí HTTP mar úsáid HTTPS. Bíonn torthaí "
"míchearta leis seo le haghaidh: meth: `~django.http.httpRequest.is_secure`, "
"agus:meth: `~django.http.httpRequest.build_absolute_uri`, agus nach ndéanfaí "
"iarratais HTTP a atreorú chuig HTTPS de réir: setting: `SECURE_SSL_REDIRECT`."

msgid ""
"``HttpRequest.scheme`` now respects :setting:`SECURE_PROXY_SSL_HEADER`, if "
"it is configured, and the appropriate header is set on the request, for both "
"HTTP and HTTPS requests."
msgstr ""
"Meas `HttpRequest.Scheme`` anois:setting: `SECURE_PROXY_SSL_HEADER`, má tá "
"sé cumraithe, agus má shocraítear an ceannteideal cuí ar an iarratas, le "
"haghaidh iarratais HTTP agus HTTPS araon."

msgid ""
"If you deploy Django behind a reverse-proxy that forwards HTTP requests, and "
"that connects to Django via HTTPS, be sure to verify that your application "
"correctly handles code paths relying on ``scheme``, ``is_secure()``, "
"``build_absolute_uri()``, and ``SECURE_SSL_REDIRECT``."
msgstr ""
"Má úsáideann tú Django taobh thiar de seachfhreastalaí droim a sheolann "
"iarratais HTTP, agus a nascann le Django trí HTTPS, déan cinnte go "
"láimhseálann d'iarratas cosáin cód i gceart ag brath ar `scheme``, "
"`is_secure () ``, `build_absolute_uri () `, agus ``SECURE_SSL_REDIRECT``."

msgid "Django 1.11.23 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.23"

msgid "*August 1, 2019*"
msgstr "*1 Lúnasa, 2019*"

msgid "Django 1.11.23 fixes security issues in 1.11.22."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.11.23 saincheisteanna slándála i 1.11.22."

msgid ""
"CVE-2019-14232: Denial-of-service possibility in "
"``django.utils.text.Truncator``"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2019-14232: Féidearthacht seirbhíse a dhiúltú i "
"``django.utils.text.truncator``"

msgid ""
"If ``django.utils.text.Truncator``'s ``chars()`` and ``words()`` methods "
"were passed the ``html=True`` argument, they were extremely slow to evaluate "
"certain inputs due to a catastrophic backtracking vulnerability in a regular "
"expression. The ``chars()`` and ``words()`` methods are used to implement "
"the :tfilter:`truncatechars_html` and :tfilter:`truncatewords_html` template "
"filters, which were thus vulnerable."
msgstr ""
"Má rinneadh modhanna ``Django.utils.text.truncator`` ``chars () ``agus`` "
"words () ```` ``argóint `HTML=True``, bhí siad thar a bheith mall chun "
"ionchuir áirithe a mheas mar gheall ar leochaileacht tubaisteach siar-"
"rianaithe i léiriú rialta. Úsáidtear na modhanna ``chars () ``agus`` words "
"() ``chun na scagairí teimpléad:tfilter: `truncatechars_html` agus:tfilter: "
"`truncatewords_html` a chur i bhfeidhm, a bhí leochaileach dá bhrí sin."

msgid ""
"The regular expressions used by ``Truncator`` have been simplified in order "
"to avoid potential backtracking issues. As a consequence, trailing "
"punctuation may now at times be included in the truncated output."
msgstr ""
"Tá na nathanna rialta a úsáideann ``Truncator`` simplithe d'fhonn "
"saincheisteanna féideartha ar ais a sheachaint. Mar thoradh air sin, féadfar "
"poncaíocht rianúil a áireamh anois san aschur gearrtha uaireanta."

msgid "CVE-2019-14233: Denial-of-service possibility in ``strip_tags()``"
msgstr "CVE-2019-14233: Féidearthacht seirbhíse a dhiúltú i `strip_tags () ``"

msgid ""
"Due to the behavior of the underlying "
"``HTMLParser``, :func:`django.utils.html.strip_tags` would be extremely slow "
"to evaluate certain inputs containing large sequences of nested incomplete "
"HTML entities. The ``strip_tags()`` method is used to implement the "
"corresponding :tfilter:`striptags` template filter, which was thus also "
"vulnerable."
msgstr ""
"Mar gheall ar iompar an bunúsach `HTMLParser``, bheadh: :func: "
"`django.utils.html.strip_tags` thar a bheith mall chun ionchuir áirithe a "
"bhfuil seicheamh móra d'eintiteas HTML neadaithe neadaithe a mheas. "
"Úsáidtear an modh `strip_tags () `chun an scagaire teimpléad "
"comhfhreagraí:tfilter: `striptags` a chur i bhfeidhm, a bhí mar sin "
"leochaileach freisin."

msgid ""
"``strip_tags()`` now avoids recursive calls to ``HTMLParser`` when progress "
"removing tags, but necessarily incomplete HTML entities, stops being made."
msgstr ""
"Seachnaíonn ``strip_tags () ``glaonna athfhillteach chuig `HTMLParser`` "
"anois nuair a stopann dul chun cinn ag baint clibeanna, ach is gá aonáin "
"HTML neamhiomlána, ag déanamh."

msgid ""
"Remember that absolutely NO guarantee is provided about the results of "
"``strip_tags()`` being HTML safe. So NEVER mark safe the result of a "
"``strip_tags()`` call without escaping it first, for example "
"with :func:`django.utils.html.escape`."
msgstr ""
"Cuimhnigh nach gcuirtear aon ráthaíocht ar fáil go hiomlán faoi thorthaí "
"`strip_tags () ``a bheith sábháilte HTML. Mar sin NÁ marcáil go sábháilte "
"toradh glao ``strip_tags () ``gan éalú air ar dtús, mar shampla le:func: "
"`django.utils.html.escape`."

msgid ""
"CVE-2019-14234: SQL injection possibility in key and index lookups for "
"``JSONField``/``HStoreField``"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2019-14234: Féidearthacht insteallta SQL i gcuardach eochair agus "
"innéacs do ``JSONField``/``hStorefield``"

msgid ""
":lookup:`Key and index lookups <jsonfield.key>` for "
"``django.contrib.postgres.fields.JSONField`` and :lookup:`key lookups "
"<hstorefield.key>` for :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.HStoreField` "
"were subject to SQL injection, using a suitably crafted dictionary, with "
"dictionary expansion, as the ``**kwargs`` passed to ``QuerySet.filter()``."
msgstr ""
":lookup: `Cuardaigh eochair agus innéacs `le <jsonfield.key>haghaidh "
"``django.contrib.postgres.fields.jsonfield`` agus:lookup: `eochairchuardach` "
"do:class: `~django.contrib.postgres.fields.hstorefield` faoi réir "
"instealladh SQL, ag úsáid foclóir ceardaithe go cuí, le leathnú foclóra, mar "
"a tháinig an `**kwargs`` chuig ``QuerySet.filter ()` <hstorefield.key>`."

msgid ""
"CVE-2019-14235: Potential memory exhaustion in "
"``django.utils.encoding.uri_to_iri()``"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2019-14235: Ídiú cuimhne féideartha i ``django.utils.encoding.uri_to_iri "
"() ``"

msgid ""
"If passed certain inputs, :func:`django.utils.encoding.uri_to_iri` could "
"lead to significant memory usage due to excessive recursion when re-percent-"
"encoding invalid UTF-8 octet sequences."
msgstr ""
"Má chuirtear ionchuir áirithe á rith, d'fhéadfadh úsáid shuntasach cuimhne a "
"bheith mar thoradh ar :func: `django.utils.encoding.uri_to_iri` mar gheall "
"ar athshlánú iomarcach nuair a ath-ionchódú céatadáin seichimh ochtet UTF-8 "
"neamhbhailí."

msgid ""
"``uri_to_iri()`` now avoids recursion when re-percent-encoding invalid UTF-8 "
"octet sequences."
msgstr ""
"Seachnaíonn ``uri_to_iri () ``athiompú anois nuair a bhíonn seicheamh octet "
"UTF-8 neamhbhailí ag ath-ionchódú céatadáin."

msgid "Django 1.11.24 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.24"

msgid "*September 2, 2019*"
msgstr "*2 Meán Fómhair, 2019*"

msgid "Django 1.11.24 fixes a regression in 1.11.23."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.11.24 aischéimniú i 1.11.23."

msgid ""
"Fixed crash of ``KeyTransform()`` for "
"``django.contrib.postgres.fields.JSONField`` "
"and :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.HStoreField` when using on "
"expressions with params (:ticket:`30672`)."
msgstr ""
"Timpiste seasta de ``KeyTransform () ``do "
"`Django.contrib.postgres.fields.jsonfield`` agus:class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.hStorefield` nuair a úsáidtear ar nathanna "
"le params (:ticket: `30672`)."

msgid "Django 1.11.25 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.25"

msgid "*October 1, 2019*"
msgstr "*1 Deireadh Fómhair, 2019*"

msgid "Django 1.11.25 fixes a regression in 1.11.23."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.11.25 aischéimniú i 1.11.23."

msgid ""
"Fixed a crash when filtering with a ``Subquery()`` annotation of a queryset "
"containing ``django.contrib.postgres.fields.JSONField`` "
"or :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.HStoreField` (:ticket:`30769`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh timpiste agus tú ag scagadh le anótáil ``Subquery () ``ar shraith "
"fiosrúcháin ina bhfuil ``Django.Contrib.Postgres.Fields.jsonField`` "
"nó:class: `~django.contrib.postgres.fields.hStorefield` (:ticket: `30769`)."

msgid "Django 1.11.26 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.26"

msgid "*November 4, 2019*"
msgstr "*4 Samhain, 2019*"

msgid "Django 1.11.26 fixes a regression in 1.11.25."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.11.26 aischéimniú i 1.11.25."

msgid ""
"Fixed a crash when using a ``contains``, ``contained_by``, ``has_key``, "
"``has_keys``, or ``has_any_keys`` lookup on "
"``django.contrib.postgres.fields.JSONField``, if the right or left hand side "
"of an expression is a key transform (:ticket:`30826`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh timpiste nuair a úsáidtear cuardach ``contains``, `contained_by``, "
"`has_keys``, `has_keys``, nó ``has_any_keys`` ar "
"`django.contrib.postgres.fields.jsonfield``, más eochair claochlú é an taobh "
"deise nó clé de abairt (:ticket: 30826`)."

msgid "Django 1.11.27 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.27"

msgid "*December 18, 2019*"
msgstr "*18 Nollaig, 2019*"

msgid "Django 1.11.27 fixes a security issue and a data loss bug in 1.11.26."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 1.11.27 saincheist slándála agus fabht caillteanais sonraí "
"i 1.11.26."

msgid "CVE-2019-19844: Potential account hijack via password reset form"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2019-19844: Fuadach cuntas féideartha trí fhoirm athshocraithe pasfhocal"

msgid ""
"By submitting a suitably crafted email address making use of Unicode "
"characters, that compared equal to an existing user email when lower-cased "
"for comparison, an attacker could be sent a password reset token for the "
"matched account."
msgstr ""
"Trí sheoladh ríomhphoist atá déanta go cuí a chur isteach ag úsáid "
"carachtair Unicode, i gcomparáid le ríomhphost úsáideora atá ann cheana "
"nuair a bhíonn sé níos ísle le comparáid, d'fhéadfaí comhartha athshocraithe "
"pasfhocal a sheoladh d'ionsaitheoir don chuntas comhoiriúnaithe."

msgid ""
"In order to avoid this vulnerability, password reset requests now compare "
"the submitted email using the stricter, recommended algorithm for case-"
"insensitive comparison of two identifiers from `Unicode Technical Report 36, "
"section 2.11.2(B)(2)`__. Upon a match, the email containing the reset token "
"will be sent to the email address on record rather than the submitted "
"address."
msgstr ""
"D'fhonn an leochaileacht seo a sheachaint, déanann iarratais athshocraithe "
"pasfhocal comparáid anois leis an ríomhphost a chuirtear isteach ag baint "
"úsáide as an algartam níos déine, molta le haghaidh comparáid idir dhá "
"aitheantóir ó `Tuarascáil Theicniúil Unicode 36, alt 2.11.2 (B) (2) `__. Ar "
"chluiche, seolfar an ríomhphost ina bhfuil an comhartha athshocraithe chuig "
"an seoladh ríomhphoist atá ar taifead seachas an seoladh curtha isteach."

msgid ""
"Fixed a data loss possibility "
"in :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.forms.SplitArrayField`. When using with "
"``ArrayField(BooleanField())``, all values after the first ``True`` value "
"were marked as checked instead of preserving passed values (:ticket:`31073`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh féidearthacht caillteanais sonraí in:class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.forms.splitArrayField`. Nuair a úsáidtear é le "
"``ArrayField (BooleanField ()) `, marcáilíodh na luachanna go léir tar éis "
"an chéad luach ``True`` mar sheiceáiltear in ionad luachanna rith a chaomhnú "
"(:ticket: `31073`)."

msgid "Django 1.11.28 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.28"

msgid "*February 3, 2020*"
msgstr "*3 Feabhra, 2020*"

msgid "Django 1.11.28 fixes a security issue in 1.11.27."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.11.28 saincheist slándála i 1.11.27."

msgid "CVE-2020-7471: Potential SQL injection via ``StringAgg(delimiter)``"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2020-7471: Instealladh SQL féideartha trí ``StringaGg (teorannaitheoir) "
"``"

msgid ""
":class:`~django.contrib.postgres.aggregates.StringAgg` aggregation function "
"was subject to SQL injection, using a suitably crafted ``delimiter``."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.contrib.postgres.aggregates.StringAgg` bhí feidhm "
"chomhiomlánaithe faoi réir instealladh SQL, ag baint úsáide as ``delimiter`` "
"atá cruthaithe go cuí."

msgid "Django 1.11.29 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.29"

msgid "*March 4, 2020*"
msgstr "*4 Márta, 2020*"

msgid "Django 1.11.29 fixes a security issue in 1.11.28."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.11.29 saincheist slándála i 1.11.28."

msgid ""
"CVE-2020-9402: Potential SQL injection via ``tolerance`` parameter in GIS "
"functions and aggregates on Oracle"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2020-9402: Instealladh SQL féideartha trí pharaiméadar ``lamháltas ``i "
"bhfeidhmeanna agus comhiomlánaithe GIS ar Oracle"

msgid ""
"GIS functions and aggregates on Oracle were subject to SQL injection, using "
"a suitably crafted ``tolerance``."
msgstr ""
"Bhí feidhmeanna agus comhiomlánaithe GIS ar Oracle faoi réir instealladh "
"SQL, ag baint úsáide as “lamháltas” a chruthú go cuí."

msgid "Django 1.11.3 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.3"

msgid "*July 1, 2017*"
msgstr "*1 Iúil, 2017*"

msgid "Django 1.11.3 fixes several bugs in 1.11.2."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.11.3 roinnt fabhtanna i 1.11.2."

msgid ""
"Removed an incorrect deprecation warning about a missing ``renderer`` "
"argument if a ``Widget.render()`` method accepts ``**kwargs`` "
"(:ticket:`28265`)."
msgstr ""
"Baineadh rabhadh mícheart díghníomhaíochta faoi argóint ``renderer`` atá in "
"easnamh má ghlacann modh ``Widget.render ()`` ```**kwargs`` (:ticket: "
"`28265`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression causing ``Model.__init__()`` to crash if a field has an "
"instance only descriptor (:ticket:`28269`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú ina chúis le ``Samhail. __init__ () ``a thréimhseáil má "
"tá tuairiscí sampla amháin ag réimse (:ticket: `28269`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed an incorrect ``DisallowedModelAdminLookup`` exception when using a "
"nested reverse relation in ``list_filter`` (:ticket:`28262`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh eisceacht mícheart ``DisallowedModelAdminlookup`` nuair a úsáidtear "
"caidreamh droim neadaithe i `list_filter`` (:ticket: `28262`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed admin's ``FieldListFilter.get_queryset()`` crash on invalid input "
"(:ticket:`28202`)."
msgstr ""
"Timpeadh ``FieldListFilter.get_QuerySet () ``riaracháin seasta ar ionchur "
"neamhbhailí (:ticket: `28202`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed invalid HTML for a required ``AdminFileWidget`` (:ticket:`28278`)."
msgstr ""
"Seasta HTML neamhbhailí do `AdminFileWidget`` riachtanach (:ticket: `28278`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed model initialization to set the name of class-based model indexes for "
"models that only inherit ``models.Model`` (:ticket:`28282`)."
msgstr ""
"Tosú samhail sheasta chun ainm na n-innéacsanna samhail rang-bhunaithe a "
"shocrú do mhúnlaí nach n-oidhreann ach ``Models.model`` (:ticket: `28282`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed crash in admin's inlines when a model has an inherited non-editable "
"primary key (:ticket:`27967`)."
msgstr ""
"Timpiste seasta i línte riaracháin nuair a bhíonn eochair phríomhúil neamh-"
"eagarthaithe oidhreachta ag samhail (:ticket: `27967`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed ``QuerySet.union()``, ``intersection()``, and ``difference()`` when "
"combining with an ``EmptyQuerySet`` (:ticket:`28293`)."
msgstr ""
"Seasta ``QuerySet.union () ``, `crosta ()``, agus ``difríocht () ``nuair a "
"cheanglaítear le ``EmptyQuerySet`` (:ticket: `28293`)."

msgid ""
"Prevented ``Paginator``’s unordered object list warning from evaluating a "
"``QuerySet`` (:ticket:`28284`)."
msgstr ""
"Chuir sé cosc ar rabhadh liosta réada neamh-ordaithe ``Paginator`` ó "
"``QuerySet`` a mheas (:ticket: `28284`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed the value of ``redirect_field_name`` in ``LoginView``’s template "
"context. It's now an empty string (as it is for the original function-based "
"``login()`` view) if the corresponding parameter isn't sent in a request (in "
"particular, when the login page is accessed directly) (:ticket:`28229`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh luach ``redirect_field_name`` i gcomhthéacs teimpléad ``LoginView "
"``. Is teaghrán folamh é anois (mar atá sé don amharc bunaidh ``logáil "
"isteach () `bunaithe ar fheidhm) mura seoltar an paraiméadar comhfhreagrach "
"isteach in iarratas (go háirithe, nuair a bhíonn rochtain dhíreach ar an "
"leathanach logála isteach) (:ticket: `28229`)."

msgid ""
"Prevented attribute values in the ``django/forms/widgets/attrs.html`` "
"template from being localized so that numeric attributes (e.g. ``max`` and "
"``min``) of ``NumberInput`` work correctly (:ticket:`28303`)."
msgstr ""
"Cosc ar luachanna tréithe sa teimpléad ``django/forms/widgets/attrs.html`` a "
"logánú ionas go n-oibreoidh tréithe uimhriúla (m.sh. `max`` agus `min``) de "
"`Numberinput`` i gceart (:ticket: `28303`)."

msgid ""
"Removed casting of the option value to a string in the template context of "
"the ``CheckboxSelectMultiple``, ``NullBooleanSelect``, ``RadioSelect``, "
"``SelectMultiple``, and ``Select`` widgets (:ticket:`28176`). In Django "
"1.11.1, casting was added in Python to avoid localization of numeric values "
"in Django templates, but this made some use cases more difficult. Casting is "
"now done in the template using the ``|stringformat:'s'`` filter."
msgstr ""
"Bainte réitigh an luach rogha chuig teaghrán i gcomhthéacs teimpléad na "
"giuirléidí ``CheckboxSelectMultiple``, `NullBooleanSelect``, `RadioSelect``, "
"``SelectMultiple``, agus ``Select`` (:ticket: `28176`). I Django 1.11.1, "
"cuireadh réitigh i Python chun logánú luachanna uimhriúla i dteimpléid "
"Django a sheachaint, ach chuir sé seo níos deacra roinnt cásanna úsáide. "
"Déantar réitigh anois sa teimpléad ag baint úsáide as an scagaire ``|"
"stringformat: 's'``."

msgid ""
"Prevented a primary key alteration from adding a foreign key constraint if "
"``db_constraint=False`` (:ticket:`28298`)."
msgstr ""
"Chuir sé cosc ar athrú eochair phríomhúil ó shrianadh eochair eachtrach a "
"chur leis má tá `DB_restricint=false ``(:ticket: `28298`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed ``UnboundLocalError`` crash in ``RenameField`` with nonexistent field "
"(:ticket:`28350`)."
msgstr ""
"Timpiste seasta ``UnBoundLocalError`` i `RenameField`` le réimse nach bhfuil "
"ann (:ticket: `28350`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression preventing a model field's ``limit_choices_to`` from "
"being evaluated when a ``ModelForm`` is instantiated (:ticket:`28345`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraíodh aischéimniú a chuireann cosc ar `limit_choices_to` réimse samhail "
"a mheas nuair a dhéantar ``Modelform`` a chur isteach (:ticket: `28345`)."

msgid "Django 1.11.4 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.4"

msgid "*August 1, 2017*"
msgstr "*1 Lúnasa, 2017*"

msgid "Django 1.11.4 fixes several bugs in 1.11.3."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.11.4 roinnt fabhtanna i 1.11.3."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in 1.11.3 on Python 2 where non-ASCII ``format`` values "
"for date/time widgets results in an empty ``value`` in the widget's HTML "
"(:ticket:`28355`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i 1.11.3 ar Python 2 ina mbíonn “luach” folamh i HTML "
"an ghuirléid (:ticket: `28355`) mar thoradh ar luachanna ``formáid`` neamh-"
"ASCII do ghuirléidí dáta/ama."

msgid ""
"Fixed ``QuerySet.union()`` and ``difference()`` when combining with a "
"queryset raising ``EmptyResultSet`` (:ticket:`28378`)."
msgstr ""
"Seasta ``QuerySet.union () ``agus ``difríocht ()`` agus tú ag comhcheangal "
"le tacar ceisteanna ag ardú ``EmptyResultSet ``(:ticket: `28378`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in pickling of ``LazyObject`` on Python 2 when the "
"wrapped object doesn't have ``__reduce__()`` (:ticket:`28389`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú maidir le picáil ``LazyObject`` ar Python 2 nuair nach "
"bhfuil ``__reduce__ () ``ag an réad fillte (:ticket: `28389`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed crash in ``runserver``'s ``autoreload`` with Python 2 on Windows with "
"non-``str`` environment variables (:ticket:`28174`)."
msgstr ""
"Timpiste seasta i ``autoreload`` ``runserver`` le Python 2 ar Windows le "
"hathróga timpeallachta neamh-`str` (:ticket: `28174`)."

msgid ""
"Corrected ``Field.has_changed()`` to return ``False`` for disabled form "
"fields: ``BooleanField``, ``MultipleChoiceField``, ``MultiValueField``, "
"``FileField``, ``ModelChoiceField``, and ``ModelMultipleChoiceField``."
msgstr ""
"Ceartaithe ``Field.has_Changed () ``chun `False`` a thabhairt ar ais do "
"réimsí foirme faoi mhíchumas: ``BooleanField``, `MultipleChoiceField``, "
"`MultivalueField``, `FileField``, `ModelChoiceField``, agus "
"`ModelMultipleChoiceField``."

msgid ""
"Fixed ``QuerySet.count()`` for ``union()``, ``difference()``, and "
"``intersection()`` queries. (:ticket:`28399`)."
msgstr ""
"Seasta ``QuerySet.count () ``le haghaidh ceisteanna ``aontas ()``, "
"`difríocht () ``, agus ``crosta ()``. (:ticéad: `28399`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed ``ClearableFileInput`` rendering as a subwidget of ``MultiWidget`` "
"(:ticket:`28414`). Custom ``clearable_file_input.html`` widget templates "
"will need to adapt for the fact that context values ``checkbox_name``, "
"``checkbox_id``, ``is_initial``, ``input_text``, ``initial_text``, and "
"``clear_checkbox_label`` are now attributes of ``widget`` rather than "
"appearing in the top-level context."
msgstr ""
"Seasta rindreáil ``ClearableFileInput`` mar fhoghuirléid de ``MultiWidget`` "
"(:ticket: `28414`). Ní mór teimpléid giuirléid saincheaptha "
"``clearable_file_input.html`` a oiriúnú go bhfuil luachanna comhthéacs "
"``checkbox_name``, `checkbox_id``, `is_initial``, `input_text``, "
"``initial_text`, agus ``clear_checkbox_label`` tréithe `widget`anois seachas "
"a bheith le feiceáil sa chomhthéacs barrleibhéil."

msgid ""
"Fixed queryset crash when using a ``GenericRelation`` to a proxy model "
"(:ticket:`28418`)."
msgstr ""
"Timpiste tacar ceisteanna seasta nuair a úsáidtear ``GenericRelation`` le "
"samhail seachfhreastalaí (:ticket: `28418`)."

msgid "Django 1.11.5 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.5"

msgid "Django 1.11.5 fixes a security issue and several bugs in 1.11.4."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 1.11.5 saincheist slándála agus roinnt fabhtanna i 1.11.4."

msgid ""
"Fixed GEOS version parsing if the version has a commit hash at the end (new "
"in GEOS 3.6.2) (:ticket:`28441`)."
msgstr ""
"Parsáil leagan GEOS seasta má tá hash tiomanta ag an leagan ag an deireadh "
"(nua i GEOS 3.6.2) (:ticket: `28441`)."

msgid "Added compatibility for ``cx_Oracle`` 6 (:ticket:`28498`)."
msgstr "Comhoiriúnacht breise le haghaidh ``CX_Oracle`` 6 (:ticket: `28498`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed select widget rendering when option values are tuples "
"(:ticket:`28502`)."
msgstr ""
"Rindreáil giuirléid roghnaithe seasta nuair a bhíonn luachanna roghanna "
"tuples (:ticket: `28502`)."

msgid ""
"Django 1.11 inadvertently changed the sequence and trigger naming scheme on "
"Oracle. This causes errors on INSERTs for some tables if "
"``'use_returning_into': False`` is in the ``OPTIONS`` part of ``DATABASES``. "
"The pre-1.11 naming scheme is now restored. Unfortunately, it necessarily "
"requires an update to Oracle tables created with Django 1.11.[1-4]. Use the "
"upgrade script in :ticket:`28451` comment 8 to update sequence and trigger "
"names to use the pre-1.11 naming scheme."
msgstr ""
"D'athraigh Django 1.11 an scéim ainmniúcháin seicheamh agus spreagtha ar "
"Oracle go neamhthuiscint. Is cúis leis seo earráidí ar Ionsáidí do roinnt "
"táblaí má tá ```use_returning_into': False`` sa chuid ``OPTIONS`` de "
"`DATABASES``. Tá an scéim ainmnithe réamh-1.11 ar ais anois. Ar an "
"drochuair, is gá go n-éilíonn sé nuashonrú ar tháblaí Oracle a cruthaíodh le "
"Django 1.11. [1-4]. Úsáid an script uasghrádaithe in:ticket: `28451` trácht "
"8 chun seicheamh a nuashonrú agus ainmneacha a spreagadh chun an scéim "
"ainmniúcháin réamh-1.11 a úsáid."

msgid ""
"Added POST request support to ``LogoutView``, for equivalence with the "
"function-based ``logout()`` view (:ticket:`28513`)."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh tacaíocht iarratais POST leis ``LogoutView``, le haghaidh "
"cothromaíochta leis an radharc ``logout () `bunaithe ar fheidhm (: ticket: "
"`28513`)."

msgid ""
"Omitted ``pages_per_range`` from ``BrinIndex.deconstruct()`` if it's "
"``None`` (:ticket:`25809`)."
msgstr ""
"Fág ``pages_per_range`` ó ``Brinindex.deconstruct () ``má tá sé ``None`` "
"(:ticket: `25809`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression where ``SelectDateWidget`` localized the years in the "
"select box (:ticket:`28530`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú nuair a rinne ``SelectDateWidget`` na blianta sa bhosca "
"roghnaithe (:ticket: `28530`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in 1.11.4 where ``runserver`` crashed with non-Unicode "
"system encodings on Python 2 + Windows (:ticket:`28487`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i 1.11.4 nuair a tháinig ``runserver ``le hichódaithe "
"córais neamh-Unicode ar Python 2 + Windows (:ticket: `28487`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 1.10 where changes to a ``ManyToManyField`` "
"weren't logged in the admin change history (:ticket:`27998`) and prevented "
"``ManyToManyField`` initial data in model forms from being affected by "
"subsequent model changes (:ticket:`28543`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 1.10 nuair nár logáilíodh athruithe ar "
"``ManyTomanyField`` sa stair athraithe riaracháin (:ticket: `27998`) agus "
"cosc ar shonraí tosaigh ``ManyTomanyField` i bhfoirmeacha samhail a bheith "
"difear ag athruithe samhail ina dhiaidh sin (:ticket: `28543`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed non-deterministic results or an ``AssertionError`` crash in some "
"queries with multiple joins (:ticket:`26522`)."
msgstr ""
"Torthaí seasta neamh-chinnitheacha nó timpiste ``AssertionError`` i roinnt "
"ceisteanna le comhlánaithe iolracha (:ticket: `26522`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in ``contrib.auth``'s ``login()`` and ``logout()`` views "
"where they ignored positional arguments (:ticket:`28550`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i dtuairimí ```logáil () ``agus ``logout () `` "
"`contrib.auth`` áit ar thug siad neamhaird ar argóintí seasaimh (:ticket: "
"`28550`)."

msgid "Django 1.11.6 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.6"

msgid "*October 5, 2017*"
msgstr "*Deireadh Fómhair 5, 2017*"

msgid "Django 1.11.6 fixes several bugs in 1.11.5."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.11.6 roinnt fabhtanna i 1.11.5."

msgid ""
"Made the ``CharField`` form field convert whitespace-only values to the "
"``empty_value`` when ``strip`` is enabled (:ticket:`28555`)."
msgstr ""
"Rinne an réimse foirme ``Charfield`` luachanna spás bán amháin a thiontú go "
"``vacty_value`` nuair a chumasaítear ``strip`` (:ticket: `28555`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed crash when using the name of a model's autogenerated primary key "
"(``id``) in an ``Index``'s ``fields`` (:ticket:`28597`)."
msgstr ""
"Timpiste seasta nuair a úsáidtear ainm eochair phríomhghinithe uathghinithe "
"samhail (``id``) i `réimsí ``Innéacs ``(:ticket: `28597`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 1.9 where a custom view error handler such as "
"``handler404`` that accesses ``csrf_token`` could cause CSRF verification "
"failures on other pages (:ticket:`28488`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 1.9 áit a bhféadfadh láimhseálaí earráid "
"amharc saincheaptha mar ``handler404`` a fhaigheann rochtain ar "
"`csrf_token`` a bheith ina chúis le teipeanna fíoraithe CSRF ar leathanaigh "
"eile (:ticket: `28488`)."

msgid "Django 1.11.7 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.7"

msgid "*November 1, 2017*"
msgstr "*1 Samhain, 2017*"

msgid "Django 1.11.7 fixes several bugs in 1.11.6."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.11.7 roinnt fabhtanna i 1.11.6."

msgid ""
"Prevented ``cache.get_or_set()`` from caching ``None`` if the ``default`` "
"argument is a callable that returns ``None`` (:ticket:`28601`)."
msgstr ""
"Cosc ar ``cache.get_or_set () ``ó chosc ``None`` a chosc más inghlaonta é an "
"argóint ``default`` a thugann ar ais ``None`` (:ticket: `28601`)."

msgid "Fixed the Basque ``DATE_FORMAT`` string (:ticket:`28710`)."
msgstr "Socraigh an teaghrán ``DATE_FORMAT ``Bascach (:ticket: `28710`)."

msgid ""
"Made ``QuerySet.reverse()`` affect ``nulls_first`` and ``nulls_last`` "
"(:ticket:`28722`)."
msgstr ""
"Rinneadh ``QuerySet.Reverse () `i bhfeidhm ar ``nulls_first`` agus "
"``nulls_last`` (:ticket: `28722`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed unquoted table names in ``Subquery`` SQL when using ``OuterRef`` "
"(:ticket:`28689`)."
msgstr ""
"Ainmneacha tábla neamhluaite seasta i ``SubQuery`` SQL nuair a úsáidtear "
"``OuterRef`` (:ticket: `28689`)."

msgid "Django 1.11.8 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.8"

msgid "*December 2, 2017*"
msgstr "*2 Nollaig, 2017*"

msgid "Django 1.11.8 fixes several bugs in 1.11.7."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.11.8 roinnt fabhtanna i 1.11.7."

msgid ""
"Reallowed, following a regression in Django 1.10, ``AuthenticationForm`` to "
"raise the inactive user error when using ``ModelBackend`` (:ticket:`28645`)."
msgstr ""
"Athchóirithe, tar éis aischéimnithe i Django 1.10, `Form Authentication`` "
"chun an earráid úsáideora neamhghníomhach a ardú agus `ModelBackend`` á "
"úsáid (:ticket: `28645`)."

msgid ""
"Added support for ``QuerySet.values()`` and ``values_list()`` for "
"``union()``, ``difference()``, and ``intersection()`` queries "
"(:ticket:`28781`)."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíocht bhreise do ``QuerySet.values () ``agus ``values_list ()`` do "
"cheisteanna ``union () ``, `difríocht ()``, agus ``cross-() ``(: ticket: "
"`28781`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed incorrect index name truncation when using a namespaced ``db_table`` "
"(:ticket:`28792`)."
msgstr ""
"Bearradh ainm innéacs mícheart socraithe nuair a úsáidtear spás ainmneacha "
"``db_table`` (:ticket: `28792`)."

msgid ""
"Made ``QuerySet.iterator()`` use server-side cursors on PostgreSQL after "
"``values()`` and ``values_list()`` (:ticket:`28817`)."
msgstr ""
"Rinne ``QuerySet.iterator () ``úsáid cúrsaí taobh an fhreastalaí ar "
"PostgreSQL tar éis ``values ()`` agus ``values_list () ``(:ticket: `28817`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed crash on SQLite and MySQL when ordering by a filtered subquery that "
"uses ``nulls_first`` or ``nulls_last`` (:ticket:`28848`)."
msgstr ""
"Timpiste seasta ar SQLite agus MySQL agus tú ag ordú le fo-cheist scagtha a "
"úsáideann ``nulls_first`` nó ``nulls_last`` (:ticket: `28848`)."

msgid ""
"Made query lookups for ``CICharField``, ``CIEmailField``, and "
"``CITextField`` use a ``citext`` cast (:ticket:`28702`)."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann cuardaigh fiosrúcháin do `Cicharfield``, `Ciemailfield``, agus "
"``CitextField`` caitheadh ``citext`` (:ticket: `28702`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in caching of a ``GenericForeignKey`` when the referenced "
"model instance uses multi-table inheritance (:ticket:`28856`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraíodh aischéimniú i gcáil ``GenericForeignKey`` nuair a úsáideann an "
"tsamhail tagartha oidhreacht il-tábla (:ticket: `28856`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed \"Cannot change column 'x': used in a foreign key constraint\" crash "
"on MySQL with a sequence of ``AlterField`` and/or ``RenameField`` operations "
"in a migration (:ticket:`28305`)."
msgstr ""
"Seasta “Ní féidir colún 'x' a athrú: a úsáidtear i dtimpiste eochair srian "
"eachtrach” ar MySQL le seicheamh d'oibríochtaí ``Alterfield` agus/nó "
"`RenameField` i imirce (:ticket: `28305`)."

msgid "Django 1.11.9 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.11.9"

msgid "*January 1, 2018*"
msgstr "*1 Eanáir, 2018*"

msgid "Django 1.11.9 fixes several bugs in 1.11.8."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 1.11.9 roinnt fabhtanna i 1.11.8."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 1.11 that added newlines between "
"``MultiWidget``'s subwidgets (:ticket:`28890`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 1.11 a chuir línte nua idir foghuirléidí "
"``MultiWidget` (:ticket: `28890`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed incorrect class-based model index name generation for models with "
"quoted ``db_table`` (:ticket:`28876`)."
msgstr ""
"Giniúint ainm innéacs samhail bunaithe ar rang mícheart socraithe do mhúnlaí "
"le luaite ``db_table`` (:ticket: `28876`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed incorrect foreign key constraint name for models with quoted "
"``db_table`` (:ticket:`28876`)."
msgstr ""
"Ainm srianta eochair eachtrach mícheart socraithe do mhúnlaí le luaite "
"``db_table`` (:ticket: `28876`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in caching of a ``GenericForeignKey`` when the referenced "
"model instance uses more than one level of multi-table inheritance "
"(:ticket:`28856`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraíodh aischéimniú i gcáil ``GenericForeignKey`` nuair a úsáideann an "
"samhail tagartha níos mó ná leibhéal amháin d'oidhreacht il-tábla (:ticket: "
"`28856`)."

msgid "Django 1.2 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 1.2"

msgid "*May 17, 2010.*"
msgstr "*17 Bealtaine, 2010. *"

msgid "Welcome to Django 1.2!"
msgstr "Fáilte go dtí Django 1.2!"

msgid ""
"Nearly a year in the making, Django 1.2 packs an impressive list "
"of :ref:`new features <whats-new-1.2>` and lots of bug fixes. These release "
"notes cover the new features, as well as important changes you'll want to be "
"aware of when upgrading from Django 1.1 or older versions."
msgstr ""
"Beagnach bliain á dhéanamh, tá liosta mórthaibhseach á phacáistiú ag Django "
"1.2 de :ref:`gnéithe nua <whats-new-1.2>` agus go leor ceartúcháin ar "
"fhabht. Clúdaíonn na nótaí scaoileadh seo na gnéithe nua, chomh maith le "
"hathruithe tábhachtacha ar mhaith leat a bheith feasach orthu agus tú ag "
"uasghrádú ó Django 1.1 nó leaganacha níos sine."

msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Forbhreathnú"

msgid "Django 1.2 introduces several large, important new features, including:"
msgstr ""
"Tugann Django 1.2 roinnt gnéithe nua móra tábhachtacha isteach, lena n-"
"áirítear:"

msgid ""
"Support for :ref:`multiple database connections <support-for-multiple-"
"databases>` in a single Django instance."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíocht do: ref: `naisc iolracha bunachar sonraí <support-for-multiple-"
"databases>`i gcás amháin Django."

msgid "`Model validation`_ inspired by Django's form validation."
msgstr "`Bailíochtú samhail `_ spreagtha ag bailíochtú foirm Django."

msgid ""
"Vastly :ref:`improved protection against Cross-Site Request Forgery "
"<improved-csrf-protection>` (CSRF)."
msgstr ""
"<improved-csrf-protection>Go mór: ref: `cosaint fheabhsaithe i gcoinne "
"Fhorbhóisiú Iarratais Tras-Láithreáin `(CSRF)."

msgid ""
"A new :ref:`user \"messages\" framework <messages-framework>` with support "
"for cookie- and session-based message for both anonymous and authenticated "
"users."
msgstr ""
"Creat nua:ref: `teachtaireachtaí úsáideora <messages-framework>`le tacaíocht "
"do theachtaireacht bhunaithe ar fhianán agus seisiún d'úsáideoirí gan ainm "
"agus fíordheimhnithe araon."

msgid ""
"Hooks for `object-level permissions`_, `permissions for anonymous users`_, "
"and :ref:`more flexible username requirements <relaxed-requirements-for-"
"usernames>`."
msgstr ""
"<relaxed-requirements-for-usernames>Crúcaí le haghaidh `ceadúnais ar "
"leibhéal réad`_, `ceadanna d'úsáideoirí gan ainm `_, agus:ref: `riachtanais "
"ainm úsáideora níos solúbtha `."

msgid "Customization of email sending via `email backends`_."
msgstr "Saincheapadh seoladh ríomhphoist trí `backends`_."

msgid ""
"New :ref:`\"smart\" if template tag <new-in-1.2-smart-if>` which supports "
"comparison operators."
msgstr ""
"New:ref: `\"cliste” má chlib teimpléad <new-in-1.2-smart-if>`a thacaíonn le "
"hoibreoirí comparáide."

msgid ""
"These are just the highlights; full details and a complete list of "
"features :ref:`may be found below <whats-new-1.2>`."
msgstr ""
"<whats-new-1.2>Is iad seo ach na buaicphointí; is féidir sonraí iomlána agus "
"liosta iomlán gnéithe: ref: `a fháil thíos `."

msgid ""
"`Django Advent`_ covered the release of Django 1.2 with a series of articles "
"and tutorials that cover some of the new features in depth."
msgstr ""
"Clúdaigh `Django Advent`_ scaoileadh Django 1.2 le sraith alt agus ranganna "
"teagaisc a chlúdaíonn cuid de na gnéithe nua go domhain."

msgid ""
"Wherever possible these features have been introduced in a backwards-"
"compatible manner per :doc:`our API stability policy </misc/api-stability>` "
"policy."
msgstr ""
"Cibé áit is féidir, tugadh na gnéithe seo isteach ar bhealach atá "
"comhoiriúnach le cúl faoir:doc: 'ár mbeartas cobhsaíochta AP</misc/api-"
"stability> I'."

msgid ""
"However, a handful of features *have* changed in ways that, for some users, "
"will be backwards-incompatible. The big changes are:"
msgstr ""
"Mar sin féin, tá dornán gnéithe* athraithe ar bhealaí a bheidh, i gcás "
"roinnt úsáideoirí, ag teacht ar chúl. Is iad na hathruithe móra:"

msgid "Support for Python 2.3 has been dropped. See the full notes below."
msgstr "Tá tacaíocht do Python 2.3 titim. Féach na nótaí iomlána thíos."

msgid ""
"The new CSRF protection framework is not backwards-compatible with the old "
"system. Users of the old system will not be affected until the old system is "
"removed in Django 1.4."
msgstr ""
"Níl an creat nua cosanta CSRF comhoiriúnach ar chúl leis an seanchóras. Ní "
"bheidh tionchar ag úsáideoirí an tseanchórais go dtí go mbainfear an "
"seanchóras i Django 1.4."

msgid ""
"However, upgrading to the new CSRF protection framework requires a few "
"important backwards-incompatible changes, detailed in `CSRF Protection`_, "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Mar sin féin, éilíonn uasghrádú chuig an gcreat nua cosanta CSRF roinnt "
"athruithe tábhachtacha atá neamhchomhoiriúnach le cúil, sonraithe i `Cosaint "
"CSRF `_, thíos."

msgid ""
"Authors of custom :class:`~django.db.models.Field` subclasses should be "
"aware that a number of methods have had a change in prototype, detailed "
"under `get_db_prep_*() methods on Field`_, below."
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir go mbeadh a fhios ag údair fo-aicmí saincheap:class: "
"`~django.db.models.field` go bhfuil athrú tagtha ar roinnt modhanna ar "
"fhréamhshamhail, sonraithe faoi `get_db_prep_* () modhanna ar Field`_, thíos."

msgid ""
"The internals of template tags have changed somewhat; authors of custom "
"template tags that need to store state (e.g. custom control flow tags) "
"should ensure that their code follows the new rules for `stateful template "
"tags`_"
msgstr ""
"Tá athrú beagán tagtha ar inmheánacha clibeanna teimpléad; ba cheart d'údair "
"clibeanna teimpléad saincheaptha a gcaithfidh stát a stóráil (m.sh. "
"clibeanna sreafa rialaithe saincheaptha) a chinntiú go leanann a gcód na "
"rialacha nua maidir le `clibeanna teimpléad stáit`_"

msgid ""
"The :func:`~django.contrib.auth.decorators.user_passes_test`, :func:`~django.contrib.auth.decorators.login_required`, "
"and :func:`~django.contrib.auth.decorators.permission_required`, decorators "
"from :mod:`django.contrib.auth` only apply to functions and no longer work "
"on methods. There's a simple one-line fix :ref:`detailed below <user-passes-"
"test-login-required-permission-required>`."
msgstr ""
"An: func: `~django.contrib.auth.decorators.user_passes_test`, :func: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.decorators.login_required`, agus:func: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.decorators.permission_requred`, maisitheoirí ó:mod: "
"`django.contrib.` ní bhaineann ach le feidhmeanna agus ní oibríonn siad ar "
"mhodhanna a thuilleadh. <user-passes-test-login-required-permission-"
"required>Tá socrú aon-líne simplí ann: ref: `sonraithe thíos `."

msgid ""
"Again, these are just the big features that will affect the most users. "
"Users upgrading from previous versions of Django are heavily encouraged to "
"consult the complete list of :ref:`backwards-incompatible changes <backwards-"
"incompatible-changes-1.2>` and the list of :ref:`deprecated features "
"<deprecated-features-1.2>`."
msgstr ""
"Arís, níl iad seo ach na gnéithe móra a rachaidh i bhfeidhm ar na "
"húsáideoirí is mó. <deprecated-features-1.2>Spreagtar go mór úsáideoirí a "
"uasghrádú ó leaganacha roimhe seo de Django dul i gcomhairle leis an liosta "
"iomlán de:ref: `athruithe neamh-chomhoiriúnacha ar aghaidh 'agus an liosta "
"de:ref: `gn <backwards-incompatible-changes-1.2>éithe scoite `."

msgid ""
"While not a new feature, it's important to note that Django 1.2 introduces "
"the first shift in our Python compatibility policy since Django's initial "
"public debut. Previous Django releases were tested and supported on 2.x "
"Python versions from 2.3 up; Django 1.2, however, drops official support for "
"Python 2.3. As such, the minimum Python version required for Django is now "
"2.4, and Django is tested and supported on Python 2.4, 2.5 and 2.6, and will "
"be supported on the as-yet-unreleased Python 2.7."
msgstr ""
"Cé nach gné nua é, tá sé tábhachtach a thabhairt faoi deara go dtugann "
"Django 1.2 an chéad athrú isteach inár mbeartas comhoiriúnachta Python ó "
"thús phoiblí tosaigh Django. Rinneadh tástáil agus tacaíodh le eisiúintí "
"Django roimhe seo ar leaganacha 2.x Python ó 2.3 suas; Tlagann Django 1.2, "
"áfach, tacaíocht oifigiúil do Python 2.3. Dá bhrí sin, is é 2.4 an leagan "
"íosta Python atá riachtanach do Django anois, agus déantar tástáil agus "
"tacaítear le Django ar Python 2.4, 2.5 agus 2.6, agus tacófar leis ar an "
"Python 2.7 nach bhfuil eisithe fós."

msgid ""
"This change should affect only a small number of Django users, as most "
"operating-system vendors today are shipping Python 2.4 or newer as their "
"default version. If you're still using Python 2.3, however, you'll need to "
"stick to Django 1.1 until you can upgrade; per :doc:`our support policy </"
"internals/release-process>`, Django 1.1 will continue to receive security "
"support until the release of Django 1.3."
msgstr ""
"Níor cheart go mbíonn tionchar ag an athrú seo ach ar líon beag úsáideoirí "
"Django, mar tá formhór na ndíoltóirí córais oibriúcháin inniu ag seoladh "
"Python 2.4 nó níos nuaí mar a leagan réamhshoc Má tá Python 2.3 á úsáid agat "
"fós, áfach, beidh ort cloí le Django 1.1 go dtí gur féidir leat uasghrádú a "
"dhéanamh; per:doc: `ár mbeartas tacaíochta ', leanfaidh Django 1.1 ag fáil "
"tac</internals/release-process> aíochta slándála go dtí scaoilfear Django "
"1.3."

msgid ""
"A roadmap for Django's overall 2.x Python support, and eventual transition "
"to Python 3.x, is currently being developed, and will be announced prior to "
"the release of Django 1.3."
msgstr ""
"Tá treochlár do thacaíocht foriomlán 2.x Python Django, agus aistriú go "
"Python 3.x sa deireadh, á fhorbairt faoi láthair, agus fógrófar é sula "
"scaoilfear Django 1.3."

msgid "What's new in Django 1.2"
msgstr "Cad atá nua i Django 1.2"

msgid "Support for multiple databases"
msgstr "Tacaíocht do iliomad bunachar sonraí"

msgid ""
"Django 1.2 adds the ability to use :doc:`more than one database </topics/db/"
"multi-db>` in your Django project. Queries can be issued at a specific "
"database with the ``using()`` method on ``QuerySet`` objects. Individual "
"objects can be saved to a specific database by providing a ``using`` "
"argument when you call ``save()``."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann Django 1.2 an cumas úsáid: doc: `níos mó ná bunachar sonraí amháin "
"'i do thionscadal Django. </topics/db/multi-db> Is féidir ceisteanna a "
"eisiúint ag bunachar sonraí ar leith leis an modh ``using () ``ar rudaí "
"``QuerySet`. Is féidir rudaí aonair a shábháil chuig bunachar sonraí ar "
"leith trí argóint ``úsáid ``a sholáthar nuair a ghlaonn tú ar ``save ()``."

msgid "Model validation"
msgstr "Bailíochtú samhail"

msgid ""
"Model instances now have support for :ref:`validating their own data "
"<validating-objects>`, and both model and form fields now accept "
"configurable lists of :doc:`validators </ref/validators>` specifying "
"reusable, encapsulated validation behavior. Note, however, that validation "
"must still be performed explicitly. Simply invoking a model instance's "
"``save()`` method will not perform any validation of the instance's data."
msgstr ""
"Tá tacaíocht anois ag cásanna samhlacha le haghaidh: ref: `a gcuid sonraí "
"féin a bhailíochtú </ref/validators> <validating-objects>`, agus glacann "
"réimsí samhail agus foirm araon le liostaí inchumraithe de:doc: `validators` "
"a shonraíonn iompar bailíochtaithe in-athúsáidte, ionfhabhtaithe. Tabhair "
"faoi deara, áfach, go gcaithfear bailíochtú a dhéanamh go sainráite fós. Ní "
"dhéanfar aon bhailíochtú sonraí an cháis ar mhodh ``save () ``samhail a "
"ghairm."

msgid "Improved CSRF protection"
msgstr "Cosaint CSRF feabhsaithe"

msgid ""
"Django now has much improved protection against :doc:`Cross-Site Request "
"Forgery (CSRF) attacks</ref/csrf>`. This type of attack occurs when a "
"malicious website contains a link, a form button or some JavaScript that is "
"intended to perform some action on your website, using the credentials of a "
"logged-in user who visits the malicious site in their browser. A related "
"type of attack, \"login CSRF,\" where an attacking site tricks a user's "
"browser into logging into a site with someone else's credentials, is also "
"covered."
msgstr ""
"Tá cosaint i bhfad feabhsaithe ag Django anois in aghaidh: doc: `Ionsaithe "
"Fhorbhósáide Iarratas Tras-Láithreáin (CSRF )</ref/csrf> `. Tarlaíonn an "
"cineál ionsaithe seo nuair a bhíonn nasc, cnaipe foirme nó roinnt JavaScript "
"i láithreán gréasáin mailíseach atá beartaithe chun gníomh éigin a dhéanamh "
"ar do shuíomh Gréasáin, ag baint úsáide as dintiúir úsáideora logáilte "
"isteach a thugann cuairt ar an suíomh mailíseach ina mbrabhsálaí. Clúdaítear "
"cineál ionsaí gaolmhar, “logáil isteach CSRF,” áit a gcuireann suíomh "
"ionsaitheach brabhsálaí úsáideora isteach i suíomh le dintiúir duine eile, "
"clúdaithe freisin."

msgid "Messages framework"
msgstr "Creat teachtaireachtaí"

msgid ""
"Django now includes a robust and configurable :doc:`messages framework </ref/"
"contrib/messages>` with built-in support for cookie- and session-based "
"messaging, for both anonymous and authenticated clients. The messages "
"framework replaces the deprecated user message API and allows you to "
"temporarily store messages in one request and retrieve them for display in a "
"subsequent request (usually the next one)."
msgstr ""
"Cuimsíonn Django anois creata “teachtaireachtaí láidir agus cumraithe: doc: "
"le tacaíocht ionsuite do theachtaireachtaí bunaithe ar f</ref/contrib/"
"messages> hianán agus seisiún, do chliaint gan ainm agus fíordheimhnithe "
"araon. Cuireann an creat teachtaireachtaí in ionad an API teachtaireachta "
"úsáideora lasmuigh agus tugann sé deis duit teachtaireachtaí a stóráil go "
"sealadach in iarratas amháin agus iad a aisghabháil le taispeáint in "
"iarratas ina dhiaidh sin (an chéad cheann eile de ghnáth)"

msgid "Object-level permissions"
msgstr "Ceadanna ar leibhéal réada"

msgid ""
"A foundation for specifying permissions at the per-object level has been "
"added. Although there is no implementation of this in core, a custom "
"authentication backend can provide this implementation and it will be used "
"by :class:`django.contrib.auth.models.User`. See the :doc:`authentication "
"docs </topics/auth/index>` for more information."
msgstr ""
"Tá bonn curtha leis chun ceadanna a shonrú ag an leibhéal in aghaidh an "
"ábhair. Cé nach bhfuil sé seo á chur i bhfeidhm sa chroílár, is féidir le "
"hinneal fíordheimhnithe saincheaptha an cur i bhfeidhm seo a sholáthar agus "
"bainfidh :class:`django.contrib.auth.models.User` úsáid as. Féach "
"an :doc:`doiciméid fíordheimhnithe </topics/auth/index>` le haghaidh "
"tuilleadh eolais."

msgid "Permissions for anonymous users"
msgstr "Ceadanna d'úsáideoirí gan ainm"

msgid ""
"If you provide a custom auth backend with ``supports_anonymous_user`` set to "
"``True``, AnonymousUser will check the backend for permissions, just like "
"User already did.  This is useful for centralizing permission handling - "
"apps can always delegate the question of whether something is allowed or not "
"to the authorization/authentication backend. See the :doc:`authentication "
"docs </topics/auth/index>` for more details."
msgstr ""
"Má sholáthraíonn tú cúltaca saincheaptha auth le ``supports_anonymous_user`` "
"socraithe go ``True``, seiceálfaidh AnonymousUser an cúltaca le haghaidh "
"ceadanna, díreach mar a rinne an Úsáideoir cheana féin. Tá sé seo úsáideach "
"chun láimhseáil ceadanna a lárú - is féidir le feidhmchláir an cheist i "
"gcónaí an gceadaítear rud éigin nó nach bhfuil a tharmligean chuig an "
"gcúltaca údaraisiú Féach na:doc: `doiciméid fíordheimhniúcháin` le haghaidh "
"tuilleadh sonraí </topics/auth/index>."

msgid "Relaxed requirements for usernames"
msgstr "Riachtanais suaimhneach d'ainmneacha"

msgid ""
"The built-in :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User` "
"model's :attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.username` field now allows a "
"wider range of characters, including ``@``, ``+``, ``.`` and ``-`` "
"characters."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn an réimse bunaithe:class: `~django.contrib.auth.models.user` "
"model's:attr: `~django.contrib.auth.models.user.name` raon níos leithne "
"carachtair, lena n-áirítear carachtair ``@``, `+``, `.`` agus ``-``."

msgid "Email backends"
msgstr "Cúltaca ríomhphoist"

msgid ""
"You can now :ref:`configure the way that Django sends email <topic-email-"
"backends>`. Instead of using SMTP to send all email, you can now choose a "
"configurable email backend to send messages. If your hosting provider uses a "
"sandbox or some other non-SMTP technique for sending mail, you can now "
"construct an email backend that will allow Django's standard :doc:`mail "
"sending methods</topics/email>` to use those facilities."
msgstr ""
"<topic-email-backends>Is féidir leat anois:ref: `an bealach a sheolann "
"Django ríomhphost a chumrú `. In ionad SMTP a úsáid chun gach ríomhphost a "
"sheoladh, is féidir leat cúltaca ríomhphoist inchumraithe a roghnú anois "
"chun teachtaireachtaí a sheoladh. Má úsáideann do sholáthraí óstála bosca "
"gainimh nó teicníc éigin neamh-SMTP eile chun post a sheoladh, is féidir "
"leat cúltaca ríomhphoist a thógáil anois a ligfidh do chaighdeán Django: "
"doc: `modhanna seolta ríomhphost` na</topics/email> háiseanna sin a úsáid."

msgid ""
"This also makes it easier to debug mail sending. Django ships with backend "
"implementations that allow you to send email to a :ref:`file<topic-email-"
"file-backend>`, to the :ref:`console<topic-email-console-backend>`, or "
"to :ref:`memory<topic-email-memory-backend>`. You can even configure all "
"email to be :ref:`thrown away<topic-email-dummy-backend>`."
msgstr ""
"Fágann sé seo go bhfuil sé níos éasca seoladh ríomhphoist a dhífhabhtú. "
"<topic-email-console-backend><topic-email-memory-backend>Seolann Django le "
"cur i bhfeidhm cúltaca a ligeann duit ríomhphost a sheoladh chuig a:ref: "
"`file <topic-email-file-backend>`, chuig:ref: `console`, nó chuig: ref: "
"`memory `. <topic-email-dummy-backend>Is féidir leat gach ríomhphost a "
"chumrú go mbeadh: ref: `caitheadh amach `."

msgid "\"Smart\" :ttag:`if` tag"
msgstr "“Cliste” :ttag: clib `if"

msgid ""
"The :ttag:`if` tag has been upgraded to be much more powerful. First, we've "
"added support for comparison operators. No longer will you have to type:"
msgstr ""
"Tá an chlib: ttag: `if `uasghrádaithe le bheith i bhfad níos cumhachtaí. Ar "
"dtús, tá tacaíocht curtha againn d'oibreoirí comparáide. Ní bheidh ort "
"clóscríobh a thuilleadh:"

msgid "You can now do this:"
msgstr "Is féidir leat é seo a dhéanamh anois:"

msgid ""
"There's really no reason to use ``{% ifequal %}`` or ``{% ifnotequal %}`` "
"anymore, unless you're the nostalgic type."
msgstr ""
"Níl aon chúis ann i ndáiríre ``{% ifequal%}`` nó ``{% ifnotequal%}`` a úsáid "
"níos mó, mura bhfuil tú an cineál nostalgic."

msgid ""
"The operators supported are ``==``, ``!=``, ``<``, ``>``, ``<=``, ``>=``, "
"``in`` and ``not in``, all of which work like the Python operators, in "
"addition to ``and``, ``or`` and ``not``, which were already supported."
msgstr ""
"Is iad na hoibreoirí a dtacaítear leo ná ``==``, ``!=``, `` <``, ``>``, `` "
"<=``, ``> =``, ``i`` agus ``not in``, a oibríonn go léir cosúil leis na "
"hoibreoirí Python, chomh maith le `` agus``, `` nó`` agus `` ní``, ar "
"tacaíodh leo cheana féin."

msgid "Also, filters may now be used in the ``if`` expression. For example:"
msgstr ""
"Chomh maith leis sin, is féidir scagairí a úsáid anois sa abairt `if ``. Mar "
"shampla:"

msgid "Template caching"
msgstr "Caching teimpléad"

msgid ""
"In previous versions of Django, every time you rendered a template, it would "
"be reloaded from disk. In Django 1.2, you can use a :ref:`cached template "
"loader <template-loaders>` to load templates once, then cache the result for "
"every subsequent render. This can lead to a significant performance "
"improvement if your templates are broken into lots of smaller subtemplates "
"(using the ``{% extends %}`` or ``{% include %}`` tags)."
msgstr ""
"I leaganacha roimhe seo de Django, gach uair a rinne tú teimpléad, déanfaí é "
"a athluchtú ón diosca. I Django 1.2, is féidir leat a:ref: `lódóir teimpléad "
"taisceáilte <template-loaders>`a úsáid chun teimpléid a luchtú uair amháin, "
"ansin an toradh a thaisceadh do gach rindreáil ina dhiaidh sin. D'fhéadfadh "
"feabhas suntasach feidhmíochta a bheith mar thoradh air seo má bhriseadh do "
"theimpléid ina go leor fotheimpléid níos lú (ag baint úsáide as na clibeanna "
"``{%%}`` nó ``{% include%}``)."

msgid ""
"As a side effect, it is now much easier to support non-Django template "
"languages."
msgstr ""
"Mar fho-iarsacht, tá sé i bhfad níos éasca anois tacú le teangacha teangacha "
"teimpléid neamh-Django."

msgid "Class-based template loaders"
msgstr "Luchtaitheoirí teimpléad aicmbunaithe"

msgid ""
"As part of the changes made to introduce `Template caching`_  and following "
"a general trend in Django, the template loaders API has been modified to use "
"template loading mechanisms that are encapsulated in Python classes as "
"opposed to functions, the only method available until Django 1.1."
msgstr ""
"Mar chuid de na hathruithe a rinneadh chun `Caching Teimpléad`_ a thabhairt "
"isteach agus ag leanúint treocht ghinearálta i Django, modhnaíodh API "
"luchtaithe teimpléad chun meicníochtaí luchtaithe teimpléad a úsáid atá "
"cuimsithe i ranganna Python seachas feidhmeanna, an t-aon mhodh atá ar fáil "
"go dtí Django 1.1."

msgid ""
"All the template loaders :ref:`shipped with Django <template-loaders>` have "
"been ported to the new API but they still implement the function-based API "
"and the template core machinery still accepts function-based loaders "
"(builtin or third party) so there is no immediate need to modify your "
"``TEMPLATE_LOADERS`` setting in existing projects, things will keep working "
"if you leave it untouched up to and including the Django 1.3 release."
msgstr ""
"Tá <template-loaders>na luchtóirí teimpléad uile: ref: `sheolta le Django `a "
"iompraíodh chuig an API nua ach cuireann siad an API feidhmion-bhunaithe i "
"bhfeidhm fós agus glacann croí-innealra teimpléad le luchtóirí feidhmion-"
"bhunaithe (bunaithe nó tríú páirtí) mar sin ní gá láithreach do shuíomh "
"`TEMPLATE_LOADERS` a mhodhnú i dtionscadail atá ann cheana, leanfaidh rudaí "
"ag obair má fhágann tú é gan teagmháil go dtí agus lena n-áirítear "
"scaoileadh Django 1.3."

msgid ""
"If you have developed your own custom template loaders we suggest to "
"consider porting them to a class-based implementation because the code for "
"backwards compatibility with function-based loaders starts its deprecation "
"process in Django 1.2 and will be removed in Django 1.4.  There is a "
"description of the API these loader classes must implement in the template "
"API reference and you can also examine the source code of the loaders "
"shipped with Django."
msgstr ""
"Má tá do luchtaitheoirí teimpléad saincheaptha féin forbartha agat molaimid "
"smaoineamh ar iad a iompar chuig cur i bhfeidhm aicme-bhunaithe toisc go "
"dtosaíonn an cód le haghaidh comhoiriúnacht ar ais le luchtóirí feidhmion-"
"bhunaithe ar a phróiseas díscrúdaithe i Django 1.2 agus bainfear é i Django "
"1.4. Tá cur síos ar an API ní mór do na ranganna lódóra seo a chur i "
"bhfeidhm sa thagairt API teimpléid agus is féidir leat scrúdú a dhéanamh "
"freisin cód foinse na luchtóirí a sheoltar le Django."

msgid "Natural keys in fixtures"
msgstr "Eochracha nádúrtha i daingneo"

msgid ""
"Fixtures can now refer to remote objects using :ref:`topics-serialization-"
"natural-keys`. This lookup scheme is an alternative to the normal primary-"
"key based object references in a fixture, improving readability and "
"resolving problems referring to objects whose primary key value may not be "
"predictable or known."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le daingneáin tagairt a dhéanamh anois do rudaí iargúlta ag baint "
"úsáide:ref: `topics-serialization-natural-keys`. Is rogha eile í an scéim "
"cuardaigh seo seachas na gnáththagairtí réad bunaithe ar eochair bhunaithe i "
"ndaingneán, léiteacht a fheabhsú agus fadhbanna a réiteach ag tagairt do "
"rudaí nach mbeadh a bpríomh-phríomhluach intuartha nó ar eolas acu."

msgid "Fast failure for tests"
msgstr "Teip tapa le haghaidh tástálacha"

msgid ""
"Both the :djadmin:`test` subcommand of ``django-admin.py`` and the "
"``runtests.py`` script used to run Django's own test suite now support a ``--"
"failfast`` option. When specified, this option causes the test runner to "
"exit after encountering a failure instead of continuing with the test run. "
"In addition, the handling of ``Ctrl-C`` during a test run has been improved "
"to trigger a graceful exit from the test run that reports details of the "
"tests that were run before the interruption."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn an fho-ordú: djadmin: `test` de `django-admin.py`` agus an script "
"``runtests.py`` a úsáidtear chun sraith tástála Django féin a reáchtáil le "
"rogha ``--failfast`` anois. Nuair a shonraítear é, cuireann an rogha seo "
"faoi deara an tástála imeacht tar éis dó teacht ar theip in ionad leanúint "
"ar aghaidh leis an rith tástála. Ina theannta sin, feabhsaíodh láimhseáil "
"``Ctrl-C`` le linn rith tástála chun imeacht grámhar ón rith tástála a "
"spreagadh a thuairiscíonn sonraí faoi na tástálacha a reáchtáil roimh an "
"gcuid isteach."

msgid "``BigIntegerField``"
msgstr "``BigIntegerfield``"

msgid ""
"Models can now use a 64-bit :class:`~django.db.models.BigIntegerField` type."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le samhlacha cineál 64-giot:class: "
"`~Django.db.Models.BigIntegerField` a úsáid anois."

msgid "Improved localization"
msgstr "Logánú feabhsaithe"

msgid ""
"Django's :doc:`internationalization framework </topics/i18n/index>` has been "
"expanded with locale-aware formatting and form processing. That means, if "
"enabled, dates and numbers on templates will be displayed using the format "
"specified for the current locale. Django will also use localized formats "
"when parsing data in forms. See :doc:`/topics/i18n/formatting` for more "
"details."
msgstr ""
"Django's:doc: Leathnaíodh `creat idirnáisiúnaitheach` le formáidiú agus "
"próiseáil foirmeacha ar an </topics/i18n/index> eolas áitiúil. Ciallaíonn sé "
"sin, má tá sé cumasaithe, taispeánfar dátaí agus uimhreacha ar theimpléid ag "
"baint úsáide as an bhformáid a shonraítear don áitiúil reatha. Úsáidfidh "
"Django formáidí logánaithe freisin agus sonraí á pháirseáil i bhfoirmeacha. "
"Féach: doc: `/topics/i18n/formatting` le haghaidh tuilleadh sonraí."

msgid "``readonly_fields`` in ``ModelAdmin``"
msgstr "``readonly_fields`` i ``ModelAdmin``"

msgid ""
":attr:`django.contrib.admin.ModelAdmin.readonly_fields` has been added to "
"enable non-editable fields in add/change pages for models and inlines. Field "
"and calculated values can be displayed alongside editable fields."
msgstr ""
":attr: `django.contrib.admin.ModelAdmin.readonly_fields` curtha leis chun "
"réimsí neamh-ineagarthóireachta a chumasú i leathanaigh bhreiseáin/athraigh "
"le haghaidh samhlacha agus inlínte. Is féidir luachanna allamuigh agus ríofa "
"a thaispeáint taobh le réimsí inathraithe."

msgid "Customizable syntax highlighting"
msgstr "Aibhsiú comhréireachta in"

msgid ""
"You can now use a :envvar:`DJANGO_COLORS` environment variable to modify or "
"disable the colors used by ``django-admin.py`` to provide :ref:`syntax "
"highlighting <syntax-coloring>`."
msgstr ""
"<syntax-coloring>Is féidir leat athróg timpeallachta a:envvar: "
"`DJANGO_COLORS` a úsáid anois chun na dathanna a úsáideann ``django-"
"admin.py`` a mhodhnú nó a dhíchumasú chun: ref: `aibhsiú comhréireachta `a "
"sholáthar."

msgid "Syndication feeds as views"
msgstr "Fothaíonn sindiciú mar thuairimí"

msgid ""
":doc:`Syndication feeds </ref/contrib/syndication>` can now be used directly "
"as views in your :doc:`URLconf </topics/http/urls>`. This means that you can "
"maintain complete control over the URL structure of your feeds. Like any "
"other view, feeds views are passed a ``request`` object, so you can do "
"anything you would normally do with a view, like user based access control, "
"or making a feed a named URL."
msgstr ""
":doc: Is féidir `fothaí sindiciúcháin` a úsáid go díreach anois mar thu</ref/"
"contrib/syndication> airimí i d:doc: `URLCon</topics/http/urls> f`. "
"Ciallaíonn sé seo gur féidir leat smacht iomlán a choinneáil ar struchtúr "
"URL do fhothaí. Cosúil le haon radharc eile, cuirtear tuairimí fothaí ar "
"réad ``iarrata``, ionas gur féidir leat aon rud a dhéanfá de ghnáth le "
"radharc a dhéanamh, cosúil le rialú rochtana úsáideora, nó URL ainmnithe a "
"dhéanamh do bheatha."

msgid ""
"The most significant new feature for :doc:`GeoDjango </ref/contrib/gis/"
"index>` in 1.2 is support for multiple spatial databases.  As a result, the "
"following :ref:`spatial database backends <spatial-backends>` are now "
"included:"
msgstr ""
"Is é an ghné nua is suntasaí le haghaidh: doc: `GeodJango` i 1.2 ná "
"tacaíocht do iolracha bunachair sonraí </ref/contrib/gis/index> spásúla. "
"<spatial-backends>Mar thoradh air sin, tá na cinn seo a leanas: ref: "
"`cúltaca bunachar sonraí spásúla `san áireamh anois:"

msgid "``django.contrib.gis.db.backends.postgis``"
msgstr "``django.contrib.gis.db.backends.postgis``"

msgid "``django.contrib.gis.db.backends.mysql``"
msgstr "``django.contrib.gis.db.backends.mysql``"

msgid "``django.contrib.gis.db.backends.oracle``"
msgstr "``django.contrib.gis.db.backends.oracle``"

msgid "``django.contrib.gis.db.backends.spatialite``"
msgstr "``django.contrib.gis.db.backends.spatialite``"

msgid ""
"GeoDjango now supports the rich capabilities added in the PostGIS 1.5 "
"release. New features include support for the :ref:`geography type "
"<geography-type>` and enabling of :ref:`distance queries <distance-queries>` "
"with non-point geometries on geographic coordinate systems."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn GeodJango anois leis na cumais shaibhir a chuirtear sa scaoileadh "
"PostGIS 1.5. I measc na ngnéithe nua tá tacaíocht don: ref: `cineál "
"tíreolaíochta <geography-type>`agus cumasú o:ref: `fiosruithe achair` le "
"geoiméadraí <distance-queries>neamh-phointe ar chórais comhordaithe "
"geografacha."

msgid ""
"Support for 3D geometry fields was added, and may be enabled by setting "
"the :attr:`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.GeometryField.dim` keyword to 3 in "
"your :class:`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.GeometryField`. "
"The :class:`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.Extent3D` aggregate and "
"``extent3d()`` ``GeoQuerySet`` method were added as a part of this feature."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh tacaíocht do réimsí geoiméadra 3D leis, agus féadfar é a chumasú "
"tríd an eochairfhocal: attr: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.geometryfield.dim` a shocrú go 3 i do: class: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.geometryfield`. Cuireadh comhiomlán: Class: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.ext3D` comhiomlán agus modh ``extent3d () "
"```GeoquerySet`` mar chuid den ghné seo."

msgid ""
"The ``force_rhr()``, ``reverse_geom()``, and ``geohash()`` ``GeoQuerySet`` "
"methods are new."
msgstr ""
"Tá na modhanna ``force_rhr () ``, `reverse_geom ()``, agus ``geohash () "
"````GeoquerySet`` nua."

msgid ""
"The GEOS interface was updated to use thread-safe C library functions when "
"available on the platform."
msgstr ""
"Nuashonraíodh comhéadan GEOS chun feidhmeanna leabharlainne C atá sábháilte "
"le snáithe a úsáid nuair atá ar fáil ar an ardán."

msgid ""
"The GDAL interface now allows the user to set "
"a :attr:`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.Layer.spatial_filter` on the features "
"returned when iterating over a :class:`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.Layer`."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an comhéadan GDAL anois don úsáideoir a:attr: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.layer.spatial_filter` a shocrú ar na gnéithe a "
"cuireadh ar ais agus iad ag athrú thar a:class: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.layer`."

msgid ""
"Finally, :doc:`GeoDjango's documentation </ref/contrib/gis/index>` is now "
"included with Django's and is no longer hosted separately at "
"``geodjango.org``."
msgstr ""
"Faoi dheireadh, :doc: Tá doiciméadú “GeodJango” san áireamh anois le "
"Django's agus ní óstáiltear é ar leithligh ag `geodjango.org`` </ref/contrib/"
"gis/index> a thuilleadh."

msgid "JavaScript-assisted handling of inline related objects in the admin"
msgstr ""
"Láimhseáil le cúnamh JavaScript ar rudaí a bhaineann le líne sa riarachán"

msgid ""
"If a user has JavaScript enabled in their browser, the interface for inline "
"objects in the admin now allows inline objects to be dynamically added and "
"removed. Users without JavaScript-enabled browsers will see no change in the "
"behavior of inline objects."
msgstr ""
"Má tá JavaScript cumasaithe ag úsáideoir ina bhrabhsálaí, ceadaíonn an "
"comhéadan le haghaidh rudaí inlíne sa riarachán anois rudaí inlíne a chur "
"leis agus a bhaint go dinimiciúil. Ní fheicfidh úsáideoirí gan brabhsálaithe "
"atá cumasaithe ag JavaScript aon athrú ar iompar rudaí inlíne."

msgid "New ``now`` template tag format specifier characters: ``c`` and ``u``"
msgstr ""
"Carachtair sonraitheora formáid clib teimpléad nua ``ano``: `c`` agus ``u``"

msgid ""
"The argument to the :ttag:`now` has gained two new format characters: ``c`` "
"to specify that a datetime value should be formatted in ISO 8601 format, and "
"``u`` that allows output of the microseconds part of a datetime or time "
"value."
msgstr ""
"Tá dhá charachtar formáide nua faighte ag an argóint chuig: ttag: `ano`: "
"`c`` chun a shonrú gur chóir luach dáta-ama a fhormáidiú i bhformáid ISO "
"8601, agus ``u`` a cheadaíonn aschur na microtsoicind de luach dáta-ama nó "
"ama."

msgid ""
"These are also available in others parts like the :tfilter:`date` "
"and :tfilter:`time` template filters, the ``humanize`` template tag library "
"and the new `format localization`_ framework."
msgstr ""
"Tá siad seo ar fáil freisin i gcodanna eile cosúil leis an scagairí "
"teimpléad: tfilter: `dáta` agus:tfilter: `aim`, leabharlann clib teimpléad "
"``daonann`` agus an creat nua `formáid logánaithe`_."

msgid "Backwards-incompatible changes in 1.2"
msgstr "Athruithe neamh-chomhoiriúnacha ar chúl i 1.2"

msgid ""
"Wherever possible the new features above have been introduced in a backwards-"
"compatible manner per :doc:`our API stability policy </misc/api-stability>` "
"policy. This means that practically all existing code which worked with "
"Django 1.1 will continue to work with Django 1.2; such code will, however, "
"begin issuing warnings (see below for details)."
msgstr ""
"Nuair is féidir, tugadh na gnéithe nua thuas isteach ar bhealach atá "
"comhoiriúnach le cúl faoir:doc: 'ár mbeartas cobhsaíochta API</misc/api-"
"stability> '. Ciallaíonn sé seo go leanfaidh gach cód atá ann cheana a "
"d'oibrigh le Django 1.1 ag obair le Django 1.2; tosóidh an cód den sórt sin, "
"áfach, ag eisiúint rabhaidh (féach thíos le haghaidh sonraí)."

msgid ""
"However, a handful of features *have* changed in ways that, for some users, "
"will be immediately backwards-incompatible. Those changes are detailed below."
msgstr ""
"Mar sin féin, tá dornán gnéithe* athraithe ar bhealaí a bheidh, i gcás "
"roinnt úsáideoirí, ag teacht ar ais láithreach. Tá na hathruithe sin "
"sonraithe thíos."

msgid "CSRF Protection"
msgstr "Cosaint CSRF"

msgid ""
"We've made large changes to the way CSRF protection works, detailed "
"in :doc:`the CSRF documentation </ref/csrf>`. Here are the major changes you "
"should be aware of:"
msgstr ""
"Tá athruithe móra déanta againn ar an mbealach a oibríonn cosaint CSRF, "
"mionsonraithe in:doc: `</ref/csrf> an doiciméadú CSRF`. Seo na hathruithe "
"móra ba chóir duit a bheith ar an eolas fúthu:"

msgid ""
"``CsrfResponseMiddleware`` and ``CsrfMiddleware`` have been deprecated and "
"will be removed completely in Django 1.4, in favor of a template tag that "
"should be inserted into forms."
msgstr ""
"Tá `CsrfResponseMiddleware`` agus ``CsrfMiddleware`` díluaite agus bainfear "
"iad go hiomlán i Django 1.4, i bhfabhar clib teimpléad ba chóir a chur "
"isteach i bhfoirmeacha."

msgid ""
"All contrib apps use a ``csrf_protect`` decorator to protect the view. This "
"requires the use of the ``csrf_token`` template tag in the template. If you "
"have used custom templates for contrib views, you MUST READ THE UPGRADE "
"INSTRUCTIONS to fix those templates."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann gach aip ranníoca maisitheoir ``csrf_protect`` chun an radharc a "
"chosaint. Éilíonn sé seo go n-úsáidfear an chlib teimpléid ``csrf_token`` sa "
"teimpléad. Má d’úsáid tú teimpléid shaincheaptha le haghaidh amhairc "
"ranníoca, NÍ MÓR duit NA TREORACHA Uasghrádaithe a léamh chun na teimpléid "
"sin a dheisiú."

msgid "Documentation removed"
msgstr "Doiciméadú bainte"

msgid ""
"The upgrade notes have been removed in current Django docs. Please refer to "
"the docs for Django 1.3 or older to find these instructions."
msgstr ""
"Baineadh na nótaí uasghrádaithe sna docs reatha Django. Féach do thoil do na "
"doiciméid do Django 1.3 nó níos sine chun na treoracha seo a fháil."

msgid ""
"``CsrfViewMiddleware`` is included in ``MIDDLEWARE_CLASSES`` by default. "
"This turns on CSRF protection by default, so views that accept POST requests "
"need to be written to work with the middleware. Instructions on how to do "
"this are found in the CSRF docs."
msgstr ""
"Tá ``CSRFViewMiddleware`` san áireamh i ``MIDDLEWARE_CLASSES`` de réir "
"réamhshocraithe. Casann sé seo ar chosaint CSRF de réir réamhshocraithe, mar "
"sin caithfear tuairimí a ghlacann le hiarratais POST a scríobh chun oibriú "
"leis an middleware. Tá treoracha maidir le conas é seo a dhéanamh le fáil "
"sna doiciméid CSRF."

msgid ""
"All of the CSRF has moved from contrib to core (with backwards compatible "
"imports in the old locations, which are deprecated and will cease to be "
"supported in Django 1.4)."
msgstr ""
"Tá an CSRF go léir bogadh ó chontrib go croí (le allmhairí comhoiriúnacha ar "
"chúl sna sean-áiteanna, atá díscoilte agus scoirfidh siad le tacú leo i "
"Django 1.4)."

msgid "``get_db_prep_*()`` methods on ``Field``"
msgstr "Modhanna ``get_db_prep_* () ``ar `Field``"

msgid ""
"Prior to Django 1.2, a custom ``Field`` had the option of defining several "
"functions to support conversion of Python values into database-compatible "
"values. A custom field might look something like::"
msgstr ""
"Roimh Django 1.2, bhí an rogha ag saincheaptha ``Field` roinnt feidhmeanna a "
"shainiú chun tacú le tiontú luachanna Python ina luachanna comhoiriúnacha "
"bunachar sonraí. D'fhéadfadh cuma rud éigin ar réimse saincheaptha:"

msgid ""
"In 1.2, these three methods have undergone a change in prototype, and two "
"extra methods have been introduced::"
msgstr ""
"I 1.2, rinneadh athrú ar na trí mhodh seo ar fhréamhshamhail, agus tugadh "
"dhá mhodh breise isteach:"

msgid ""
"These changes are required to support multiple databases -- ``db_type`` and "
"``get_db_prep_*`` can no longer make any assumptions regarding the database "
"for which it is preparing. The ``connection`` argument now provides the "
"preparation methods with the specific connection for which the value is "
"being prepared."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn na hathruithe seo chun tacú le bunachair sonraí iolracha - ní "
"féidir le ``db_type`` agus ``get_db_prep_*`` aon toimhde a dhéanamh maidir "
"leis an mbunachar sonraí a bhfuil sé ag ullmhú dó a thuilleadh. Soláthraíonn "
"an argóint ``nasc`` anois do na modhanna ullmhúcháin leis an nasc sonrach a "
"bhfuil an luach á ullmhú dó."

msgid ""
"The two new methods exist to differentiate general data-preparation "
"requirements from requirements that are database-specific. The ``prepared`` "
"argument is used to indicate to the database-preparation methods whether "
"generic value preparation has been performed. If an unprepared (i.e., "
"``prepared=False``) value is provided to the ``get_db_prep_*()`` calls, they "
"should invoke the corresponding ``get_prep_*()`` calls to perform generic "
"data preparation."
msgstr ""
"Tá an dá mhodh nua ann chun riachtanais ghinearálta ullmhúcháin sonraí a "
"idirdhealú ó riachtanais atá sonrach don bhunachar Úsáidtear an argóint "
"“ullmhaithe” chun a chur in iúl do na modhanna ullmhúcháin bunachar sonraí "
"an bhfuil ullmhúchán luacha cineálach déanta. Má chuirtear luach "
"neamhullmhaithe (ie, ``Prepared=False``) ar fáil do na glaonna "
"``get_db_prep_* () `, ba cheart dóibh na glaonna comhfhreagracha "
"``get_prep_* ()` a ghairm chun ullmhúchán cineálach sonraí a dhéanamh."

msgid ""
"We've provided conversion functions that will transparently convert "
"functions adhering to the old prototype into functions compatible with the "
"new prototype. However, these conversion functions will be removed in Django "
"1.4, so you should upgrade your ``Field`` definitions to use the new "
"prototype as soon as possible."
msgstr ""
"Tá feidhmeanna comhshó curtha curtha ar fáil againn a thiontú go "
"trédhearcach feidhmeanna a chloíonn leis an sean-fhréamhshamhail ina "
"fheidhmeanna atá comhoiriúnach leis Mar sin féin, bainfear na feidhmeanna "
"comhshó seo i Django 1.4, mar sin ba cheart duit do shainmhínithe ``Field` a "
"uasghrádú chun an fréamhshamhail nua a úsáid chomh luath agus is féidir."

msgid ""
"If your ``get_db_prep_*()`` methods made no use of the database connection, "
"you should be able to upgrade by renaming ``get_db_prep_value()`` to "
"``get_prep_value()`` and ``get_db_prep_lookup()`` to ``get_prep_lookup()``. "
"If you require database specific conversions, then you will need to provide "
"an implementation ``get_db_prep_*`` that uses the ``connection`` argument to "
"resolve database-specific values."
msgstr ""
"Mura ndearna do mhodhanna ``get_db_prep_* () ``úsáid as an nasc bunachar "
"sonraí, ba cheart go mbeadh tú in ann uasghrádú trí ``get_db_prep_value () "
"`a athainmniú go ``get_prep_value ()`` agus ``get_db_prep_lookup () ``. Má "
"theastaíonn tiontaithe sonrach ar bhunachar sonraí uait, ansin beidh ort cur "
"chun feidhme ``get_db_prep_*`` a sholáthar a úsáideann an argóint ``nasc`` "
"chun luachanna sonracha bunachar sonraí a réiteach."

msgid "Stateful template tags"
msgstr "Clibeanna teimpléad stáiteach"

msgid ""
"Template tags that store rendering state on their ``Node`` subclass have "
"always been vulnerable to thread-safety and other issues; as of Django 1.2, "
"however, they may also cause problems when used with the new :ref:`cached "
"template loader<template-loaders>`."
msgstr ""
"<template-loaders>Bhí clibeanna teimpléad a stóráilíonn stát rindreála ar a "
"bhfo-aicme ``Node`` leochaileach i gcónaí do shábháilteacht snáithe agus "
"saincheisteanna eile; amhail Django 1.2, áfach, d'fhéadfadh fadhbanna a "
"bheith acu freisin nuair a úsáidtear iad leis an lódóir teimpléad nua:ref: "
"`cacháil'."

msgid ""
"All of the built-in Django template tags are safe to use with the cached "
"loader, but if you're using custom template tags that come from third party "
"packages, or from your own code, you should ensure that the ``Node`` "
"implementation for each tag is thread-safe. For more information, "
"see :ref:`template tag thread safety "
"considerations<template_tag_thread_safety>`."
msgstr ""
"Tá na clibeanna teimpléid Django ionsuite go léir sábháilte le húsáid leis "
"an lódóir i dtaisce, ach má tá clibeanna teimpléid saincheaptha á n-úsáid "
"agat a thagann ó phacáistí tríú páirtí, nó ó do chód féin, ba cheart duit a "
"chinntiú go bhfuil an ``Nóid`` tá cur i bhfeidhm gach clib sábháilte ó "
"thaobh snáitheanna de. Le haghaidh tuilleadh faisnéise, féach :ref: "
"`teimpléad breithnithe sábháilteachta snáithe "
"chlib<template_tag_thread_safety>`."

msgid ""
"You may also need to update your templates if you were relying on the "
"implementation of Django's template tags *not* being thread safe. "
"The :ttag:`cycle` tag is the most likely to be affected in this way, "
"especially when used in conjunction with the :ttag:`include` tag. Consider "
"the following template fragment:"
msgstr ""
"Seans go mbeidh ort do theimpléid a nuashonrú freisin má bhí tú ag brath ar "
"chur i bhfeidhm chlibeanna teimpléid Django *gan* a bheith sábháilte. Is é "
"an chlib :ttag:`cycle` an ceann is dóichí a gcuirfear isteach air ar an "
"mbealach seo, go háirithe nuair a úsáidtear é in éineacht leis an "
"gclib :ttag:`cuir san áireamh`. Smaoinigh ar an blúire teimpléad seo a "
"leanas:"

msgid "with a ``subtemplate.html`` that reads:"
msgstr "le ``subtemplate.html`` a léann:"

msgid "Using the non-thread-safe, pre-Django 1.2 renderer, this would output:"
msgstr ""
"Ag baint úsáide as an renderer réamh-Django 1.2 neamh-shábháilte le snáithe, "
"d'aschur sé seo:"

msgid "Using the thread-safe Django 1.2 renderer, you will instead get:"
msgstr ""
"Ag baint úsáide as an renderer Django 1.2 atá sábháilte le snáithe, "
"gheobhaidh tú ina ionad sin:"

msgid ""
"This is because each rendering of the :ttag:`include` tag is an independent "
"rendering. When the :ttag:`cycle` tag was not thread safe, the state of "
"the :ttag:`cycle` tag would leak between multiple renderings of the "
"same :ttag:`include`. Now that the :ttag:`cycle` tag is thread safe, this "
"leakage no longer occurs."
msgstr ""
"Tá sé seo toisc gur rindreáil neamhspleách é gach rindreáil den chlib: ttag: "
"`include`. Nuair nach raibh an clibe:ttag: `timthriall` sábháilte, "
"sceitheadh staid an chlib: ttag: `timthriall` idir illéiriú den chéanna: "
"ttag: `include`. Anois go bhfuil an clibe:ttag: `timthriall` sábháilte "
"snáithe, ní tharlaíonn an sceitheadh seo a thuilleadh."

msgid "``user_passes_test``, ``login_required`` and ``permission_required``"
msgstr ""
"``tástáil_pas_úsáideoraithe``, `logain_riachtanai`` agus ``cead_riachtana``"

msgid ""
"``django.contrib.auth.decorators`` provides the decorators "
"``login_required``, ``permission_required`` and ``user_passes_test``. "
"Previously it was possible to use these decorators both on functions (where "
"the first argument is 'request') and on methods (where the first argument is "
"'self', and the second argument is 'request'). Unfortunately, flaws were "
"discovered in the code supporting this: it only works in limited "
"circumstances, and produces errors that are very difficult to debug when it "
"does not work."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn ``django.contrib.auth.decorators ``do mhaisitheoirí "
"``login_required``, `permission_requred`` agus ``user_passes_test``. Roimhe "
"seo bhí sé in ann na maisitheoirí seo a úsáid ar fheidhmeanna (i gcás gurb é "
"'iarratas' an chéad argóint) agus ar mhodhanna (i gcás gurb é 'féin' an "
"chéad argóint, agus 'iarratas' an dara argóint). Ar an drochuair, aimsíodh "
"lochtanna sa chód a thacaíonn leis seo: ní oibríonn sé ach i gcúinsí "
"teoranta, agus táirgeann sé earráidí atá an-deacair a dhífhabhtú nuair nach "
"n-oibríonn sé."

msgid ""
"For this reason, the 'auto adapt' behavior has been removed, and if you are "
"using these decorators on methods, you will need to manually "
"apply :func:`django.utils.decorators.method_decorator` to convert the "
"decorator to one that works with methods. For example, you would change code "
"from this::"
msgstr ""
"Ar an gcúis seo, baineadh an t-iompar 'uathoibrithe uathoibrí', agus má tá "
"na maisitheoirí seo á úsáid agat ar mhodhanna, beidh ort iarratas a dhéanamh "
"de láimh:func: `django.utils.decorators.method_decorator` chun an "
"maisitheoir a thiontú go ceann a oibríonn le modhanna. Mar shampla, "
"d'athrófá cód as seo:"

msgid "or::"
msgstr "nó::"

msgid ""
"For those of you who've been following the development trunk, this change "
"also applies to other decorators introduced since 1.1, including "
"``csrf_protect``, ``cache_control`` and anything created using "
"``decorator_from_middleware``."
msgstr ""
"Dóibh siúd agaibh a bhí ag leanúint an stoc forbartha, baineann an t-athrú "
"seo freisin le maisitheoirí eile a tugadh isteach ó 1.1, lena n-áirítear "
"``csrf_protect``, `cache_control`` agus aon rud a cruthaíodh ag baint úsáide "
"as `decorator_from_middleware`."

msgid ":ttag:`if` tag changes"
msgstr ":ttag: athraíonn clib `if `"

msgid ""
"Due to new features in the :ttag:`if` template tag, it no longer accepts "
"'and', 'or' and 'not' as valid **variable** names. Previously, these strings "
"could be used as variable names. Now, the keyword status is always enforced, "
"and template code such as ``{% if not %}`` or ``{% if and %}`` will throw a "
"``TemplateSyntaxError``. Also, ``in`` is a new keyword and so is not a valid "
"variable name in this tag."
msgstr ""
"Mar gheall ar ghnéithe nua sa chlib teimpléad:ttag: `if `, ní ghlacann sé le "
"'agus', 'nó' agus 'not' mar ainmneacha bailí** athraithe** a thuilleadh. "
"Roimhe seo, d'fhéadfaí na teaghráin seo a úsáid mar ainmneacha athróg. "
"Anois, cuirtear stádas an eochairfhocal i bhfeidhm i gcónaí, agus caithfidh "
"cód teimpléad mar ``{% mura bhfuil%}`` nó ``{% if and%} ``` "
"TemplateSyntaxError ``. Chomh maith leis sin, is eochairfhocal nua é ``in`` "
"agus mar sin ní ainm athróg bailí sa chlib seo."

msgid "``LazyObject``"
msgstr "``Lazyobject``"

msgid ""
"``LazyObject`` is an undocumented-but-often-used utility class used for "
"lazily wrapping other objects of unknown type."
msgstr ""
"Is aicme fóntais neamhdhoiciméadaithe ach a úsáidtear go minic é "
"`LazyObject`` a úsáidtear chun rudaí eile de chineál anaithnid a fhilleadh "
"go leisciúil."

msgid ""
"In Django 1.1 and earlier, it handled introspection in a non-standard way, "
"depending on wrapped objects implementing a public method named "
"``get_all_members()``. Since this could easily lead to name clashes, it has "
"been changed to use the standard Python introspection method, involving "
"``__members__`` and ``__dir__()``."
msgstr ""
"I Django 1.1 agus níos luaithe, láimhseáil sé introspection ar bhealach "
"neamhchaighdeánach, ag brath ar rudaí fillte a chuireann modh poiblí darb "
"ainm `get_all_members () `i bhfeidhm. Ós rud é go bhféadfadh comhraic "
"ainmneacha a bheith mar thoradh air seo go héasca, athraíodh é chun an modh "
"caighdeánach introspection Python a úsáid, lena mbaineann ``__members__`` "
"agus ``__dir__ () ``."

msgid ""
"If you used ``LazyObject`` in your own code and implemented the "
"``get_all_members()`` method for wrapped objects, you'll need to make a "
"couple of changes:"
msgstr ""
"Má d'úsáid tú ``LazyObject`` i do chód féin agus má chuir tú an modh "
"`get_all_members () `i bhfeidhm le haghaidh rudaí fillte, beidh ort cúpla "
"athrú a dhéanamh:"

msgid ""
"First, if your class does not have special requirements for introspection "
"(i.e., you have not implemented ``__getattr__()`` or other methods that "
"allow for attributes not discoverable by normal mechanisms), you can simply "
"remove the ``get_all_members()`` method. The default implementation on "
"``LazyObject`` will do the right thing."
msgstr ""
"Ar dtús, mura bhfuil riachtanais speisialta ag do rang maidir le hionscrúdú "
"(ie, níl `__getattr__ () `curtha i bhfeidhm agat nó modhanna eile a "
"cheadaíonn tréithe nach féidir le gnáthmheicníochtaí a aimsiú), is féidir "
"leat an modh `get_all_members ()` a bhaint. Déanfaidh an cur i bhfeidhm "
"réamhshocraithe ar `LazyObject`` an rud ceart."

msgid ""
"If you have more complex requirements for introspection, first rename the "
"``get_all_members()`` method to ``__dir__()``. This is the standard "
"introspection method for Python 2.6 and above. If you require support for "
"Python versions earlier than 2.6, add the following code to the class::"
msgstr ""
"Má tá riachtanais níos casta agat maidir le hionscrúdú, athainmnigh an modh "
"``get_all_members () ``ar dtús go ``__dir__ ()``. Is é seo an modh "
"caighdeánach introspection do Python 2.6 agus os a chionn. Má theastaíonn "
"tacaíocht uait do leaganacha Python níos luaithe ná 2.6, cuir an cód seo a "
"leanas leis an rang:"

msgid "``__dict__`` on model instances"
msgstr "``__dict__`` ar chásanna samhail"

msgid ""
"Historically, the ``__dict__`` attribute of a model instance has only "
"contained attributes corresponding to the fields on a model."
msgstr ""
"Go stairiúil, níl ach tréithe a fhreagraíonn do na réimsí ar mhúnla i "
"dtréith ``__dict__`` de shampla samhail."

msgid ""
"In order to support multiple database configurations, Django 1.2 has added a "
"``_state`` attribute to object instances. This attribute will appear in "
"``__dict__`` for a model instance. If your code relies on iterating over "
"``__dict__`` to obtain a list of fields, you must now be prepared to handle "
"or filter out the ``_state`` attribute."
msgstr ""
"D'fhonn tacú le cumraíochtaí iolracha bunachar sonraí, chuir Django 1.2 "
"tréith ``_state ``le cásanna réada. Beidh an tréith seo le feiceáil in "
"``__dict__`` do shampla samhail. Má bhraitheann do chód ar athrá thar "
"``__dict__`` chun liosta réimsí a fháil, ní mór duit a bheith ullamh anois "
"chun an tréith ``_state ``a láimhseáil nó a scagadh amach."

msgid ""
"The exit status code of the test runners (``tests/runtests.py`` and ``python "
"manage.py test``) no longer represents the number of failed tests, because a "
"failure of 256 or more tests resulted in a wrong exit status code. The exit "
"status code for the test runner is now 0 for success (no failing tests) and "
"1 for any number of test failures. If needed, the number of test failures "
"can be found at the end of the test runner's output."
msgstr ""
"Ní léiríonn cód stádas imeachta na reathaithe tástála (`tests/runtests.py`` "
"agus ``python manage.py test ``) líon na dtástálacha theip a thuilleadh, "
"toisc go raibh cód stádais imeachta mícheart mar thoradh ar theip 256 "
"tástáil nó níos mó. Is é an cód stádais imeachta don rádálaí tástála anois 0 "
"le haghaidh rath (gan aon tástálacha teip) agus 1 le haghaidh aon líon "
"teipeanna tástála. Más gá, is féidir líon na dteipeanna tástála a fháil ag "
"deireadh aschur an rádálaí tástála."

msgid ""
"To fix bugs with cookies in Internet Explorer, Safari, and possibly other "
"browsers, our encoding of cookie values was changed so that the comma and "
"semicolon are treated as non-safe characters, and are therefore encoded as "
"``\\054`` and ``\\073`` respectively.  This could produce backwards "
"incompatibilities, especially if you are storing comma or semi-colon in "
"cookies and have JavaScript code that parses and manipulates cookie values "
"client-side."
msgstr ""
"Chun fabhtanna a shocrú le fianáin in Internet Explorer, Safari, agus "
"b'fhéidir brabhsálaithe eile, athraíodh ár n-ionchódú luachanna fianán ionas "
"go ndéileálfar leis an gcamóg agus an leathróir mar charachtair neamh-"
"shábháilte, agus dá bhrí sin ionchódú iad mar ``\\ 054`` agus``\\ 073`` faoi "
"seach. D'fhéadfadh sé seo neamhoiriúnachtaí ar ais a bheith mar thoradh air, "
"go háirithe má tá camóg nó leath-colon á stóráil agat i bhfianáin agus má tá "
"cód JavaScript agat a pháirsíonn agus a ionramhlaigh luachanna fianán taobh "
"an chliaint."

msgid "``ModelForm.is_valid()`` and ``ModelForm.errors``"
msgstr "``ModelForm.is_Valid () ``agus ``ModelForm.Errors``"

msgid ""
"Much of the validation work for ModelForms has been moved down to the model "
"level. As a result, the first time you call ``ModelForm.is_valid()``, access "
"``ModelForm.errors`` or otherwise trigger form validation, your model will "
"be cleaned in-place. This conversion used to happen when the model was "
"saved. If you need an unmodified instance of your model, you should pass a "
"copy to the ``ModelForm`` constructor."
msgstr ""
"Tá cuid mhaith den obair bailíochtaithe do ModelForms bogadh síos go "
"leibhéal an mhúnla. Mar thoradh air sin, an chéad uair a ghlaonn tú ar "
"`ModelForm.is_Valid () `, rochtain a fháil ar ``ModelForm.errors`` nó "
"bailíochtú foirm a spreagann tú ar shlí eile, glanfar do mhúnla in áit. Bhí "
"an tiontú seo ag tarlú nuair a shábháiltear an tsamhail. Má theastaíonn "
"sampla neamh-mhodhnaithe de do mhúnla uait, ba chóir duit cóip a chur chuig "
"an tógálaí ``ModelForm ``."

msgid "``BooleanField`` on MySQL"
msgstr "``Booleanfield`` ar MySQL"

msgid ""
"In previous versions of Django, a model's ``BooleanField`` under MySQL would "
"return its value as either ``1`` or ``0``, instead of ``True`` or ``False``; "
"for most people this wasn't a problem because ``bool`` is a subclass of "
"``int`` in Python. In Django 1.2, however, ``BooleanField`` on MySQL "
"correctly returns a real ``bool``.  The only time this should ever be an "
"issue is if you were expecting the ``repr`` of a ``BooleanField`` to print "
"``1`` or ``0``."
msgstr ""
"I leaganacha roimhe seo de Django, chuirfeadh ``Booleanfield`` samhail faoi "
"MySQL ar ais a luach mar ``1`` nó `0``, ``0``,, `True`` nó `False``; i "
"bhformhór na ndaoine ní fadhb é seo toisc gur fo-aicme de ``int ``i Python é "
"``bool``. I Django 1.2, áfach, filleann ``Booleanfield`` ar MySQL fíor-"
"``bool` i gceart. Is é an t-aon uair ba chóir é seo a bheith ina cheist "
"riamh ná má bhí tú ag súil le ``repr`` ```Booleanfield`` ```1`` nó ``0`` a "
"phriontáil."

msgid "Changes to the interpretation of ``max_num`` in FormSets"
msgstr "Athruithe ar an léirmhíniú ar ``max_num`` i FormSets"

msgid ""
"As part of enhancements made to the handling of FormSets, the default value "
"and interpretation of the ``max_num`` parameter to "
"the :ref:`django.forms.formsets.formset_factory() <formsets-max-num>` "
"and :ref:`django.forms.models.modelformset_factory() <model-formsets-max-"
"num>` functions has changed slightly. This change also affects the way "
"the :attr:`~django.contrib.admin.InlineModelAdmin.max_num` argument is used "
"for inline admin objects."
msgstr ""
"<formsets-max-num><model-formsets-max-num>Mar chuid de fheabhsuithe a "
"rinneadh ar láimhseáil FormSets, tá athrú beagán tagtha ar luach "
"réamhshocraithe agus léirmhíniú an pharaiméadar ``max_num`` chuig "
"feidhmeanna: ref: `django.forms.formset_factory () `agus:ref: "
"`django.forms.modelformset_factory ()`. Bíonn tionchar ag an athrú seo "
"freisin ar an mbealach a úsáidtear argóint an:attr: "
"`~django.contrib.admin.inlineModelAdmin.max_num` le haghaidh rudaí "
"riaracháin inlíne."

msgid ""
"Previously, the default value for ``max_num`` was ``0`` (zero). FormSets "
"then used the boolean value of ``max_num`` to determine if a limit was to be "
"imposed on the number of generated forms. The default value of ``0`` meant "
"that there was no default limit on the number of forms in a FormSet."
msgstr ""
"Roimhe seo, ba é `0`` (nialas) an luach réamhshocraithe do ``max_num``. "
"Ansin d'úsáid FormSets luach boolean ``max_num`` chun a chinneadh an raibh "
"teorainn le forchur ar líon na bhfoirmeacha a ghintear. Chiallaigh luach "
"réamhshocraithe ``0`` nach raibh aon teorainn réamhshocraithe ar líon na "
"bhfoirmeacha i FormSet."

msgid ""
"Starting with 1.2, the default value for ``max_num`` has been changed to "
"``None``, and FormSets will differentiate between a value of ``None`` and a "
"value of ``0``. A value of ``None`` indicates that no limit on the number of "
"forms is to be imposed; a value of ``0`` indicates that a maximum of 0 forms "
"should be imposed. This doesn't necessarily mean that no forms will be "
"displayed -- see the :ref:`ModelFormSet documentation <model-formsets-max-"
"num>` for more details."
msgstr ""
