"Python: MOD: `rabhaigh`, nó trí Python a reáchtáil le bratach ``-Wd`` nó ``-"
"Wall``."

msgid ""
"In Django 1.3, these warnings will become a ``DeprecationWarning``, which is "
"*not* silent. In Django 1.4 support for these features will be removed "
"entirely."
msgstr ""
"I Django 1.3, beidh na rabhaidh seo ina `DeprecationWarning``, ar* níl* "
"ciúin. I Django 1.4 bainfear tacaíocht do na gnéithe seo go hiomlán."

msgid ""
"For more details, see the documentation :doc:`Django's release process </"
"internals/release-process>` and our :doc:`deprecation timeline </internals/"
"deprecation>`.`"
msgstr ""
"Le haghaidh tuilleadh sonraí, féach an doiciméadú:doc: `Próiseas scaoileadh "
"Django` agus inn:doc: `líne ama díphróiseálaí` </internals/release-process> "
"</internals/deprecation> . `"

msgid "Specifying databases"
msgstr "Sonraí sonraí"

msgid ""
"Prior to Django 1.2, Django used a number of settings to control access to a "
"single database. Django 1.2 introduces support for multiple databases, and "
"as a result the way you define database settings has changed."
msgstr ""
"Roimh Django 1.2, d'úsáid Django roinnt socruithe chun rochtain ar bhunachar "
"sonraí amháin a rialú. Tugann Django 1.2 isteach tacaíocht do bhunachair "
"shonraí iolracha, agus mar thoradh air sin tá athrú tagtha ar an mbealach a "
"shainíonn tú socruithe bunachar sonraí."

msgid ""
"Any existing Django settings file will continue to work as expected until "
"Django 1.4. Until then, old-style database settings will be automatically "
"translated to the new-style format."
msgstr ""
"Leanfaidh aon chomhad socruithe Django atá ann cheana ag obair mar a "
"bhíothas ag súil go dtí Django 1.4. Go dtí sin, aistrítear socruithe "
"bunachar sonraí sean-stíl go huathoibríoch go formáid nua."

