"tréithe ``title_template`` agus `description_template`` á shonrú agat). Ba "
"chóir duit a chinntiú go sonraíonn tú tréithe ``title_template`` agus "
"`description_template`` i gcónaí, nó modhanna ``item_title () ``agus "
"``item_description ()`` a sholáthraíonn tú."

msgid ""
"However, ``LatestEntriesByCategory`` uses the ``get_object()`` method with "
"the ``bits`` argument to specify a specific category to show. In the "
"new :class:`~django.contrib.syndication.views.Feed` class, ``get_object()`` "
"method takes a ``request`` and arguments from the URL, so it would look like "
"this::"
msgstr ""
"Mar sin féin, úsáideann ``LatestentriesByCategory`` an modh ``get_object () "
"``leis an argóint ``bits`` chun catagóir ar leith a shonrú le taispeáint. Sa "
"rang nua:class: `~django.contrib.syndication.views.feed`, glacann modh "
"``get_object () ```request`` agus argóintí ón URL, mar sin bheadh cuma seo "
"air::"

msgid ""
"Additionally, the ``get_feed()`` method on ``Feed`` classes now take "
"different arguments, which may impact you if you use the ``Feed`` classes "
"directly. Instead of just taking an optional ``url`` argument, it now takes "
"two arguments: the object returned by its own ``get_object()`` method, and "
