msgid "The ``django.db.models.permalink()`` decorator is removed."
msgstr "Baintear an maisitheoir ``django.db.models.permalink () ``."

msgid ""
"The ``USE_ETAGS`` setting is removed. ``CommonMiddleware`` and "
"``django.utils.cache.patch_response_headers()`` no longer set ETags."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an socrú ``USE_ETAGS``. Ní shocraíonn ``CommonMiddleware`` agus "
"``django.utils.cache.patch_response_heads () ``ETags a thuilleadh."

msgid "The ``Model._meta.has_auto_field`` attribute is removed."
msgstr "An ``Samhail. Baintear tréith _meta.has_auto_field``."

msgid ""
"``url()``'s support for inline flags in regular expression groups (``(?i)``, "
