msgstr ""
"Tacaíocht ``url () ``do bhratacha inlíne i ngrúpaí léirithe rialta (`` (? i) "
"``,`` (? L) ``,`` (? m) ``,`` (? s) ``, agus`` (? u) ``) baintear."

msgid ""
"Support for ``Widget.render()`` methods without the ``renderer`` argument is "
