msgstr ""
"Baintear tacaíocht do mhodhanna ``Widget.render ()`` gan an argóint "
"``renderer``."

msgid "Django 2.1.1 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 2.1.1"

msgid "*August 31, 2018*"
msgstr "*31 Lúnasa, 2018*"

msgid "Django 2.1.1 fixes several bugs in 2.1."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 2.1.1 roinnt fabhtanna i 2.1."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression where ``QueryDict.urlencode()`` crashed if the dictionary "
"contains a non-string value (:ticket:`29627`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú nuair a tháinig ``Querydict.urlenCode () ``le titim má "
"tá luach neamh-sreang sa fhoclóir (:ticket: `29627`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 2.0 where using ``manage.py test --keepdb`` "
"fails on PostgreSQL if the database exists and the user doesn't have "
"permission to create databases (:ticket:`29613`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 2.0 nuair a theipeann ar `manage.py test --"
"keepdb`` a úsáid ar PostgreSQL má tá an bunachar sonraí ann agus mura bhfuil "
"cead ag an úsáideoir bunachair sonraí a chruthú (:ticket: `29613`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 2.0 where combining ``Q`` objects with ``__in`` "
"lookups and lists crashed (:ticket:`29643`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 2.0 nuair a tháinig rudaí `Q`` a chomhcheangal "
"le cuardaigh agus liostaí ``__in`` (:ticket: `29643`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed translation failure of ``DurationField``'s \"overflow\" error message "
"(:ticket:`29623`)."
msgstr ""
"Teip aistriúcháin sheasta ar theachtaireacht earráide “overflow” "
"``Durationfield`` (:ticket: `29623`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression where the admin change form crashed if the user doesn't "
"have the 'add' permission to a model that uses ``TabularInline`` "
"(:ticket:`29637`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú nuair a tháinig an fhoirm athraithe riaracháin mura "
"bhfuil an cead 'cuir' ag an úsáideoir le samhail a úsáideann "
"``TabularInline`` (:ticket: `29637`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression where a ``related_query_name`` reverse accessor wasn't "
"set up when a ``GenericRelation`` is declared on an abstract base model "
"(:ticket:`29653`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraíodh aischéimniú nuair nár cuireadh rochtain ar ais "
"``related_query_name`` ar bun nuair a dhearbhaítear ``GenericRelation`` ar "
"mhúnla bonn teibí (:ticket: `29653`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed the test client's JSON serialization of a request data dictionary for "
"structured content type suffixes (:ticket:`29662`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh sraith JSON an chliaint tástála ar fhoclóir sonraí iarratais le "
"haghaidh iarmhairtí cineál ábhair struchtúrtha (:ticket: `29662`)."

msgid ""
"Made the admin change view redirect to the changelist view after a POST if "
"the user has the 'view' permission (:ticket:`29663`)."
msgstr ""
"Rinneadh an dearcadh athraithe riaracháin a atreorú chuig an radharc liosta "
"athraithe tar éis POST má tá cead 'amharc' ag an úsáideoir (:ticket: "
"`29663`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed admin change view crash for view-only users if the form has an extra "
"form field (:ticket:`29682`)."
msgstr ""
"Timpiste radharc athraithe riaracháin seasta d'úsáideoirí amhairc amháin má "
"tá réimse foirme bhreise ag an bhfoirm (:ticket: `29682`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 2.0.5 where ``QuerySet.values()`` or "
"``values_list()`` after combining querysets with ``extra()`` with "
"``union()``, ``difference()``, or ``intersection()`` crashed due to "
"mismatching columns (:ticket:`29694`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 2.0.5 nuair a tháinig ``QuerySet.values () "
"``nó `values_list ()`` tar éis ceisteanna a chomhcheangal le ``extra () ``le "
"`union ()``, `difríocht () ``, nó ``crosbhall ()`` mar gheall ar cholúin "
"mímheaitseála (:ticket: `29694`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed crash if ``InlineModelAdmin.has_add_permission()`` doesn't accept the "
"``obj`` argument (:ticket:`29723`)."
msgstr ""
"Timpiste seasta mura nglacann ``InlineModelAdmin.has_Add_Permission () "
"``leis an argóint ``obj`` (:ticket: `29723`)."

