msgid "Support for GDAL 2.1 is removed."
msgstr "Baintear tacaíocht do GDAL 2.1."

msgid "Support for PostGIS 2.4 is removed."
msgstr "Baintear tacaíocht do PostGIS 2.4."

msgid "Dropped support for PostgreSQL 10"
msgstr "Tacaíocht titim do PostgreSQL 10"

msgid ""
"Upstream support for PostgreSQL 10 ends in November 2022. Django 4.1 "
"supports PostgreSQL 11 and higher."
msgstr ""
"Críochnaíonn tacaíocht suas srutha do PostgreSQL 10 i mí na Samhna 2022. "
"Tacaíonn Django 4.1 le PostgreSQL 11 agus níos airde."

msgid "Dropped support for MariaDB 10.2"
msgstr "Tacaíocht titim do MariaDB 10.2"

msgid ""
"Upstream support for MariaDB 10.2 ends in May 2022. Django 4.1 supports "
"MariaDB 10.3 and higher."
msgstr ""
"Críochnaíonn tacaíocht suas srutha do MariaDB 10.2 i mí na Bealtaine 2022. "
"Tacaíonn Django 4.1 le MariaDB 10.3 agus níos airde."

msgid "Admin changelist searches spanning multi-valued relationships changes"
msgstr ""
"Cuardaigh an liosta athraithe riaracháin a chuimsíonn athruithe caidrimh il"

msgid ""
"Admin changelist searches using multiple search terms are now applied in a "
"single call to ``filter()``, rather than in sequential ``filter()`` calls."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear cuardach ar liosta athraithe riaracháin ag úsáid téarmaí cuardaigh "
"iolracha i bhfeidhm anois i nglao amháin ar ``filter () ``, seachas i "
"nglaonna ``filter () `seicheamhacha."

msgid ""
"For multi-valued relationships, this means that rows from the related model "
"must match all terms rather than any term. For example, if ``search_fields`` "
"is set to ``['child__name', 'child__age']``, and a user searches for "
"``'Jamal 17'``, parent rows will be returned only if there is a relationship "
"to some 17-year-old child named Jamal, rather than also returning parents "
"who merely have a younger or older child named Jamal in addition to some "
"other 17-year-old."
msgstr ""
"Maidir le caidrimh illuachmhar, ciallaíonn sé seo go gcaithfidh sraitheanna "
"ón tsamhail gaolmhar na téarmaí go léir a mheaitseáil Mar shampla, má "
"shocraítear ``search_fields`` go ``['child__name', 'child__age']`` agus má "
"chuardaíonn úsáideoir ```Jamal 17'`, ní thabharfar sraitheanna tuismitheora "
"ar ais ach amháin má bhíonn caidreamh le leanbh 17 bliain d'aois ainm Jamal, "
"seachas tuismitheoirí a thabhairt ar ais nach bhfuil ach leanbh níos sine ar "
"ainm Jamal."

msgid ""
"See the :ref:`spanning-multi-valued-relationships` topic for more discussion "
"of this difference. In Django 4.0 and "
"earlier, :meth:`~django.contrib.admin.ModelAdmin.get_search_results` "
"followed the second example query, but this undocumented behavior led to "
"queries with excessive joins."
msgstr ""
"Féach an t-ábhar: ref: `spanning-il-luach-caidrim' le haghaidh tuilleadh plé "
"a dhéanamh ar an difríocht seo. I Django 4.0 agus níos luaithe, lean:: meth: "
"`~django.contrib.admin.modeladmin.get_search_results` an dara ceist sampla, "
"ach mar thoradh ar an iompar neamhdhoiciméadaithe seo bhí ceisteanna le "
"comhpháirteanna iomarcacha."

msgid "Reverse foreign key changes for unsaved model instances"
msgstr "Athruithe eochra eachtracha a aisiompú do chásanna samhail"

msgid ""
"In order to unify the behavior with many-to-many relations for unsaved model "
"instances, a reverse foreign key now raises ``ValueError`` when "
"calling :class:`related managers "
"<django.db.models.fields.related.RelatedManager>` for unsaved objects."
msgstr ""
"<django.db.models.fields.related.RelatedManager>D'fhonn an t-iompar a aontú "
"le caidreamh go leor le go leor le haghaidh cásanna samhail neamhshábháilte, "
"ardaíonn eochair eachtrach droim “ValueError” anois agus iad ag glaoch ar: "
"class: `bainisteoirí gaolmhara `le haghaidh rudaí neamhshábháilte."

msgid ""
"Related managers "
"for :class:`~django.db.models.ForeignKey`, :class:`~django.db.models.ManyToManyField`, "
"and :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.fields.GenericRelation` are now "
"cached on the :class:`~django.db.models.Model` instance to which they "
"belong. *This change was reverted in Django 4.1.2.*"
msgstr ""
"Tá bainisteoirí gaolmhara le haghaidh: class: "
"`~django.db.models.foreignKey`, :class: `~django.db.models.manyToManyField`, "
"agus:class: `~django.contrib.contentTypes.Fields.GenericRelation` ar an "
"sampla: Class: `~Django.db.Models.Model` lena mbaineann siad anois. * "
"Cuireadh an t-athrú seo ar ais i Django 4.1.2. *"

msgid ""
":class:`~django.test.runner.DiscoverRunner` now returns a non-zero error "
"code for unexpected successes from tests marked "
"with :py:func:`unittest.expectedFailure`."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.test.runner.DiscoverRunner` filleann cód earráide neamh-"
"nialas anois le haghaidh éachtaí gan choinne ó thástálacha atá marcáilte "
"le:py:func: `UnitTest.ExpectedFailure`."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.middleware.csrf.CsrfViewMiddleware` no longer masks the CSRF "
"cookie like it does the CSRF token in the DOM."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.middleware.csrf.csrfViewMiddleware` ní mhaiscann an fianán "
"CSRF a thuilleadh mar a dhéanann sé an comhartha CSRF sa DOM."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.middleware.csrf.CsrfViewMiddleware` now uses "
"``request.META['CSRF_COOKIE']`` for storing the unmasked CSRF secret rather "
"than a masked version. This is an undocumented, private API."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.middleware.csrf.csrfViewMiddleware` anois úsáideann "
"``request.meta ['CSRF_COOKIE'] ``chun an rún CSRF neamhchumtha a stóráil "
"seachas leagan masctha. Is API príobháideach neamhdhoiciméadaithe é seo."

msgid ""
"The :attr:`.ModelAdmin.actions` "
"and :attr:`~django.contrib.admin.ModelAdmin.inlines` attributes now default "
"to an empty tuple rather than an empty list to discourage unintended "
"mutation."
msgstr ""
"Tugann an: Attr: `.ModelAdmin.Actions` agus:attr: "
"`~django.contrib.admin.modelAdmin.inlines` réamhshocraithe anois le tuple "
"folamh seachas liosta folamh chun sóchán neamhbheartaithe a dhíspreagadh."

msgid ""
"The ``type=\"text/css\"`` attribute is no longer included in ``<link>`` tags "
"for CSS :doc:`form media </topics/forms/media>`."
msgstr ""
"</topics/forms/media> <link>Níl an tréith ``type=\"text/css\"`` san áireamh "
"a thuilleadh i gclibeanna ```` le haghaidh CSS:doc: `form media`."

msgid ""
"``formset:added`` and ``formset:removed`` JavaScript events are now pure "
"JavaScript events and don't depend on jQuery. See :ref:`admin-javascript-"
"inline-form-events` for more details on the change."
msgstr ""
"Is imeachtaí JavaScript íon iad imeachtaí JavaScript ``formset:added`` agus "
"``formset: removed`` anois agus níl siad ag brath ar jQuery. Féach:ref: "
"`admin-javascript-inline-form-events` le haghaidh tuilleadh sonraí faoin "
"athrú."

msgid ""
"The ``exc_info`` argument of the undocumented "
"``django.utils.log.log_response()`` function is replaced by ``exception``."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear ``exception`` in ionad argóint ``exc_info`` den fheidhm "
"``django.utils.log.log_response () `neamhdhoiciméadaithe."

msgid ""
"The ``size`` argument of the undocumented "
"``django.views.static.was_modified_since()`` function is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear argóint ``size`` den fheidhm "
"``django.views.static.was_modified_since () ``neamhdhoiciméadaithe."

msgid "The admin log out UI now uses ``POST`` requests."
msgstr "Úsáideann an UI logáil amach riaracháin iarratais ``POST ``anois."

msgid ""
"The undocumented ``InlineAdminFormSet.non_form_errors`` property is replaced "
"by the ``non_form_errors()`` method. This is consistent with ``BaseFormSet``."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear an modh ``non_form_errors () `in ionad na maoine "
"neamhdhoiciméadaithe ``inlineAdminFormSet.NON_FORM_ERRORS``. Tá sé seo "
"comhsheasmhach le ``BaseFormSet``."

msgid ""
"As per :ref:`above<templates-4.1>`, the cached template loader is now "
"enabled in development. You may specify ``OPTIONS['loaders']`` to override "
"this, if necessary."
msgstr ""
"Mar gheall ar: ref: `thuas <templates-4.1>`, tá an lódóir teimpléad "
"taisceáilte cumasaithe anois i bhforbairt. Féadfaidh tú ``OPTIONS ['loader'] "
"``a shonrú chun é seo a shárú, más gá."

msgid ""
"The undocumented ``django.contrib.auth.views.SuccessURLAllowedHostsMixin`` "
"mixin is replaced by ``RedirectURLMixin``."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear `RedirecturlMixin`` in ionad an mixin "
"``django.contrib.auth.views.successURLAllowedHostsMixin`` "
"neamhdhoiciméadaithe."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.db.models.BaseConstraint` subclasses must "
"implement :meth:`~django.db.models.BaseConstraint.validate` method to allow "
"those constraints to be used for validation."
msgstr ""
":class: `~Django.db.Models.BaseConstraint` caithfidh fo-aicmí modh: "
"`~Django.db.Models.BaseConstraint.validate` a chur i bhfeidhm chun na "
"srianta sin a úsáid le haghaidh bailíochtú."

msgid ""
"The undocumented ``URLResolver._is_callback()``, "
"``URLResolver._callback_strs``, and ``URLPattern.lookup_str()`` are moved to "
"``django.contrib.admindocs.utils``."
msgstr ""
"An ``URLResolver gan doiciméadú. _is_callback () ``, `UrlResolver. Bogtar "
"_callback_strs``, agus ``URLPattern.lookup_str () ``chuig "
"``django.contrib.admindocs.utils``."

msgid ""
"The :meth:`.Model.full_clean` method now converts an ``exclude`` value to a "
"``set``. It’s also preferable to pass an ``exclude`` value as a ``set`` to "
"the :meth:`.Model.clean_fields`, :meth:`.Model.full_clean`, :meth:`.Model.validate_unique`, "
"and :meth:`.Model.validate_constraints` methods."
msgstr ""
"Athraíonn an modh: Meth: `.model.FULL_CLEAN` luach ``eisiúint`` anois go "
"``set`. Is fearr freisin luach ``eisithe`` a chur ar aghaidh mar ``set`` "
"chuig na modhanna: meth: `.model.clean_fields`, :meth: "
"`.model.full_clean`, :meth: `.model.validate_unique`, agus:meth: "
"`.model.validate_restricints`."

msgid ""
"The minimum supported version of ``asgiref`` is increased from 3.4.1 to "
"3.5.2."
msgstr "Méadaítear an leagan íosta tacaithe de `asgiref`` ó 3.4.1 go 3.5.2."

msgid ""
"Combined expressions no longer use the error-prone behavior of guessing "
"``output_field`` when argument types match. As a consequence, resolving an "
"``output_field`` for database functions and combined expressions may now "
"crash with mixed types. You will need to explicitly set the ``output_field`` "
"in such cases."
msgstr ""
"Ní úsáideann abairtí comhcheangailte an t-iompar earráidí a bhaineann le "
"tuairim a thuilleadh `output_field`` nuair a mheaitseálann cineálacha "
"argóintí. Mar thoradh air sin, féadfaidh réiteach ``output_field`` le "
"haghaidh feidhmeanna bunachar sonraí agus nathanna comhcheangailte titim "
"anois le cineálacha measctha. Beidh ort an `output_field`` a shocrú go "
"sainráite i gcásanna den sórt sin."

msgid ""
"The :djadmin:`makemessages` command no longer changes ``.po`` files when up "
"to date. In older versions, ``POT-Creation-Date`` was always updated."
msgstr ""
"Ní athraíonn an t-ordú:djaDmin: `makemessages` comhaid `.po ``a thuilleadh "
"nuair a bhíonn siad cothrom le dáta. I leaganacha níos sine, rinneadh “Pot-"
"Creation-Date” a nuashonrú i gcónaí."

msgid "Features deprecated in 4.1"
msgstr "Gnéithe atá díscríofa i 4.1"

msgid "Log out via GET"
msgstr "Logáil amach trí GET"

msgid ""
"Logging out via ``GET`` requests to the :py:class:`built-in logout view "
"<django.contrib.auth.views.LogoutView>` is deprecated. Use ``POST`` requests "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"<django.contrib.auth.views.LogoutView>Tá logáil amach trí iarratais ``GET`` "
"chuig an:py:class: `amharc logála amach ionsuite `díluachtaithe. Úsáid "
"iarratais ``POST ``ina ionad."

msgid ""
"If you want to retain the user experience of an HTML link, you can use a "
"form that is styled to appear as a link:"
msgstr ""
"Más mian leat taithí úsáideora nasc HTML a choinneáil, is féidir leat foirm "
"atá stíleáilte a úsáid le feiceáil mar nasc:"

msgid ""
"The context for sitemap index templates of a flat list of URLs is "
"deprecated. Custom sitemap index templates should be updated for the "
"adjusted :ref:`context variables <sitemap-index-context-variables>`, "
"expecting a list of objects with ``location`` and optional ``lastmod`` "
"attributes."
msgstr ""
"Tá an comhthéacs do theimpléid innéacs léarscáileáin léarscáileáin de liosta "
"comhréidh URLanna míchuige. Ba chóir teimpléid innéacs léarscáileáin "
"saincheaptha a nuashonrú do na hathróga coigeartaithe: ref: `comhthéacs "
"<sitemap-index-context-variables>`, ag súil le liosta rudaí le ``suíomh "
"``agus tréithe roghnacha ``lastmod``."

msgid "``CSRF_COOKIE_MASKED`` transitional setting is deprecated."
msgstr "Tá an socrú idirthréimhseach ``CSRF_COOKIE_MASKED`` a dhíchur."

msgid ""
"The ``name`` argument of :func:`django.utils.functional.cached_property` is "
"deprecated as it's unnecessary as of Python 3.6."
msgstr ""
"Tá an argóint ``ainm ``de:func: `django.utils.functional.cached_property` a "
"dhíchur mar nach bhfuil sé gan ghá mar Python 3.6."

msgid ""
"The ``opclasses`` argument of "
"``django.contrib.postgres.constraints.ExclusionConstraint`` is deprecated in "
"favor of using :class:`OpClass() <django.contrib.postgres.indexes.OpClass>` "
"in :attr:`.ExclusionConstraint.expressions`. To use it, you need to add "
"``'django.contrib.postgres'`` in your :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS`."
msgstr ""
"<django.contrib.postgres.indexes.OpClass>Tá an argóint `opclasses`` de "
"`Django.contrib.postgres.Constraints.ExclusionConstraint`` a dhíchur i "
"bhfabhar úsáid:class: `opClass () `in:attr: "
"`.ExclusionConstraint.Expressions`. Chun é a úsáid, ní mór duit "
"``'django.contrib.postgres'`` a chur i d':setting: `INSTALLED_APPS`."

msgid ""
"After making this change, :djadmin:`makemigrations` will generate a new "
"migration with two operations: ``RemoveConstraint`` and ``AddConstraint``. "
"Since this change has no effect on the database schema, "
"the :class:`~django.db.migrations.operations.SeparateDatabaseAndState` "
"operation can be used to only update the migration state without running any "
"SQL. Move the generated operations into the ``state_operations`` argument "
"of :class:`~django.db.migrations.operations.SeparateDatabaseAndState`. For "
"example::"
msgstr ""
"Tar éis an t-athrú seo a dhéanamh, ginfidh :djadmin: `makemigrations` imirce "
"nua le dhá oibríocht: `removeConstraint`` agus ``AddConstraint``. Ós rud é "
"nach bhfuil aon éifeacht ag an athrú seo ar an scéim bunachar sonraí, is "
"féidir an oibríocht:: class: "
"`~django.db.migrations.Operations.SeparateDatabaseAndState` a úsáid chun an "
"stát imirce a nuashonrú gan aon SQL a reáchtáil. Bog na hoibríochtaí a "
"ghintear isteach san argóint ``state_operations`` de:class: "
"`~django.db.migrations.Operations.SeparateDatabaseandState`. Mar shampla::"

msgid ""
"The undocumented ability to pass ``errors=None`` "
"to :meth:`.SimpleTestCase.assertFormError` and :meth:`assertFormsetError() "
"<django.test.SimpleTestCase.assertFormSetError>` is deprecated. Use "
"``errors=[]`` instead."
msgstr ""
"<django.test.SimpleTestCase.assertFormSetError>Tá an cumas "
"neamhdhoiciméadaithe chun ``Errors=None`` a rith chuig:meth: "
"`.simpletestCase.assertFormerror` agus:meth: `assertFormSetError () "
"`míchuige. Úsáid ``errors= [] ``ina ionad."

msgid ""
"``django.contrib.sessions.serializers.PickleSerializer`` is deprecated due "
"to the risk of remote code execution."
msgstr ""
"Tá ``Django.Contrib.Sessions.Serializers.Pickleserializer`` a dhíchur mar "
"gheall ar an mbaol go ndéanfar cód iargúlta a fhorghníomhú."

msgid ""
"The usage of ``QuerySet.iterator()`` on a queryset that prefetches related "
"objects without providing the ``chunk_size`` argument is deprecated. In "
"older versions, no prefetching was done. Providing a value for "
"``chunk_size`` signifies that the additional query per chunk needed to "
"prefetch is desired."
msgstr ""
"Tá úsáid ``QuerySet.iterator () ``ar thacar cheisteanna a fhaigheann rudaí "
"gaolmhara réamh-mheasta gan an argóint ``chunk_size`` a sholáthar. I "
"leaganacha níos sine, níor rinneadh aon réamh-aimsiú. Tugann luach a "
"sholáthar do `chunk_size`` le fios go bhfuil an ceist bhreise in aghaidh an "
"phíosa a theastaíonn chun réamh-fháil ag teastáil."

msgid ""
"Passing unsaved model instances to related filters is deprecated. In Django "
"5.0, the exception will be raised."
msgstr ""
"Tá cásanna samhail neamh-shábháilte a chur chuig scagairí gaolmhara. I "
"Django 5.0, ardófar an eisceacht."

msgid ""
"``created=True`` is added to the signature "
"of :meth:`.RemoteUserBackend.configure_user`. Support  for "
"``RemoteUserBackend`` subclasses that do not accept this argument is "
"deprecated."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear ``created=True`` leis an síniú de:meth: "
"`.remoteUserBackend.configure_user`. Tá tacaíocht do fho-aicmí "
"`RemoteUserBackend`` nach nglacann leis an argóint seo a dhíchur."

msgid ""
"The ``django.utils.timezone.utc`` alias to :attr:`datetime.timezone.utc` is "
"deprecated. Use :attr:`datetime.timezone.utc` directly."
msgstr ""
"Tá an ailias ``django.utils.timezone.utc`` to:attr: `datetime.timezone.utc` "
"díscothaithe. Úsáid: attr: `datetime.timezone.utc` go díreach."

msgid ""
"Passing a response object and a form/formset name to "
"``SimpleTestCase.assertFormError()`` and ``assertFormsetError()`` is "
"deprecated. Use::"
msgstr ""
"Tá réad freagartha agus ainm foirme/foirmeacha a chur chuig "
"``SimpletestCase.assertFormError () ``agus ``AssertFormSetError ()`` a "
"dhíchur. Úsáid::"

msgid "or pass the form/formset object directly instead."
msgstr "nó pas an réad foirme/formset go díreach ina ionad sin."

msgid ""
"The undocumented ``django.contrib.gis.admin.OpenLayersWidget`` is deprecated."
msgstr ""
"Tá an `Django.contrib.gis.admin.openLayersWidget`` neamhdhoiciméadaithe "
"míchuige."

msgid "``django.contrib.auth.hashers.CryptPasswordHasher`` is deprecated."
msgstr "Tá ``Django.Contrib.Auth.Hashers.CryptPasswordHasher`` díluachtaithe."

msgid ""
"The ability to pass ``nulls_first=False`` or ``nulls_last=False`` to "
"``Expression.asc()`` and ``Expression.desc()`` methods, and the ``OrderBy`` "
"expression is deprecated. Use ``None`` instead."
msgstr ""
"An cumas chun modhanna ``Nulls_first=False`` nó ``Nulls_last=False`` a rith "
"go ``Expression.asc () ``agus ``Expression.desc ()`` modhanna, agus tá an "
"abairt ``OrderBy`` díscothaithe. Úsáid ``None ``ina ionad."

msgid ""
"The ``\"django/forms/default.html\"`` and ``\"django/forms/formsets/"
"default.html\"`` templates which are a proxy to the table-based templates "
"are deprecated. Use the specific template instead."
msgstr ""
"Tá na teimpléid ``” django/forms/default.html “`` agus ``” django/forms/"
"formsets/default.html “`` atá ina seachfhreastalaí do na teimpléid tábla-"
"bhunaithe a dhíchur. Úsáid an teimpléad sonrach ina ionad."

msgid ""
"The undocumented ``LogoutView.get_next_page()`` method is renamed to "
"``get_success_url()``."
msgstr ""
"Athainmnítear an modh ``logoutView.get_next_page () `neamhdhoiciméadaithe go "
"``get_success_url () ``."

msgid "Features removed in 4.1"
msgstr "Gnéithe bainte i 4.1"

msgid ""
"These features have reached the end of their deprecation cycle and are "
"removed in Django 4.1."
msgstr ""
"Tá na gnéithe seo tar éis deireadh a dtimthriall díscrúdaithe bainte amach "
"agus baintear iad i Django 4.1."

msgid ""
"See :ref:`deprecated-features-3.2` for details on these changes, including "
"how to remove usage of these features."
msgstr ""
"Féach: Ref: `deprecated-features-3.2` le haghaidh sonraí faoi na hathruithe "
"seo, lena n-áirítear conas úsáid na ngnéithe seo a bhaint."

msgid ""
"Support for assigning objects which don't support creating deep copies with "
"``copy.deepcopy()`` to class attributes in ``TestCase.setUpTestData()`` is "
"removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear tacaíocht chun rudaí a shannadh nach dtacaíonn le cóipeanna domhain "
"a chruthú le `copy.deepcopy () ``do thréithe ranga i "
"``TestCase.setupTestData ()``."

msgid ""
"Support for using a boolean value "
"in :attr:`.BaseCommand.requires_system_checks` is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear tacaíocht chun luach boolean a úsáid in:attr: "
"`.basecommand.requires_system_checks`."

msgid ""
"The ``whitelist`` argument and ``domain_whitelist`` attribute of "
"``django.core.validators.EmailValidator`` are removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an argóint ``whitelist`` agus ``domain_whitelist`` tréith "
"``django.core.validators.emailvalidator``."

msgid ""
"The ``default_app_config`` application configuration variable is removed."
msgstr "Baintear an t-athróg cumraíochta feidhmchláir ``default_app_config``."

msgid ""
"``TransactionTestCase.assertQuerysetEqual()`` no longer calls ``repr()`` on "
"a queryset when compared to string values."
msgstr ""
"Ní ghlaonn ``TransactionTestCase.assertQuerySetEqual () ```repr ()`` a "
"thuilleadh ar tacar ceisteanna i gcomparáid le luachanna sreangáin."

msgid ""
"The ``django.core.cache.backends.memcached.MemcachedCache`` backend is "
"removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an cúltaca ``django.core.cache.backends.memcached.memcachedcache``."

msgid ""
"Support for the pre-Django 3.2 format of messages used by "
"``django.contrib.messages.storage.cookie.CookieStorage`` is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear tacaíocht don fhormáid réamh-Django 3.2 de theachtaireachtaí a "
"úsáideann ``Django.contrib.messages.storage.cookie.cookie.cookieStorage``."

msgid "Django 4.1.1 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.1.1"

msgid "*September 5, 2022*"
msgstr "*Meán Fómhair 5, 2022*"

msgid "Django 4.1.1 fixes several bugs in 4.1."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 4.1.1 roinnt fabhtanna i 4.1."

msgid ""
"Reallowed, following a regression in Django 4.1, using ``GeoIP2()`` when "
"GEOS is not installed (:ticket:`33886`)."
msgstr ""
"Athluchtaithe, tar éis aischéimniú i Django 4.1, ag baint úsáide as ``GeoIP2 "
"() ``nuair nach bhfuil GEOS suiteáilte (:ticket: `33886`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.1 that caused a crash of admin's autocomplete "
"widgets when translations are deactivated (:ticket:`33888`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.1 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste giuirléidí "
"uathchomhlánaithe riaracháin nuair a dhíghníomhachtar aistriúcháin (:ticket: "
"`33888`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.1 that caused a crash of the ``test`` "
"management command when running in parallel and ``multiprocessing`` start "
"method is ``spawn`` (:ticket:`33891`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.1 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste ar an ordú "
"bainistíochta ``tástála` agus é ag rith go comhthreomhar agus is é modh "
"tosaithe ``ilphróiseála ``ná `spawn`` (:ticket: `33891`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.1 that caused an incorrect redirection to the "
"admin changelist view when using *\"Save and continue editing\"* and *\"Save "
"and add another\"* options (:ticket:`33893`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.1 a bhí ina chúis le atreorú mícheart chuig "
"radharc an liosta athraithe riaracháin agus tú ag úsáid roghanna *\"Sábháil "
"agus lean ort ag eagarthóirí\"* agus *\"Sábháil agus cuir eile\"* roghanna "
"eile (:ticket: `33893`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.1 that caused a crash "
"of :class:`~django.db.models.expressions.Window` expressions "
"with :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.aggregates.ArrayAgg` (:ticket:`33898`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.1 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste de:class: "
"`~Django.db.Models.Expressions.Window` abairtí le:class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.aggregates.arrayAgg` (:ticket: `33898`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.1 that caused a migration crash on SQLite "
"3.35.5+ when removing an indexed field (:ticket:`33899`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.1 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste imirce ar "
"SQLite 3.35.5+ nuair a bhain réimse innéacsaithe á bhaint (:ticket: `33899`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 4.1 that caused a crash of model validation on "
"``UniqueConstraint()`` with field names in ``expressions`` (:ticket:`33902`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 4.1 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste bailíochtú samhail "
"ar `UniqueConstraint () ``le hainmneacha réimse i `expressions`` (:ticket: "
"`33902`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 4.1 that caused an incorrect validation of "
"``CheckConstraint()`` with range fields on PostgreSQL (:ticket:`33905`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 4.1 a d'fhág bailíochtú mícheart ``CheckConstraint "
"() ``le réimsí raon ar PostgreSQL (:ticket: `33905`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.1 that caused an incorrect migration when "
"adding ``AutoField``, ``BigAutoField``, or ``SmallAutoField`` on PostgreSQL "
"(:ticket:`33919`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.1 a bhí ina chúis le himirce mícheart nuair "
"a chuirtear ``Autofield``, `BigAutofield``, nó ``SmallAutofield`` ar "
"PostgreSQL (:ticket: `33919`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.1 that caused a migration crash on PostgreSQL "
"when altering ``AutoField``, ``BigAutoField``, or ``SmallAutoField`` to "
"``OneToOneField`` (:ticket:`33932`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.1 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste imirce ar "
"PostgreSQL nuair a athraíodh ``AutoField`, `BigAutoField`, nó "
"``SmallAutoField`` go `OneTooneField`` (:ticket: `33932`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a migration crash on ``ManyToManyField`` fields with ``through`` "
"referencing models in different apps (:ticket:`33938`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh timpiste imirce ar réimsí ``ManyTomanyField` le samhlacha tagartha "
"``trí ``in aipeanna éagsúla (:ticket: `33938`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.1 that caused an incorrect migration when "
"renaming a model with ``ManyToManyField`` and ``db_table`` (:ticket:`33953`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.1 a bhí ina chúis le himirce mícheart nuair "
"a athainmníodh samhail le ``ManyTomanyField`` agus ``db_table`` (:ticket: "
"`33953`)."

msgid ""
"Reallowed, following a regression in Django 4.1, creating reverse foreign "
"key managers on unsaved instances (:ticket:`33952`)."
msgstr ""
"Athluchtaithe, tar éis aischéimnithe i Django 4.1, ag cruthú "
"príomhbhainisteoirí eachtracha droim ar chásanna neamhshábháilte (:ticket: "
"`33952`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.1 that caused a migration crash on SQLite < "
"3.20 (:ticket:`33960`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.1 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste imirce ar "
"SQLite <3.20 (:ticket: `33960`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.1 that caused an admin crash when "
"the :mod:`~django.contrib.admindocs` app was used "
"(:ticket:`33955`, :ticket:`33971`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.1 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste riaracháin "
"nuair a úsáideadh an aip: mod: `~django.contrib.admindocs` (:ticket: "
"`33955`, :ticket: `33971`)."

msgid "Django 4.1.10 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.1.10"

msgid ""
"Django 4.1.10 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\" in 4.1.9."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 4.1.10 saincheist slándála le déine “measartha” i 4.1.9."

msgid "Django 4.1.11 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.1.11"

msgid ""
"Django 4.1.11 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\" in 4.1.10."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 4.1.11 saincheist slándála le déine “measartha” i 4.1.10."

msgid "Django 4.1.12 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.1.12"

msgid ""
"Django 4.1.12 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\" in 4.1.11."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 4.1.12 saincheist slándála le déine “measartha” i 4.1.11."

msgid "Django 4.1.13 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.1.13"

msgid ""
"Django 4.1.13 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\" in 4.1.12."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 4.1.13 saincheist slándála le déine “measartha” i 4.1.12."

msgid "Django 4.1.2 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.1.2"

msgid ""
"Django 4.1.2 fixes a security issue with severity \"medium\" and several "
"bugs in 4.1.1."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 4.1.2 saincheist slándála le déine “meánach” agus roinnt "
"fabhtanna i 4.1.1."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.1 that caused a migration crash on PostgreSQL "
"when adding a model with ``ExclusionConstraint`` (:ticket:`33982`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.1 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste imirce ar "
"PostgreSQL nuair a chuirtear samhail le ``ExclusionConstraint`` (:ticket: "
"`33982`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.1 that caused aggregation over a queryset "
"that contained an ``Exists`` annotation to crash due to too many selected "
"columns (:ticket:`33992`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.1 a d'fhág comhiomlánú thar tacar "
"fiosrúcháin ina raibh anótáil ``Exists` 'titim mar gheall ar an iomarca "
"colúin roghnaithe (:ticket: `33992`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 4.1 that caused an incorrect validation of "
"``CheckConstraint`` on ``NULL`` values (:ticket:`33996`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 4.1 a bhí ina chúis le bailíochtú mícheart "
"``CheckConstraint`` ar luachanna ``NULL` (:ticket: `33996`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.1 that caused a ``QuerySet.values()/"
"values_list()`` crash on ``ArrayAgg()`` and ``JSONBAgg()`` (:ticket:`34016`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.1 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste "
"``QuerySet.values () /values_list () ``ar `ArrayAgg ()`` agus ``JsonBagg () "
"``(:ticket: `34016`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 4.1 that "
"caused :attr:`.ModelAdmin.autocomplete_fields` to be incorrectly selected "
"after adding/changing related instances via popups (:ticket:`34025`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 4.1 a chúisí:attr: `.ModelAdmin.autocomplete_fields` "
"a roghnú go mícheart tar éis cásanna gaolmhara a chur leis a/a athrú trí "
"popups (:ticket: `34025`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.1 where the app registry was not populated "
"when running parallel tests with the ``multiprocessing`` start method "
"``spawn`` (:ticket:`34010`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.1 nuair nár daonraíodh clárlann an aip agus "
"tástálacha comhthreomhara á reáchtáil leis an modh tosaigh ``multiprocessing "
"``spawn`` (:ticket: `34010`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.1 where the ``--debug-mode`` argument to "
"``test`` did not work when running parallel tests with the "
"``multiprocessing`` start method ``spawn`` (:ticket:`34010`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.1 nuair nár oibrigh an argóint ``--debug-"
"mode ``le `tástáil`` nuair a bhí tástálacha comhthreomhara á reáchtáil leis "
"an modh tosaigh ``multiprocessing ```spawn`` (:ticket: `34010`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.1 that didn't alter a sequence type when "
"altering type of pre-Django 4.1 serial columns on PostgreSQL "
"(:ticket:`34058`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.1 nár athraigh cineál seicheamh agus é ag "
"athrú cineál colúin sraitheacha réamh-Django 4.1 ar PostgreSQL (:ticket: "
"`34058`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.1 that caused a crash for :class:`View` "
"subclasses with asynchronous handlers when handling non-allowed HTTP methods "
"(:ticket:`34062`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.1 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste d'fho-aicmí: "
"class: `View` le láimhseálaithe asincrónacha agus modhanna HTTP neamh-"
"cheadaithe á láimhseáil (:ticket: `34062`)."

msgid ""
"Reverted caching related managers for ``ForeignKey``, ``ManyToManyField``, "
"and ``GenericRelation`` that caused the incorrect refreshing of related "
"objects (:ticket:`33984`)."
msgstr ""
"Bainisteoirí a bhaineann le caching ar ais do `ForeignKey``, "
"`ManyTomanyField``, agus ``GenericRelation`` a bhí ina chúis le rudaí "
"gaolmhara a athnuachan mícheart (:ticket: `33984`)."

msgid ""
"Relaxed the system check added in Django 4.1 for the same name used for "
"multiple template tag modules to a warning (:ticket:`32987`)."
msgstr ""
"Scaoileadh an seiceáil chórais a cuireadh i Django 4.1 don ainm céanna a "
"úsáidtear le haghaidh iolracha modúil clib teimpléad le rabhadh (:ticket: "
"`32987`)."

msgid "Django 4.1.3 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.1.3"

msgid "*November 1, 2022*"
msgstr "*1 Samhain, 2022*"

msgid ""
"Django 4.1.3 fixes a bug in 4.1.2 and adds compatibility with Python 3.11."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 4.1.3 fabht i 4.1.2 agus cuireann sé comhoiriúnacht le "
"Python 3.11."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 4.1 that caused non-Python files created by "
"``startproject`` and ``startapp`` management commands from custom templates "
"to be incorrectly formatted using the ``black`` command (:ticket:`34085`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 4.1 a d'fhág go raibh comhaid neamh-Python a "
"cruthaíodh ag orduithe bainistíochta ``startproject`` agus `startapp`` ó "
"theimpléid saincheaptha a fhormáidiú go mícheart ag baint úsáide as an ordú "
"``black`` (:ticket: `34085`)."

msgid "Django 4.1.4 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.1.4"

msgid "*December 6, 2022*"
msgstr "*6 Nollaig, 2022*"

msgid "Django 4.1.4 fixes several bugs in 4.1.3."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 4.1.4 roinnt fabhtanna i 4.1.3."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.1 that caused an unnecessary table rebuild "
"when adding a ``ManyToManyField`` on SQLite (:ticket:`34138`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.1 a bhí ina chúis le tábla neamhriachtanach "
"a athógáil nuair a chuirtear ``ManyTomanyField`` ar SQLite (:ticket: "
"`34138`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 4.1 that caused a crash of the sitemap index view with "
"an empty :meth:`Sitemap.items() <django.contrib.sitemaps.Sitemap.items>` and "
"a callable :attr:`~django.contrib.sitemaps.Sitemap.lastmod` "
"(:ticket:`34088`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 4.1 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste ar an radharc "
"innéacs léarscáileáin le folamh: meth: `SiteMap.items () "
"<django.contrib.sitemaps.Sitemap.items>`agus glao:attr: "
"`~django.contrib.sitemaps.sitemap.lastmod` (:ticket: `34088`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 4.1 that caused a crash using ``acreate()``, "
"``aget_or_create()``, and ``aupdate_or_create()`` asynchronous methods of "
"related managers (:ticket:`34139`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 4.1 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste ag baint úsáide as "
"``acreate () ``, `aget_or_create ()``, agus ``aupdate_or_create () "
"``modhanna asincrónacha bainisteoirí gaolmhara (:ticket: `34139`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 4.1 that caused a crash of ``QuerySet.bulk_create()`` "
"with ``\"pk\"`` in ``unique_fields`` (:ticket:`34177`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 4.1 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste "
"``queryset.bulk_create () ``le ``pk\"`` i ``unique_fields`` (:ticket: "
"`34177`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 4.1 that caused a crash of ``QuerySet.bulk_create()`` "
"on fields with ``db_column`` (:ticket:`34171`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 4.1 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste "
"``QuerySet.bulk_create () ``ar réimsí le ``db_column`` (:ticket: `34171`)."

msgid "Django 4.1.5 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.1.5"

msgid "*January 2, 2023*"
msgstr "*2 Eanáir, 2023*"

msgid ""
"Django 4.1.5 fixes a bug in 4.1.4. Also, the latest string translations from "
"Transifex are incorporated."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 4.1.5 fabht i 4.1.4. Chomh maith leis sin, corpraítear na "
"haistriúcháin teaghráin is déanaí ó Transifex."

msgid ""
"Fixed a long standing bug in the ``__len`` lookup for ``ArrayField`` that "
"caused a crash of model validation on :attr:`Meta.constraints "
"<django.db.models.Options.constraints>` (:ticket:`34205`)."
msgstr ""
"<django.db.models.Options.constraints>Socraigh fabht fada sa chuardach "
"``__len`` le haghaidh ``ArrayField`` a bhí ina chúis le timpiste bailíochtú "
"samhail ar:attr: `Meta.Constraints `(:ticket: `34205`)."

msgid "Django 4.1.6 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.1.6"

msgid ""
"Django 4.1.6 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\" and a bug in "
"4.1.5."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 4.1.6 saincheist slándála le déine “measartha” agus fabht i "
"4.1.5."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 4.1 that caused a crash of model validation on "
"``UniqueConstraint`` with ordered expressions (:ticket:`34291`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 4.1 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste bailíochtú samhail "
"ar `UniqueConstraint`` le nathanna ordaithe (:ticket: `34291`)."

msgid "Django 4.1.7 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.1.7"

msgid ""
"Django 4.1.7 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\" and a bug in "
"4.1.6."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 4.1.7 saincheist slándála le déine “measartha” agus fabht i "
"4.1.6."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 4.1 that caused a crash of model validation on "
"``ValidationError`` with no ``code`` (:ticket:`34319`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 4.1 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste bailíochtú samhail "
"ar ``ValidationError`` gan aon ``cód ``(:ticket: `34319`)."

msgid "Django 4.1.8 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.1.8"

msgid "*April 5, 2023*"
msgstr "*Aibreán 5, 2023*"

msgid "Django 4.1.8 fixes a bug in 4.1.7."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 4.1.8 fabht i 4.1.7."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 4.1 that caused invalidation of sessions when rotating "
"secret keys with ``SECRET_KEY_FALLBACKS`` (:ticket:`34384`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 4.1 a bhí ina chúis le seisiúin a bheith neamhbhailí "
"agus eochracha rúnda á rothlú le ``SECRET_KEY_FALLBACKS`` (:ticket: `34384`)."

msgid "Django 4.1.9 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.1.9"

msgid "Django 4.1.9 fixes a security issue with severity \"low\" in 4.1.8."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 4.1.9 saincheist slándála le déine “íseal” i 4.1.8."

msgid "Django 4.2 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.2"

msgid "*April 3, 2023*"
msgstr "*3 Aibreán, 2023*"

msgid "Welcome to Django 4.2!"
msgstr "Fáilte go dtí Django 4.2!"

msgid ""
"These release notes cover the :ref:`new features <whats-new-4.2>`, as well "
"as some :ref:`backwards incompatible changes <backwards-incompatible-4.2>` "
"you'll want to be aware of when upgrading from Django 4.1 or earlier. "
"We've :ref:`begun the deprecation process for some features <deprecated-"
"features-4.2>`."
msgstr ""
"Clúdaíonn na nótaí scaoilte seo na:ref: `gnéithe nua <whats-new-4.2>`, chomh "
"maith le roinnt athruithe: ref: `athruithe neamh-chomhoiriúnacha ar "
"chúl<backwards-incompatible-4.2>` a mbeidh tú ag iarraidh a bheith ar an "
"eolas fúthu agus tú ag uasghrádú ó Django 4.1 nó níos luaithe. <deprecated-"
"features-4.2>We've:ref: `thosaigh an próiseas díghabhála do roinnt gnéithe `."

msgid ""
"Django 4.2 is designated as a :term:`long-term support release <Long-term "
"support release>`. It will receive security updates for at least three years "
"after its release. Support for the previous LTS, Django 3.2, will end in "
"April 2024."
msgstr ""
"<Long-term support release>Ainmnítear Django 4.2 mar a: téarma: `scaoileadh "
"tacaíochta fadtéarmach `. Gheobhaidh sé nuashonruithe slándála ar feadh trí "
"bliana ar a laghad tar éis a scaoilte Tiocfaidh deireadh le tacaíocht don "
"LTS roimhe seo, Django 3.2, i mí Aibreáin 2024."

msgid ""
"Django 4.2 supports Python 3.8, 3.9, 3.10, 3.11, and 3.12 (as of 4.2.8). We "
"**highly recommend** and only officially support the latest release of each "
"series."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn Django 4.2 le Python 3.8, 3.9, 3.10, 3.11, agus 3.12 (amhail "
"4.2.8). Molaimid** go hard** agus ní thacaímid go hoifigiúil ach leis an "
"scaoileadh is déanaí de gach sraith."

msgid "What's new in Django 4.2"
msgstr "Cad atá nua i Django 4.2"

msgid "Psycopg 3 support"
msgstr "Tacaíocht Psycopg 3"

msgid ""
"Django now supports `psycopg`_ version 3.1.8 or higher. To update your code, "
"install the :pypi:`psycopg library <psycopg>`, you don't need to change "
"the :setting:`ENGINE <DATABASE-ENGINE>` as ``django.db.backends.postgresql`` "
"supports both libraries."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn Django anois le `psycopg`_ leagan 3.1.8 nó níos airde. <DATABASE-"
"ENGINE>Chun do chód a nuashonrú, suiteáil an leabharlan:pypi: `psycopg `, "
"<psycopg>ní gá duit an: setting: `ENGINE` a athrú mar thacaíonn "
"``django.db.backends.postgresql`` leis an dá leabharlann."

msgid ""
"Support for ``psycopg2`` is likely to be deprecated and removed at some "
"point in the future."
msgstr ""
"Is dóigh go ndéanfar tacaíocht do `psycopg2` a dhíchur agus a bhaint ag "
"pointe éigin sa todhchaí."

msgid ""
"Be aware that ``psycopg`` 3 introduces some breaking changes over "
"``psycopg2``. As a consequence, you may need to make some changes to account "
"for `differences from psycopg2`_."
msgstr ""
"Bí ar an eolas go gcuireann `psycopg`` 3 roinnt athruithe briseacha isteach "
"thar `psycopg2``. Mar thoradh air sin, b'fhéidir go mbeidh ort roinnt "
"athruithe a dhéanamh chun cuntas a thabhairt ar `difríochtaí ó psycopg2`_."

msgid "Comments on columns and tables"
msgstr "Tuairimí ar cholúin agus táblaí"

msgid ""
"The new :attr:`Field.db_comment <django.db.models.Field.db_comment>` "
"and :attr:`Meta.db_table_comment "
"<django.db.models.Options.db_table_comment>` options allow creating comments "
"on columns and tables, respectively. For example::"
msgstr ""
"<django.db.models.Options.db_table_comment>Ceadaíonn na roghanna nua:attr: "
"`Field.db_Comment <django.db.models.Field.db_comment>`agus:attr: "
"`Meta.db_Table_Comment` tuairimí a chruthú ar cholúin agus táblaí, faoi "
"seach. Mar shampla::"

msgid ""
"Also, the "
"new :class:`~django.db.migrations.operations.AlterModelTableComment` "
"operation allows changing table comments defined in "
"the :attr:`Meta.db_table_comment "
"<django.db.models.Options.db_table_comment>`."
msgstr ""
"<django.db.models.Options.db_table_comment>Chomh maith leis sin, ceadaíonn "
"an oibríocht nua:class: "
"`~django.db.migrations.Operations.AlterModelTableComment `tráchtanna tábla a "
"athrú atá sainmhínithe in:attr: `Meta.DB_Table_Comment`."

msgid "Mitigation for the BREACH attack"
msgstr "Maolú don ionsaí BREACH"

msgid ""
":class:`~django.middleware.gzip.GZipMiddleware` now includes a mitigation "
"for the BREACH attack. It will add up to 100 random bytes to gzip responses "
"to make BREACH attacks harder. Read more about the mitigation technique in "
"the `Heal The Breach (HTB) paper`_."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.middleware.gzip.gzipMiddleware` tá maolú anois maidir leis "
"an ionsaí BREACH. Cuirfidh sé suas le 100 bait randamach le freagraí gzip "
"chun ionsaithe BREACH a dhéanamh níos deacra. Léigh tuilleadh faoin teicníc "
"maolaithe sa pháipéar `Heal The Breach (HTB) `_."

msgid "In-memory file storage"
msgstr "Stóráil comhad i gcuimhne"

msgid ""
"The new :class:`django.core.files.storage.InMemoryStorage` class provides a "
"non-persistent storage useful for speeding up tests by avoiding disk access."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn an rang nua:class: `django.core.files.storage.inmemoryStorage` "
"stóráil neamh-leanúnach atá úsáideach chun tástálacha a bhrostú trí rochtain "
"diosca a sheachaint."

msgid "Custom file storages"
msgstr "Stóráil comhaid saincheaptha"

msgid ""
"The new :setting:`STORAGES` setting allows configuring multiple custom file "
"storage backends. It also controls storage engines for managing :doc:`files "
"</topics/files>` (the ``\"default\"`` key) and :doc:`static files </ref/"
"contrib/staticfiles>` (the ``\"staticfiles\"`` key)."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an socrú nua:setting: `STORAGES` cúltaca stórála comhad saincheaptha "
"iolracha a chumrú. Rialaíonn sé innill stórála freisin chun bainistiú: doc: "
"`comhad` (an eochair ``\"réamhshocraithe” ``) agus:doc: `comhad stataich` "
"(an ``\"staticfiles</topics/files> \"`eochair </ref/contrib/staticfiles>)."

msgid ""
"The old ``DEFAULT_FILE_STORAGE`` and ``STATICFILES_STORAGE`` settings are "
"deprecated as of this release."
msgstr ""
"Tá na sean-socruithe ``DEFAULT_FILE_STORAGE`` agus ``STATICFILES_STORAGE`` a "
"dhíscríobh amhail an eisiúint seo."

msgid ""
"The light or dark color theme of the admin can now be toggled in the UI, as "
"well as being set to follow the system setting."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir téama dath éadrom nó dorcha an riaracháin a thosc anois sa "
"Chomhéadan, chomh maith le bheith socraithe chun socrú an chórais a leanúint."

msgid ""
"The admin's font stack now prefers system UI fonts and no longer requires "
"downloading fonts. Additionally, CSS variables are available to more easily "
"override the default font families."
msgstr ""
"Is fearr le cruach cló an riaracháin clónna UI córais anois agus ní "
"theastaíonn clónna a íoslódáil a thuilleadh Ina theannta sin, tá athróga CSS "
"ar fáil chun na teaghlaigh cló réamhshocraithe a shárú níos éasca."

msgid ""
"The :source:`admin/delete_confirmation.html <django/contrib/admin/templates/"
"admin/delete_confirmation.html>` template now has some additional blocks and "
"scripting hooks to ease customization."
msgstr ""
"Tá roinnt bloic agus crúcaí scripteála breise anois ag an teimpléad:source: "
"`admin/delete_confirmation.html` chun saincheapadh a éasc<django/contrib/"
"admin/templates/admin/delete_confirmation.html> ú."

msgid ""
"The chosen options "
"of :attr:`~django.contrib.admin.ModelAdmin.filter_horizontal` "
"and :attr:`~django.contrib.admin.ModelAdmin.filter_vertical` widgets are now "
"filterable."
msgstr ""
"Tá na roghanna roghnaithe de:attr: "
"`~django.contrib.admin.modeladmin.filter_horizontal` agus:attr: "
"`~django.contrib.admin.modeladmin.filter_vertical` giuirléidí inscagtha "
"anois."

msgid ""
"The ``admin/base.html`` template now has a new block ``nav-breadcrumbs`` "
"which contains the navigation landmark and the ``breadcrumbs`` block."
msgstr ""
"Tá bloc nua ``nav-breadcrumbs`` sa teimpléad `admin/base.html` anois ina "
"bhfuil an sainchomhartha nascleanúna agus an bloc ``breadcrumbs``."

msgid ""
":attr:`.ModelAdmin.list_editable` now uses atomic transactions when making "
"edits."
msgstr ""
":attr: Úsáideann `.modeladmin.list_editable` idirbhearta adamhacha anois "
"agus eagarthóireachtaí á dhéanamh."

msgid "jQuery is upgraded from version 3.6.0 to 3.6.4."
msgstr "jQuery is upgraded from version 3.6.0 to 3.6.4."

msgid ""
"The default iteration count for the PBKDF2 password hasher is increased from "
"390,000 to 600,000."
msgstr ""
"Méadaítear an líon athraithe réamhshocraithe don hasher pasfhocal PBKDF2 ó "
"390,000 go 600,000."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.contrib.auth.forms.UserCreationForm` now saves many-to-many "
"form fields for a custom user model."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.contrib.auth.forms.userCreationForm` sábhálann go leor "
"réimsí foirme anois do mhúnla úsáideora saincheaptha."

msgid ""
"The new :class:`~django.contrib.auth.forms.BaseUserCreationForm` is now the "
"recommended base class for customizing the user creation form."
msgstr ""
"Is é an nua:class: `~django.contrib.auth.forms.baseUserCreationForm` an "
"bunaicme a mholtar anois chun an fhoirm chruthaithe úsáideora a "
"shaincheapadh."

msgid ""
"The :doc:`GeoJSON serializer </ref/contrib/gis/serializers>` now outputs the "
"``id`` key for serialized features, which defaults to the primary key of "
"objects."
msgstr ""
"Aisíonn an:doc: `GeoJSON serializer` an eochair `id ``anois le haghaidh "
"gnéithe sraithe</ref/contrib/gis/serializers> acha, a réamhshocraíonn ar "
"phríomh-eochair na rudaí."

msgid ""
"The :class:`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.GDALRaster` class now "
"supports :class:`pathlib.Path`."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn an rang:class: `~django.contrib.gis.gdal.gdalraster` anois:class: "
"`Pathlib.path`."

msgid ""
"The :class:`~django.contrib.gis.geoip2.GeoIP2` class now supports  ``.mmdb`` "
"files downloaded from DB-IP."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn an rang:class: `~django.contrib.gis.geoip2.geoip2` anois le comhaid "
"``.mmdb`` a íoslódáil ó DB-IP."

msgid ""
"The OpenLayers template widget no longer includes inline CSS (which also "
"removes the former ``map_css`` block) to better comply with a strict Content "
"Security Policy."
msgstr ""
"Ní chuimsíonn giuirléid teimpléad OpenLayers CSS inlíne a thuilleadh (a "
"bhaineann an iar-bhloc `map_css` freisin) chun polasaí slándála Ábhar dian a "
"chomhlíonadh níos fearr."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.contrib.gis.forms.widgets.OpenLayersWidget` is now based on "
"OpenLayers 7.2.2 (previously 4.6.5)."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.contrib.gis.forms.widgets.openLayersWidget` bunaithe anois "
"ar OpenLayers 7.2.2 (4.6.5 roimhe seo)."

msgid ""
"The new :lookup:`isempty` lookup and :class:`IsEmpty() "
"<django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.IsEmpty>` expression allow filtering "
"empty geometries on PostGIS."
msgstr ""
"<django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.IsEmpty>Ligeann an léiriú "
"nua:lookup: `isempty` agus: class: `isEmpty () `geoiméadraí folmha a scagadh "
"ar PostGIS."

msgid ""
"The new :class:`FromWKB() <django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.FromWKB>` "
"and :class:`FromWKT() <django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.FromWKT>` "
"functions allow creating geometries from Well-known binary (WKB) and Well-"
"known text (WKT) representations."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn na feidh "
"<django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.FromWKB><django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.FromWKT>meanna "
"nua:aicme: `fromWKB () `agus:aicme: `fromWKT ()` geoiméadrachtaí a chruthú ó "
"ionadaíochtaí dénártha aitheanta (WKB) agus téacs aitheanta (WKT)."

msgid ""
"The new :lookup:`trigram_strict_word_similar` lookup, and "
"the :class:`TrigramStrictWordSimilarity() "
"<django.contrib.postgres.search.TrigramStrictWordSimilarity>` "
"and :class:`TrigramStrictWordDistance() "
"<django.contrib.postgres.search.TrigramStrictWordDistance>` expressions "
"allow using trigram strict word similarity."
msgstr ""
"<django.contrib.postgres.search.TrigramStrictWordSimilarity><django.contrib.postgres.search.TrigramStrictWordDistance>Ceadaíonn "
"an cuardach nua:lookup: `trigram_strict_word_similar`, agus an:class: "
"`trigramstrictWordSimilarity () `agus:class: `trigramstrictWordDistance ()` "
"cosúlacht focal dian trigram a úsáid."

msgid ""
"The :lookup:`arrayfield.overlap` lookup now supports ``QuerySet.values()`` "
"and ``values_list()`` as a right-hand side."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn an cuardach: lookup: `arrayfield.overlap` anois le "
"``QuerySet.values () ``agus ``values_list ()`` mar thaobh na láimhe deise."

msgid ""
"The new :meth:`.Sitemap.get_languages_for_item` method allows customizing "
"the list of languages for which the item is displayed."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an modh nua:meth: `.SiteMap.Get_Languages_for_Item` liosta na "
"dteangacha a bhfuil an mír ar taispeáint dóibh a shaincheapadh."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.contrib.staticfiles.storage.ManifestStaticFilesStorage` now "
"has experimental support for replacing paths to JavaScript modules in "
"``import`` and ``export`` statements with their hashed counterparts. If you "
"want to try it, subclass ``ManifestStaticFilesStorage`` and set the "
"``support_js_module_import_aggregation`` attribute to ``True``."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.contrib.staticfiles.storage.manifestStaticFilesStorage` "
"tacaíocht turgnamhach anois chun cosáin chuig modúil JavaScript a "
"athsholáthar i ráitis ``allmhairi`` agus ``export`` lena gcomhghleacaithe "
"hashed. Más mian leat triail a bhaint as, déan fo-aicme "
"``ManifestStaticFilesStorage`` agus socraigh an tréith "
"``support_js_module_import_aggregation`` go `True``."

msgid ""
"The new :attr:`.ManifestStaticFilesStorage.manifest_hash` attribute provides "
"a hash over all files in the manifest and changes whenever one of the files "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn an tréith nua:attr: `.manifestStaticFilesStorage.manifest_hash` "
"hash thar gach comhad sa manifest agus athraíonn sé aon uair a athraíonn "
"ceann de na comhaid."

msgid ""
"The new ``\"assume_role\"`` option is now supported in :setting:`OPTIONS` on "
"PostgreSQL to allow specifying the :ref:`session role <database-role>`."
msgstr ""
"<database-role>Tacaítear anois leis an rogha nua ``\"assume_role\"`` "
"in:setting: `OPTIONS` ar PostgreSQL chun ligean an ról seisiúin `a shonrú."

msgid ""
"The new ``\"server_side_binding\"`` option is now supported "
"in :setting:`OPTIONS` on PostgreSQL with ``psycopg`` 3.1.8+ to allow "
"using :ref:`server-side binding cursors <database-server-side-parameters-"
"binding>`."
msgstr ""
"<database-server-side-parameters-binding>Tacaítear anois leis an rogha nua "
"``\"server_side_binding\"`` in:setting: `OPTIONS` ar PostgreSQL le "
"``psycopg`` 3.1.8+ chun cead a úsáid:ref: `cúrsaí ceangailteacha taobh "
"freastalaí`."

msgid ""
"The debug page now shows :pep:`exception notes <678>` and :pep:`fine-grained "
"error locations <657>` on Python 3.11+."
msgstr ""
"<657>Taispeánann an leathanach dífhabhtaithe anois:pep: `nótaí eisceachta "
"`agus <678>:pep: `suíomhanna earráide mion-ghráinne` ar Python 3.11+."

msgid ""
"Session cookies are now treated as credentials and therefore hidden and "
"replaced with stars (``**********``) in error reports."
msgstr ""
"Déileáiltear le fianáin seisiúin mar dhintiúir anois agus mar sin folaítear "
"iad agus cuirtear réaltaí (``**********``) ina n-ionad i dtuairiscí earráide."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.forms.ModelForm` now accepts the new ``Meta`` option "
"``formfield_callback`` to customize form fields."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.forms.ModelForm` glacann anois leis an rogha nua ``Meta`` "
"``formfield_callback`` chun réimsí foirme a shaincheapadh."

msgid ""
":func:`~django.forms.models.modelform_factory` now respects the "
"``formfield_callback`` attribute of the ``form``’s ``Meta``."
msgstr ""
":func: `~django.forms.models.modelform_factory` meas anois ar an tréith "
"``formfield_callback`` de `Meta`` an `foirm ``."

msgid ""
"Added support and translations for the Central Kurdish (Sorani) language."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh tacaíocht agus aistriúcháin leis an teanga Cúirdis Lárnach (Sorani)."

msgid ""
"The :ref:`django-db-logger` logger now logs transaction management queries "
"(``BEGIN``, ``COMMIT``, and ``ROLLBACK``) at the ``DEBUG`` level."
msgstr ""
"Logálann an logghair:ref: `django-db-logger` fiosruithe bainistíochta "
"idirbheart anois (``BEGIN``, `COMMIT``, agus ``ROLLBACK``) ag an leibhéal "
"``DEBUG`."

msgid ""
":djadmin:`makemessages` command now supports locales with private sub-tags "
"such as ``nl_NL-x-informal``."
msgstr ""
":djadmin: Tacaíonn an t-ordú `makemessages` anois le háiteanna le fo-"
"chlibeanna príobháideacha mar ``nl_nl-x-informal``."

msgid ""
"The new :option:`makemigrations --update` option merges model changes into "
"the latest migration and optimizes the resulting operations."
msgstr ""
"Comhcheanglaíonn an rogha nua:option: `makemigrations --update` athruithe "
"samhail san imirce is déanaí agus déanann sé na hoibríochtaí mar thoradh air "
"a bharrfheabhsú."

msgid "Migrations now support serialization of ``enum.Flag`` objects."
msgstr "Tacaíonn imirce anois le sraitheadh rudaí ``Enum.flag``."

msgid ""
"``QuerySet`` now extensively supports filtering against :ref:`window-"
"functions` with the exception of disjunctive filter lookups against window "
"functions when performing aggregation."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn ``QuerySet` `go forleathan anois le scagadh i gcoinne: ref: "
"`feidhmeanna fuinneog` seachas cuardaigh scagaire disjunctive i gcoinne "
"feidhmeanna fuinneoige agus comhiomlánú á dhéanamh."

msgid ""
":meth:`~.QuerySet.prefetch_related` now "
"supports :class:`~django.db.models.Prefetch` objects with sliced querysets."
msgstr ""
": meth: Tacaíonn `~.querySet.Prefetch_Related` anois:class: "
"`~django.db.models.prefetch` rudaí le ceisteanna slisnithe."

msgid ""
":ref:`Registering lookups <lookup-registration-api>` "
"on :class:`~django.db.models.Field` instances is now supported."
msgstr ""
":ref: Tacaítear anois le cásanna `Cuardaigh a chlárú <lookup-registration-"
"api>`ar:class: `~django.db.models.field`."

msgid ""
"The new ``robust`` argument for :func:`~django.db.transaction.on_commit` "
"allows performing actions that can fail after a database transaction is "
"successfully committed."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an argóint nua ``robust`` le haghaidh: func: "
"`~django.db.transaction.on_commit 'gníomhartha a dhéanamh ar féidir leo teip "
"a dhéanamh tar éis idirbheart bunachar sonraí a dhéanamh go rathúil."

msgid ""
"The new :class:`KT() <django.db.models.fields.json.KT>` expression "
"represents the text value of a key, index, or path transform "
"of :class:`~django.db.models.JSONField`."
msgstr ""
"Léiríonn an abairt nua:class: `KT () <django.db.models.fields.json.KT>`luach "
"téacs eochair, innéacs nó athrú cosáin de:class: "
"`~django.db.models.jsonField`."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.db.models.functions.Now` now supports microsecond precision "
"on MySQL and millisecond precision on SQLite."
msgstr ""
":class: `~Django.db.Models.Functions.Now` tacaíonn anois le cruinneas "
"micreasoicind ar MySQL agus cruinneas milisoicind ar SQLite."

msgid ""
":class:`F() <django.db.models.F>` expressions that output ``BooleanField`` "
"can now be negated using ``~F()`` (inversion operator)."
msgstr ""
":class: abairtí `F () <django.db.models.F>`is féidir an t-aschur "
"``Booleanfield`` a dhiúltú anois ag baint úsáide as ``~F () ``(oibreoir "
"inversation)."

msgid ""
"``Model`` now provides asynchronous versions of some methods that use the "
"database, using an ``a`` "
"prefix: :meth:`~.Model.adelete`, :meth:`~.Model.arefresh_from_db`, "
"and :meth:`~.Model.asave`."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn ``Model ``leaganacha asincrónacha anois de roinnt modhanna a "
"úsáideann an bunachar sonraí, ag baint úsáide as réimír ``a``: :meth: "
"`~.model.Adelete`, :meth: `~.model.arefresh_from_db`, agus:meth: "
"`~.model.asave`."

msgid ""
"Related managers now provide asynchronous versions of methods that change a "
"set of related objects, using an ``a`` "
"prefix: :meth:`~.RelatedManager.aadd`, :meth:`~.RelatedManager.aclear`, :meth:`~.RelatedManager.aremove`, "
"and :meth:`~.RelatedManager.aset`."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn bainisteoirí gaolmhara leaganacha asincrónacha de mhodhanna "
"anois a athraíonn sraith rudaí gaolmhara, ag baint úsáide as réimír "
"``a``: :meth: `~.relatedManager.aAdd`, :meth: `~.relatedManager.aRemove`, "
"agus:meth: `~.relatedManager.aset`."

msgid ""
":attr:`CharField.max_length <django.db.models.CharField.max_length>` is no "
"longer required to be set on PostgreSQL, which supports unlimited "
"``VARCHAR`` columns."
msgstr ""
":attr: Ní gá `charfield.max_length <django.db.models.CharField.max_length>`a "
"shocrú ar PostgreSQL a thuilleadh, a thacaíonn le colúin ``VARCHAR`` "
"neamhtheoranta."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.http.StreamingHttpResponse` now supports async iterators "
"when Django is served via ASGI."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.http.StreamInghttPresponse` tacaíonn anois le "
"haitearálaithe async nuair a sheirbheáltar Django trí ASGI."

msgid ""
"The :option:`test --debug-sql` option now formats SQL queries with "
"``sqlparse``."
msgstr ""
"Formálaíonn an rogha: rogha `test --debug-sql` fiosruithe SQL anois le "
"`sqlparse`."

msgid ""
"The :class:`~django.test.RequestFactory`, :class:`~django.test.AsyncRequestFactory`, :class:`~django.test.Client`, "
"and :class:`~django.test.AsyncClient` classes now support the ``headers`` "
"parameter, which accepts a dictionary of header names and values. This "
"allows a more natural syntax for declaring headers."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn ranga:Class: `~django.test.requestFactory`, :class: "
"`~django.test.asyncRequestFactory`, :class: `~django.test.client`, "
"agus:class: `~django.test.asyncClient` anois leis an paraiméadar "
"``headers``, a ghlacann le foclóir ainmneacha agus luachanna ceanntásc. "
"Ligeann sé seo comhréir níos nádúrtha chun ceanntásca a dhearbhú."

msgid ""
"The new ``encoder`` parameter for :meth:`django.utils.html.json_script` "
"function allows customizing a JSON encoder class."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an paraiméadar nua ``encoder`` le haghaidh: meth: "
"`django.utils.html.json_script` aicme ionchódóra JSON a shaincheapadh."

msgid ""
"The private internal vendored copy of ``urllib.parse.urlsplit()`` now strips "
"``'\\r'``, ``'\\n'``, and ``'\\t'`` (see :cve:`2022-0391` and :bpo:`43882`). "
"This is to protect projects that may be incorrectly using the internal "
"``url_has_allowed_host_and_scheme()`` function, instead of using one of the "
"documented functions for handling URL redirects. The Django functions were "
"not affected."
msgstr ""
"Stíleann an cóip phríobháideach inmheánach de `urllib.parse.urlsplit () "
"``anois ``'\\ r'``, ```\\ n '`, agus``'\\ t'`` (féach: cve: `2022-0391` "
"agus:bpo: `43882`). Tá sé seo chun tionscadail a d'fhéadfadh a bheith ag "
"úsáid mícheart an fheidhm inmheánach ``url_has_allowed_host_and_scheme () `a "
"chosaint, in ionad ceann de na feidhmeanna doiciméadaithe a úsáid chun "
"atreoruithe URL a láimhseáil. Níor chuir tionchar ar fheidhmeanna Django."

msgid ""
"The new :func:`django.utils.http.content_disposition_header` function "
"returns a ``Content-Disposition`` HTTP header value as specified "
"by :rfc:`6266`."
msgstr ""
"Tugann an fheidhm nua:func: `django.utils.http.content_disposition_header` "
"luach ceanntásc HTTP ``Content-Disposition`` mar a shonraítear ar:rfc: "
"`6266`."

msgid ""
"The list of common passwords used by ``CommonPasswordValidator`` is updated "
"to the most recent version."
msgstr ""
"Déantar an liosta de na pasfhocail choitianta a úsáideann "
"``CommonPasswordValidator`` a nuashonrú go dtí an leagan is déanaí."

msgid "Backwards incompatible changes in 4.2"
msgstr "Athruithe neamh-chomhoiriúnacha ar ais i 4.2"

msgid ""
"``DatabaseFeatures.allows_group_by_pk`` is removed as it only remained to "
"accommodate a MySQL extension that has been supplanted by proper functional "
"dependency detection in MySQL 5.7.15. Note that "
"``DatabaseFeatures.allows_group_by_selected_pks`` is still supported and "
"should be enabled if your backend supports functional dependency detection "
"in ``GROUP BY`` clauses as specified by the ``SQL:1999`` standard."
msgstr ""
"Baintear ``databaseFeatures.allows_group_by_pk ``mar níor fhan sé ach "
"freastal ar síneadh MySQL a cuireadh in ionad trí bhrath spleáchais "
"fheidhmiúil ceart i MySQL 5.7.15. Tabhair faoi deara go dtacaítear le "
"``DatabaseFeatures.allows_group_by_selected_pks`` fós agus ba chóir é a "
"chumasú má thacaíonn do chúlcheann le brath spleáchais fheidhmiúil i "
"gclásail ``GROUP BY`` mar a shonraítear leis an gcaighdeán `SQL:1999``."

msgid ""
":djadmin:`inspectdb` now uses ``display_size`` from "
"``DatabaseIntrospection.get_table_description()`` rather than "
"``internal_size`` for ``CharField``."
msgstr ""
":djadmin: úsáideann `inspectdb` anois ``display_size`` ó "
"`databaseintrospection.get_table_description () ``seachas ``internal_size`` "
"do `charfield``."

msgid "Dropped support for MariaDB 10.3"
msgstr "Tacaíocht titim do MariaDB 10.3"

msgid ""
"Upstream support for MariaDB 10.3 ends in May 2023. Django 4.2 supports "
"MariaDB 10.4 and higher."
msgstr ""
"Críochnaíonn tacaíocht suas srutha do MariaDB 10.3 i mí na Bealtaine 2023. "
"Tacaíonn Django 4.2 le MariaDB 10.4 agus níos airde."

msgid "Dropped support for MySQL 5.7"
msgstr "Tacaíocht titim do MySQL 5.7"

msgid ""
"Upstream support for MySQL 5.7 ends in October 2023. Django 4.2 supports "
"MySQL 8 and higher."
msgstr ""
"Críochnaíonn tacaíocht upstream do MySQL 5.7 i mí Dheireadh Fómhair 2023. "
"Tacaíonn Django 4.2 le MySQL 8 agus níos airde."

msgid "Dropped support for PostgreSQL 11"
msgstr "Tacaíocht titim do PostgreSQL 11"

msgid ""
"Upstream support for PostgreSQL 11 ends in November 2023. Django 4.2 "
"supports PostgreSQL 12 and higher."
msgstr ""
"Críochnaíonn tacaíocht suas srutha do PostgreSQL 11 i mí na Samhna 2023. "
"Tacaíonn Django 4.2 le PostgreSQL 12 agus níos airde."

msgid "Setting ``update_fields`` in ``Model.save()`` may now be required"
msgstr ""
"B'fhéidir go mbeadh gá anois ag socrú ``update_fields`` i `Model.save () ``"

msgid ""
"In order to avoid updating unnecessary "
"columns, :meth:`.QuerySet.update_or_create` now passes ``update_fields`` to "
"the :meth:`Model.save() <django.db.models.Model.save>` calls. As a "
"consequence, any fields modified in the custom ``save()`` methods should be "
"added to the ``update_fields`` keyword argument before calling ``super()``. "
"See :ref:`overriding-model-methods` for more details."
msgstr ""
"<django.db.models.Model.save>D'fhonn colúin neamhriachtanacha a nuashonrú a "
"sheachaint, téann :meth: `.queryset.update_or_create` anois "
"``update_fields`` chuig na glaonna:: `Model.save () `. Mar thoradh air sin, "
"ba chóir aon réimsí a mhodhnaítear sna modhanna saincheaptha ``save () ``a "
"chur leis an argóint eochairfhocal ``update_fields`` sula nglactar ar "
"``super ()``. Féach: Ref: `overriding-model-methods` le haghaidh tuilleadh "
"sonraí."

msgid "Dropped support for raw aggregations on MySQL"
msgstr "Tacaíocht titim do chomhiomlánú amh ar MySQL"

msgid ""
"MySQL 8+ allows functional dependencies on ``GROUP BY`` columns, so the pre-"
"Django 4.2 workaround of grouping by primary keys of the main table is "
"removed. As a consequence, using ``RawSQL()`` aggregations is no longer "
"supported on MySQL as there is no way to determine if such aggregations are "
"needed or valid in the ``GROUP BY`` clause. Use :ref:`aggregation-functions` "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn MySQL 8+ spleáchas feidhmiúla ar cholúin ``GROUP BY ``, mar sin "
"baintear an réamh-Django 4.2 maidir le grúpáil de réir eochracha príomhúil "
"an phríomh-thábla. Mar thoradh air sin, ní thacaítear le comhiomlánú "
"``RawSQL () `a úsáid a thuilleadh ar MySQL mar níl aon bhealach ann chun a "
"chinneadh an bhfuil comhiomlánú den sórt sin de dhíth nó bailí sa chlásal "
"``GROUP BY`. Úsáid: ref: `feidhmeanna comhiomlánaithe' ina ionad."

msgid ""
"The undocumented ``django.http.multipartparser.parse_header()`` function is "
"removed. Use ``django.utils.http.parse_header_parameters()`` instead."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an fheidhm ``django.http.multipartparser.parse_header () "
"`neamhdhoiciméadaithe. Úsáid ``django.utils.http.parse_header_parameters () "
"``ina ionad."

msgid ""
":ttag:`{% blocktranslate asvar … %}<blocktranslate>` result is now marked as "
"safe for (HTML) output purposes."
msgstr ""
":ttag: `{% blocktranslate asvar...%}<blocktranslate>` tá toradh marcáilte "
"anois mar shábháilte chun críocha aschuir (HTML)."

msgid ""
"The ``autofocus`` HTML attribute in the admin search box is removed as it "
"can be confusing for screen readers."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an tréith HTML ``autofocus` sa bhosca cuardaigh riaracháin mar "
"d'fhéadfadh sé a bheith mearbhall do léitheoirí scáileáin."

msgid ""
"The :option:`makemigrations --check` option no longer creates missing "
"migration files."
msgstr ""
"Ní chruthaíonn an rogha:option: `makemigrations --check` comhaid imirce in "
"easnamh a thuilleadh."

msgid ""
"The ``alias`` argument for :meth:`.Expression.get_group_by_cols` is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an argóint ``alias`` do:meth: `.expression.get_group_by_cols`."

msgid ""
"The minimum supported version of ``sqlparse`` is increased from 0.2.2 to "
"0.3.1."
msgstr "Méadaítear an leagan íosta tacaithe de `sqlparse`` ó 0.2.2 go 0.3.1."

msgid ""
"The undocumented ``negated`` parameter of "
"the :class:`~django.db.models.Exists` expression is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an paraiméadar ``diúlt`` neamhdhoiciméadaithe den léir:class: "
"`~django.db.Models.Exists`."

msgid ""
"The ``is_summary`` argument of the undocumented ``Query.add_annotation()`` "
"method is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear argóint ``is_resum`` den mhodh ``Query.add_annotation () "
"``neamhdhoiciméadaithe."

msgid ""
"The minimum supported version of SQLite is increased from 3.9.0 to 3.21.0."
msgstr "Méadaítear an leagan íosta tacaithe de SQLite ó 3.9.0 go 3.21.0."

msgid ""
"The minimum supported version of ``asgiref`` is increased from 3.5.2 to "
"3.6.0."
msgstr "Méadaítear an leagan íosta tacaithe de `asgiref`` ó 3.5.2 go 3.6.0."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.contrib.auth.forms.UserCreationForm` now rejects usernames "
"that differ only in case. If you need the previous behavior, "
"use :class:`~django.contrib.auth.forms.BaseUserCreationForm` instead."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.contrib.auth.forms.userCreationForm` diúltú anois "
"ainmneacha úsáideora nach bhfuil difríocht ann ach i gcás. Má theastaíonn an "
"t-iompar roimhe seo uait, bain úsáid as: class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.forms.baseUserCreationForm` ina ionad."

msgid ""
"The minimum supported version of ``mysqlclient`` is increased from 1.4.0 to "
"1.4.3."
msgstr ""
"Méadaítear an leagan íosta tacaithe de `mysqlclient`` ó 1.4.0 go 1.4.3."

msgid ""
"The minimum supported version of ``argon2-cffi`` is increased  from 19.1.0 "
"to 19.2.0."
msgstr ""
"Méadaítear an leagan íosta tacaithe de ``argon2-cffi`` ó 19.1.0 go 19.2.0."

msgid ""
"The minimum supported version of ``Pillow`` is increased from 6.2.0 to 6.2.1."
msgstr "Méadaítear an leagan íosta tacaithe de ``Pillow`` ó 6.2.0 go 6.2.1."

msgid ""
"The minimum supported version of ``jinja2`` is increased from 2.9.2 to "
"2.11.0."
msgstr "Méadaítear an leagan íosta tacaithe de `jinja2`` ó 2.9.2 go 2.11.0."

msgid ""
"The minimum supported version of :pypi:`redis-py <redis>` is increased from "
"3.0.0 to 3.4.0."
msgstr ""
"Méadaítear an leagan íosta tacaithe de: pypi: `redis-py <redis>`ó 3.0.0 go "
"3.4.0."

msgid ""
"Manually instantiated ``WSGIRequest`` objects must be provided a file-like "
"object for ``wsgi.input``. Previously, Django was more lax than the expected "
"behavior as specified by the WSGI specification."
msgstr ""
"Ní mór réad cosúil le comhad a sholáthar do `wsgi.input`` rudaí "
"`WSGIRequest`` de láimh. Roimhe seo, bhí Django níos saoire ná an t-iompar a "
"bhfuiltear ag súil leis mar a shonraíonn sonraíocht WSGI."

msgid "Support for ``PROJ`` < 5 is removed."
msgstr "Baintear tacaíocht do `PROJ`` <5."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.core.mail.backends.smtp.EmailBackend` now verifies "
"a :py:attr:`hostname <ssl.SSLContext.check_hostname>` "
"and :py:attr:`certificates <ssl.SSLContext.verify_mode>`. If you need the "
"previous behavior that is less restrictive and not recommended, subclass "
"``EmailBackend`` and override the ``ssl_context`` property."
msgstr ""
"<ssl.SSLContext.check_hostname><ssl.SSLContext.verify_mode>:class: "
"`~django.core.mail.backends.smtp.emailBackend` fíoraíonn anois a:py:attr: "
"`hostname `agus:py:attr: `teastais`. Más gá duit an t-iompar roimhe seo nach "
"bhfuil chomh sriantach agus nach mholtar, fo-aicme ``emailBackend`` agus "
"athsháraigh an maoin ``ssl_context``."

msgid "Features deprecated in 4.2"
msgstr "Gnéithe atá díscríofa i 4.2"

msgid "``index_together`` option is deprecated in favor of ``indexes``"
msgstr "Tá rogha ``index_together ``díluasaithe i bhfabhar ``indexes``"

msgid ""
"The ``Meta.index_together`` option is deprecated in favor of "
"the :attr:`~django.db.models.Options.indexes` option."
msgstr ""
"Tá an rogha `Meta.index_Together`` a dhíchur i bhfabhar an roghna:attr: "
"`~Django.db.Models.Options.Indexes`."

msgid ""
"Migrating existing ``index_together`` should be handled as a migration. For "
"example::"
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir an imirce atá ann cheana féin a láimhseáil mar imirce. Mar shampla::"

msgid "Should become::"
msgstr "Ba chóir go mbeadh:"

msgid ""
"Running the :djadmin:`makemigrations` command will generate a migration "
"containing a :class:`~django.db.migrations.operations.RenameIndex` operation "
"which will rename the existing index. Next, consider squashing migrations to "
"remove ``index_together`` from historical migrations."
msgstr ""
"Ag rith an t-ordú:djadmin: `makemigrations` ginfidh imirce ina bhfuil "
"oibríocht a:class: `~django.db.migrations.operations.renameIndex` a "
"athainmneoidh an t-innéacs atá ann cheana. Ansin, smaoinigh ar imirce a "
"scrúdú chun `index_together ``a bhaint as imirce stairiúla."

msgid ""
"The ``AlterIndexTogether`` migration operation is now officially supported "
"only for pre-Django 4.2 migration files. For backward compatibility reasons, "
"it's still part of the public API, and there's no plan to deprecate or "
"remove it, but it should not be used for new migrations. "
"Use :class:`~django.db.migrations.operations.AddIndex` "
"and :class:`~django.db.migrations.operations.RemoveIndex` operations instead."
msgstr ""
"Ní thugtar tacaíocht oifigiúil anois leis an oibríocht imirce "
"`AlterIndexTogether` ach amháin do chomhaid imirce réamh-Django 4.2. Ar "
"chúiseanna comhoiriúnachta ar chúl, tá sé fós mar chuid den API poiblí, agus "
"níl aon phlean ann é a dhíchur nó a bhaint, ach níor cheart é a úsáid le "
"haghaidh imirce nua. Úsáid:aicme: "
"`~django.db.migrations.operations.addIndex` agus:class: "
"`~django.db.migrations.operations.removeIndex` oibríochtaí ina ionad."

msgid "Passing encoded JSON string literals to ``JSONField`` is deprecated"
msgstr ""
"Tá litríochtaí teaghrán ionchódaithe JSON a chur chuig ``JSONField`` "
"míluasaithe"

msgid ""
"``JSONField`` and its associated lookups and aggregates used to allow "
"passing JSON encoded string literals which caused ambiguity on whether "
"string literals were already encoded from database backend's perspective."
msgstr ""
"“JSONField” agus a chuardaigh agus comhiomlánaithe gaolmhara a úsáideadh "
"chun litríochtaí teaghrán ionchódaithe JSON a chur ar aghaidh a bhí ina "
"chúis le débhríocht ar an raibh litríochtaí teaghráin ionchódaithe cheana "
"féin ó pheirspictíocht cúltaca bunachar sonraí."

msgid ""
"During the deprecation period string literals will be attempted to be JSON "
"decoded and a warning will be emitted on success that points at passing non-"
"encoded forms instead."
msgstr ""
"Le linn na tréimhse díghabhála déanfar iarracht litríochtaí teaghrán a "
"dhíchódú JSON agus astófar rabhadh maidir le rath a thugann le fios "
"foirmeacha neamh-ionchódaithe a rith ina ionad sin."

msgid "Code that used to pass JSON encoded string literals::"
msgstr "Cód a d'úsáid chun litríochtaí teaghrán ionchódaithe JSON a rith::"

msgid ""
"From Django 5.1+ string literals will be implicitly interpreted as JSON "
"string literals."
msgstr ""
"Ó Django 5.1+ déanfar litríochtaí teaghrán a léirmhíniú go hinchinneach mar "
"litríochtaí teaghrán JSON."

msgid ""
"The ``BaseUserManager.make_random_password()`` method is deprecated. See "
"`recipes and best practices <https://docs.python.org/3/library/"
"secrets.html#recipes-and-best-practices>`_ for using "
"Python's :py:mod:`secrets` module to generate passwords."
msgstr ""
"Tá an modh ``BaseUserManager.Make_Random_Password () ``díluachtaithe. Féach "
"`oidis agus dea-chleachtais `_ chun modúl Python: < https://docs.python.org/"
"3/library/secrets.html#recipes-and-best-practices> py:MOD: `rúda` a úsáid "
"chun pasfhocail a ghiniúint."

msgid ""
"The ``length_is`` template filter is deprecated in favor "
"of :tfilter:`length` and the ``==`` operator within an :ttag:`{% if %}<if>` "
"tag. For example"
msgstr ""
"<if>Tá an scagaire teimpléad ``long_is ``a dhíchur i bhfabhar: tfilter: "
"`leng` agus an oibreoir ``==`` laistigh de chlib: ttag: `{% if%}`. Mar "
"shampla"

msgid "instead of:"
msgstr "in ionad:"

msgid ""
"``django.contrib.auth.hashers.SHA1PasswordHasher``, "
"``django.contrib.auth.hashers.UnsaltedSHA1PasswordHasher``, and "
"``django.contrib.auth.hashers.UnsaltedMD5PasswordHasher`` are deprecated."
msgstr ""
"Tá ``Django.Contrib.Auth.Hashers.Sha1PasswordHasher``, "
"`Django.Contrib.Auth.Hashers.UnsaltedSha1PasswordHasher``, agus "
"``Django.Contrib.Auth.Hashers.UnsaltedMd5PasswordHasher``."

msgid ""
"``django.contrib.postgres.fields.CICharField`` is deprecated in favor of "
"``CharField(db_collation=\"…\")`` with a case-insensitive non-deterministic "
"collation."
msgstr ""
"Tá ``django.contrib.postgres.fields.cicharfield`` luasghabháilte i bhfabhar "
"``CharField (db_collation=\"...”) ``le comparáid neamh-chinntitheach cás-"
"neamh-íogair."

msgid ""
"``django.contrib.postgres.fields.CIEmailField`` is deprecated in favor of "
"``EmailField(db_collation=\"…\")`` with a case-insensitive non-deterministic "
"collation."
msgstr ""
"Tá ``django.contrib.postgres.fields.Ciemailfield`` scoite i bhfabhar "
"``EmailField (db_collation=\"...”) ``le comhlánú neamhchinntiúil cás-neamh-"
"íogair."

msgid ""
"``django.contrib.postgres.fields.CITextField`` is deprecated in favor of "
"``TextField(db_collation=\"…\")`` with a case-insensitive non-deterministic "
"collation."
msgstr ""
"Tá ``django.contrib.postgres.fields.citextField`` scoite i bhfabhar "
"``TextField (db_collation=\"...”) ``le comhlánú neamhchinntiúil cás-neamh-"
"íogair."

msgid "``django.contrib.postgres.fields.CIText`` mixin is deprecated."
msgstr "Tá mixin ``django.contrib.postgres.fields.citext`` measctha."

msgid ""
"The ``map_height`` and ``map_width`` attributes of ``BaseGeometryWidget`` "
"are deprecated, use CSS to size map widgets instead."
msgstr ""
"Tá na tréithe ``map_height`` agus ``map_width`` de `BasegeometryWidget`` a "
"dhíchur, bain úsáid as CSS chun giuirléidí léarscáileála a mhéadú ina ionad "
"sin."

msgid ""
"``SimpleTestCase.assertFormsetError()`` is deprecated in favor of "
"``assertFormSetError()``."
msgstr ""
"Tá ``SimpleTestCase.AssertFormSetError () ``díluaite i bhfabhar "
"``AssertFormSetError ()``."

msgid ""
"``TransactionTestCase.assertQuerysetEqual()`` is deprecated in favor of "
"``assertQuerySetEqual()``."
msgstr ""
"Tá ``TransactionTestCase.assertQuerySetEqual () `díluaite i bhfabhar "
"``AssertQuerySetEqual () ``."

msgid ""
"Passing positional arguments to ``Signer`` and ``TimestampSigner`` is "
"deprecated in favor of keyword-only arguments."
msgstr ""
"Tá argóintí seasaimh a chur chuig ``Signer`` agus ``TimeStampSigner`` i "
"bhfabhar argóintí eochairfhocal amháin."

msgid ""
"The ``DEFAULT_FILE_STORAGE`` setting is deprecated in favor of "
"``STORAGES[\"default\"]``."
msgstr ""
"Tá an socrú ``DEFAULT_FILE_STORAGE`` a dhíchur i bhfabhar ``STORAGES "
"[\"réamhshocraithe\"] ``."

msgid ""
"The ``STATICFILES_STORAGE`` setting is deprecated in favor of "
"``STORAGES[\"staticfiles\"]``."
msgstr ""
"Tá an socrú ``STATICFILES_STORAGE`` a dhíchur i bhfabhar ``STORAGES "
"[\"staticfiles\"] ``."

msgid ""
"The ``django.core.files.storage.get_storage_class()`` function is deprecated."
msgstr ""
"Tá an fheidhm ``django.core.files.storage.get_storage_class () ``díluaite."

msgid "Django 4.2.1 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.2.1"

msgid ""
"Django 4.2.1 fixes a security issue with severity \"low\" and several bugs "
"in 4.2."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 4.2.1 saincheist slándála le déine “íseal” agus roinnt "
"fabhtanna i 4.2."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused a crash of ``QuerySet.defer()`` "
"when deferring fields by attribute names (:ticket:`34458`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste "
"``QuerySet.defer () ``agus réimsí á chur ar iarchur de réir ainmneacha "
"tréithe (:ticket: `34458`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused a crash "
"of :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.search.SearchVector` function with ``%`` "
"characters (:ticket:`34459`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste de:class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.search.searchVector` feidhm le carachtair ``%`` "
"(:ticket: `34459`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused aggregation over query that "
"uses explicit grouping to group against the wrong columns (:ticket:`34464`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a bhí ina chúis le comhiomlánú thar cheist "
"a úsáideann grúpáil follasach chun grúpáil i gcoinne na gcolúin míchearta "
"(:ticket: `34464`)."

msgid ""
"Reallowed, following a regression in Django 4.2, setting the "
"``\"cursor_factory\"`` option in :setting:`OPTIONS` on PostgreSQL "
"(:ticket:`34466`)."
msgstr ""
"Athluchtaithe, tar éis aischéimnithe i Django 4.2, ag socrú an rogha "
"``\"cursor_factory\"`` in:setting: `OPTIONS` ar PostgreSQL (:ticket: "
"`34466`)."

msgid ""
"Enforced UTF-8 client encoding on PostgreSQL, following a regression in "
"Django 4.2 (:ticket:`34470`)."
msgstr ""
"Ionchódú cliant UTF-8 forfheidhmithe ar PostgreSQL, tar éis aischéimnithe i "
"Django 4.2 (:ticket: `34470`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 where ``i18n_patterns()`` didn't respect "
"the ``prefix_default_language`` argument when a fallback language of the "
"default language was used (:ticket:`34455`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 nuair nach raibh meas ag ``i18n_patterns "
"() ```an argóint ``prefix_default_language`` nuair a úsáideadh teanga chosc "
"den teanga réamhshocraithe (:ticket: `34455`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 where translated URLs of the default "
"language from ``i18n_patterns()`` with ``prefix_default_language`` set to "
"``False`` raised 404 errors for a request with a different language "
"(:ticket:`34515`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 nuair a d'ardaigh URLanna aistrithe na "
"teanga réamhshocraithe ó ``i18n_patterns () ``le ``prefix_default_language`` "
"socraithe go ``False`` earráid 404 d'iarratas le teanga dhifriúil (:ticket: "
"`34515`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 where creating copies and deep copies of "
"``HttpRequest``, ``HttpResponse``, and their subclasses didn't always work "
"correctly (:ticket:`34482`, :ticket:`34484`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 nuair a chruthaigh cóipeanna agus "
"cóipeanna domhain de `HttpRequest``, `HttpResponse``, agus nár oibrigh a "
"gcuid fo-aicmí i gceart i gcónaí (:ticket: `34482`, :ticket: `34484`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 where ``timesince`` and ``timeuntil`` "
"template filters returned incorrect results for a datetime with a non-UTC "
"timezone when a time difference is less than 1 day (:ticket:`34483`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 nuair a d'fhill scagairí teimpléad "
"``timesince`` agus `timeuntil`` torthaí míchearta le dáta-am le crios ama "
"neamh-UTC nuair a bhíonn difríocht ama níos lú ná 1 lá (:ticket: `34483`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused a crash "
"of :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.search.SearchHeadline` function with "
"``psycopg`` 3 (:ticket:`34486`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste de:class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.search.searchheadline` feidhm le ``psycopg`` 3 "
"(:ticket: `34486`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused incorrect "
"``ClearableFileInput`` margins in the admin (:ticket:`34506`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a bhí ina chúis le corrlach "
"``ClearableFileInput`` mícheart sa riarachán (:ticket: `34506`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 where breadcrumbs didn't appear on admin "
"site app index views (:ticket:`34512`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 nuair nach raibh brúin aráin le feiceáil "
"ar radhairc innéacs aip láithreáin riaracháin (:ticket: `34512`)."

msgid ""
"Made squashing migrations reduce ``AddIndex``, ``RemoveIndex``, "
"``RenameIndex``, and ``CreateModel`` operations which allows removing a "
"deprecated ``Meta.index_together`` option from historical migrations and use "
"``Meta.indexes`` instead (:ticket:`34525`)."
msgstr ""
"Laghdaíonn imirce scáileáin oibríochtaí ``AddIndex``, `RemoveIndex``, "
"`RenameIndex``, agus `CreateModel`` a cheadaíonn rogha "
"`Meta.index_Together`` a bhaint as imirce stairiúla agus bain úsáid as "
"`Meta.indexes`` ina ionad (:ticket: `34525`)."

msgid "Django 4.2.10 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.2.10"

msgid ""
"Django 4.2.10 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\" in 4.2.9."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 4.2.10 saincheist slándála le déine “measartha” i 4.2.9."

msgid "Django 4.2.11 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.2.11"

msgid ""
"Django 4.2.11 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\" and a "
"regression in 4.2.10."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 4.2.11 saincheist slándála le déine “measartha” agus "
"aischéimniú i 4.2.10."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2.10 where ``intcomma`` template filter could "
"return a leading comma for string representation of floats (:ticket:`35172`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2.10 áit a bhféadfadh scagaire teimpléad "
"``intcom`` coma tosaigh a thabhairt ar ais le haghaidh léiriú teaghrán ar "
"snámha (:ticket: `35172`)."

msgid "Django 4.2.12 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.2.12"

msgid "*May 6, 2024*"
msgstr "*6 Bealtaine, 2024*"

msgid ""
"Django 4.2.12 fixes a compatibility issue with Python 3.11.9+ and 3.12.3+."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 4.2.12 saincheist chomhoiriúnachta le Python 3.11.9+ agus "
"3.12.3+."

msgid ""
"Fixed a crash in Django 4.2 when validating email max line lengths with "
"content decoded using the ``surrogateescape`` error handling scheme "
"(:ticket:`35361`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh timpiste i Django 4.2 agus uasmhéid líne ríomhphoist á bhailíochtú "
"le hábhar díchódaithe ag baint úsáide as an scéim láimhseála earráide "
"``surrogateescape` (:ticket: `35361`)."

msgid "Django 4.2.13 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.2.13"

msgid "*May 7, 2024*"
msgstr "*7 Bealtaine, 2024*"

msgid "Django 4.2.13 fixes a packaging error in 4.2.12."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 4.2.13 earráid pacáistithe i 4.2.12."

msgid "Django 4.2.14 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.2.14"

msgid "*July 9, 2024*"
msgstr "*9 Iúil, 2024*"

msgid ""
"Django 4.2.14 fixes two security issues with severity \"moderate\" and two "
"security issues with severity \"low\" in 4.2.13."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 4.2.14 dhá shaincheist slándála le déine “measartha” agus "
"dhá shaincheist slándála le déine “íseal” i 4.2.13."

msgid ""
"CVE-2024-38875: Potential denial-of-service vulnerability in "
"``django.utils.html.urlize()``"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2024-38875: Leochaileacht féideartha seirbhíse a dhiúltú i "
"``django.utils.html.urlize () `"

msgid ""
":tfilter:`urlize` and :tfilter:`urlizetrunc` were subject to a potential "
"denial-of-service attack via certain inputs with a very large number of "
"brackets."
msgstr ""
"Bhí: tfilter: `urlize` agus:tfilter: `urlizetrunc` faoi réir ionsaí "
"féideartha diúltú seirbhíse trí ionchuir áirithe le líon an-mhór lúibíní."

msgid ""
"CVE-2024-39329: Username enumeration through timing difference for users "
"with unusable passwords"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2024-39329: Áireamh ainm úsáideora trí dhifríocht uainiúcháin "
"d'úsáideoirí a bhfuil pasfhocail neamhúsáidte acu"

msgid ""
"The :meth:`~django.contrib.auth.backends.ModelBackend.authenticate()` method "
"allowed remote attackers to enumerate users via a timing attack involving "
"login requests for users with unusable passwords."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaigh an modh:Meth: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.backends.modelBackend.Authenticate () `ionsaitheoirí "
"iargúlta úsáideoirí a áireamh trí ionsaí uainiúcháin a bhaineann le "
"hiarratais logála isteach d'úsáideoirí a bhfuil pasfhocail neamhúsáidte acu."

msgid "CVE-2024-39330: Potential directory-traversal via ``Storage.save()``"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2024-39330: Aistriú féideartha stiúrthóireachta trí ``Storage.save () ``"

msgid ""
"Derived classes of the :class:`~django.core.files.storage.Storage` base "
"class which override :meth:`generate_filename() "
"<django.core.files.storage.Storage.generate_filename()>` without replicating "
"the file path validations existing in the parent class, allowed for "
"potential directory-traversal via certain inputs when calling :meth:`save() "
"<django.core.files.storage.Storage.save()>`."
msgstr ""
"<django.core.files.storage.Storage.generate_filename () > "
"<django.core.files.storage.Storage.save () >Aicmí díorthaithe den aicme "
"bonn:class: `~django.core.files.storage.storage` a sháraithe:meth: "
"`generate_filename ()` gan an bailíochtú cosán comhaid atá ann sa rang "
"tuismitheora a mhacasamhlú, ceadaítear le haghaidh aistrithe féideartha trí "
"ionchuir áirithe agus glaoch: meth: `save (`)."

msgid ""
"Built-in ``Storage`` sub-classes were not affected by this vulnerability."
msgstr ""
"Ní raibh tionchar ag an leochaileacht seo ar fho-aicmí “Stóráil” ionsuite."

msgid ""
"CVE-2024-39614: Potential denial-of-service vulnerability in "
"``get_supported_language_variant()``"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2024-39614: Leochaileacht féideartha seirbhíse a dhiúltú i "
"``get_supported_language_variant () ``"

msgid ""
":meth:`~django.utils.translation.get_supported_language_variant` was subject "
"to a potential denial-of-service attack when used with very long strings "
"containing specific characters."
msgstr ""
":meth: Bhí `~django.utils.translation.get_supported_language_variant` faoi "
"réir ionsaí diúltaithe seirbhíse féideartha nuair a úsáidtear é le teaghráin "
"an-fhada ina raibh carachtair shonracha ann."

msgid ""
"To mitigate this vulnerability, the language code provided "
"to :meth:`~django.utils.translation.get_supported_language_variant` is now "
"parsed up to a maximum length of 500 characters."
msgstr ""
"Chun an leochaileacht seo a mhaolú, déantar an cód teanga a chuirtear ar "
"fáil do:meth: `~django.utils.translation.get_supported_language_variant` a "
"pháirseáil anois suas go dtí an fad uasta 500 carachtar."

msgid ""
"When the language code is over 500 characters, a :exc:`ValueError` will now "
"be raised if ``strict`` is ``True``, or if there is no generic variant and "
"``strict`` is ``False``."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a bhíonn an cód teanga os cionn 500 carachtar, ardófar a:exc: "
"`ValueError` anois má tá ``docht ```True``, nó mura bhfuil aon leagan "
"cineálach ann agus má tá ``docht`` bréag``."

msgid "Django 4.2.15 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.2.15"

msgid "*August 6, 2024*"
msgstr "*6 Lúnasa, 2024*"

msgid ""
"Django 4.2.15 fixes three security issues with severity \"moderate\", one "
"security issue with severity \"high\", and a regression in 4.2.14."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 4.2.15 trí shaincheist slándála le déine “measartha”, "
"saincheist slándála amháin le déine “ard”, agus aischéimniú i 4.2.14."

msgid ""
"CVE-2024-41989: Memory exhaustion in "
"``django.utils.numberformat.floatformat()``"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2024-41989: Ídiú cuimhne i ``django.utils.numberformat.floatformat () ``"

msgid ""
"If :tfilter:`floatformat` received a string representation of a number in "
"scientific notation with a large exponent, it could lead to significant "
"memory consumption."
msgstr ""
"Má fuair: tFilter: `floatformat` léiriú teaghrán ar uimhir i nótaí eolaíoch "
"le heaspóntóir mór, d'fhéadfadh tomhaltas suntasach cuimhne a bheith mar "
"thoradh air."

msgid ""
"To avoid this, decimals with more than 200 digits are now returned as is."
msgstr ""
"Chun é seo a sheachaint, cuirtear deacháin le níos mó ná 200 dhigit ar ais "
"anois mar atá."

msgid ""
"CVE-2024-41990: Potential denial-of-service vulnerability in "
"``django.utils.html.urlize()``"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2024-41990: Leochaileacht féideartha a dhiúltú seirbhíse i "
"``django.utils.html.urlize () ``"

msgid ""
":tfilter:`urlize` and :tfilter:`urlizetrunc` were subject to a potential "
"denial-of-service attack via very large inputs with a specific sequence of "
"characters."
msgstr ""
"Bhí: tfilter: `urlize` agus:tfilter: `urlizetrunc` faoi réir ionsaí "
"féideartha diúltaithe seirbhíse trí ionchuir an-mhóra le seicheamh sonrach "
"carachtair."

msgid ""
"CVE-2024-41991: Potential denial-of-service vulnerability in "
"``django.utils.html.urlize()`` and ``AdminURLFieldWidget``"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2024-41991: Leochaileacht féideartha a dhiúltú seirbhíse i "
"``django.utils.html.urlize () ``agus ``adminURLFieldWidget``"

msgid ""
":tfilter:`urlize`, :tfilter:`urlizetrunc`, and ``AdminURLFieldWidget`` were "
"subject to a potential denial-of-service attack via certain inputs with a "
"very large number of Unicode characters."
msgstr ""
"Bhí: tfilter: `urlize`, :tfilter: `urlizetrunc`, agus "
"``adminURLFieldWidget`` faoi réir ionsaí diúltaithe seirbhíse féideartha trí "
"ionchuir áirithe le líon an-mhór carachtair Unicode."

msgid ""
"CVE-2024-42005: Potential SQL injection in ``QuerySet.values()`` and "
"``values_list()``"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2024-42005: Instealladh SQL féideartha i ``QuerySet.Values () ``agus "
"``values_list ()``"

msgid ""
":meth:`.QuerySet.values` and :meth:`~.QuerySet.values_list` methods on "
"models with a ``JSONField`` were subject to SQL injection in column aliases, "
"via a crafted JSON object key as a passed ``*arg``."
msgstr ""
":meth: `.queryset.values` agus:meth: `~.queryset.values_list` modhanna ar "
"mhúnlaí le ``JSONField`` faoi réir instealladh SQL i ainmneacha colún, trí "
"eochair réad JSON ceardaithe mar ``*arg`` a rith."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2.14 that caused a crash in "
"``LocaleMiddleware`` when processing a language code over 500 characters "
"(:ticket:`35627`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2.14 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste in "
"``LocalEmiddleware`` agus cód teanga á phróiseáil os cionn 500 carachtar "
"(:ticket: `35627`)."

msgid "Django 4.2.16 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.2.16"

msgid "*September 3, 2024*"
msgstr "*Meán Fómhair 3, 2024*"

msgid ""
"Django 4.2.16 fixes one security issue with severity \"moderate\" and one "
"security issue with severity \"low\" in 4.2.15."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 4.2.16 saincheist slándála amháin le déine “measartha” agus "
"saincheist slándála amháin le déine “íseal” i 4.2.15."

msgid ""
"CVE-2024-45230: Potential denial-of-service vulnerability in "
"``django.utils.html.urlize()``"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2024-45230: Leochaileacht féideartha seirbhíse a dhiúltú i "
"``django.utils.html.urlize () `"

msgid ""
"CVE-2024-45231: Potential user email enumeration via response status on "
"password reset"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2024-45231: Áireamh ríomhphoist úsáideora féideartha trí stádas "
"freagartha ar athshocrú pasfhocal"

msgid ""
"Due to unhandled email sending failures, "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.auth.forms.PasswordResetForm` class allowed "
"remote attackers to enumerate user emails by issuing password reset requests "
"and observing the outcomes."
msgstr ""
"Mar gheall ar theipeanna seolta ríomhphoist gan láimhseáil, cheadaigh "
"rang:class: `~django.contrib.auth.forms.PasswordResetForm` d'ionsaitheoirí "
"iargúlta ríomhphoist úsáideora a áireamh trí iarratais athshocraithe "
"pasfhocal a eisiúint agus na torthaí a bhreathnú."

msgid ""
"To mitigate this risk, exceptions occurring during password reset email "
"sending are now handled and logged using the :ref:`django-contrib-auth-"
"logger` logger."
msgstr ""
"Chun an riosca seo a mhaolú, déantar eisceachtaí a tharlaíonn le linn "
"seoladh ríomhphoist athshocraithe pasfhocal a láimhseáil agus a logáil anois "
"ag baint úsáide as an logger:ref: `django-contrib-auth-logger`."

msgid "Django 4.2.17 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.2.17"

msgid "*December 4, 2024*"
msgstr "*4 Nollaig, 2024*"

msgid ""
"Django 4.2.17 fixes one security issue with severity \"high\" and one "
"security issue with severity \"moderate\" in 4.2.16."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 4.2.17 saincheist slándála amháin le déine “ard” agus "
"saincheist slándála amháin le déine “measartha” i 4.2.16."

msgid "CVE-2024-53907: Denial-of-service possibility in ``strip_tags()``"
msgstr "CVE-2024-53907: Féidearthacht seirbhíse a dhiúltú i `strip_tags () ``"

msgid ""
":func:`~django.utils.html.strip_tags` would be extremely slow to evaluate "
"certain inputs containing large sequences of nested incomplete HTML "
"entities. The ``strip_tags()`` method is used to implement the "
"corresponding :tfilter:`striptags` template filter, which was thus also "
"vulnerable."
msgstr ""
":func: Bheadh `~django.utils.html.strip_tags` thar a bheith mall chun "
"ionchuir áirithe a mheas ina bhfuil seicheamh móra d'eintiteas HTML "
"neamhiomlán neadaithe. Úsáidtear an modh `strip_tags () ``chun an scagaire "
"teimpléad comhfhreagraí:tfilter: `striptags` a chur i bhfeidhm, a bhí mar "
"sin leochaileach freisin."

msgid ""
"``strip_tags()`` now has an upper limit of recursive calls to ``HTMLParser`` "
"before raising a :exc:`.SuspiciousOperation` exception."
msgstr ""
"Tá teorainn uachtarach glaonna athfhillteach ag ``strip_tags () ``anois "
"chuig `htmlParser`` sula ndéantar eisceacht a:exc: `.SuspiciousOperation`."

msgid ""
"CVE-2024-53908: Potential SQL injection via ``HasKey(lhs, rhs)`` on Oracle"
msgstr ""
"CVE-2024-53908: Instealladh SQL féideartha trí ``Haskey (lhs, rhs) ``ar "
"Oracle"

msgid ""
"Direct usage of the ``django.db.models.fields.json.HasKey`` lookup on Oracle "
"was subject to SQL injection if untrusted data was used as a ``lhs`` value."
msgstr ""
"Bhí úsáid dhíreach an chuardach ``django.db.models.fields.json.hasKey`` ar "
"Oracle faoi réir instealladh SQL má úsáideadh sonraí neamhiontaofa mar luach "
"`lhs`."

msgid ""
"Applications that use the :lookup:`has_key <jsonfield.has_key>` lookup "
"through the ``__`` syntax are unaffected."
msgstr ""
"Ní dhéantar tionchar ar iarratais a úsáideann an cuardach: `has_key "
"<jsonfield.has_key>`tríd an gcomhréir ``__``."

msgid "Django 4.2.18 release notes"
msgstr ""

msgid "*January 14, 2025*"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Django 4.2.18 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\" in 4.2.17."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"CVE-2024-56374: Potential denial-of-service vulnerability in IPv6 validation"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Lack of upper bound limit enforcement in strings passed when performing IPv6 "
"validation could lead to a potential denial-of-service attack. The "
"undocumented and private functions ``clean_ipv6_address`` and "
"``is_valid_ipv6_address`` were vulnerable, as was "
"the  :class:`django.forms.GenericIPAddressField` form field, which has now "
"been updated to define a ``max_length`` of 39 characters."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The :class:`django.db.models.GenericIPAddressField` model field was not "
"affected."
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 4.2.19 release notes"
msgstr ""

msgid "*February 5, 2025*"
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 4.2.19 fixes a regression in 4.2.18."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2.18 that caused ``validate_ipv6_address()`` "
"and ``validate_ipv46_address()`` to crash when handling non-string values "
"(:ticket:`36098`)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 4.2.2 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.2.2"

msgid "*June 5, 2023*"
msgstr "*5 Meitheamh, 2023*"

msgid "Django 4.2.2 fixes several bugs in 4.2.1."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 4.2.2 roinnt fabhtanna i 4.2.1."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused an unnecessary "
"``DBMS_LOB.SUBSTR()`` wrapping in the ``__isnull`` and ``__exact=None`` "
"lookups for ``TextField()``/``BinaryField()`` on Oracle (:ticket:`34544`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a bhí ina chúis le timfhilleadh "
"``DBMS_LOB.SUBSTR () ``neamhriachtanach sa ``__isnull`` agus "
"``__exact=None`` le haghaidh ``TextField () ``/``BinaryField ()`` ar Oracle "
"(:ticket: `34544`)."

msgid ""
"Restored, following a regression in Django 4.2, ``get_prep_value()`` call in "
"``JSONField`` subclasses (:ticket:`34539`)."
msgstr ""
"Athchóirithe, tar éis aischéimniú i Django 4.2, glaoch ``get_prep_value () "
"``i bhfo-aicmí ``JsonField`` (:ticket: `34539`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused a crash of ``QuerySet.defer()`` "
"when passing a ``ManyToManyField`` or ``GenericForeignKey`` reference. While "
"doing so is a no-op, it was allowed in older version (:ticket:`34570`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste "
"``QuerySet.defer () ``agus tagairt ``ManyTomanyField` nó "
"`GenericForeignKey`` á rith. Cé gur neamh-op é sin a dhéanamh, ceadaíodh é i "
"leagan níos sine (:ticket: `34570`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused a crash of ``QuerySet.only()`` "
"when passing a reverse ``OneToOneField`` reference (:ticket:`34612`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste "
"``QuerySet.only () ``nuair a chuirtear tagairt ``OneTooneField` ar ais "
"(:ticket: `34612`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 4.2 where :option:`makemigrations --update` didn't "
"respect the ``--name`` option (:ticket:`34568`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 4.2 áit nár urraigh: rogha: `makemigrations --"
"update` an rogha ``--name ``(:ticket: `34568`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a performance regression in Django 4.2 when compiling queries without "
"ordering (:ticket:`34580`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú feidhmíochta i Django 4.2 agus ceisteanna á thiomsú gan "
"ordú (:ticket: `34580`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 where nonexistent stylesheet was linked on "
"a “Congratulations!” page (:ticket:`34588`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 áit a raibh bileog stíle nach raibh ann "
"nasctha ar “Comhghairdeas!” leathanach (:ticket: `34588`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused a crash of "
"``QuerySet.aggregate()`` with expressions referencing other aggregates "
"(:ticket:`34551`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste "
"``QuerySet.aggregé () ``le nathanna ag tagairt do chomhiomláin eile "
"(:ticket: `34551`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused a crash of "
"``QuerySet.aggregate()`` with aggregates referencing subqueries "
"(:ticket:`34551`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste "
"``QuerySet.aggregé () ``le comhiomláin ag tagairt do fho-cheisteanna "
"(:ticket: `34551`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused a crash of querysets on SQLite "
"when filtering on ``DecimalField`` against values outside of the defined "
"range (:ticket:`34590`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste de cheisteanna "
"ar SQLite agus iad ag scagadh ar ``Decimalfield` i gcoinne luachanna "
"lasmuigh den raon sainmhínithe (:ticket: `34590`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused a serialization crash on a "
"``ManyToManyField`` without a natural key when its ``Manager``’s base "
"``QuerySet`` used ``select_related()`` (:ticket:`34620`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste sraitheach ar "
"``ManyTomanyField` gan eochair nádúrtha nuair a d'úsáid bonn ```Bainiste`` "
"`QuerySet ````select_related ()`` (:ticket: `34620`)."

msgid "Django 4.2.20 release notes"
msgstr ""

msgid "*March 6, 2025*"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Django 4.2.20 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\" in 4.2.19."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"CVE-2025-26699: Potential denial-of-service vulnerability in "
"``django.utils.text.wrap()``"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``wrap()`` and :tfilter:`wordwrap` template filter were subject to a "
"potential denial-of-service attack when used with very long strings."
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 4.2.21 release notes"
msgstr ""

msgid "*May 7, 2025*"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Django 4.2.21 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\", a data loss "
"bug, and a regression in 4.2.20."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This release was built using an upgraded :pypi:`setuptools`, producing "
"filenames compliant with :pep:`491` and :pep:`625` and thus addressing a "
"PyPI warning about non-compliant distribution filenames. This change only "
"affects the Django packaging process and does not impact Django's behavior."
msgstr ""

msgid "CVE-2025-32873: Denial-of-service possibility in ``strip_tags()``"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
":func:`~django.utils.html.strip_tags` would be slow to evaluate certain "
"inputs containing large sequences of incomplete HTML tags. This function is "
"used to implement the :tfilter:`striptags` template filter, which was thus "
"also vulnerable."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
":func:`~django.utils.html.strip_tags` now raises "
"a :exc:`.SuspiciousOperation` exception if it encounters an unusually large "
"number of unclosed opening tags."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Fixed a data corruption possibility in ``file_move_safe()`` when "
"``allow_overwrite=True``, where leftover content from a previously larger "
"file could remain after overwriting with a smaller one due to lack of "
"truncation (:ticket:`36298`)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2.20, introduced when "
"fixing :cve:`2025-26699`, where the :tfilter:`wordwrap` template filter did "
"not preserve empty lines between paragraphs after wrapping text "
"(:ticket:`36341`)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 4.2.22 release notes"
msgstr ""

msgid "*June 4, 2025*"
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 4.2.22 fixes a security issue with severity \"low\" in 4.2.21."
msgstr ""

msgid "CVE-2025-48432: Potential log injection via unescaped request path"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Internal HTTP response logging used ``request.path`` directly, allowing "
"control characters (e.g. newlines or ANSI escape sequences) to be written "
"unescaped into logs. This could enable log injection or forgery, letting "
"attackers manipulate log appearance or structure, especially in logs "
"processed by external systems or viewed in terminals."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Although this does not directly impact Django's security model, it poses "
"risks when logs are consumed or interpreted by other tools. To fix this, the "
"internal ``django.utils.log.log_response()`` function now escapes all "
"positional formatting arguments using a safe encoding."
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 4.2.23 release notes"
msgstr ""

msgid "*June 10, 2025*"
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 4.2.23 fixes a potential log injection issue in 4.2.22."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Fixed a log injection possibility by migrating remaining response logging to "
"``django.utils.log.log_response()``, which safely escapes arguments such as "
"the request path to prevent unsafe log output (:cve:`2025-48432`)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 4.2.24 release notes"
msgstr ""

msgid "*September 3, 2025*"
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 4.2.24 fixes a security issue with severity \"high\" in 4.2.23."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"CVE-2025-57833: Potential SQL injection in ``FilteredRelation`` column "
"aliases"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
":class:`.FilteredRelation` was subject to SQL injection in column aliases, "
"using a suitably crafted dictionary, with dictionary expansion, as the "
"``**kwargs`` passed to :meth:`.QuerySet.annotate` or :meth:`.QuerySet.alias`."
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 4.2.25 release notes"
msgstr ""

msgid "*October 1, 2025*"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Django 4.2.25 fixes one security issue with severity \"high\" and one "
"security issue with severity \"low\" in 4.2.24."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"CVE-2025-59681: Potential SQL injection in ``QuerySet.annotate()``, "
"``alias()``, ``aggregate()``, and ``extra()`` on MySQL and MariaDB"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
":meth:`.QuerySet.annotate`, :meth:`~.QuerySet.alias`, :meth:`~.QuerySet.aggregate`, "
"and :meth:`~.QuerySet.extra` methods were subject to SQL injection in column "
"aliases, using a suitably crafted dictionary, with dictionary expansion, as "
"the ``**kwargs`` passed to these methods (follow up to :cve:`2022-28346`)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"CVE-2025-59682: Potential partial directory-traversal via "
"``archive.extract()``"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``django.utils.archive.extract()`` function, used by :option:`startapp --"
"template` and :option:`startproject --template`, allowed partial directory-"
"traversal via an archive with file paths sharing a common prefix with the "
"target directory (follow up to :cve:`2021-3281`)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 4.2.3 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.2.3"

msgid ""
"Django 4.2.3 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\" and several "
"bugs in 4.2.2."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 4.2.3 saincheist slándála le déine “measartha” agus roinnt "
"fabhtanna i 4.2.2."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused incorrect alignment of timezone "
"warnings for ``DateField`` and ``TimeField`` in the admin (:ticket:`34645`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a d'fhág ailíniú mícheart rabhaidh crios "
"ama do ``Datefield`` agus ``Timefield`` sa riarachán (:ticket: `34645`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused incorrect highlighting of rows "
"in the admin changelist view when ``ModelAdmin.list_editable`` contained a "
"``BooleanField`` (:ticket:`34638`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a d'fhág aibhsiú mícheart ar shraitheanna "
"i radharc an liosta athraithe riaracháin nuair a bhí ``BooleanField` "
"``ModelAdmin.list_Editable`` (:ticket: `34638`)."

msgid "Django 4.2.4 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.2.4"

msgid "*August 1, 2023*"
msgstr "*1 Lúnasa, 2023*"

msgid "Django 4.2.4 fixes several bugs in 4.2.3."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 4.2.4 roinnt fabhtanna i 4.2.3."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused a crash of "
"``QuerySet.aggregate()`` with aggregates referencing window functions "
"(:ticket:`34717`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste "
"``QuerySet.Aggregate () ``le comhiomláin ag tagairt feidhmeanna fuinneoige "
"(:ticket: `34717`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused a crash when grouping by a "
"reference in a subquery (:ticket:`34748`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste agus é ag "
"grúpáil le tagairt i bhfocheist (:ticket: `34748`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused aggregation over query that "
"uses explicit grouping by multi-valued annotations to group against the "
"wrong columns (:ticket:`34750`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a bhí ina chúis le comhiomlánú thar cheist "
"a úsáideann grúpáil follasach trí anótaí illuacha chun grúpáil i gcoinne na "
"gcolúin míchearta (:ticket: `34750`)."

msgid "Django 4.2.5 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.2.5"

msgid ""
"Django 4.2.5 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\" and several "
"bugs in 4.2.4."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 4.2.5 saincheist slándála le déine “measartha” agus roinnt "
"fabhtanna i 4.2.4."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused an incorrect validation of "
"``CheckConstraints`` on ``__isnull`` lookups against ``JSONField`` "
"(:ticket:`34754`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a bhí ina chúis le bailíochtú mícheart ar "
"``CheckConstraints`` ar chuardaigh ``__isnull`` i gcoinne ``JsonField`` "
"(:ticket: `34754`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 4.2 where the deprecated ``DEFAULT_FILE_STORAGE`` and "
"``STATICFILES_STORAGE`` settings were not synced with ``STORAGES`` "
"(:ticket:`34773`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 4.2 inar shioncronaíodh na socruithe "
"``DEFAULT_FILE_STORAGE`` agus ``STATICFILES_STORAGE`` a shioncronú le "
"``STORAGES`` (:ticket: `34773`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2.2 that caused an unnecessary selection of a "
"non-nullable ``ManyToManyField`` without a natural key during serialization "
"(:ticket:`34779`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2.2 a bhí ina chúis le roghnú gan ghá de "
"`ManyTomanyField` neamh-neamh-neamhriachtanach gan eochair nádúrtha le linn "
"sraitheoireachta (:ticket: `34779`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused a crash of a queryset when "
"filtering against deeply nested ``OuterRef()`` annotations (:ticket:`34803`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste tacar "
"fiosrúcháin agus é ag scagadh i gcoinne anótaí ``OuterRef () ``neadaithe go "
"domhain (:ticket: `34803`)."

msgid "Django 4.2.6 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.2.6"

msgid ""
"Django 4.2.6 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\" and several "
"bugs in 4.2.5."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 4.2.6 saincheist slándála le déine “measartha” agus roinnt "
"fabhtanna i 4.2.5."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2.5 where overriding the deprecated "
"``DEFAULT_FILE_STORAGE`` and ``STATICFILES_STORAGE`` settings in tests "
"caused the main ``STORAGES`` to mutate (:ticket:`34821`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2.5 áit a raibh na socruithe "
"“DEFAULT_FILE_STORAGE`` agus `STATICFILES_STORAGE`` díluaite i dtástálacha "
"mar chúis leis an bpríomh-`STORAGES`` a athrú (:ticket: `34821`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused unnecessary casting of string "
"based fields (``CharField``, ``EmailField``, ``TextField``, ``CICharField``, "
"``CIEmailField``, and ``CITextField``) used with the ``__isnull`` lookup on "
"PostgreSQL. As a consequence, indexes using an ``__isnull`` expression or "
"condition created before Django 4.2 wouldn't be used by the query planner, "
"leading to a performance regression (:ticket:`34840`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a bhí ina chúis le réitigh "
"neamhriachtanach réimsí bunaithe ar shreang (``Charfield``, `EmailField``, "
"`Emailfield``, `CitextField``) a úsáidtear leis an lorg ``__isnull`` ar "
"PostgreSQL. Mar thoradh air sin, ní úsáidfeadh an pleanálaí fiosrúcháin "
"innéacsanna a úsáideann léiriú nó coinníoll ``__isnull` a cruthaíodh roimh "
"Django 4.2, rud a fhágann go mbeadh aischéimniú feidhmíochta ann (:ticket: "
"`34840`)."

msgid ""
"You may need to recreate such indexes created in your database with Django "
"4.2 to 4.2.5, as they contain unnecessary ``::text`` casting. Find candidate "
"indexes with this query:"
msgstr ""
"B'fhéidir go mbeidh ort innéacsanna den sórt sin a cruthaíodh i do bhunachar "
"sonraí a athchruthú le Django 4.2 go 4.2.5, toisc go bhfuil réitigh ``:: "
"text`` gan ghá iontu. Faigh innéacsanna iarrthóirí leis an bhfiosrú seo:"

msgid "Django 4.2.7 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.2.7"

msgid ""
"Django 4.2.7 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\" and several "
"bugs in 4.2.6."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 4.2.7 saincheist slándála le déine “measartha” agus roinnt "
"fabhtanna i 4.2.6."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused a crash of "
"``QuerySet.aggregate()`` with aggregates referencing expressions containing "
"subqueries (:ticket:`34798`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste "
"``QuerySet.aggregé () ``le comhiomláin ag tagairt nathanna ina bhfuil fo-"
"cheisteanna (:ticket: `34798`)."

msgid ""
"Restored, following a regression in Django 4.2, creating ``varchar/"
"text_pattern_ops`` indexes on ``CharField`` and ``TextField`` with "
"deterministic collations on PostgreSQL (:ticket:`34932`)."
msgstr ""
"Athchóirithe, tar éis aischéimniú i Django 4.2, ag cruthú innéacsanna "
"``varchar/text_pattern_ops`` ar `Charfield`` agus ``Textfield`` le coláidí "
"cinntiúcháin ar PostgreSQL (:ticket: `34932`)."

msgid "Django 4.2.8 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.2.8"

msgid "*December 4, 2023*"
msgstr "*4 Nollaig, 2023*"

msgid ""
"Django 4.2.8 fixes several bugs in 4.2.7 and adds compatibility with Python "
"3.12."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 4.2.8 roinnt fabhtanna i 4.2.7 agus cuireann sé "
"comhoiriúnacht le Python 3.12."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused :option:`makemigrations --"
"check` to stop displaying pending migrations (:ticket:`34457`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a chúisí:option: `makemigrations --check` "
"chun stop a chur le himirce ar feitheamh a thaispeáint (:ticket: `34457`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused a crash of "
"``QuerySet.aggregate()`` with aggregates referencing other aggregates or "
"window functions through conditional expressions (:ticket:`34975`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste "
"``QuerySet.Aggregate () ``le comhiomlánaithe ag tagairt do chomhiomlánacha "
"eile nó feidhmeanna fuinneoige trí nathanna coinníollach (:ticket: `34975`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused a crash when annotating a "
"``QuerySet`` with a ``Window`` expressions composed of a ``partition_by`` "
"clause mixing field types and aggregation expressions (:ticket:`34987`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste nuair a bhí "
"anótáil ag ``QuerySet` le abairtí ``Fuinneog`` comhdhéanta de chlásal "
"``partition_by`` ag meascadh cineálacha réimse agus abairtí comhiomlánaithe "
"(:ticket: `34987`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 where the admin's change list page had "
"misaligned pagination links and inputs when using ``list_editable`` "
"(:ticket:`34991`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 áit a raibh naisc agus ionchuir "
"leathanaigh mí-ailínithe ag leathanach liosta athraithe an riaracháin agus "
"`list_editable` á n-úsáid agat (:ticket: `34991`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 where checkboxes in the admin would be "
"centered on narrower screen widths (:ticket:`34994`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 áit a mbeadh boscaí seiceála sa riarachán "
"dírithe ar leithead scáileáin níos cúnga (:ticket: `34994`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused a crash of querysets with "
"aggregations on MariaDB when the ``ONLY_FULL_GROUP_BY`` SQL mode was enabled "
"(:ticket:`34992`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste ceisteanna le "
"comhiomlánaithe ar MariaDB nuair a cumasaíodh an modh SQL "
"`ONLY_FULL_GROUP_BY`` (:ticket: `34992`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 where the admin's read-only password widget "
"and some help texts were incorrectly aligned at tablet widths "
"(:ticket:`34982`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 nuair a rinneadh giuirléid pasfhocal léite "
"amháin an riaracháin agus roinnt téacsanna cabhrach ailínithe go mícheart ag "
"leithead táibléad (:ticket: `34982`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2 that caused a migration crash on SQLite "
"when altering unsupported ``Meta.db_table_comment`` (:ticket:`35006`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste imirce ar "
"SQLite agus é ag athrú ``Meta.db_Table_Comment`` (:ticket: `35006`) gan "
"tacaíocht."

msgid "Django 4.2.9 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 4.2.9"

msgid "*January 2, 2024*"
msgstr "*2 Eanáir, 2024*"

msgid "Django 4.2.9 fixes a bug in 4.2.8."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 4.2.9 fabht i 4.2.8."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 4.2.8 where admin fields on the same line could "
"overflow the page and become non-interactive (:ticket:`35012`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 4.2.8 áit a bhféadfadh réimsí riaracháin ar an "
"líne chéanna an leathanach a shárú agus a bheith neamh-idirghníomhach "
"(:ticket: `35012`)."

msgid "Django 5.0 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoileadh Django 5.0"

msgid "Welcome to Django 5.0!"
msgstr "Fáilte go dtí Django 5.0!"

msgid ""
"These release notes cover the :ref:`new features <whats-new-5.0>`, as well "
"as some :ref:`backwards incompatible changes <backwards-incompatible-5.0>` "
"you'll want to be aware of when upgrading from Django 4.2 or earlier. "
"We've :ref:`begun the deprecation process for some features <deprecated-"
"features-5.0>`."
msgstr ""
"Clúdaíonn na nótaí scaoilte seo na:ref: `gnéithe nua <whats-new-5.0>`, chomh "
"maith le roinnt athruithe: ref: `athruithe neamh-chomhoiriúnacha ar "
"chúl<backwards-incompatible-5.0>` a mbeidh tú ag iarraidh a bheith ar an "
"eolas fúthu agus tú ag uasghrádú ó Django 4.2 nó níos luaithe. <deprecated-"
"features-5.0>We've:ref: `thosaigh an próiseas díghabhála do roinnt gnéithe `."

msgid ""
"Django 5.0 supports Python 3.10, 3.11, and 3.12. We **highly recommend** and "
"only officially support the latest release of each series."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn Django 5.0 le Python 3.10, 3.11, agus 3.12. Molaimid** go hard** "
"agus ní thacaímid go hoifigiúil ach leis an scaoileadh is déanaí de gach "
"sraith."

msgid "The Django 4.2.x series is the last to support Python 3.8 and 3.9."
msgstr ""
"Is é an tsraith Django 4.2.x an ceann deireanach a thacaíonn le Python 3.8 "
"agus 3.9."

msgid ""
"Following the release of Django 5.0, we suggest that third-party app authors "
"drop support for all versions of Django prior to 4.2. At that time, you "
"should be able to run your package's tests using ``python -Wd`` so that "
"deprecation warnings appear. After making the deprecation warning fixes, "
"your app should be compatible with Django 5.0."
msgstr ""
"Tar éis Django 5.0 a scaoileadh, molaimid go scaoilfidh údair aip tríú "
"páirtí tacaíocht do gach leagan de Django roimh 4.2. Ag an am sin, ba cheart "
"go mbeadh tú in ann tástálacha do phacáiste a reáchtáil ag baint úsáide as "
"`python -Wd`` ionas go mbeidh rabhaidh dífhabhtaithe le feiceáil. Tar éis "
"duit na socruithe rabhaidh díghrádaithe a dhéanamh, ba chóir go mbeadh d'aip "
"comhoiriúnach le Django 5.0."

msgid "What's new in Django 5.0"
msgstr "Cad atá nua i Django 5.0"

msgid "Facet filters in the admin"
msgstr "Scagairí facet sa riarachán"

msgid ""
"Facet counts are now shown for applied filters in the admin changelist when "
"toggled on via the UI. This behavior can be changed via the "
"new :attr:`.ModelAdmin.show_facets` attribute. For more information "
"see :ref:`facet-filters`."
msgstr ""
"Taispeántar comhaireamh gnéithe anois le haghaidh scagairí feidhme sa liosta "
"athraithe riaracháin nuair a dhéantar iad a thosú tríd an gComhéadan Is "
"féidir an t-iompar seo a athrú tríd an tréith nua:attr: "
"`.modeladmin.show_facets`. Le haghaidh tuilleadh faisnéise féach:ref: `facet-"
"filters`."

msgid "Simplified templates for form field rendering"
msgstr "Teimpléid shimplithe le haghaidh rindreáil réimse"

msgid ""
"Django 5.0 introduces the concept of a field group, and field group "
"templates. This simplifies rendering of the related elements of a Django "
"form field such as its label, widget, help text, and errors."
msgstr ""
"Tugann Django 5.0 coincheap grúpa allamuigh isteach, agus teimpléid grúpa "
"allamuigh. Déanann sé seo rindreáil na n-eilimintí gaolmhara de réimse "
"foirme Django mar a lipéad, giuirléid, téacs cabhrach agus earráidí a "
"shimpliú."

msgid "For example, the template below:"
msgstr "Mar shampla, an teimpléad thíos:"

msgid "Can now be simplified to:"
msgstr "Is féidir é a shimpliú anois go:"

msgid ""
":meth:`~django.forms.BoundField.as_field_group` renders fields with the "
"``\"django/forms/field.html\"`` template by default and can be customized on "
"a per-project, per-field, or per-request basis. See :ref:`reusable-field-"
"group-templates`."
msgstr ""
":meth: `~django.forms.BoundField.as_Field_Group` réimsí a léiriú leis an "
"teimpléad ``” django/forms/field.html “`de réir réamhshocraithe agus is "
"féidir iad a shaincheapadh ar bhonn in aghaidh an tionscadail, in aghaidh an "
"réimse nó in aghaidh iarratais. Féach:ref: `teimpléid grúpaí-athúsáidteacha'."

msgid "Database-computed default values"
msgstr "Luachanna réamhshocraithe ríofa bunachar sonraí"

msgid ""
"The new :attr:`Field.db_default <django.db.models.Field.db_default>` "
"parameter sets a database-computed default value. For example::"
msgstr ""
"<django.db.models.Field.db_default>Socraíonn an paraiméadar nua:attr: "
"`Field.db_default `luach réamhshocraithe ríofa bunachar sonraí. Mar shampla::"

msgid "Database generated model field"
msgstr "Réimse samhail a ghintear bunachar"

msgid ""
"The new :class:`~django.db.models.GeneratedField` allows creation of "
"database generated columns. This field can be used on all supported database "
"backends to create a field that is always computed from other fields. For "
"example::"
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn an nua:class: `~django.db.Models.GeneratedField` colúin a ghintear "
"bunachar sonraí a chruthú. Is féidir an réimse seo a úsáid ar gach cúltaca "
"bunachar sonraí tacaithe chun réimse a chruthú a ríomhtar i gcónaí ó réimsí "
"eile. Mar shampla::"

msgid "More options for declaring field choices"
msgstr "Tuilleadh roghanna chun roghanna allamuigh"

msgid ""
":attr:`.Field.choices` *(for model fields)* and :attr:`.ChoiceField.choices` "
"*(for form fields)* allow for more flexibility when declaring their values. "
"In previous versions of Django, ``choices`` should either be a list of 2-"
"tuples, or an :ref:`field-choices-enum-types` subclass, but the latter "
"required accessing the ``.choices`` attribute to provide the values in the "
"expected form::"
msgstr ""
":attr: `.Field.Choices` * (do réimsí samhail) * agus:attr: "
"`.choicefield.choices` * (le haghaidh réimsí foirme) * ceadaíonn níos mó "
"solúbthachta agus a gcuid luachanna á dhearbhú. I leaganacha roimhe seo de "
"Django, ba chóir go mbeadh “roghanna” ina liosta de 2-tuples, nó fo-aicme: "
"`field-choices-enum-types', ach d'éilíonn an dara ceann rochtain a fháil ar "
"an tréith ``.choices`` chun na luachanna a sholáthar sa fhoirm a bhfuil súil "
"leis:"

msgid ""
"Django 5.0 adds support for accepting a mapping or a callable instead of an "
"iterable, and also no longer requires ``.choices`` to be used directly to "
"expand :ref:`enumeration types <field-choices-enum-types>`::"
msgstr ""
"<field-choices-enum-types>Cuireann Django 5.0 tacaíocht le glacadh le mapáil "
"nó le glaoch in ionad athraitheach, agus ní éilíonn freisin go n-úsáidfear "
"`.choices`` go ndéanfaí úsáid go díreach chun leathnaithe:ref: `cineálacha "
"áireamh `::"

msgid ""
"Under the hood the provided ``choices`` are normalized into a list of 2-"
"tuples as the canonical form whenever the ``choices`` value is updated. For "
"more information, please check the :ref:`model field reference on choices "
"<field-choices>`."
msgstr ""
"Faoin gcochall déantar na “roghanna” a sholáthraítear a normalú i liosta de "
"dhá thúpla mar an fhoirm chanónach aon uair a nuashonraítear an luach "
"``roghnaí`. <field-choices>Le haghaidh tuilleadh faisnéise, seiceáil le do "
"thoil an:ref: `tagairt réimse samhail ar roghanna `."

msgid ""
"The new :meth:`.AdminSite.get_log_entries` method allows customizing the "
"queryset for the site's listed log entries."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an modh nua:meth: `.adminsite.get_log_entries` an tacar fiosrúcháin "
"a shaincheapadh d'iontrálacha logála liostaithe an láithreáin."

msgid ""
"The ``django.contrib.admin.AllValuesFieldListFilter``, "
"``ChoicesFieldListFilter``, ``RelatedFieldListFilter``, and "
"``RelatedOnlyFieldListFilter`` admin filters now handle multi-valued query "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"Láimhseálann na scagairí riaracháin "
"``django.contrib.admin.allvaluesFieldListFilter``, "
"`RelatedFieldListFilter``, agus ``RelatedFieldListFilter``, agus "
"``RelatedOnlyFieldListFilter`` paraiméadair fiosrúcháin illuachmhara anois."

msgid "``XRegExp`` is upgraded from version 3.2.0 to 5.1.1."
msgstr "Déantar ``XregExp`` a uasghrádú ó leagan 3.2.0 go 5.1.1."

msgid ""
"The new :meth:`.AdminSite.get_model_admin` method returns an admin class for "
"the given model class."
msgstr ""
"Tugann an modh nua:meth: `.adminsite.get_model_admin` rang riaracháin ar ais "
"don rang samhail ar leith."

msgid ""
"Properties in :attr:`.ModelAdmin.list_display` now support ``boolean`` "
"attribute."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn airíonna in:attr: `.modeladmin.list_display` anois le tréith "
"``boolean``."

msgid "jQuery is upgraded from version 3.6.4 to 3.7.1."
msgstr "tá jQuery uasghrádaithe ó leagan 3.6.4 go 3.7.1."

msgid ""
"The default iteration count for the PBKDF2 password hasher is increased from "
"600,000 to 720,000."
msgstr ""
"Méadaítear an líon athraithe réamhshocraithe don hasher pasfhocal PBKDF2 ó "
"600,000 go 720,000."

msgid ""
"The new asynchronous functions are now provided, using an ``a`` "
"prefix: :func:`django.contrib.auth.aauthenticate`, :func:`~.django.contrib.auth.aget_user`, :func:`~.django.contrib.auth.alogin`, :func:`~.django.contrib.auth.alogout`, "
"and :func:`~.django.contrib.auth.aupdate_session_auth_hash`."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear na feidhmeanna asincrónacha nua ar fáil anois, ag baint úsáide as "
"réimír ``a``: :func: `django.contrib.auth.aautenticate`, :func: "
"`~.django.contrib.auth.aget_user`, :func: "
"`~.django.contrib.auth.alogin`, :func: "
"`~.django.contrib.contrib.auth.alogin` b.auth.alogout`, agus:func: "
"`~.django.contrib.auth.aupdate_session_auth_hash`."

msgid ""
"``AuthenticationMiddleware`` now adds an :meth:`.HttpRequest.auser` "
"asynchronous method that returns the currently logged-in user."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann ``AuthenticationMiddleWare`` anois:meth: `.httpRequest.auser` modh "
"asincrónach a thugann an t-úsáideoir logáilte isteach faoi láthair ar ais."

msgid ""
"The new :func:`django.contrib.auth.hashers.acheck_password` asynchronous "
"function and :meth:`.AbstractBaseUser.acheck_password` method allow "
"asynchronous checking of user passwords."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an feidhm asincrónach nua:func: "
"`django.contrib.auth.hashers.acheck_password` agus: meth: "
"`.abstractBaseUser.acheck_password` seiceáil asincrónach pasfhocail "
"úsáideora."

msgid ""
":meth:`.QuerySet.prefetch_related` now supports "
"prefetching :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.fields.GenericForeignKey` "
"with non-homogeneous set of results."
msgstr ""
":meth: Tacaíonn `.querySet.Prefetch_Related` anois le prefetching:class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Fields.GenericForeignKey` le sraith torthaí "
"neamh-aonchineálach."

msgid ""
"The new :class:`ClosestPoint() "
"<django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.ClosestPoint>` function returns a 2-"
"dimensional point on the geometry that is closest to another geometry."
msgstr ""
"Tugann an fheidhm nua:class: `closestPoint () "
"<django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.ClosestPoint>`pointe dhíthoiseach ar "
"an geoiméadracht atá is gaire do ghéimseadracht eile."

msgid ""
":ref:`GIS aggregates <gis-aggregation-functions>` now support the ``filter`` "
"argument."
msgstr ""
":ref: Tacaíonn comhiomlánacha `GIS `anois leis an argóint ``<gis-aggregation-"
"functions>scagair``."

msgid "Support for GDAL 3.7 and GEOS 3.12 is added."
msgstr "Cuirtear tacaíocht do GDAL 3.7 agus GEOS 3.12 leis."

msgid ""
"The new :meth:`.GEOSGeometry.equals_identical` method allows point-wise "
"equivalence checking of geometries."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an modh nua:meth: `.geosgeometry.equals_identical` seiceáil "
"coibhéasachta pointe ciallmhar geoiméadracha."

msgid ""
"The new :meth:`.MessagesTestMixin.assertMessages` assertion method allows "
"testing :mod:`~django.contrib.messages` added to a :class:`response "
"<django.http.HttpResponse>`."
msgstr ""
"<django.http.HttpResponse>Ligeann an modh dearbhaithe nua:meth: "
"`.messagestestMixin.assertMessages` tástáil: mod: `~django.contrib.messages` "
"curtha le a:class: `response `."

msgid ""
"The new :attr:`~.ExclusionConstraint.violation_error_code` attribute "
"of :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.constraints.ExclusionConstraint` allows "
"customizing the ``code`` of ``ValidationError`` raised during :ref:`model "
"validation <validating-objects>`."
msgstr ""
"<validating-objects>Ceadaíonn an tréith nua:attr: "
"`~.EXCLUSIONCONSTRAINT.VIOLATION_ERROR_CODE` de:class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.restricints.ExclusionConstraint` an `cód ``de "
"`ValidationError`` a ardaíodh trí:ref: `bailíochtú samhail `a shaincheapadh."

msgid "Asynchronous views"
msgstr "Tuairimí asincrónacha"

msgid ""
"Under ASGI, ``http.disconnect`` events are now handled. This allows views to "
"perform any necessary cleanup if a client disconnects before the response is "
"generated. See :ref:`async-handling-disconnect` for more details."
msgstr ""
"Faoi ASGI, déantar imeachtaí `http.disconnect`` a láimhseáil anois. Ligeann "
"sé seo tuairimí aon ghlanadh riachtanach a dhéanamh má dhícheanglaíonn "
"cliant sula ngintear an freagra. Féach: ref: `async-handling-disconnect` le "
"haghaidh tuilleadh sonraí."

msgid ""
"The following decorators now support wrapping asynchronous view functions:"
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn na maisitheoirí seo a leanas anois le feidhmeanna amhairc "
"asincrónacha fillte:"

msgid ":func:`~django.views.decorators.cache.cache_control`"
msgstr ":func: `~django.views.decorators.cache.cache_rial`"

msgid ":func:`~django.views.decorators.cache.never_cache`"
msgstr ":func: `~django.views.decorators.cache.never_cache`"

msgid ":func:`~django.views.decorators.common.no_append_slash`"
msgstr ":func: `~django.views.decorators.common.no_append_slash`"

msgid ":func:`~django.views.decorators.csrf.csrf_exempt`"
msgstr ":func: `~django.views.decorators.csrf.csrf_exempt`"

msgid ":func:`~django.views.decorators.csrf.csrf_protect`"
msgstr ":func: `~django.views.decorators.csrf.csrf_protect`"

msgid ":func:`~django.views.decorators.csrf.ensure_csrf_cookie`"
msgstr ":func: `~django.views.decorators.csrf.ensure_csrf_cookie`"

msgid ":func:`~django.views.decorators.csrf.requires_csrf_token`"
msgstr ":func: `~django.views.decorators.csrf.requres_csrf_token`"

msgid ":func:`~django.views.decorators.debug.sensitive_variables`"
msgstr ":func: `~django.views.decorators.debug.sensitive_athraitheoir`"

msgid ":func:`~django.views.decorators.debug.sensitive_post_parameters`"
msgstr ":func: `~django.views.decorators.debug.sensitive_post_pharaiméadair`"

msgid ":func:`~django.views.decorators.gzip.gzip_page`"
msgstr ":func: `~django.views.decorators.gzip.gzip_page`"

msgid ":func:`~django.views.decorators.http.condition`"
msgstr ":func: `~django.views.decorators.http.condition`"

msgid "``conditional_page()``"
msgstr "``leathanach_coinníollacha () ``"

msgid ":func:`~django.views.decorators.http.etag`"
msgstr ":func: `~django.views.decorators.http.etag`"

msgid ":func:`~django.views.decorators.http.last_modified`"
msgstr ":func: `~django.views.decorators.http.last_modified`"

msgid ":func:`~django.views.decorators.http.require_http_methods`"
msgstr ":func: `~django.views.decorators.http.requerim_http_methods`"

msgid ":func:`~django.views.decorators.http.require_GET`"
msgstr ":func: `~django.views.decorators.http.requeri_get`"

msgid ":func:`~django.views.decorators.http.require_POST`"
msgstr ":func: `~django.views.decorators.http.requeri_post`"

msgid ":func:`~django.views.decorators.http.require_safe`"
msgstr ":func: `~django.views.decorators.http.requeri_sábháilte`"

msgid ":func:`~django.views.decorators.vary.vary_on_cookie`"
msgstr ":func: `~django.views.decorators.vary.vary_on_cookie`"

msgid ":func:`~django.views.decorators.vary.vary_on_headers`"
msgstr ":func: `~django.views.decorators.vary.vary_on_headers`"

msgid "``xframe_options_deny()``"
msgstr "``xframe_options_deny () ``"

msgid "``xframe_options_sameorigin()``"
msgstr "``xframe_options_sameorigin () ``"

msgid "``xframe_options_exempt()``"
msgstr "``xframe_options_díolmhaithe () ``"

msgid ""
":func:`~django.views.decorators.debug.sensitive_variables` "
"and :func:`~django.views.decorators.debug.sensitive_post_parameters` can now "
"be used with asynchronous functions."
msgstr ""
":func: `~django.views.decorators.debug.sensitive_variables` agus:func: "
"`~django.views.decorators.debug.sensitive_post_parameters` is féidir a úsáid "
"anois le feidhmeanna asincrónacha."

msgid ""
":meth:`.File.open` now passes all positional (``*args``) and keyword "
"arguments (``**kwargs``) to Python's built-in :func:`python:open`."
msgstr ""
":meth: `.file.open` téann anois gach argóint seasmhach (`*args``) agus "
"eochairfhocal (``**kwargs ``) chuig Python ionsuite: func: `python:open`."

msgid ""
"The new :attr:`~django.forms.URLField.assume_scheme` argument "
"for :class:`~django.forms.URLField` allows specifying a default URL scheme."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn an argóint nua:attr: `~django.forms.urlfield.assume_scheme` "
"do:class: `~django.forms.urlfield` scéim réamhshocraithe URL a shonrú."

msgid "In order to improve accessibility, the following changes are made:"
msgstr ""
"D'fhonn inrochtaineacht a fheabhsú, déantar na hathruithe seo a leanas:"

msgid ""
"Form fields now include the ``aria-describedby`` HTML attribute to enable "
"screen readers to associate form fields with their help text."
msgstr ""
"Cuimsíonn réimsí foirme an tréith HTML ``aria-describedby`` anois chun a "
"chumas léitheoirí scáileáin réimsí foirme a cheangal lena dtéacs cabhrach."

msgid ""
"Invalid form fields now include the ``aria-invalid=\"true\"`` HTML attribute."
msgstr ""
"Cuimsíonn réimsí foirme neamhbhailí an tréith HTML ``aria-invalid=\"true\"`` "
"anois."

msgid "Support and translations for the Uyghur language are now available."
msgstr "Tá tacaíocht agus aistriúcháin don teanga Uighur ar fáil anois."

msgid ""
"Serialization of functions decorated with :func:`functools.cache` "
"or :func:`functools.lru_cache` is now supported without the need to write a "
"custom serializer."
msgstr ""
"Tacaítear anois le sraith feidhmeanna maisithe le: func: `functools.cache` "
"nó: func: `functools.lru_cache` gan gá le serializer saincheaptha a scríobh."

msgid ""
"The new ``create_defaults`` argument of :meth:`.QuerySet.update_or_create` "
"and :meth:`.QuerySet.aupdate_or_create` methods allows specifying a "
"different field values for the create operation."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn an argóint nua ``create_defaults`` de:meth: "
"`.queryset.update_or_create` agus:meth: `.queryset.AUPDate_or_create` "
"luachanna réimse difriúla a shonrú don oibríocht chruthaigh."

msgid ""
"The new ``violation_error_code`` attribute "
"of :class:`~django.db.models.BaseConstraint`, :class:`~django.db.models.CheckConstraint`, "
"and :class:`~django.db.models.UniqueConstraint` allows customizing the "
"``code`` of ``ValidationError`` raised during :ref:`model validation "
"<validating-objects>`."
msgstr ""
"<validating-objects>Ceadaíonn an tréith nua ``violation_error_code`` "
"de:class: `~django.db.models.baseConstraint`, :class: "
"`~django.db.models.checkConstraint`, agus:class: "
"`~Django.db.Models.UniqueConstraint` an `code`` de `ValidationError`` a "
"shaincheapadh le linn: ref: `bailíochtú samhail `."

msgid ""
"The :ref:`force_insert <ref-models-force-insert>` argument "
"of :meth:`.Model.save` now allows specifying a tuple of parent classes that "
"must be forced to be inserted."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn an argóint:ref: `force_insert <ref-models-force-insert>`de:meth: "
"`.model.save` anois tiúpla d'aicmí tuismitheoirí a shonrú ar chaithfear "
"iallach a chur isteach."

msgid ""
":meth:`.QuerySet.bulk_create` and :meth:`.QuerySet.abulk_create` methods now "
"set the primary key on each model instance when the ``update_conflicts`` "
"parameter is enabled (if the database supports it)."
msgstr ""
":meth: `.queryset.bulk_create` agus:meth: `.queryset.abulk_create` socraíonn "
"modhanna an príomh-eochair anois ar gach samhail nuair a chumasaítear an "
"paraiméadar ``update_conflicts`` (má thacaíonn an bunachar sonraí leis)."

msgid ""
"The new :attr:`.UniqueConstraint.nulls_distinct` attribute allows "
"customizing the treatment of ``NULL`` values on PostgreSQL 15+."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an tréith nua:attr: `.UniqueConstraint.NULLS_Distinct` cóireáil "
"luachanna ``NULL`` a shaincheapadh ar PostgreSQL 15+."

msgid ""
"The new :func:`~django.shortcuts.aget_object_or_404` "
"and :func:`~django.shortcuts.aget_list_or_404` asynchronous shortcuts allow "
"asynchronous getting objects."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn an nua:func: `~django.shortcuts.aget_object_or_404` agus:func: "
"`~django.shortcuts.aget_list_or_404` aicearraí asyncrónach rudaí a fháil "
"asincrónach."

msgid ""
"The new :func:`~django.db.models.aprefetch_related_objects` function allows "
"asynchronous prefetching of model instances."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an fheidhm nua:func: `~django.db.models.aprefetch_related_objects` "
"réamhfhaighdeach asincrónach cásanna samhail."

msgid ""
":meth:`.QuerySet.aiterator` now supports previous calls to "
"``prefetch_related()``."
msgstr ""
":meth: Tacaíonn `.querySet.Aiterator` anois le glaonna roimhe seo chuig "
"``prefetch_related () ``."

msgid ""
"On MariaDB 10.7+, ``UUIDField`` is now created as ``UUID`` column rather "
"than ``CHAR(32)`` column. See the migration guide above for more details "
"on :ref:`migrating-uuidfield`."
msgstr ""
"Ar MariaDB 10.7+, cruthaítear ``UUIDField`` anois mar cholún ``UUID`` "
"seachas colún ``CHAR (32) ``. Féach an treoir imirce thuas le haghaidh "
"tuilleadh sonraí ar:ref: `migrating-uuidfield`."

msgid ""
"Django now supports `oracledb`_ version 1.3.2 or higher. Support for "
"``cx_Oracle`` is deprecated as of this release and will be removed in Django "
"6.0."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn Django anois le leagan `oracledb`_ 1.3.2 nó níos airde. Tá "
"tacaíocht do `CX_Oracle`` díluaite amhail an scaoileadh seo agus bainfear é "
"i Django 6.0."

msgid ""
"The new :attr:`django.core.paginator.Paginator.error_messages` argument "
"allows customizing the error messages raised by :meth:`.Paginator.page`."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an argóint nua:attr: "
"`django.core.paginator.paginator.error_messages` na teachtaireachtaí "
"earráide arna ardú arga:meth: `.paginator.page` a shaincheapadh."

msgid ""
"The new :meth:`.Signal.asend` and :meth:`.Signal.asend_robust` methods allow "
"asynchronous signal dispatch. Signal receivers may be synchronous or "
"asynchronous, and will be automatically adapted to the correct calling style."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn na modhanna nua:meth: `.signal.asend` agus:meth: "
"`.signal.asend_robust` seoladh comhartha asincrónach. D'fhéadfadh glacadóirí "
"comhartha a bheith sioncrónach nó asincrónach, agus cuirfear iad in oiriúint "
"go huathoibríoch don stíl ghlaonna ceart."

msgid ""
"The new :tfilter:`escapeseq` template filter applies :tfilter:`escape` to "
"each element of a sequence."
msgstr ""
"Baineann an scagaire teimpléad nua:tfilter: `escapeseq`: tfilter: `escape` "
"le gach eilimint de sheicheamh."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.test.Client` and :class:`~django.test.AsyncClient` now "
"provide asynchronous methods, using an ``a`` "
"prefix: :meth:`~django.test.Client.asession`, :meth:`~django.test.Client.alogin`, :meth:`~django.test.Client.aforce_login`, "
"and :meth:`~django.test.Client.alogout`."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.test.client` agus:class: `~django.test.asyncclient` "
"modhanna asincrónacha ar fáil anois, ag baint úsáide as réimír ``a``:: meth: "
"`~django.test.client.asession`, :meth: "
"`~django.test.client.alogintest`, :meth: `~Django....client.aforce_login`, "
"agus:meth: `~django.test.client.aloGout`."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.test.AsyncClient` now supports the ``follow`` parameter."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.test.asyncClient` tacaíonn anois leis an paraiméadar "
"``follow``."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.test.runner.DiscoverRunner` now allows showing the duration "
"of the slowest tests using the :option:`test --durations` option (available "
"on Python 3.12+)."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.test.runner.DiscoverRunner` ceadaíonn fad na dtástálacha is "
"moille a thaispeáint anois ag baint úsáide as an rogha: `test --durations` "
"(ar fáil ar Python 3.12+)."

msgid ""
"The new ``offset`` argument "
"of :class:`~django.core.validators.StepValueValidator` allows specifying an "
"offset for valid values."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an argóint nua ``offset`` de:class: "
"`~django.core.validators.stepvalueValidator` fhritháireamh a shonrú do "
"luachanna bailí."

msgid "Backwards incompatible changes in 5.0"
msgstr "Athruithe neamh-chomhoiriúnacha ar ais i 5.0"

msgid ""
"``DatabaseFeatures.supports_expression_defaults`` should be set to ``False`` "
"if the database doesn't support using database functions as defaults."
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir ``DatabaseFeatures.supports_expression_defaults`` a shocrú go "
"``False`` mura dtacaíonn an bunachar sonraí le feidhmeanna bunachar sonraí a "
"úsáid mar réamhshocraithe."

msgid ""
"``DatabaseFeatures.supports_default_keyword_in_insert`` should be set to "
"``False`` if the database doesn't support the ``DEFAULT`` keyword in "
"``INSERT`` queries."
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir ``databaseFeatures.supports_default_keyword_in_insert`` a shocrú go "
"``False`` mura dtacaíonn an bunachar sonraí leis an eochairfhocal "
"``DEFAULT`` i gceisteanna ``INSERT``."

msgid ""
"``DatabaseFeatures.supports_default_keyword_in_bulk_insert`` should be set "
"to ``False`` if the database doesn't support the ``DEFAULT`` keyword in bulk "
"``INSERT`` queries."
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir ``databaseFeatures.supports_default_keyword_in_bulk_insert`` a "
"shocrú go ``False`` mura dtacaíonn an bunachar sonraí leis an eochairfhocal "
"``DEFAULT`` i mórcheisteanna ``INSERT``."

msgid "Support for GDAL 2.2 and 2.3 is removed."
msgstr "Baintear tacaíocht do GDAL 2.2 agus 2.3."

msgid "Support for GEOS 3.6 and 3.7 is removed."
msgstr "Baintear tacaíocht do GEOS 3.6 agus 3.7."

msgid ""
"The ``django.contrib.sitemaps.ping_google()`` function and the "
"``ping_google`` management command are removed as the Google Sitemaps ping "
"endpoint is deprecated and will be removed in January 2024."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an fheidhm ``django.contrib.sitemaps.ping_google () ``agus an t-"
"ordú bainistíochta `ping_google`` de réir mar a dhéantar críochphointe ping "
"Google Sitemaps as dul in iúl agus bainfear é i mí Eanáir 2024."

msgid ""
"The ``django.contrib.sitemaps.SitemapNotFound`` exception class is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an rang eisceachta ``Django.Contrib.SiteMaps.SiteMapNotFound``."

msgid "Dropped support for MySQL < 8.0.11"
msgstr "Tacaíocht titim do MySQL < 8.0.11"

msgid ""
"Support for pre-releases of MySQL 8.0.x series is removed. Django 5.0 "
"supports MySQL 8.0.11 and higher."
msgstr ""
"Baintear tacaíocht do réamh-eisiúintí de shraith MySQL 8.0.x. Tacaíonn "
"Django 5.0 le MySQL 8.0.11 agus níos airde."

msgid ""
"Using ``create_defaults__exact`` may now be required with "
"``QuerySet.update_or_create()``"
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh go mbeadh gá anois ag baint úsáide as ``create_defaults__exact`` "
"le ``QuerySet.Update_or_create () ``"

msgid ""
":meth:`.QuerySet.update_or_create` now supports the parameter "
"``create_defaults``. As a consequence, any models that have a field named "
"``create_defaults`` that are used with an ``update_or_create()`` should "
"specify the field in the lookup with ``create_defaults__exact``."
msgstr ""
":meth: Tacaíonn `.queryset.update_or_create` anois leis an bparaiméadar "
"``create_defaults``. Mar thoradh air sin, ba cheart d'aon mhúnlaí a bhfuil "
"réimse acu darb ainm ``create_defaults`` a úsáidtear le ``update_or_create "
"() ``an réimse sa chuardach le `create_defaults__exact`` a shonrú."

msgid "Migrating existing ``UUIDField`` on MariaDB 10.7+"
msgstr "Ag aistriú ``UUIDField`` atá ann cheana ar MariaDB 10.7+"

msgid ""
"On MariaDB 10.7+, ``UUIDField`` is now created as ``UUID`` column rather "
"than ``CHAR(32)`` column. As a consequence, any ``UUIDField`` created in "
"Django < 5.0 should be replaced with a ``UUIDField`` subclass backed by "
"``CHAR(32)``::"
msgstr ""
"Ar MariaDB 10.7+, cruthaítear ``UUIDField`` anois mar cholún ``UUID`` "
"seachas colún ``CHAR (32) ``. Mar thoradh air sin, ba cheart fo-aicme "
"``UUidField`` a thacaíonn ``CHAR (32) ``a chur in ionad aon ``UUIDField`` a "
"cruthaíodh i Django < 5.0:"

msgid ""
"Running the :djadmin:`makemigrations` command will generate a migration "
"containing a no-op ``AlterField`` operation."
msgstr ""
"Ag rith an t-ordú:djadmin: `makemigrations` ginfidh imirce ina bhfuil "
"oibríocht ``Alterfield` gan op."

msgid ""
"The ``instance`` argument of the undocumented "
"``BaseModelFormSet.save_existing()`` method is renamed to ``obj``."
msgstr ""
"Athainmnítear argóint ``instance`` an modh ``BaseModelFormSet.save_Existing "
"() ``neamhdhoiciméadaithe go ``obj``."

msgid "The undocumented ``django.contrib.admin.helpers.checkbox`` is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an ``django.contrib.admin.helpers.checkbox`` neamhdhoiciméadaithe."

msgid ""
"Integer fields are now validated as 64-bit integers on SQLite to match the "
"behavior of ``sqlite3``."
msgstr ""
"Déantar réimsí sláimhir a bhailíochtú anois mar shláimhreacha 64-giotán ar "
"SQLite chun iompar `sqlite3`` a mheaitseáil."

msgid ""
"The undocumented ``Query.annotation_select_mask`` attribute is changed from "
"a set of strings to an ordered list of strings."
msgstr ""
"Athraítear an tréith ``Query.annotation_Select_Mask`` neamhdhoiciméadaithe ó "
"shraith teaghráin go liosta ordaithe teaghráin."

msgid ""
"``ImageField.update_dimension_fields()`` is no longer called on the "
"``post_init`` signal if ``width_field`` and ``height_field`` are not set."
msgstr ""
"Ní ghlaofar ``imagefield.update_dimension_fields () ``ar an gcomhartha "
"``post_init`` a thuilleadh mura socraítear ``width_field`` agus "
"``height_field``."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.db.models.functions.Now` database function now uses "
"``LOCALTIMESTAMP`` instead of ``CURRENT_TIMESTAMP`` on Oracle."
msgstr ""
":class: `~Django.db.Models.Functions.Now` úsáideann feidhm bunachar sonraí "
"``LOCALTIMESTAMP`` anois in ionad ``CURRENT_TIMESTAMP`` ar Oracle."

msgid ""
":attr:`.AdminSite.site_header` is now rendered in a ``<div>`` tag instead of "
"``<h1>``. Screen reader users rely on heading elements for navigation within "
"a page. Having two ``<h1>`` elements was confusing and the site header "
"wasn't helpful as it is repeated on all pages."
msgstr ""
"<div><h1>:attr: `.adminsite.site_header` a rindreáiltear anois i gclib ```` "
"in ionad ````. Tá úsáideoirí léitheoirí scáileáin ag brath ar eilimintí "
"ceannteidil le haghaidh nasclean Bhí dhá ghné <h1>```a bheith mearbhall agus "
"ní raibh ceanntásc an láithreáin cabhrach mar go ndéantar é a athdhéanamh ar "
"gach leathanach."

msgid ""
"In order to improve accessibility, the admin's main content area and header "
"content area are now rendered in a ``<main>`` and ``<header>`` tag instead "
"of ``<div>``."
msgstr ""
"<div>D'fhonn inrochtaineacht a fheabhsú, déantar príomhlimistéar ábhair an "
"riaracháin agus limistéar ábhar ceanntásc a léiriú anois i gclib <main>```` "
"agus ```` <header>``in ionad`` `."

msgid ""
"On databases without native support for the SQL ``XOR`` operator, ``^`` as "
"the exclusive or (``XOR``) operator now returns rows that are matched by an "
"odd number of operands rather than exactly one operand. This is consistent "
"with the behavior of MySQL, MariaDB, and Python."
msgstr ""
"Ar bhunachair sonraí gan tacaíocht dhúchasach don oibreoir SQL ``XOR``, "
"filleann ``^`` mar oibreoir eisiach nó (``XOR``) sraitheanna anois atá "
"comhoiriúnaithe le líon aisteach oibrithe seachas oibrand amháin go díreach. "
"Tá sé seo ag teacht le hiompar MySQL, MariaDB, agus Python."

msgid ""
"The minimum supported version of ``asgiref`` is increased from 3.6.0 to "
"3.7.0."
msgstr "Méadaítear an leagan íosta tacaithe de `asgiref`` ó 3.6.0 go 3.7.0."

msgid ""
"The minimum supported version of ``selenium`` is increased from 3.8.0 to "
"4.8.0."
msgstr "Méadaítear an leagan íosta tacaithe de `selenium`` ó 3.8.0 go 4.8.0."

msgid ""
"The ``AlreadyRegistered`` and ``NotRegistered`` exceptions are moved from "
"``django.contrib.admin.sites`` to ``django.contrib.admin.exceptions``."
msgstr ""
"Aistrítear na heisceachtaí ``AlreadyRegistered`` agus `Notregistered`` ó "
"``django.contrib.admin.sites`` go `django.contrib.admin.exceptions``."

msgid ""
"The minimum supported version of SQLite is increased from 3.21.0 to 3.27.0."
msgstr "Méadaítear an leagan íosta tacaithe de SQLite ó 3.21.0 go 3.27.0."

msgid "Support for ``cx_Oracle`` < 8.3 is removed."
msgstr "Baintear tacaíocht do ``CX_Oracle ``< 8.3."

msgid ""
"Executing SQL queries before the app registry has been fully populated now "
"raises :exc:`RuntimeWarning`."
msgstr ""
"Ardaíonn sé anois ceisteanna SQL a fhorghníomhú sula ndéantar clárlann na n-"
"aipeanna daonra go hiomlán anois:exc: `RuntimeWarning`."

msgid ""
":exc:`~django.core.exceptions.BadRequest` is raised for non-UTF-8 encoded "
"requests with the :mimetype:`application/x-www-form-urlencoded` content "
"type. See :rfc:`1866` for more details."
msgstr ""
": exc: Ardaítear `~django.core.exceptions.badRequest` le haghaidh iarratais "
"ionchódaithe neamh-UTF-8 leis an gcineál ábhair: mimetype: `application/x-"
"www-form-urlencoded`. Féach: RFC: `1866` le haghaidh tuilleadh sonraí."

msgid "The minimum supported version of ``colorama`` is increased to 0.4.6."
msgstr "Méadaítear an leagan íosta tacaithe de “colorama” go 0.4.6."

msgid "The minimum supported version of ``docutils`` is increased to 0.19."
msgstr "Méadaítear an leagan íosta tacaithe de `docutils` go 0.19."

msgid ""
"Filtering querysets against overflowing integer values now always returns an "
"empty queryset. As a consequence, you may need to use "
"``ExpressionWrapper()`` to :ref:`explicitly wrap <using-f-with-annotations>` "
"arithmetic against integer fields in such cases."
msgstr ""
"Tugann scagadh ceisteanna i gcoinne luachanna sláimhriúla atá ró-shlán anois "
"tacar ceisteanna folamh i gcónaí. <using-f-with-annotations>Mar thoradh air "
"sin, b'fhéidir go mbeidh ort ``ExpressionWrapper () ``a úsáid to:ref: "
"`uimhríocht a fhilleadh go sainráite `i gcoinne réimsí sláireach i gcásanna "
"den sórt sin."

msgid "Features deprecated in 5.0"
msgstr "Gnéithe atá díscríofa i 5.0"

msgid ""
"The ``DjangoDivFormRenderer`` and ``Jinja2DivFormRenderer`` transitional "
"form renderers are deprecated."
msgstr ""
"Tá na léiritheoirí foirme idirthréimhseacha ``DjangoDivFormRenderer`` agus "
"``Jinja2DivFormRenderer`` a dhíchur."

msgid ""
"Passing positional arguments ``name`` and ``violation_error_message`` "
"to :class:`~django.db.models.BaseConstraint` is deprecated in favor of "
"keyword-only arguments."
msgstr ""
"Tá argóintí seasaimh ``name`` agus ``violation_error_message`` a chur "
"chuig:class: `~django.db.models.baseConstraint` i bhfabhar argóintí "
"eochairfhocal amháin."

msgid ""
"``request`` is added to the signature of :meth:`.ModelAdmin.lookup_allowed`. "
"Support for ``ModelAdmin`` subclasses that do not accept this argument is "
"deprecated."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear ``request`` leis an síniú de:meth: `.modeladmin.lookup_allowed`. Tá "
"tacaíocht do fho-aicmí ``ModelAdmin`` nach nglacann leis an argóint seo "
"caite."

msgid ""
"The ``get_joining_columns()`` method of ``ForeignObject`` and "
"``ForeignObjectRel`` is deprecated. Starting with Django 6.0, "
"``django.db.models.sql.datastructures.Join`` will no longer fallback to "
"``get_joining_columns()``. Subclasses should implement "
"``get_joining_fields()`` instead."
msgstr ""
"Tá an modh ``get_joining_columns () ``de `ForeignObject`` agus "
"``ForeignObjectRel`` a dhíchur. Ag tosú le Django 6.0, ní thiocfaidh "
"``Django.db.Models.sql.DataStructures.join`` ar ais chuig "
"``get_joining_columns () ``a thuilleadh. Ba chóir go gcuirfeadh fo-ranganna "
"``get_joining_fields () ``a chur i bhfeidhm ina ionad."

msgid ""
"The ``ForeignObject.get_reverse_joining_columns()`` method is deprecated."
msgstr "Tá an modh ``ForeignObject.get_Reverse_Joining_Columns () ``a dhíchur."

msgid ""
"The default scheme for ``forms.URLField`` will change from ``\"http\"`` to "
"``\"https\"`` in Django 6.0. Set :setting:`FORMS_URLFIELD_ASSUME_HTTPS` "
"transitional setting to ``True`` to opt into assuming ``\"https\"`` during "
"the Django 5.x release cycle."
msgstr ""
"Athróidh an scéim réamhshocraithe do ``Forms.URLField`` ó ``\"http\"`` go "
"``\"https\"`` i Django 6.0. Socraigh: Socrú: `FORMS_URLFIELD_ASSUME_HTTPS` "
"socrú idirthréimhseach go ``True`` chun glacadh leis ``https\"`` le linn "
"timthriall scaoilte Django 5.x."

msgid "``FORMS_URLFIELD_ASSUME_HTTPS`` transitional setting is deprecated."
msgstr ""
"``FORMS_URLFIELD_ASSUME_HTTPS`` tá an socrú idirthréimhseach a dhíchur."

msgid ""
"Support for calling ``format_html()`` without passing args or kwargs is "
"deprecated."
msgstr ""
"Tá an tacaíocht chun glaoch ar ``format_html () ``gan args nó kwargs a rith "
"a chur as."

msgid ""
"Support for ``cx_Oracle`` is deprecated in favor of `oracledb`_ 1.3.2+ "
"Python driver."
msgstr ""
"Tá tacaíocht do `CX_Oracle`` a dhíchur i bhfabhar tiománaí Python "
"`oracledb`_ 1.3.2+."

msgid ""
"``DatabaseOperations.field_cast_sql()`` is deprecated in favor of "
"``DatabaseOperations.lookup_cast()``. Starting with Django 6.0, "
"``BuiltinLookup.process_lhs()`` will no longer call ``field_cast_sql()``. "
"Third-party database backends should implement ``lookup_cast()`` instead."
msgstr ""
"Táthar ag moladh ``DatabaseOperations.field_cast_sql()`` i bhfabhar "
"``DatabaseOperations.lookup_cast()``. Ag tosú le Django 6.0, ní thabharfar "
"``field_cast_sql()`` ar ``BuiltinLookup.process_lhs()`` a thuilleadh. Ba "
"cheart go gcuirfí ``lookup_cast()`` i bhfeidhm ina ionad sin d'innill "
"bhunachar sonraí tríú páirtí."

msgid ""
"The ``django.db.models.enums.ChoicesMeta`` metaclass is renamed to "
"``ChoicesType``."
msgstr ""
"Athainmnítear an metaclass ``Django.db.Models.Enums.ChoiceSmeta`` go "
"``ChoiceStype``."

msgid "The ``Prefetch.get_current_queryset()`` method is deprecated."
msgstr "Tá an modh ``Prefetch.get_current_querySet () ``díluachtaithe."

msgid ""
"The ``get_prefetch_queryset()`` method of related managers and descriptors "
"is deprecated. Starting with Django 6.0, ``get_prefetcher()`` and "
"``prefetch_related_objects()`` will no longer fallback to "
"``get_prefetch_queryset()``. Subclasses should implement "
"``get_prefetch_querysets()`` instead."
msgstr ""
"Tá an modh ``get_prefetch_queryset () ``bainisteoirí agus tuairiscí "
"gaolmhara a dhíchur. Ag tosú le Django 6.0, ní thiocfaidh ``get_prefetcher "
"() ``agus ``prefetch_related_objects ()`` ar ais chuig "
"``get_prefetch_queryset () ``a thuilleadh. Ba chóir go gcuirfeadh fo-"
"ranganna ``get_prefetch_querysets () ``a chur i bhfeidhm ina ionad."

msgid "Features removed in 5.0"
msgstr "Gnéithe bainte i 5.0"

msgid ""
"These features have reached the end of their deprecation cycle and are "
"removed in Django 5.0."
msgstr ""
"Tá na gnéithe seo tar éis deireadh a dtimthriall díscrúdaithe bainte amach "
"agus baintear iad i Django 5.0."

msgid ""
"See :ref:`deprecated-features-4.0` for details on these changes, including "
"how to remove usage of these features."
msgstr ""
"Féach: Ref: `deprecated-features-4.0` le haghaidh sonraí faoi na hathruithe "
"seo, lena n-áirítear conas úsáid na ngnéithe seo a bhaint."

msgid "The ``SERIALIZE`` test setting is removed."
msgstr "Baintear an socrú tástála ``SERIALIZE``."

msgid "The undocumented ``django.utils.baseconv`` module is removed."
msgstr "Baintear an modúl ``django.utils.baseconv`` neamhdhoiciméadaithe."

msgid "The undocumented ``django.utils.datetime_safe`` module is removed."
msgstr "Baintear an modúl ``django.utils.datetime_safe`` neamhdhoiciméadaithe."

msgid ""
"The default value of the ``USE_TZ`` setting is changed from ``False`` to "
"``True``."
msgstr ""
"Athraítear luach réamhshocraithe an socrú ``USE_TZ`` ó ``False`` go ``True``."

msgid ""
"The default sitemap protocol for sitemaps built outside the context of a "
"request is changed from ``'http'`` to ``'https'``."
msgstr ""
"Athraítear an prótacal réamhshocraithe léarscáileanna láithreáin do "
"léarscáileanna láithreáin a tógadh lasmuigh de chomhthéacs iarratais ó "
"``'http'`` go ``https'``."

msgid ""
"The ``extra_tests`` argument for ``DiscoverRunner.build_suite()`` and "
"``DiscoverRunner.run_tests()`` is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an argóint ``extra_tests`` do `DiscoverRunner.build_suite () ``agus "
"``DiscoverRunner.run_tests ()``."

msgid ""
"The ``django.contrib.postgres.aggregates.ArrayAgg``, ``JSONBAgg``, and "
"``StringAgg`` aggregates no longer return ``[]``, ``[]``, and ``''``, "
"respectively, when there are no rows."
msgstr ""
"Ní fhilleann na comhiomlánacha "
"``Django.Contrib.Postgres.Aggregates.Arrayagg``, ``Jsonbagg``, agus "
"``Stringagg`` a thuilleadh ``[]``, ``[]``, agus `````, faoi seach, nuair "
"nach bhfuil aon sraitheanna ann."

msgid "The ``USE_L10N`` setting is removed."
msgstr "Baintear an socrú ``USE_L10N``."

msgid "The ``USE_DEPRECATED_PYTZ`` transitional setting is removed."
msgstr "Baintear an socrú idirthréimhseach ``USE_DEPRECATED_PYTZ``."

msgid "Support for ``pytz`` timezones is removed."
msgstr "Baintear tacaíocht do chóin ama ``pytz``."

msgid "The ``is_dst`` argument is removed from:"
msgstr "Baintear an argóint ``is_dst`` as:"

msgid "``QuerySet.datetimes()``"
msgstr "``QuerySet.DateTimes () ``"

msgid "``django.utils.timezone.make_aware()``"
msgstr "``django.utils.timezone.make_aware () ``"

msgid "``django.db.models.functions.Trunc()``"
msgstr "``Django.db.Models.Functions.trunc () ``"

msgid "``django.db.models.functions.TruncSecond()``"
msgstr "``Django.db.Models.Functions.TruncSecond () ``"

msgid "``django.db.models.functions.TruncMinute()``"
msgstr "``Django.db.Models.Functions.TruncMinute () ``"

msgid "``django.db.models.functions.TruncHour()``"
msgstr "``Django.db.Models.Functions.Trunchour () ``"

msgid "``django.db.models.functions.TruncDay()``"
msgstr "``Django.db.Models.Functions.TruncDay () ``"

msgid "``django.db.models.functions.TruncWeek()``"
msgstr "``Django.db.Models.Functions.TruncWeek () ``"

msgid "``django.db.models.functions.TruncMonth()``"
msgstr "``Django.db.Models.Functions.TruncMonth () ``"

msgid "``django.db.models.functions.TruncQuarter()``"
msgstr "``Django.db.Models.Functions.TruncQuarter () ``"

msgid "``django.db.models.functions.TruncYear()``"
msgstr "``Django.db.Models.Functions.TruncYear () ``"

msgid ""
"The ``django.contrib.gis.admin.GeoModelAdmin`` and ``OSMGeoAdmin`` classes "
"are removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear na ranganna ``Django.contrib.gis.admin.geomodelAdmin`` agus "
"``OsmGeoAdmin``."

msgid "The undocumented ``BaseForm._html_output()`` method is removed."
msgstr ""
"An ``Basfhoirm neamh-dhoiciméadaithe. Baintear an modh _html_output () ``."

msgid ""
"The ability to return a ``str``, rather than a ``SafeString``, when "
"rendering an ``ErrorDict`` and ``ErrorList`` is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an cumas ``str`` a thabhairt ar ais, seachas ``SafeString``, nuair "
"a dhéantar ``ErrorDict`` agus ``Liosta Error`` a rindreáil."

msgid ""
"See :ref:`deprecated-features-4.1` for details on these changes, including "
"how to remove usage of these features."
msgstr ""
"Féach: Ref: `deprecated-features-4.1` le haghaidh sonraí faoi na hathruithe "
"seo, lena n-áirítear conas úsáid na ngnéithe seo a bhaint."

msgid "The ``SitemapIndexItem.__str__()`` method is removed."
msgstr "An ``SitemapIndexItem. Baintear modh __str__ () `."

msgid "The ``CSRF_COOKIE_MASKED`` transitional setting is removed."
msgstr "Baintear an suíomh idirthréimhseach ``CSRF_COOKIE_MASKED``."

msgid ""
"The ``name`` argument of ``django.utils.functional.cached_property()`` is "
"removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an argóint ``ainm ``de `django.utils.functional.cached_property "
"()``."

msgid ""
"The ``opclasses`` argument of "
"``django.contrib.postgres.constraints.ExclusionConstraint`` is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an argóint `opclasses`` de "
"`Django.contrib.postgres.Constraints.ExclusionConstraint``."

msgid ""
"The undocumented ability to pass ``errors=None`` to "
"``SimpleTestCase.assertFormError()`` and ``assertFormsetError()`` is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an cumas neamhdhoiciméadaithe chun ``Errors=None`` a chur chuig "
"``SimpleTestCase.AssertFormError () ``agus ``AssertFormSetError ()``."

msgid "``django.contrib.sessions.serializers.PickleSerializer`` is removed."
msgstr "Baintear ``Django.contrib.sessions.serializers.pickleserializer``."

msgid ""
"The usage of ``QuerySet.iterator()`` on a queryset that prefetches related "
"objects without providing the ``chunk_size`` argument is no longer allowed."
msgstr ""
"Ní cheadaítear úsáid ``QuerySet.iterator () ``ar thacar cheisteanna a "
"thuilleann rudaí gaolmhara gan an argóint ``chunk_size`` a sholáthar a "
"thuilleadh."

msgid ""
"Passing unsaved model instances to related filters is no longer allowed."
msgstr ""
"Ní cheadaítear cásanna samhaltaithe gan sábháil a chur ar aghaidh chuig na "
"scagairí gaolmhara a thuilleadh."

msgid ""
"``created=True`` is required in the signature of "
"``RemoteUserBackend.configure_user()`` subclasses."
msgstr ""
"Tá ``created=True`` ag teastáil i síniú fo-aicmí "
"``RemoteUserBackend.configure_user () ``."

msgid ""
"Support for logging out via ``GET`` requests in the "
"``django.contrib.auth.views.LogoutView`` and "
"``django.contrib.auth.views.logout_then_login()`` is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear tacaíocht le logáil amach trí iarratais ``GET`` sna "
"`django.contrib.auth.views.logoutview`` agus "
"``django.contrib.auth.views.logout_then_login () ``."

msgid ""
"The ``django.utils.timezone.utc`` alias to ``datetime.timezone.utc`` is "
"removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an ailias ``django.utils.timezone.utc`` chuig "
"`datetime.timezone.utc``."

msgid ""
"Passing a response object and a form/formset name to "
"``SimpleTestCase.assertFormError()`` and ``assertFormSetError()`` is no "
"longer allowed."
msgstr ""
"Ní cheadaítear réad freagartha agus ainm foirme/foirmeacha a chur chuig "
"``simpletestCase.assertFormError () ``agus ``AssertFormSetError ()`` a "
"thuilleadh."

msgid "The ``django.contrib.gis.admin.OpenLayersWidget`` is removed."
msgstr "Baintear an ``Django.contrib.gis.admin.openlayerswidget``."

msgid "The ``django.contrib.auth.hashers.CryptPasswordHasher`` is removed."
msgstr "Baintear an ``Django.contrib.auth.hashers.cryptPasswordHasher``."

msgid ""
"The ``\"django/forms/default.html\"`` and ``\"django/forms/formsets/"
"default.html\"`` templates are removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear na teimpléid ``” django/forms/default.html “`` agus ``” django/"
"forms/formsets/default.html “``."

msgid ""
"The default form and formset rendering style is changed to the div-based."
msgstr ""
"Athraítear an fhoirm réamhshocraithe agus an stíl rindreála foirmeacha go "
"dtí an div-bhunaithe."

msgid ""
"Passing ``nulls_first=False`` or ``nulls_last=False`` to "
"``Expression.asc()`` and ``Expression.desc()`` methods, and the ``OrderBy`` "
"expression is no longer allowed."
msgstr ""
"Ag dul chun modhanna ``Nulls_first=False`` nó ``Nulls_last=False`` go "
"`Expression.asc () ``agus ``Expression.desc ()``, agus ní cheadaítear an "
"abairt ``OrderBy`` a thuilleadh."

msgid "Django 5.0.1 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 5.0.1"

msgid "Django 5.0.1 fixes several bugs in 5.0."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 5.0.1 roinnt fabhtanna i 5.0."

msgid ""
"Reallowed, following a regression in Django 5.0, using a foreign key to a "
"model with a primary key that is not ``AutoField`` "
"in :attr:`.ModelAdmin.list_filter` (:ticket:`35020`)."
msgstr ""
"Athluchtaithe, tar éis aischéimnithe i Django 5.0, ag baint úsáide as "
"eochair eachtrach do mhúnla le príomheochair nach ``Autofield`` in:attr: "
"`.modeladmin.list_filter` (:ticket: `35020`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a long standing bug in handling the ``RETURNING INTO`` clause that "
"caused a crash when creating a model instance with a ``GeneratedField`` "
"which ``output_field`` had backend-specific converters (:ticket:`35024`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht fada ag láimhseáil an clásal ``RETURNING INTO` a bhí ina "
"chúis le timpiste nuair a chruthaíodh samhail samhail le ``GeneratedField`` "
"a raibh tiontaireoirí cúltaca sonracha ag ``output_field`` (:ticket: "
"`35024`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.0 that caused a crash of ``Model.save()`` for "
"models with both ``GeneratedField`` and ``ForeignKey`` fields "
"(:ticket:`35019`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 5.0 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste ``Model.save "
"() ``do mhúnlaí le réimsí ``GeneratedField`` agus `ForeignKey` araon "
"(:ticket: `35019`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 5.0 that caused a migration crash on Oracle < 23c when "
"adding a ``GeneratedField`` with ``output_field=BooleanField`` "
"(:ticket:`35018`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 5.0 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste imirce ar Oracle "
"<23c nuair a chuirtear ``GeneratedField`` leis ``output_field=Booleanfield`` "
"(:ticket: `35018`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.0 where admin fields on the same line could "
"overflow the page and become non-interactive (:ticket:`35012`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 5.0 áit a bhféadfadh réimsí riaracháin ar an "
"líne chéanna an leathanach a shárú agus a bheith neamh-idirghníomhach "
"(:ticket: `35012`)."

msgid "Added compatibility for ``oracledb`` 2.0.0 (:ticket:`35054`)."
msgstr ""
"Comhoiriúnacht breise le haghaidh ``oracledb`` 2.0.0 (:ticket: `35054`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.0 where querysets referenced incorrect field "
"names from ``FilteredRelation()`` (:ticket:`35050`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 5.0 áit a dtagraíodh ceisteanna ceisteanna "
"ainmneacha réimse míchearta ó ``FilteredRelation () ``(:ticket: `35050`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.0 that caused a system check crash when "
"``ModelAdmin.filter_horizontal`` or ``filter_vertical`` contained a reverse "
"many-to-many relation with ``related_name`` (:ticket:`35056`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 5.0 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste seiceála "
"córais nuair a bhí gaol droim go leor le ``related_name`` "
"`modeladmin.filter_horizontal`` nó `filter_vertical`` (:ticket: `35056`)."

msgid "Django 5.0.10 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 5.0.10"

msgid ""
"Django 5.0.10 fixes one security issue with severity \"high\" and one "
"security issue with severity \"moderate\" in 5.0.9."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 5.0.10 saincheist slándála amháin le déine “ard” agus "
"saincheist slándála amháin le déine “measartha” i 5.0.9."

msgid "Django 5.0.11 release notes"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Django 5.0.11 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\" in 5.0.10."
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 5.0.12 release notes"
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 5.0.12 fixes a regression in 5.0.11."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.0.11 that caused ``validate_ipv6_address()`` "
"and ``validate_ipv46_address()`` to crash when handling non-string values "
"(:ticket:`36098`)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 5.0.13 release notes"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Django 5.0.13 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\" in 5.0.12."
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 5.0.14 release notes"
msgstr ""

msgid "*April 2, 2025*"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Django 5.0.14 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\" in 5.0.13."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"CVE-2025-27556: Potential denial-of-service vulnerability in ``LoginView``, "
"``LogoutView``, and ``set_language()`` on Windows"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Python's :func:`NFKC normalization <python:unicodedata.normalize>` is slow "
"on Windows. As a "
"consequence, :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.LoginView`, :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.LogoutView`, "
"and :func:`~django.views.i18n.set_language` were subject to a potential "
"denial-of-service attack via certain inputs with a very large number of "
"Unicode characters."
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 5.0.2 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 5.0.2"

msgid ""
"Django 5.0.2 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\" and several "
"bugs in 5.0.1. Also, the latest string translations from Transifex are "
"incorporated."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 5.0.2 saincheist slándála le déine “measartha” agus roinnt "
"fabhtanna i 5.0.1. Chomh maith leis sin, corpraítear na haistriúcháin "
"teaghráin is déanaí ó Transifex."

msgid ""
"Reallowed, following a regression in Django 5.0.1, filtering against local "
"foreign keys not included in :attr:`.ModelAdmin.list_filter` "
"(:ticket:`35087`)."
msgstr ""
"Athchóirithe, tar éis aischéimniú i Django 5.0.1, scagadh i gcoinne "
"eochracha eachtracha áitiúla nach bhfuil san áireamh in:attr: "
"`.modeladmin.list_filter` (:ticket: `35087`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.0 where links in the admin had an incorrect "
"color (:ticket:`35121`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 5.0 áit a raibh dath mícheart ag naisc sa "
"riarachán (:ticket: `35121`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 5.0 that caused a crash of ``Model.full_clean()`` on "
"models with a ``GeneratedField`` (:ticket:`35127`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 5.0 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste ``Model.full_clean "
"() ``ar mhúnlaí le ``GeneratedField`` (:ticket: `35127`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.0 that caused a crash of "
"``FilteredRelation()`` with querysets as right-hand sides (:ticket:`35135`). "
"``FilteredRelation()`` now raises a ``ValueError`` on querysets as right-"
"hand sides."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 5.0 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste de "
"``FilteredRelation () ``le ceisteanna mar thaobh na láimhe deise (:ticket: "
"`35135`). Ardaíonn ``FilteredRelation () ``anois ``Error lua`` ar "
"cheisteanna mar thaobh na láimhe deise."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.0 that caused a crash of the ``dumpdata`` "
"management command when a base queryset used ``prefetch_related()`` "
"(:ticket:`35159`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 5.0 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste ar an ordú "
"bainistíochta ``dumpdata` nuair a d'úsáid tacar ceisteanna bonn "
"``prefetch_related () ``(:ticket: `35159`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.0 that caused the ``request_finished`` signal "
"to sometimes not be fired when running Django through an ASGI server, "
"resulting in potential resource leaks (:ticket:`35059`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 5.0 a d'fhág gur chúis leis an comhartha "
"``request_finished` uaireanta agus Django á rith trí fhreastalaí ASGI, agus "
"sceitheadh acmhainní féideartha ann (:ticket: `35059`) mar thoradh air."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 5.0 that caused a migration crash on MySQL when adding "
"a ``BinaryField``, ``TextField``, ``JSONField``, or ``GeometryField`` with a "
"``db_default`` (:ticket:`35162`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 5.0 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste imirce ar MySQL "
"nuair a chuirtear ``Binaryfield``, `TextField``, `JsonField``, nó "
"``GeometryField`` le `db_default`` (:ticket: `35162`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 5.0 that caused a migration crash on models with a "
"literal ``db_default`` of a complex type such as ``dict`` instance of a "
"``JSONField``. Running ``makemigrations`` might generate no-op "
"``AlterField`` operations for fields using ``db_default`` (:ticket:`35149`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 5.0 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste imirce ar mhúnlaí le "
"litriúil `db_default`` de chineál casta mar shampla ``dict`` de "
"`JsonField``. D'fhéadfadh go mbeadh ``makemigrations`` ag rith oibríochtaí "
"``Alterfield`` a ghiniúint do réimsí ag baint úsáide as `db_default`` "
"(:ticket: `35149`)."

msgid "Django 5.0.3 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 5.0.3"

msgid ""
"Django 5.0.3 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\" and several "
"bugs in 5.0.2."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 5.0.3 saincheist slándála le déine “measartha” agus roinnt "
"fabhtanna i 5.0.2."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.0.2 where ``intcomma`` template filter could "
"return a leading comma for string representation of floats (:ticket:`35172`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 5.0.2 áit ar bhféadfadh scagaire teimpléad "
"``intcom`` coma tosaigh a thabhairt ar ais le haghaidh léiriú teaghrán ar "
"snámha (:ticket: `35172`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 5.0 that caused a crash of ``Signal.asend()`` and "
"``asend_robust()`` when all receivers were asynchronous functions "
"(:ticket:`35174`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 5.0 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste ``signal.asend () "
"``agus ``asend_robust ()`` nuair a bhí feidhmeanna asincrónacha iad na "
"glacadóirí go léir (:ticket: `35174`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.0.1 where :meth:`.ModelAdmin.lookup_allowed` "
"would prevent filtering against foreign keys using lookups like ``__isnull`` "
"when the field was not included in :attr:`.ModelAdmin.list_filter` "
"(:ticket:`35173`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 5.0.1 áit a chuirfeadh: meth: "
"`.ModelAdmin.lookup_allowed` cosc ar scagadh i gcoinne eochracha eachtracha "
"ag úsáid cuardaigh mar ``__isnull`` nuair nach raibh an réimse san áireamh "
"in:attr: `.modeladmin.list_filter` (:ticket: `35173`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.0 that caused a crash of "
"``@sensitive_variables`` and ``@sensitive_post_parameters`` decorators on "
"functions loaded from ``.pyc`` files (:ticket:`35187`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 5.0 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste de "
"mhaisitheoirí ``@sensitive_variables`` agus ``@sensitive_post_parameters`` "
"ar fheidhmeanna a luchtaigh ó chomhaid `.pyc`` (:ticket: `35187`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.0 that caused a crash when reloading a test "
"database and a base queryset for a base manager used ``prefetch_related()`` "
"(:ticket:`35238`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 5.0 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste agus bunachar "
"sonraí tástála á athluchtú agus tacar ceisteanna bonn do bhainisteoir bonn a "
"úsáideadh ``prefetch_related () ``(:ticket: `35238`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 5.0 where facet filters in the admin would crash on a "
"``SimpleListFilter`` using a queryset without primary keys (:ticket:`35198`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 5.0 áit a dtispódh scagairí gnéithe sa riarachán ar "
"``SimpleListFilter`` ag baint úsáide as tacar ceisteanna gan eochracha "
"bunscoile (:ticket: `35198`)."

msgid "Django 5.0.4 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 5.0.4"

msgid "*April 3, 2024*"
msgstr "*3 Aibreán, 2024*"

msgid "Django 5.0.4 fixes several bugs in 5.0.3."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 5.0.4 roinnt fabhtanna i 5.0.3."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 5.0 that caused a crash of ``Model.full_clean()`` on "
"fields with expressions in ``db_default``. As a consequence, "
"``Model.full_clean()`` no longer validates for empty values in fields with "
"``db_default`` (:ticket:`35223`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 5.0 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste ``Model.full_clean "
"() ``ar réimsí le nathanna i `db_default``. Mar thoradh air sin, ní "
"bhailíonn ``Model.full_clean () ``a thuilleadh le haghaidh luachanna folmha "
"i réimsí le ``db_default`` (:ticket: `35223`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.0 where the ``AdminFileWidget`` could be "
"rendered with two ``id`` attributes on the \"Clear\" checkbox "
"(:ticket:`35273`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 5.0 áit ar féidir an `AdminFileWidget`` a "
"léiriú le dhá thréith ``id ``ar an mbosca seiceála “Clear” (:ticket: "
"`35273`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 5.0 that caused a migration crash on PostgreSQL 15+ "
"when adding a partial ``UniqueConstraint`` with ``nulls_distinct`` "
"(:ticket:`35329`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 5.0 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste imirce ar PostgreSQL "
"15+ nuair a chuirtear páirteach ``UniqueConstraint`` le `nulls_distingt`` "
"(:ticket: `35329`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a crash in Django 5.0 when performing queries involving table aliases "
"and lookups on a ``GeneratedField`` of the aliased table (:ticket:`35344`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh timpiste i Django 5.0 agus ceisteanna á ndéanamh ina mbaineann "
"ainmneacha tábla agus cuardaigh ar ``GeneratedField`` den tábla aiasaithe "
"(:ticket: `35344`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 5.0 that caused a migration crash when adding a "
"``GeneratedField`` relying on the ``__contains`` or ``__icontains`` lookups "
"or using a ``Value`` containing a ``\"%\"`` (:ticket:`35336`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 5.0 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste imirce nuair a "
"chuirtear ``GeneratedField`` ag brath ar na cuardaigh ``__contains`` nó "
"``__icontains`` nó ```Lua`` á úsáid ina bhfuil ``%\"`` (:ticket: `35336`)."

msgid "Django 5.0.5 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 5.0.5"

msgid "Django 5.0.5 fixes several bugs in 5.0.4."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 5.0.5 roinnt fabhtanna i 5.0.4."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 5.0 that caused a crash of ``Model.save()`` when "
"creating an instance of a model with a ``GeneratedField`` and providing a "
"primary key (:ticket:`35350`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 5.0 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste ``Model.save () "
"``nuair a chruthaíonn sé sampla de mhúnla le `GeneratedField`` agus eochair "
"phríomhúil á sholáthar (:ticket: `35350`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a compatibility issue encountered in Python 3.11.9+ and 3.12.3+ when "
"validating email max line lengths with content decoded using the "
"``surrogateescape`` error handling scheme (:ticket:`35361`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh saincheist chomhoiriúnachta a bhí ann i Python 3.11.9+ agus 3.12.3+ "
"agus uasmhéid líne ríomhphoist á bhailíochtú le hábhar díchódaithe ag baint "
"úsáide as an scéim láimhseála earráide ``surrogateescape`` (:ticket: "
"`35361`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 5.0 that caused a crash when applying migrations "
"including alterations to ``GeneratedField`` such as setting "
"``db_index=True`` on SQLite (:ticket:`35373`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 5.0 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste agus imirce á chur i "
"bhfeidhm lena n-áirítear athruithe ar `GeneratedField`` mar shampla "
"``db_index = true`` a shocrú ar SQLite (:ticket: `35373`)."

msgid ""
"Allowed importing ``aprefetch_related_objects`` from ``django.db.models`` "
"(:ticket:`35392`)."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaítear ``aprefetch_related_objects`` a allmhairiú ó ``django.db.models`` "
"(:ticket: `35392`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 5.0 that caused a migration crash when a "
"``GeneratedField`` was added before any of the referenced fields from its "
"``expression`` definition (:ticket:`35359`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 5.0 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste imirce nuair a "
"cuireadh `GeneratedField`` roimh aon cheann de na réimsí tagartha óna "
"sainmhíniú ``expression` (:ticket: `35359`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 5.0 that caused a migration crash when altering a "
"``GeneratedField`` referencing a renamed field (:ticket:`35422`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 5.0 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste imirce nuair a "
"athraíodh ``GeneratedField`` ag tagairt do réimse athainmnithe (:ticket: "
"`35422`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 5.0 where the ``querysets`` argument of "
"``GenericPrefetch`` was not required (:ticket:`35426`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 5.0 nuair nach raibh an argóint ``querysets`` de "
"`GenericPrefetch`` ag teastáil (:ticket: `35426`)."

msgid "Django 5.0.6 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 5.0.6"

msgid "Django 5.0.6 fixes a packaging error in 5.0.5."
msgstr "Socraíonn Django 5.0.6 earráid phacáistithe i 5.0.5."

msgid "Django 5.0.7 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 5.0.7"

msgid ""
"Django 5.0.7 fixes two security issues with severity \"moderate\", two "
"security issues with severity \"low\", and one bug in 5.0.6."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 5.0.7 dhá shaincheist slándála le déine “measartha”, dhá "
"shaincheist slándála le déine “íseal”, agus fabht amháin i 5.0.6."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 5.0 that caused a crash of ``Model.full_clean()`` on "
"unsaved model instances with a ``GeneratedField`` and certain "
"defined :attr:`Meta.constraints <django.db.models.Options.constraints>` "
"(:ticket:`35560`)."
msgstr ""
"<django.db.models.Options.constraints>Socraigh fabht i Django 5.0 a bhí ina "
"chúis le timpiste ``Model.full_clean () ``ar chásanna samhail "
"neamhshábháilte le ``GeneratedField`` agus sainmhínithe áirithe: attr: "
"`Meta.Constraints `(:ticket: `35560`)."

msgid "Django 5.0.8 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 5.0.8"

msgid ""
"Django 5.0.8 fixes three security issues with severity \"moderate\", one "
"security issue with severity \"high\", and several bugs in 5.0.7."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 5.0.8 trí shaincheist slándála le déine “measartha”, "
"saincheist slándála amháin le déine “ard”, agus roinnt fabhtanna i 5.0.7."

msgid ""
"Added missing validation for ``UniqueConstraint(nulls_distinct=False)`` when "
"using ``*expressions`` (:ticket:`35594`)."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh bailíochtú in easnamh le haghaidh ``UniqueConstraint "
"(Nulls_Distinct=False) ``nuair a úsáidtear ``*expressions`` (:ticket: "
"`35594`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.0 where ``ModelAdmin.action_checkbox`` could "
"break the admin changelist HTML page when rendering a model instance with a "
"``__html__`` method (:ticket:`35606`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 5.0 inar bhféadfadh "
"``ModelAdmin.ACTION_Checkbox`` leathanach HTML an liosta athraithe "
"riaracháin a bhriseadh agus samhail samhail á rindreáil le modh ``__html__` "
"(:ticket: `35606`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a crash when creating a model with a ``Field.db_default`` and a "
"``Meta.constraints`` constraint composed of ``__endswith``, "
"``__startswith``, or ``__contains`` lookups (:ticket:`35625`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh timpiste nuair a chruthaítear samhail le ``Field.db_default`` agus "
"srian ``Meta.Constraints`` comhdhéanta de ``__endswith``, ``__startswith``, "
"nó ``__contains`` (:ticket: `35625`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.0.7 that caused a crash in "
"``LocaleMiddleware`` when processing a language code over 500 characters "
"(:ticket:`35627`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 5.0.7 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste in "
"``LocalEmiddleware` nuair a phróiseálann cód teanga os cionn 500 carachtar "
"(:ticket: `35627`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 5.0 that caused a system check crash when "
"``ModelAdmin.date_hierarchy`` was a ``GeneratedField`` with an "
"``output_field`` of ``DateField`` or ``DateTimeField`` (:ticket:`35628`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 5.0 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste seiceála córais "
"nuair a bhí ``ModelAdmin.Date_Hierarchy ``ina `GeneratedField`` le "
"`output_field`` de ``DateField`` nó ``DateTimeField`` (:ticket: `35628`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 5.0 which caused constraint validation to either crash "
"or incorrectly raise validation errors for constraints referring to fields "
"using ``Field.db_default`` (:ticket:`35638`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 5.0 a d'fhág bailíochtú srianta timpeáil nó earráidí "
"bailíochtaithe a ardú go mícheart le haghaidh srianta ag tagairt do réimsí "
"ag baint úsáide as `field.db_default`` (:ticket: `35638`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a crash in Django 5.0 when saving a model containing a ``FileField`` "
"with a ``db_default`` set (:ticket:`35657`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh timpiste i Django 5.0 nuair a shábháil múnla ina bhfuil "
"`filefield`` le tacar `db_default`` (:ticket: `35657`)."

msgid "Django 5.0.9 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 5.0.9"

msgid ""
"Django 5.0.9 fixes one security issue with severity \"moderate\" and one "
"security issue with severity \"low\" in 5.0.8."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 5.0.9 saincheist slándála amháin le déine “measartha” agus "
"saincheist slándála amháin le déine “íseal” i 5.0.8."

msgid "Django 5.1 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 5.1"

msgid "*August 7, 2024*"
msgstr "*7 Lúnasa, 2024*"

msgid "Welcome to Django 5.1!"
msgstr "Fáilte go Django 5.1!"

msgid ""
"These release notes cover the :ref:`new features <whats-new-5.1>`, as well "
"as some :ref:`backwards incompatible changes <backwards-incompatible-5.1>` "
"you should be aware of when upgrading from Django 5.0 or earlier. "
"We've :ref:`begun the deprecation process for some features <deprecated-"
"features-5.1>`."
msgstr ""
"Clúdaíonn na nótaí scaoilte seo na:ref: `gnéithe nua <whats-new-5.1>`, chomh "
"maith le roinnt athruithe: ref: `athruithe neamh-chomhoiriúnacha ar "
"chúl<backwards-incompatible-5.1>` ba chóir duit a bheith ar an eolas fúthu "
"agus tú ag uasghrádú ó Django 5.0 nó níos luaithe. <deprecated-"
"features-5.1>We've:ref: `thosaigh an próiseas díghabhála do roinnt gnéithe `."

msgid ""
"Django 5.1 supports Python 3.10, 3.11, 3.12, and 3.13 (as of 5.1.3). We "
"**highly recommend** and only officially support the latest release of each "
"series."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn Django 5.1 le Python 3.10, 3.11, 3.12, agus 3.13 (amhail 5.1.3). "
"Molaimid** go hard** agus ní thacaímid go hoifigiúil ach leis an scaoileadh "
"is déanaí de gach sraith."

msgid "What's new in Django 5.1"
msgstr "Cad atá nua i Django 5.1"

msgid "``{% querystring %}`` template tag"
msgstr "``{% querystring%}`` clib teimpléad"

msgid ""
"Django 5.1 introduces the :ttag:`{% querystring %} <querystring>` template "
"tag, simplifying the modification of query parameters in URLs, making it "
"easier to generate links that maintain existing query parameters while "
"adding or changing specific ones."
msgstr ""
"Tugann Django 5.1 clib te <querystring>impléad:ttag: `{% querystring%}` "
"isteach, ag simpliú modhnú paraiméadair cheisteanna in URLanna, rud a "
"fhágann go bhfuil sé níos éasca naisc a ghiniúint a choinníonn paraiméadair "
"cheisteanna atá ann cheana agus cinn sonracha á chur leis nó a athrú."

msgid ""
"For instance, navigating pagination and query strings in templates can be "
"cumbersome. Consider this template fragment that dynamically generates a URL "
"for navigating to the next page within a paginated view:"
msgstr ""
"Mar shampla, féadann sé a bheith an-deacair uimhriú leathanach agus "
"teaghráin ceisteanna i dteimpléid a nascleanúint. Smaoinigh ar an blúire "
"teimpléad seo a ghineann URL go dinimiciúil chun dul chuig an gcéad "
"leathanach eile laistigh d'amharc leathanachach:"

msgid ""
"When switching to using this new template tag, the above magically becomes:"
msgstr ""
"Agus tú ag aistriú chuig an gclib teimpléid nua seo a úsáid, bíonn an méid "
"thuas go draíochta:"

msgid "PostgreSQL Connection Pools"
msgstr "Linnte Ceangail PostgreSQL"

msgid ""
"Django 5.1 also introduces :ref:`connection pool <postgresql-pool>` support "
"for PostgreSQL. As the time to establish a new connection can be relatively "
"long, keeping connections open can reduce latency."
msgstr ""
"Tugann Django 5.1 isteach freisin: ref: tacaíocht `linn nasc <postgresql-"
"pool>`do PostgreSQL. Toisc gur féidir leis an am chun nasc nua a bhunú a "
"bheith réasúnta fada, is féidir le naisc a choinneáil oscailte an latency a "
"laghdú."

msgid ""
"To use a connection pool with `psycopg`_, you can set the ``\"pool\"`` "
"option inside :setting:`OPTIONS` to be a dict to be passed "
"to :class:`~psycopg:psycopg_pool.ConnectionPool`, or to ``True`` to use the "
"``ConnectionPool`` defaults::"
msgstr ""
"Chun linn nasc le `psycopg`_ a úsáid, is féidir leat an rogha ``\"pool\"`` a "
"shocrú taobh istigh: setting: `OPTIONS` chun a bheith ina dhic le rith "
"chuig:class: `~psycopg:psycopg_pool.connectionpool`, nó chuig `True`` chun "
"na réamhshocruithe ``ConnectionPool`` a úsáid:"

msgid "Middleware to require authentication by default"
msgstr "Middleware chun fíordheimhniú de réir réamhshocraithe a bheith"

msgid ""
"The new :class:`~django.contrib.auth.middleware.LoginRequiredMiddleware` "
"redirects all unauthenticated requests to a login page. Views can allow "
"unauthenticated requests by using the "
"new :func:`~django.contrib.auth.decorators.login_not_required` decorator."
msgstr ""
"Atreoraíonn an nua:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.middleware.loginrequiredMiddleware` gach iarratas "
"neamhfhíordheimhnithe chuig leathanach logála isteach. Is féidir le tuairimí "
"iarratais neamhfhíordheimhnithe a cheadú tríd an maisitheoir nua:func: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.decorators.login_not_required` a úsáid."

msgid ""
"``LoginRequiredMiddleware`` respects the ``login_url`` and "
"``redirect_field_name`` values set via "
"the :func:`~.django.contrib.auth.decorators.login_required` decorator, but "
"does not support setting ``login_url`` or ``redirect_field_name`` via "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.auth.mixins.LoginRequiredMixin`."
msgstr ""
"Meas ``LoginRequiredMiddleware`` na luachanna ``login_url`` agus "
"``redirect_field_name`` atá leagtha amach trí:func: "
"`~.django.contrib.auth.decorators.login_required`, ach ní thacaíonn sé le "
"``login_url`` nó ``redirect_field_name`` a shocrú trí:class: "
"~django.contrib.auth.mixins.loginrequiredMixin`."

msgid ""
"To enable this, add "
"``\"django.contrib.auth.middleware.LoginRequiredMiddleware\"`` to "
"your :setting:`MIDDLEWARE` setting."
msgstr ""
"Chun é seo a chumasú, cuir "
"``\"django.contrib.auth.middleware.loginrequiredMiddleware\"` le do shuíomh: "
"`MIDDLEWARE`."

msgid ""
":attr:`.ModelAdmin.list_display` now supports using ``__`` lookups to list "
"fields from related models."
msgstr ""
":attr: Tacaíonn `.modelAdmin.list_display` anois le cuardaigh ``__`` a úsáid "
"chun réimsí a liostáil ó mhúnlaí gaolmhara."

msgid ""
"The default iteration count for the PBKDF2 password hasher is increased from "
"720,000 to 870,000."
msgstr ""
"Méadaítear an líon athraithe réamhshocraithe don hasher pasfhocal PBKDF2 ó "
"720,000 go 870,000."

msgid ""
"The default ``parallelism`` of the ``ScryptPasswordHasher`` is increased "
"from 1 to 5, to follow OWASP recommendations."
msgstr ""
"Méadaítear réamhshocraithe ``parallelism`` den `ScryptPasswordHasher`` ó 1 "
"go 5, chun moltaí OWASP a leanúint."

msgid ""
"The new :class:`~django.contrib.auth.forms.AdminUserCreationForm` and the "
"existing :class:`~django.contrib.auth.forms.AdminPasswordChangeForm` now "
"support disabling password-based authentication by setting an unusable "
"password on form save. This is now available in the admin when visiting the "
"user creation and password change pages."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn an nua:class: `~django.contrib.auth.forms.adminUserCreationForm` "
"agus an: class: `~django.contrib.auth.forms.adminPasswordChangeForm` atá ann "
"cheana anois le fíordheimhniú pasfhocal a dhíchumasú trí phasfhocal "
"neamhúsáidte a shocrú ar shábháil foirm. Tá sé seo ar fáil anois sa "
"riarachán agus tú ag cuairt ar na leathanaigh cruthaithe úsáideora agus "
"athraithe pasfhocal."

msgid ""
":func:`~.django.contrib.auth.decorators.login_required`, :func:`~.django.contrib.auth.decorators.permission_required`, "
"and :func:`~.django.contrib.auth.decorators.user_passes_test` decorators now "
"support wrapping asynchronous view functions."
msgstr ""
":func: `~.django.contrib.auth.decorators.login_required`, :func: "
"`~.django.contrib.auth.decorators.permission_required`, agus:func: "
"`~.django.contrib.auth.decorators.user_passes_test` tacaíonn maisiúcháin "
"anois le feidhmeanna amharc asincrónach timfhilleadh."

msgid ""
"``ReadOnlyPasswordHashWidget`` now includes a button to reset the user's "
"password, which replaces the link previously embedded in the "
"``ReadOnlyPasswordHashField``'s help text, improving the overall "
"accessibility of the :class:`~django.contrib.auth.forms.UserChangeForm`."
msgstr ""
"Cuimsíonn ``ReadOnlyPasswordHashWidget`` cnaipe anois chun pasfhocal an "
"úsáideora a athshocrú, a athshocraíonn an nasc atá leabaithe roimhe seo i "
"dtéacs cabhrach ``ReadOnlyPasswordHashField``, ag feabhsú inrochtaineacht "
"fhoriomlán na:class: `~django.contrib.auth.forms.userChangeForm`."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.BoundingCircle` is now "
"supported on SpatiaLite 5.1+."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.BoundingCircle` tá "
"tacaíocht anois ar Spatialite 5.1 +."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.Collect` is now supported on MySQL "
"8.0.24+."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.contrib.gis.db.models.collect` tacaítear anois ar MySQL "
"8.0.24 +."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.contrib.gis.geoip2.GeoIP2` now allows querying "
"using :class:`ipaddress.IPv4Address` or :class:`ipaddress.IPv6Address` "
"objects."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.contrib.gis.geoip2.geoip2` ceadaíonn fiosrú anois ag baint "
"úsáid:class: `iPaddress.ipv4Address` nó:class: `iPadress.ipv6Address` rudaí."

msgid ""
":meth:`.GeoIP2.country` now exposes the ``continent_code``, "
"``continent_name``, and ``is_in_european_union`` values."
msgstr ""
":meth: Nochtann `.geoip2.country` anois na luachanna ```continent_code``, "
"`ainm_continent``, agus ``is_in_european_union``."

msgid ""
":meth:`.GeoIP2.city` now exposes the ``accuracy_radius`` and ``region_name`` "
"values. In addition, the ``dma_code`` and ``region`` values are now exposed "
"as ``metro_code`` and ``region_code``, but the previous keys are also "
"retained for backward compatibility."
msgstr ""
": meth: Nochtann `.geoip2.city` anois na luachanna ```curacy_radius`` agus "
"``region_name``. Ina theannta sin, nochtar na luachanna ``dma_code`` agus "
"``region`` anois mar ``metro_code`` agus ``region_code``, ach coinnítear na "
"heochracha roimhe seo freisin le haghaidh comhoiriúnacht ar chúl."

msgid ":class:`~django.contrib.gis.measure.Area` now supports the ``ha`` unit."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.contrib.gis.Measure.Area` tacaíonn anois leis an aonad "
"``ha``."

msgid ""
"The new :attr:`.OGRGeometry.is_3d` attribute allows checking if a geometry "
"has a ``Z`` coordinate dimension."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an tréith nua:attr: `.ogrgeometry.is_3d` a sheiceáil an bhfuil toise "
"comhordaithe ``Z`` ag geoiméadacht."

msgid ""
"The new :meth:`.OGRGeometry.set_3d` method allows addition and removal of "
"the ``Z`` coordinate dimension."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an modh nua:meth: `.ogrgeometry.set_3d` an toise comhordaithe ``Z`` "
"a chur leis agus a bhaint."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.OGRGeometry`, :class:`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.Point`, :class:`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.LineString`, :class:`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.Polygon`, "
"and :class:`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.GeometryCollection` and its subclasses "
"now support measured geometries via the new :attr:`.OGRGeometry.is_measured` "
"and ``m`` properties, and the :meth:`.OGRGeometry.set_measured` method."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.contrib.gis.gdal.ogrGeometry`, :class: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.point`, :class: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.lineString`, :class: "
"`~django.contrib.gdal.polygon`, agus:class: `~django.contrib.gdal.polygon`, "
"agus:class: `~django.contrib.gdal.polygon` Tacaíonn "
"go.contrib.gis.gdal.GeometryCollection` agus a fho-aicmí le geoiméadraí "
"tomhaiste anois tríd an modh nua:attr: `.ogrgeometry.is_measured` agus `m``, "
"agus an modh nua:ogrgeometry.set_measured`."

msgid ""
":attr:`.OGRGeometry.centroid` is now available on all supported geometry "
"types."
msgstr ""
":attr: Tá `.ogrgeometry.centroid` ar fáil anois ar gach cineál geoiméadachta "
"tacaithe."

msgid ""
":class:`FromWKB() <django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.FromWKB>` "
"and :class:`FromWKT() <django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.FromWKT>` "
"functions now support the optional ``srid`` argument (except for Oracle "
"where it is ignored)."
msgstr ""
":class: `fromWKB () "
"<django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.FromWKB>`agus:class: `fromWkt ()` "
"<django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.FromWKT>tacaíonn feidhmeanna anois "
"leis an argóint roghnach ``srid`` (ach amháin do Oracle ina ndéantar "
"neamhaird air)."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.contrib.postgres.indexes.BTreeIndex` now supports the "
"``deduplicate_items`` parameter."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.contrib.postgres.indexes.btreeIndex` tacaíonn anois leis an "
"paraiméadar ``deduplicate_items``."

msgid ""
":class:`django.contrib.sessions.backends.cached_db.SessionStore` now handles "
"exceptions when storing session information in the cache, logging proper "
"error messages with their traceback via the newly added :ref:`sessions "
"logger <django-contrib-sessions-logger>`."
msgstr ""
"<django-contrib-sessions-logger>:class: "
"`django.contrib.sessions.backends.cached_db.sessionStore` láimhseálann "
"eisceachtaí anois nuair a bhíonn faisnéis seisiúin á stóráil sa taisce, ag "
"logáil teachtaireachtaí earráide cearta lena rianú tríd an logger nua-"
"chuirte:ref: `session logger`."

msgid ""
":class:`django.contrib.sessions.backends.base.SessionBase` and all built-in "
"session engines now provide async API. The new asynchronous methods all have "
"``a`` prefixed names, e.g. ``aget()``, ``akeys()``, or ``acycle_key()``."
msgstr ""
":class: `django.contrib.sessions.backends.base.sessionbase` agus "
"soláthraíonn gach inneall seisiún ionsuite API async anois. Tá ainmneacha "
"réamhshocraithe ag na modhanna asincrónacha nua go léir, m.sh. ``aget () ``, "
"`akeys ()``, nó ``acycle_key () ``."

msgid ""
"``\"init_command\"`` option is now supported in :setting:`OPTIONS` on SQLite "
"to allow specifying :ref:`pragma options <sqlite-init-command>` to set upon "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"<sqlite-init-command>Tacaítear anois le rogha ``\"init_command\"`` "
"in:setting: `OPTIONS` ar SQLite chun ligean sonraithe:ref: `roghanna pragma` "
"a shocrú ar nasc."

msgid ""
"``\"transaction_mode\"`` option is now supported in :setting:`OPTIONS` on "
"SQLite to allow specifying the :ref:`sqlite-transaction-behavior`."
msgstr ""
"Tacaítear anois le rogha ``\"transaction_mode\"`` in:setting: `OPTIONS` ar "
"SQLite chun ligean an: ref: `sqlite-transaction-iompraíocht a shonrú."

msgid ""
"``\"pool\"`` option is now supported in :setting:`OPTIONS` on PostgreSQL to "
"allow using :ref:`connection pools <postgresql-pool>`."
msgstr ""
"<postgresql-pool>Tacaítear anois le rogha ``\"pool\"`` in:setting: `OPTIONS` "
"ar PostgreSQL chun cead a bhaint as: ref: `linnte nasc`."

msgid ""
"In order to improve accessibility, the technical 404 and 500 error pages now "
"use HTML landmark elements for the header, footer, and main content areas."
msgstr ""
"D'fhonn inrochtaineacht a fheabhsú, úsáideann na leathanaigh earráide "
"teicniúla 404 agus 500 eilimintí sainchomharthaí HTML anois don cheanntásc, "
"buntásc agus príomhréimsí ábhair."

msgid ""
"The :attr:`~django.core.files.storage.FileSystemStorage.allow_overwrite` "
"parameter of :class:`~django.core.files.storage.FileSystemStorage` now "
"allows saving new files over existing ones."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn an paraiméadar: Attr: "
"`~django.core.files.storage.filesystemStorage.allow_overwrite` de:class: "
"`~django.core.files.storage.filesystemStorage` comhaid nua a shábháil thar "
"na cinn atá ann cheana anois."

msgid ""
"In order to improve accessibility and enable screen readers to associate "
"fieldsets with their help text, the form fieldset now includes the ``aria-"
"describedby`` HTML attribute."
msgstr ""
"D'fhonn inrochtaineacht a fheabhsú agus chun léitheoirí scáileáin a chumasú "
"tacair réimse a cheangal lena dtéacs cabhrach, tá an tréith HTML `aria-"
"describedby`` sa tacar réimse foirme anois."

msgid ""
"The :djadmin:`makemigrations` command now displays meaningful symbols for "
"each operation to highlight :class:`operation categories "
"<django.db.migrations.operations.base.OperationCategory>`."
msgstr ""
"<django.db.migrations.operations.base.OperationCategory>Taispeánann an t-"
"ordú: DjaDmin: `makemigrations` siombailí bríocha anois do gach oibríocht "
"chuig hardlight: class: `catagóirí oibríochta `."

msgid ""
"The new ``Operation.category`` attribute allows specifying "
"an :class:`operation category "
"<django.db.migrations.operations.base.OperationCategory>` used by "
"the :djadmin:`makemigrations` to display a meaningful symbol for the "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an tréith nua ``Operation.Category`` a shonrú an:class: `catagóir "
"oibríochta `a úsáideann na:djadmin: "
"`makemigrations<django.db.migrations.operations.base.OperationCategory>` "
"chun siombail bhrí don oibríocht a thaispeáint."

msgid ""
":meth:`.QuerySet.explain` now supports the ``generic_plan`` option on "
"PostgreSQL 16+."
msgstr ""
":meth: Tacaíonn `.querySet.explain` anois leis an rogha ``generic_plan ``ar "
"PostgreSQL 16+."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.db.models.expressions.RowRange` now accepts positive "
"integers for the ``start`` argument and negative integers for the ``end`` "
"argument."
msgstr ""
":class: `~Django.db.Models.Expressions.RowRange` glacann anois le "
"sláimhreacha dearfacha don argóint ``start`` agus sláimhreacha diúltacha don "
"argóint ``deireadh ``."

msgid ""
"The new ``exclusion`` argument "
"of :class:`~django.db.models.expressions.RowRange` "
"and :class:`~django.db.models.expressions.ValueRange` allows excluding rows, "
"groups, and ties from the window frames."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn an argóint nua ``eisiam`` de:class: "
"`~django.db.Models.Expressions.RowRange` agus:class: "
"`~django.db.Models.Expressions.ValueRange` sraitheanna, grúpaí agus ceangail "
"a eisiamh ó fhrámaí na bhfuinneoga."

msgid ""
":meth:`.QuerySet.order_by` now supports ordering by annotation transforms "
"such as ``JSONObject`` keys and ``ArrayAgg`` indices."
msgstr ""
":meth: Tacaíonn `.querySet.Order_by` anois le hordú trí athfhoirmithe "
"anótála mar eochracha ``JSONObject`` agus innéacsanna ``ArrayAgg`."

msgid ""
":class:`F() <django.db.models.F>` and :class:`OuterRef() "
"<django.db.models.OuterRef>` expressions that "
"output :class:`~django.db.models.CharField`, :class:`~django.db.models.EmailField`, :class:`~django.db.models.SlugField`, :class:`~django.db.models.URLField`, :class:`~django.db.models.TextField`, "
"or :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.ArrayField` can now "
"be :ref:`sliced <slicing-using-f>`."
msgstr ""
"<slicing-using-f>:class: `F () <django.db.models.F>`agus:class: `OuterRef "
"()` abairtí a aschuir:class: `~django.d "
"<django.db.models.OuterRef>b.models.charfield`, :class: "
"`~django.db.models.emails.field`, :class: "
"`~django.db.models.slugfield`, :class: `~django.db.models.urlfield` "
"`, :class: `~django.db.Models.TextField`, nó:class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.arrayfield` is féidir anois:ref: `sliseadh`."

msgid ""
"The new ``from_queryset`` argument of :meth:`.Model.refresh_from_db` "
"and :meth:`.Model.arefresh_from_db`  allows customizing the queryset used to "
"reload a model's value. This can be used to lock the row before reloading or "
"to select related objects."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an argóint nua ``from_queryset`` de:meth: `.model.Refresh_from_db` "
"agus:meth: `.model.arefresh_from_db` an tacar fiosrúcháin a úsáidtear chun "
"luach samhail a athluchtú a shaincheapadh. Is féidir é seo a úsáid chun an "
"tsraith a ghlasáil sula n-athluchtú nó chun rudaí gaolmhara a roghnú."

msgid ""
"The new :attr:`.Expression.constraint_validation_compatible` attribute "
"allows specifying that the expression should be ignored during a constraint "
"validation."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an tréith nua:attr: `.expression.restricint_validation_compatible` a "
"shonrú gur chóir neamhaird a dhéanamh ar an abairt le linn bailíochtaithe "
"srianta."

msgid ""
"Custom tags may now set extra data on the ``Parser`` object that will later "
"be made available on the ``Template`` instance. Such data may be used, for "
"example, by the template loader, or other template clients."
msgstr ""
"Féadfaidh clibeanna saincheaptha sonraí breise a shocrú anois ar an réad "
"``Parser` a chuirfear ar fáil níos déanaí ar an gcás ``Teimpléad`. Féadfaidh "
"an lódóir teimpléid, nó cliaint teimpléid eile sonraí den sórt sin a úsáid, "
"mar shampla."

msgid ""
":ref:`Template engines <field-checking>` now implement a ``check()`` method "
"that is already registered with the check framework."
msgstr ""
":ref: Cuireann `innill te <field-checking>impléad` modh ``check () ``i "
"bhfeidhm anois atá cláraithe leis an gcreat seiceála cheana féin."

msgid ""
":meth:`~django.test.SimpleTestCase.assertContains`, :meth:`~django.test.SimpleTestCase.assertNotContains`, "
"and :meth:`~django.test.SimpleTestCase.assertInHTML` assertions now add "
"haystacks to assertion error messages."
msgstr ""
":meth: `~django.test.simpletestCase.AssertContains`, :meth: "
"`~django.test.simpletestCase.assertNotContains`, agus:meth: "
"`~django.test.simpletestCase.assertHTML` anois cuireann dearbhú haistacks le "
"teachtaireachtaí earráide dearbhaithe."

msgid ""
"The :class:`~django.test.RequestFactory`, :class:`~django.test.AsyncRequestFactory`, :class:`~django.test.Client`, "
"and :class:`~django.test.AsyncClient` classes now support the "
"``query_params`` parameter, which accepts a dictionary of query string keys "
"and values. This allows setting query strings on any HTTP methods more "
"easily."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn ranga:Class: `~django.test.requestFactory`, :class: "
"`~django.test.asyncRequestFactory`, :class: `~django.test.client`, ag:class: "
"`~django.test.asyncClient` anois leis an paraiméadar ``query_params``, a "
"ghlacann le foclóir eochracha agus luachanna ceisteanna. Ligeann sé seo "
"teaghráin fiosrúcháin a shocrú ar aon mhodhanna HTTP níos éasca."

msgid ""
"The new :meth:`.SimpleTestCase.assertNotInHTML` assertion allows testing "
"that an HTML fragment is not contained in the given HTML haystack."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn an dearbhú nua:meth: `.simpletestcase.assertNotInhtml` tástáil "
"nach bhfuil blúire HTML sa chraiste faigh HTML tugtha."

msgid ""
"In order to enforce test isolation, database connections inside threads are "
"no longer allowed in :class:`~django.test.SimpleTestCase`."
msgstr ""
"D'fhonn aonrú tástála a fhorfheidhmiú, ní cheadaítear naisc bunachar sonraí "
"taobh istigh de snáitheanna a thuilleadh in:class: "
"`~django.test.simpletestCase`."

msgid ""
"The new :class:`~django.core.validators.DomainNameValidator` validates "
"domain names, including internationalized domain names. The "
"new :func:`~django.core.validators.validate_domain_name` function returns an "
"instance of :class:`~django.core.validators.DomainNameValidator`."
msgstr ""
"Bailíonn an nua:class: `~django.core.validators.domainnameValidator` "
"ainmneacha fearainn, lena n-áirítear ainmneacha fearainn idirnáisiúnta. "
"Tugann an fheidhm nua:func: `~django.core.validators.validate_domain_name` "
"sampla de:class: `~django.core.validators.domainnameValidator`."

msgid "Backwards incompatible changes in 5.1"
msgstr "Athruithe neamh-chomhoiriúnacha ar ais i 5.1"

msgid "Support for PostGIS 2.5 is removed."
msgstr "Baintear tacaíocht do PostGIS 2.5."

msgid "Support for PROJ < 6 is removed."
msgstr "Baintear tacaíocht do PROJ <6."

msgid "Support for GDAL 2.4 is removed."
msgstr "Baintear tacaíocht do GDAL 2.4."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.contrib.gis.geoip2.GeoIP2` no longer opens both city and "
"country databases when a directory path is provided, preferring the city "
"database, if it is available. The country database is a subset of the city "
"database and both are not typically needed. If you require use of the "
"country database when in the same directory as the city database, explicitly "
"pass the country database path to the constructor."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.contrib.gis.geoip2.geoip2` ní osclaíonn bunachair sonraí "
"cathrach agus tíre a thuilleadh nuair a chuirtear cosán eolaire ar fáil, is "
"fearr leat bunachar sonraí na cathrach, má tá sé ar fáil. Is fo-thacar de "
"bhunachar sonraí na cathrach é bunachar sonraí na tíre agus ní theastaíonn "
"an dá cheann de ghnáth. Más gá duit bunachar sonraí na tíre a úsáid agus tú "
"san eolaire céanna le bunachar sonraí na cathrach, cuir cosán bunachar "
"sonraí na tíre go sainráite chuig an tógálaí."

msgid "Dropped support for MariaDB 10.4"
msgstr "Tacaíocht titim do MariaDB 10.4"

msgid ""
"Upstream support for MariaDB 10.4 ends in June 2024. Django 5.1 supports "
"MariaDB 10.5 and higher."
msgstr ""
"Críochnaíonn tacaíocht suas srutha do MariaDB 10.4 i mí an Mheithimh 2024. "
"Tacaíonn Django 5.1 le MariaDB 10.5 agus níos airde."

msgid "Dropped support for PostgreSQL 12"
msgstr "Tacaíocht titim do PostgreSQL 12"

msgid ""
"Upstream support for PostgreSQL 12 ends in November 2024. Django 5.1 "
"supports PostgreSQL 13 and higher."
msgstr ""
"Críochnaíonn tacaíocht suas srutha do PostgreSQL 12 i mí na Samhna 2024. "
"Tacaíonn Django 5.1 le PostgreSQL 13 agus níos airde."

msgid ""
"In order to improve accessibility, the admin's changelist filter is now "
"rendered in a ``<nav>`` tag instead of a ``<div>``."
msgstr ""
"<div>D'fhonn inrochtaineacht a fheabhsú, déantar scagaire liosta athraithe "
"an riaracháin a léiriú anois i gclib ``<nav>`` in ionad ```."

msgid ""
"In order to improve accessibility, the admin's footer is now rendered in a "
"``<footer>`` tag instead of a ``<div>``, and also moved below the ``<div "
"id=\"main\">`` element."
msgstr ""
"<div id=\"main\">D'fhonn inrochtaineacht a fheabhsú, déantar buntásc an "
"riaracháin a léiriú anois <footer><div>i gclib ```` in ionad ````, agus "
"bogadh sé faoi bhun an ghné ```."

msgid ""
"In order to improve accessibility, the expandable widget used "
"for :attr:`ModelAdmin.fieldsets <django.contrib.admin.ModelAdmin.fieldsets>` "
"and :attr:`InlineModelAdmin.fieldsets "
"<django.contrib.admin.InlineModelAdmin>`, when the fieldset has a name and "
"use the ``collapse`` class, now includes ``<details>`` and ``<summary>`` "
"elements."
msgstr ""
"<django.contrib.admin.InlineModelAdmin><details><summary>D'fhonn inrochtain "
"<django.contrib.admin.ModelAdmin.fieldsets>eacht a fheabhsú, tá an giuirléid "
"leathnaithe a úsáidtear le haghaidh: attr: `ModelAdmin.FieldSets `agus:attr: "
"`InlineModelAdmin.FieldSets`, nuair a bhíonn ainm ag an tacar réimse agus "
"úsáideann an rang ``collise``, anois eilimintí ``agus`` ``."

msgid ""
"The JavaScript file ``collapse.js`` is removed since it is no longer needed "
"in the Django admin site."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an comhad JavaScript ``collise.js ``ós rud é nach bhfuil gá leis a "
"thuilleadh ar shuíomh riaracháin Django."

msgid ""
":meth:`.SimpleTestCase.assertURLEqual` "
"and :meth:`~django.test.SimpleTestCase.assertInHTML` now add ``\": \"`` to "
"the ``msg_prefix``. This is consistent with the behavior of other assertions."
msgstr ""
":meth: `.SimpleTestCase.AsserTurleQual` agus:meth: "
"`~django.test.simpletestCase.assertInHTML` anois cuir ``”: “`` leis an "
"`msg_prefix``. Tá sé seo ag teacht le hiompar dearbhaithe eile."

msgid ""
"``django.utils.text.Truncator`` used by :tfilter:`truncatechars_html` "
"and :tfilter:`truncatewords_html` template filters now "
"uses :py:class:`html.parser.HTMLParser` subclasses. This results in a more "
"robust and faster operation, but there may be small differences in the "
"output."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann scagairí teimpléad ``django.utils.text.truncator`` ag: tfilter: "
"`truncatechars_html` agus:tfilter: `truncatewords_html` scagairí teimpléad "
"anois:py:class: `html.parser.htmlParser` fo-aicmí. Bíonn oibríocht níos "
"láidre agus níos gasta mar thoradh air seo, ach d'fhéadfadh go mbeadh "
"difríochtaí beaga san aschur."

msgid ""
"The undocumented ``django.urls.converters.get_converter()`` function is "
"removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an fheidhm ``django.urls.converters.get_converter () "
"``neamhdhoiciméadaithe."

msgid ""
"The minimum supported version of SQLite is increased from 3.27.0 to 3.31.0."
msgstr "Méadaítear an leagan íosta tacaithe de SQLite ó 3.27.0 go 3.31.0."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.db.models.FileField` now raises "
"a :class:`~django.core.exceptions.FieldError` when saving a file without a "
"``name``."
msgstr ""
":class: `~Django.db.Models.FileField` ardaíonn anois a:class: "
"`~django.core.exceptions.fielderror` agus comhad á shábháil gan ``ainm ``."

msgid ""
"``ImageField.update_dimension_fields(force=True)`` is no longer called after "
"saving the image to storage. If your storage backend resizes images, the "
"``width_field`` and ``height_field`` will not match the width and height of "
"the image."
msgstr ""
"Ní ghlaofar ``ImageField.UPDATE_Dimension_Fields (force=True) ``a thuilleadh "
"tar éis an íomhá a shábháil chuig stóráil. Má athraíonn do chúltaca stórála "
"mhéid íomhánna, ní mheaitseálfaidh an ``width_field`` agus ``height_field`` "
"leithead agus airde na híomhá."

msgid ""
"The minimum supported version of ``asgiref`` is increased from 3.7.0 to "
"3.8.1."
msgstr "Méadaítear an leagan íosta tacaithe de `asgiref`` ó 3.7.0 go 3.8.1."

msgid ""
"To improve performance, the ``delete_selected`` admin action now uses "
"``QuerySet.bulk_create()`` when creating multiple ``LogEntry`` objects. As a "
"result, ``pre_save`` and ``post_save`` signals for ``LogEntry`` are not sent "
"when multiple objects are deleted via this admin action."
msgstr ""

msgid "Features deprecated in 5.1"
msgstr "Gnéithe atá díscríofa i 5.1"

msgid ""
"The ``ModelAdmin.log_deletion()`` and ``LogEntryManager.log_action()`` "
"methods are deprecated. Subclasses should implement "
"``ModelAdmin.log_deletions()`` and  ``LogEntryManager.log_actions()`` "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Tá na modhanna ``ModelAdmin.log_Deletion () ``agus "
"`LogentryManager.log_action ()`` a dhíchur. Ba chóir go gcuirfeadh fo-"
"ranganna ``ModelAdmin.log_Deletions () ``agus ``LogentryManager.log_actions "
"()`` a chur i bhfeidhm ina ionad."

msgid ""
"The undocumented ``django.utils.itercompat.is_iterable()`` function and the "
"``django.utils.itercompat`` module are deprecated. Use ``isinstance(..., "
"collections.abc.Iterable)`` instead."
msgstr ""
"Tá an fheidhm ``django.utils.itercompat.is_iterable () ``gan doiciméadú agus "
"an modúl ``django.utils.itercompat`` a dhíchur. Úsáid ``isinstance (..., "
"Collections.abc.iterable) ``ina ionad."

msgid ""
"The ``django.contrib.gis.geoip2.GeoIP2.coords()`` method is deprecated. Use "
"``django.contrib.gis.geoip2.GeoIP2.lon_lat()`` instead."
msgstr ""
"Tá an modh ``django.contrib.gis.geoip2.geoip2.coords () ``díluaite. Úsáid "
"``django.contrib.gis.geoip2.geoip2.lon_lat () ``ina ionad."

msgid ""
"The ``django.contrib.gis.geoip2.GeoIP2.open()`` method is deprecated. Use "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.gis.geoip2.GeoIP2` constructor instead."
msgstr ""
"Tá an modh ``Django.contrib.gis.geoip2.geoip2.open () ``díluaite. Úsáid an "
"tógálaí: class: `~django.contrib.gis.geoip2.geoip2` ina ionad."

msgid ""
"Passing positional arguments to :meth:`.Model.save` and :meth:`.Model.asave` "
"is deprecated in favor of keyword-only arguments."
msgstr ""
"Tá argóintí seasaimh a chur chuig: meth: `.model.save` agus:meth: "
"`.model.asave` a dhíchur i bhfabhar argóintí eochairfhocal amháin."

msgid ""
"Setting ``django.contrib.gis.gdal.OGRGeometry.coord_dim`` is deprecated. "
"Use :meth:`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.OGRGeometry.set_3d` instead."
msgstr ""
"Tá socrú ``django.contrib.gis.gdal.ogrgeometry.coord_dim`` díluaite. Úsáid: "
"Meth: `~django.contrib.gis.gdal.ogrgeometry.set_3d` ina ionad."

msgid ""
"Overriding existing converters with ``django.urls.register_converter()`` is "
"deprecated."
msgstr ""
"Tá tiontairí atá ann cheana le ``django.urls.register_converter () "
"``díluasaithe."

msgid ""
"The ``check`` keyword argument of ``CheckConstraint`` is deprecated in favor "
"of ``condition``."
msgstr ""
"Tá an argóint eochairfhocal ``seiceáil ``de `CheckConstraint`` a dhíchur i "
"bhfabhar ``coinníoll``."

msgid ""
"The undocumented ``OS_OPEN_FLAGS`` property "
"of :class:`~django.core.files.storage.FileSystemStorage` is deprecated. To "
"allow overwriting files in storage, set the "
"new :attr:`~django.core.files.storage.FileSystemStorage.allow_overwrite` "
"option to ``True`` instead."
msgstr ""
"Tá an maoin ``OS_OPEN_FLAGS`` neamhdhoiciméadaithe de:class: "
"`~django.core.files.storage.filesystemStorage` a dhíchur. Chun comhaid a "
"fhorscríobh i stóráil a cheadú, socraigh an rogha nua:attr: "
"`~django.core.files.storage.filesystemStorage.allow_overwrite` go ``True`` "
"ina ionad."

msgid ""
"The ``get_cache_name()`` method of ``FieldCacheMixin`` is deprecated in "
"favor of the ``cache_name`` cached property."
msgstr ""
"Tá an modh ``get_cache_name () ``de `FieldCachemixin`` a dhíchur i bhfabhar "
"na maoin taiscéadaithe ``cache_name``."

msgid "Features removed in 5.1"
msgstr "Gnéithe bainte i 5.1"

msgid ""
"These features have reached the end of their deprecation cycle and are "
"removed in Django 5.1."
msgstr ""
"Tá na gnéithe seo tar éis deireadh a dtimthriall díscrúdaithe bainte amach "
"agus baintear iad i Django 5.1."

msgid ""
"See :ref:`deprecated-features-4.2` for details on these changes, including "
"how to remove usage of these features."
msgstr ""
"Féach: Ref: `deprecated-features-4.2` le haghaidh sonraí faoi na hathruithe "
"seo, lena n-áirítear conas úsáid na ngnéithe seo a bhaint."

msgid "The ``BaseUserManager.make_random_password()`` method is removed."
msgstr "Baintear an modh ``BaseUserManager.Make_Random_Password () ``."

msgid "The model's ``Meta.index_together`` option is removed."
msgstr "Baintear rogha ``Meta.index_Together`` an tsamhail."

msgid "The ``length_is`` template filter is removed."
msgstr "Baintear an scagaire teimpléad ``long_is ``."

msgid ""
"The ``django.contrib.auth.hashers.SHA1PasswordHasher``, "
"``django.contrib.auth.hashers.UnsaltedSHA1PasswordHasher``, and "
"``django.contrib.auth.hashers.UnsaltedMD5PasswordHasher`` are removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear na `Django.Contrib.Auth.Hashers.Sha1PasswordHasher``, "
"`Django.Contrib.Auth.Hashers.UnsaltedSha1PasswordHasher``, agus "
"``Django.Contrib.Auth.Hashers.UnsaltedMd5PasswordHasher``."

msgid ""
"The model ``django.contrib.postgres.fields.CICharField``, "
"``django.contrib.postgres.fields.CIEmailField``, and "
"``django.contrib.postgres.fields.CITextField`` are removed, except for "
"support in historical migrations."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an tsamhail ``Django.contrib.postgres.fields.cicharfield``, "
"`Django.contrib.postgres.fields.ciemailfield``, agus "
"``Django.contrib.postgres.fields.citextfield``, seachas tacaíocht i imirce "
"stairiúla."

msgid "The ``django.contrib.postgres.fields.CIText`` mixin is removed."
msgstr "Baintear an meascán ``Django.contrib.postgres.fields.citext``."

msgid ""
"The ``map_width`` and ``map_height`` attributes of ``BaseGeometryWidget`` "
"are removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear na tréithe ``map_width`` agus ``map_height`` de "
"`BasegeometryWidget``."

msgid "The ``SimpleTestCase.assertFormsetError()`` method is removed."
msgstr "Baintear an modh ``SimpletestCase.assertFormSetError () ``."

msgid "The ``TransactionTestCase.assertQuerysetEqual()`` method is removed."
msgstr "Baintear an modh ``TransactionTestCase.assertQuerySetEqual () ``."

msgid ""
"Support for passing encoded JSON string literals to ``JSONField`` and "
"associated lookups and expressions is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear tacaíocht chun litríochtaí teaghrán ionchódaithe JSON a chur chuig "
"``JSONField`` agus cuardaigh agus nathanna gaolmhara."

msgid ""
"Support for passing positional arguments to ``Signer`` and "
"``TimestampSigner`` is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear tacaíocht chun argóintí seasaimh a chur chuig ``Signer`` agus "
"``TimeStampSigner``."

msgid ""
"The ``DEFAULT_FILE_STORAGE`` and ``STATICFILES_STORAGE`` settings is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear na socruithe ``DEFAULT_FILE_STORAGE`` agus ``STATICFILES_STORAGE``."

msgid ""
"The ``django.core.files.storage.get_storage_class()`` function is removed."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an fheidhm ``django.core.files.storage.get_storage_class () ``."

msgid "Django 5.1.1 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 5.1.1"

msgid ""
"Django 5.1.1 fixes one security issue with severity \"moderate\", one "
"security issue with severity \"low\", and several bugs in 5.1."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 5.1.1 saincheist slándála amháin le déine “measartha”, "
"saincheist slándála amháin le déine “íseal”, agus roinnt fabhtanna i 5.1."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.1 that caused a crash of ``Window()`` when "
"passing an empty sequence to the ``order_by`` parameter, and a crash of "
"``Prefetch()`` for a sliced queryset without ordering (:ticket:`35665`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 5.1 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste ``Window () "
"``nuair a chuirtear seicheamh folamh chuig an bparaiméadar ``order_by``, "
"agus timpiste ``Prefetch ()`` le haghaidh tacar ceisteanna slisnite gan ordú "
"(:ticket: `35665`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.1 where a new ``usable_password`` field was "
"included in :class:`~django.contrib.auth.forms.BaseUserCreationForm` (and "
"children). A new :class:`~django.contrib.auth.forms.AdminUserCreationForm` "
"including this field was added, isolating the feature to the admin where it "
"was intended (:ticket:`35678`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 5.1 ina raibh réimse nua ``usable_password`` "
"san áireamh in:class: `~django.contrib.auth.forms.baseUserCreationForm` "
"(agus leanaí). Cuireadh nua:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.forms.adminUserCreationForm` lena n-áirítear an réimse "
"seo, ag leithlisiú an ghné chuig an riarachán ina raibh sé beartaithe "
"(:ticket: `35678`)."

msgid ""
"Adjusted the deprecation warning ``stacklevel`` in :meth:`.Model.save` "
"and :meth:`.Model.asave` to correctly point to the offending call site "
"(:ticket:`35060`)."
msgstr ""
"Coigeartaigh an rabhadh díscrúdaithe ``stacklevel`` in:meth: `.model.save` "
"agus:meth: `.model.asave` chun díriú i gceart ar an suíomh glaonna ciontach "
"(:ticket: `35060`)."

msgid ""
"Adjusted the deprecation warning ``stacklevel`` when using ``OS_OPEN_FLAGS`` "
"in :class:`~django.core.files.storage.FileSystemStorage` to correctly point "
"to the offending call site (:ticket:`35326`)."
msgstr ""
"Coigeartaigh an rabhadh díscrúdaithe ``stacklevel`` nuair a úsáideann tú "
"``OS_OPEN_FLAGS`` in:class: `~django.core.files.storage.filesystemStorage` "
"chun díriú i gceart ar an suíomh glaonna ciontach (:ticket: `35326`)."

msgid ""
"Adjusted the deprecation warning ``stacklevel`` in "
"``FieldCacheMixin.get_cache_name()`` to correctly point to the offending "
"call site (:ticket:`35405`)."
msgstr ""
"Coigeartaigh an rabhadh díscrúdaithe ``stacklevel`` i "
"`Fieldcachemixin.get_cache_name () ``chun díriú i gceart ar an suíomh "
"glaonna ciontach (:ticket: `35405`)."

msgid ""
"Restored, following a regression in Django 5.1, the ability to override the "
"timezone and role setting behavior used within the ``init_connection_state`` "
"method of the PostgreSQL backend (:ticket:`35688`)."
msgstr ""
"Athchóirigh, tar éis aischéimnithe i Django 5.1, an cumas an t-iompar crios "
"ama agus róil a úsáidtear laistigh den mhodh ``init_connection_state ``de "
"chúlra PostgreSQL a shárú (:ticket: `35688`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 5.1 where variable lookup errors were logged when "
"rendering admin fieldsets (:ticket:`35716`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 5.1 inar logáilíodh earráidí cuardaigh athraitheacha "
"agus tacair réimsí riaracháin á rindreáil (:ticket: `35716`)."

msgid "Django 5.1.10 release notes"
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 5.1.10 fixes a security issue with severity \"low\" in 5.1.9."
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 5.1.11 release notes"
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 5.1.11 fixes a potential log injection issue in 5.1.10."
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 5.1.12 release notes"
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 5.1.12 fixes a security issue with severity \"high\" in 5.1.11."
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 5.1.13 release notes"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Django 5.1.13 fixes one security issue with severity \"high\" and one "
"security issue with severity \"low\" in 5.1.12."
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 5.1.2 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 5.1.2"

msgid "*October 8, 2024*"
msgstr "*8 Deireadh Fómhair, 2024*"

msgid ""
"Django 5.1.2 fixes several bugs in 5.1.1. Also, the latest string "
"translations from Transifex are incorporated."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 5.1.2 roinnt fabhtanna i 5.1.1. Chomh maith leis sin, "
"corpraítear na haistriúcháin teaghráin is déanaí ó Transifex."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.1 that caused a crash when using the "
"PostgreSQL lookup :lookup:`trigram_similar` on output fields from ``Concat`` "
"(:ticket:`35732`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 5.1 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste nuair a "
"úsáideadh an lookup:lookup PostgreSQL: `trigram_similar` ar réimsí aschuir ó "
"`Concat`` (:ticket: `35732`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.1 that caused a crash of ``JSONObject()`` "
"when using server-side binding with PostgreSQL 16+ (:ticket:`35734`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 5.1 a bhí ina chúis le timpiste ``JSONObject "
"() ``agus ceangailt taobh freastalaí á úsáid le PostgreSQL 16+ (:ticket: "
"`35734`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.1 that made selected items in multi-select "
"widgets indistinguishable from non-selected items in the admin dark theme "
"(:ticket:`35809`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 5.1 a d'fhág míreanna roghnaithe i giuirléidí "
"ilroghnaithe gan idirdhealú ó mhíreanna neamh-roghnaithe sa téama dorcha "
"riaracháin (:ticket: `35809`)."

msgid "Django 5.1.3 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 5.1.3"

msgid "*November 5, 2024*"
msgstr "*5 Samhain, 2024*"

msgid ""
"Django 5.1.3 fixes several bugs in 5.1.2 and adds compatibility with Python "
"3.13."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 5.1.3 roinnt fabhtanna i 5.1.2 agus cuireann sé "
"comhoiriúnacht le Python 3.13."

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 5.1 "
"where :class:`~django.core.validators.DomainNameValidator` accepted any "
"input value that contained a valid domain name, rather than only input "
"values that were a valid domain name (:ticket:`35845`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fabht i Django 5.1 áit ar ghlac: class: "
"`~django.core.validators.domainNameValidator` le haon luach ionchuir ina "
"raibh ainm fearainn bailí ann, seachas luachanna ionchuir amháin a bhí ina "
"ainm fearainn bailí (:ticket: `35845`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.1 that prevented the use of DB-IP databases "
"with :class:`~django.contrib.gis.geoip2.GeoIP2` (:ticket:`35841`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 5.1 a chuir cosc ar úsáid bunachair sonraí DB-"
"IP le:class: `~django.contrib.gis.geoip2.geoip2` (:ticket: `35841`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.1 where non-ASCII fieldset names were not "
"displayed when rendering admin fieldsets (:ticket:`35876`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 5.1 nuair nár taispeánadh ainmneacha tacar "
"réimse neamh-ASCII agus tacair réimsí riaracháin á rindreáil (:ticket: "
"`35876`)."

msgid "Django 5.1.4 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 5.1.4"

msgid ""
"Django 5.1.4 fixes one security issue with severity \"high\", one security "
"issue with severity \"moderate\", and several bugs in 5.1.3."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn Django 5.1.4 saincheist slándála amháin le déine “ard”, saincheist "
"slándála amháin le déine “measartha”, agus roinnt fabhtanna i 5.1.3."

msgid ""
"Fixed a crash in ``createsuperuser`` on Python 3.13+ caused by an unhandled "
"``OSError`` when the username could not be determined (:ticket:`35942`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh timpiste in ``createsuperuser`` ar Python 3.13+ de bharr "
"``Oserror`` gan láimhseáil nuair nach bhféadfaí an t-ainm úsáideora a "
"chinneadh (:ticket: `35942`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.1 where relational fields were not updated "
"when calling ``Model.refresh_from_db()`` on instances with deferred fields "
"(:ticket:`35950`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh aischéimniú i Django 5.1 nuair nár nuashonraíodh réimsí caidrimh "
"agus iad ag glaoch ar ``Model.fresh_from_db () `ar chásanna le réimsí "
"iarchurtha (:ticket: `35950`)."

msgid "Django 5.1.5 release notes"
msgstr "Nótaí scaoilte Django 5.1.5"

msgid ""
"Django 5.1.5 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\" and one bug "
"in 5.1.4."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Fixed a crash when applying migrations with references to the removed "
"``Meta.index_together`` option (:ticket:`34856`)."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh timpiste agus imirce á chur i bhfeidhm le tagairtí don rogha "
"`Meta.index_Together`` bainte (:ticket: `34856`)."

msgid "Django 5.1.6 release notes"
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 5.1.6 fixes several bugs in 5.1.5."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.1.5 that caused ``validate_ipv6_address()`` "
"and ``validate_ipv46_address()`` to crash when handling non-string values "
"(:ticket:`36098`)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.1 where password fields, despite being set to "
"``required=False``, were still treated as required in forms derived "
"from :class:`~django.contrib.auth.forms.BaseUserCreationForm` "
"(:ticket:`36140`)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 5.1.7 release notes"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Django 5.1.7 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\" and several "
"bugs in 5.1.6."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 5.1 where the ``{% querystring %}`` template tag "
"returned an empty string rather than ``\"?\"`` when all parameters had been "
"removed from the query string (:ticket:`36182`)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in Django 5.1 where ``FileSystemStorage``, with "
"``allow_overwrite`` set to ``True``, did not truncate the overwritten file "
"content (:ticket:`36191`)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.1 where the ``count`` and ``exists`` methods "
"of ``ManyToManyField`` related managers would always return ``0`` and "
"``False`` when the intermediary model back references used ``to_field`` "
"(:ticket:`36197`)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.1 where the ``pre_save`` and ``post_save`` "
"signals for ``LogEntry`` were not sent when deleting a single object in the "
"admin (:ticket:`36217`)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 5.1.8 release notes"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Django 5.1.8 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\" and several "
"bugs in 5.1.7."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.1.7 where the removal of the "
"``single_object`` parameter unintentionally altered the signature and return "
"type of ``LogEntryManager.log_actions()`` (:ticket:`36234`)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 5.1.9 release notes"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Django 5.1.9 fixes a security issue with severity \"moderate\", a data loss "
"bug, and a regression in 5.1.8."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Fixed a regression in Django 5.1.8, introduced when "
"fixing :cve:`2025-26699`, where the :tfilter:`wordwrap` template filter did "
"not preserve empty lines between paragraphs after wrapping text "
"(:ticket:`36341`)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Django 5.2 release notes"
msgstr ""

msgid "Welcome to Django 5.2!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"These release notes cover the :ref:`new features <whats-new-5.2>`, as well "
"as some :ref:`backwards incompatible changes <backwards-incompatible-5.2>` "
"you should be aware of when upgrading from Django 5.1 or earlier. "
"We've :ref:`begun the deprecation process for some features <deprecated-"
"features-5.2>`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Django 5.2 is designated as a :term:`long-term support release <Long-term "
"support release>`. It will receive security updates for at least three years "
"after its release. Support for the previous LTS, Django 4.2, will end in "
"April 2026."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Django 5.2 supports Python 3.10, 3.11, 3.12, 3.13, and 3.14 (as of 5.2.8). "
"We **highly recommend** and only officially support the latest release of "
"each series."
msgstr ""

