"The :djadmin:`shell` management command now automatically imports models "
"from all installed apps. You can view further details of the imported "
"objects by setting the ``--verbosity`` flag to 2 or more:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This :ref:`behavior can be customized <customizing-shell-auto-imports>` to "
"add or remove automatic imports."
msgstr ""

msgid "Composite Primary Keys"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The new :class:`django.db.models.CompositePrimaryKey` allows tables to be "
"created with a primary key consisting of multiple fields."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To use a composite primary key, when defining a model set the ``pk`` "
"attribute to be a ``CompositePrimaryKey``::"
msgstr ""

msgid "See :doc:`/topics/composite-primary-key` for more details."
msgstr ""

msgid "Simplified override of :class:`~django.forms.BoundField`"
