msgid "Security releases"
msgstr "Eisiúintí slándála"

msgid ""
"Whenever a security issue is disclosed via :doc:`Django's security policies "
"</internals/security>`, appropriate release notes are now added to all "
"affected release series."
msgstr ""
"Aon uair a nochtar saincheist slándála trí:doc: `Polasaithe slándála "
"Django`, cuirtear nótaí scaoilte iomchu</internals/security> í anois leis na "
"sraith scaoilte go léir a bhfuil tionchar orthu."

msgid ""
"Additionally, :doc:`an archive of disclosed security issues </releases/"
"security>` is maintained."
msgstr ""
"Ina theannta sin, coimeádtar :doc:`cartlann de cheisteanna slándála a "
"nochtar </releases/security>`."

msgid "Archive of security issues"
msgstr "Cartlann saincheisteanna slándála"

msgid ""
"Django's development team is strongly committed to responsible reporting and "
"disclosure of security-related issues, as outlined in :doc:`Django's "
"security policies </internals/security>`."
msgstr ""
"Tá foireann forbartha Django tiomanta go láidir do thuairisciú agus nochtadh "
"freagrach ar shaincheisteanna a bhaineann le slándáil, mar a leagtar amach "
"in:doc: `Polasaithe slándála </internals/security> Django'."

msgid ""
"As part of that commitment, we maintain the following historical list of "
"issues which have been fixed and disclosed. For each issue, the list below "
"includes the date, a brief description, the `CVE identifier <https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Common_Vulnerabilities_and_Exposures>`_ if applicable, "
"a list of affected versions, a link to the full disclosure and links to the "
"appropriate patch(es)."
msgstr ""
"Mar chuid den tiomantas sin, coinnímid an liosta stairiúil seo a leanas de "
"shaincheisteanna a shocraíodh agus a nochtadh. < https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Common_Vulnerabilities_and_Exposures>I gcás gach eisiúint, cuimsíonn an "
"liosta thíos an dáta, cur síos gairid, an `aitheantóir CVE`_ más infheidhme, "
"liosta de na leaganacha atá buailte, nasc leis an nochtadh iomlán agus naisc "
"chuig an bpaiste/paistí cuí."

msgid "Some important caveats apply to this information:"
msgstr "Baineann roinnt rabhadh tábhachtacha leis an bhfaisnéis seo:"

msgid ""
"Lists of affected versions include only those versions of Django which had "
"stable, security-supported releases at the time of disclosure. This means "
"older versions (whose security support had expired) and versions which were "
"in pre-release (alpha/beta/RC) states at the time of disclosure may have "
"been affected, but are not listed."
msgstr ""
"Ní chuimsíonn liostaí de na leaganacha atá buailte ach na leaganacha sin de "
"Django a raibh eisiúintí cobhsaí le tacaíocht slándála ag am na nochtadh. "
"Ciallaíonn sé seo go bhféadfadh go mbeadh tionchar ag leaganacha níos sine "
"(a raibh a dtacaíocht slándála in éag) agus ar leaganacha a bhí i stáit "
"réamh-scaoilte (alpha/beta/RC) tráth na nochtadh, ach nach bhfuil liostaithe "
"orthu."

msgid ""
"The Django project has on occasion issued security advisories, pointing out "
"potential security problems which can arise from improper configuration or "
"from other issues outside of Django itself. Some of these advisories have "
"received CVEs; when that is the case, they are listed here, but as they have "
"no accompanying patches or releases, only the description, disclosure and "
"CVE will be listed."
msgstr ""
"D'eisigh tionscadal Django comhairleanna slándála uaireanta, ag cur in iúl "
"fadhbanna slándála féideartha a d'fhéadfadh teacht chun cinn ó chumraíocht "
"mhíchuí nó ó shaincheisteanna eile lasmuigh de Tá CVEanna faighte ag cuid de "
"na comhairleachtaí seo; nuair is amhlaidh, tá siad liostaithe anseo, ach "
"toisc nach bhfuil aon phaistí nó eisiúintí a ghabhann leo, ní liostófar ach "
"an tuairisc, an nochtadh agus an CVE."

msgid "Issues under Django's security process"
msgstr "Saincheisteanna faoi phróiseas slándála Django"

msgid ""
"All security issues have been handled under versions of Django's security "
"process. These are listed below."
msgstr ""
"Láimhseáladh gach saincheist slándála faoi leaganacha de phróiseas slándála "
"Django. Tá siad seo liostaithe thíos."

